window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1001,"title":"Chapter 1001 It’s Time to Break Through, Go Into Seclusion","paragraphs":["1001 It’s Time to Break Through, Go Into Seclusion","Lin Hongfeng was extremely excited. Stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage was the long-standing hope of their clan. Ever since his ancestor had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, it had been a long time since anyone else had reached that level.","It was an accident that the ancestor had become a Divine. They did not have a complete inheritance, so they could not be like the sects and clans that had inheritances, where their descendants could enter the Divine Abilities Stage continuously.","But now, Lin Hongfeng had the opportunity to enter the Divine Abilities Stage. There was no doubt what a Divine meant to Tianhe. If he had the strength of a Divine, he would not have been so passive and had to bow to Li Yan. In the end, even Bao Anzhi had been drawn out.","To him, this promise was even more important than anything else.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He could understand Lin Hongfeng’s excitement. Before he had entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he had also longed to enter this stage one day as it was a whole new realm.","However, compared to this legacy pearl, the value of a Divinity Nourishment Pill was nothing. He had many Divinity Nourishment Pills on hand, but he could not as easily obtain a legacy pearl.","“I have a pill on hand called the Divinity Nourishment Pill. With your current peak Innate cultivation, there’s at least a seventy percent chance that you’ll be able to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.”","Lin Hongfeng recovered from his excitement, pondered for a moment, and then said, “Mister Chu, can I give the pill to someone else?”","“Who do you want to give it to?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“My son, Lin Haoren,” Lin Hongfeng said bluntly.","Chu Yunfan looked at Lin Hongfeng’s determined expression. For Lin Hongfeng, the temptation of entering the Divine Abilities Stage was great, but he was willing to give this opportunity to his son. This was what parents were like.","As for why he did not give it Lin Chenxi, the reason was easy to guess. Everyone knew that Lin Chenxi was his disciple. Would Chu Yunfan let his own disciple suffer?","That was obviously impossible.","Chu Yunfan’s parents were the same. If they could, they would probably give up everything for him.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan smiled and nodded, “No problem. I’m giving it to you. It’s your business who you want to gift it to.”","“Thank you, Mr. Chu!” Lin Hongfeng said gratefully.","“No need for thanks. To me, the value of this legacy pearl far exceeds that of a Divinity Nourishment Pill,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“It’s a pity that all parents are so virtuous. How about this? Keep the Divinity Nourishment Pill for yourself. I can make you a second one. But the medicinal herbs required will have to be collected by your city. One of the main ingredients is the inner core of a Divine monster. If you become a Divine, I believe you’ll be able to obtain one.”","Chu Yunfan was touched by Lin Hongfeng’s words and was willing to make another pill for him. After all, all the main and supplementary ingredients could be collected by Tianhe. With his current cultivation, it was not difficult to refine a Divinity Nourishment Pill.","“Really? That’s great! Thank you, Mr. Chu!”","Lin Hongfeng was so excited that he couldn’t control himself. He didn’t expect that there would be such an unexpected surprise. He didn’t know that it was his affection for Lin Haoren that made Chu Yunfan think of his own parents, which in turned moved Chu Yunfan.","“Oh, by the way, Mr. Chu. Three months from now, a few neighboring cities will be holding a joint competition. If you’re able...” Lin Hongfeng looked at Chu Yunfan with a troubled expression.","“You want me to take action? What’s the situation?” Chu Yunfan said.","Lin Hongfeng then told him the whole story. It turned out that there was a spirit stone mine nearby. This mine was the lifeline of several nearby cities. Most of the spirit stones used by the nearby martial artists for cultivation were obtained from it.","At the same time, it was also the most important source of wealth for these cities. In the early years, these cities had fought each other over the mine and were almost destroyed by foreign forces.","Since then, several cities had come to an agreement to jointly manage this spirit stone mine. They send people to manage and mine it together. The final goods produced would be divided according to a certain proportion.","As for how to divide it, it would depend on the competition that was held once every three years. Whoever was stronger would naturally get more, while the weaker one would get less.","Spirit stones were related to a martial artist’s cultivation. If they received fewer spirit stones one time, they would naturally be weaker the next time around. The fewer they received, the more vicious the cycle.","In the end, it would become a situation where the strong would remain strong and the weak would remain weak.","In the past, the representative of Tianhe had always been the experts of the Fluttering Blooms. But now, because Chu Yunfan had killed Divines one after another, the Fluttering Blooms had been destroyed and could no longer provide protection for Tianhe.","This was the fundamental reason why Lin Hongfeng paid such a high price to invite Li Yan to take charge. Without a Divine at the helm, Tianhe would not have any right to speak. The possibility of being deprived of the right to participate in the distribution of benefits was very high.","Because similar things had happened before, Lin Hongfeng was very worried.","“I see,” Chu Yunfan nodded and said.","“Don’t worry, Mr. Chu. There’s no need for you to do anything. The battles at the front are all between the experts below, and the final distribution is decided by the Divines. There are still three months left, and with the Divinity Nourishment Pill that you’ve given me, I should be able to enter the Divine Abilities Stage too. When the time comes, I’ll have to trouble you to help me hold the line, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfeng said quickly.","He didn’t want to fight for first place. He just wanted to keep his current share. In this situation, he felt that he could deal with it alone, and Chu Yunfan was just insurance.","“In that case, I’ll go and take a look,” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself but he did not refuse. After all, he was only here to support them.","He came to the Holy Land, so he naturally had to gain a deeper understanding of the place.","On top of that, in a few months time, his strength should improve even further. At that time, there should not be many people in the Holy Land who could stand up to him. Even if someone were to cause trouble at this competition, it would not be a big deal.","“Thank you, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfeng said quickly. He felt that he was really lucky today.","After Chu Yunfan put away the legacy pearl into the Mountain River Diagram, he took out a medicine bottle. Inside the bottle was the Divinity Nourishment Pill.","“This is the Divinity Nourishment Pill,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’m going to borrow a room of yours for secluded cultivation. It’s time for me to improve myself.”"]},{"number":1002,"title":"Chapter 1002 Breakthrough, Tier Five of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1002 Breakthrough, Tier Five of the Divine Abilities Stage","“No problem, I’ll make the arrangements immediately. No one will be allowed to disturb you, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfeng said quickly.","Today’s harvest was too great, and he needed time to digest it.","When Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi found out about the Divinity Nourishment Pill from their father, they were extremely shocked.","Even in the Holy Land, it was extremely difficult to enter the Divine Abilities Stage even though it was not a matter of luck.","But now, the Divinity Nourishment Pill provided by Chu Yunfan could actually raise that chance to seventy percent. This was very surprising.","Of course, they didn’t think that Chu Yunfan was joking with them, because there was no need to. They weren’t qualified to be made fun of by him, so there was only one possibility. Chu Yunfan really had such an ability.","Lin Hongfeng looked at Lin Chenxi and said earnestly, “Chenxi, you have to be more respectful to Mr. Chu in the future. I can see that he’s an expert among Divines. It’s a blessing that you’ve cultivated over three lifetimes to be able to become Mr. Chu’s disciple. Don’t throw a tantrum, understand?”","“I understand, but since when do I throw tantrums?” Lin Chenxi nodded. The more she understood Chu Yunfan, the more she felt that all her luck in this life was concentrated on this one moment.","Lin Haoren looked at his sister enviously. He knew very well how important it was to have a great master. If Chu Yunfan was willing to help an outsider like Lin Hongfeng to enter the Divine Abilities Stage, then Lin Chenxi, Chu Yunfan’s disciple, could surely enter the Divine Abilities Stage in the future.","This was an opportunity that many people were envious of.","Lin Hongfeng was very touched. Before, he was still a little hesitant about whether he should associate himself to Chu Yunfan. But now, he had decided that he would not hesitate or regret it.","If their family of three hoped to enter the Divine Abilities Stage, they had to stand on Chu Yunfan’s side. If all three of them could enter the Divine Abilities Stage, it be the most glorious moment in the Lin family history.","“Haoren, I’ll leave the rest to you. Cooperate with Mr. Chu and don’t let anyone disturb him. Also, collect the herbs on the list given by Mr. Chu. It’s related to whether you can enter the Divine Abilities Stage. I hope I don’t need to explain how important that is,” Lin Hongfeng said, “I’m going to go into seclusion as well. Three months from now, I’m going to do my best to protect Tianhe’s share of the spirit stone mine so that you can have enough resources for cultivation.”","Lin Hongfeng’s face was full of affection for his children. For him, he was old and it was extremely rare to step into the Divine Abilities Stage. Naturally, his future prospects were not very bright and could not be compared to his son and daughter.","The family’s future rested on his two children.","“I understand. Leave the rest to me,” Lin Haoren said firmly. He wouldn’t let anyone ruin this. It was his only chance to enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","***","Chu Yunfan entered the chamber that the Lin family had arranged for him.","It was an extremely large secluded cultivation room. Normally, only Lin Hongfeng used it. Many arrays and barriers had been added around it.","After Chu Yunfan entered, he casually set up a formation barrier for security purposes. This was because the place where he was really doing his secluded cultivation was the Mountain River Diagram.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan was sitting cross-legged in the air. His body was completely free from gravity, and in front of him was the broken legacy pearl.","While Chu Yunfan was circulating his Emperor Method, he patted the area under the legacy pearl with one hand. Immediately, the barrier covering the legacy pearl cracked open, and the energy within turned into boundless energy that overflowed in all directions.","Chu Yunfan opened his mouth, and a powerful suction force was immediately formed. The overflowing energy turned into a long river and poured into Chu Yunfan’s body.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan could feel a huge amount of energy exploding inside his body. This energy was much purer than the Spirit Energy of nature.","Nature’s Spirit Energy was the purest raw material that couldn’t be used directly. If a cultivator wanted to use it, they had to turn it into their own energy and process it. The more powerful the cultivation technique was, the more profound the process was, and the more amazing the power it could exert.","The energy in this legacy pearl was nature’s Spirit Energy that had been processed countless times and was of much higher quality. This was the reason why those who received power from a legacy pearl would have a huge improvement in their power in a short time.","This was because refining nature’s Spirit Energy was a most time-consuming process. Only by polishing it day after day could it be polished to its purest state devoid of any impurities. Now that someone had completed this process in his place, the strength of the person who inherited this power would naturally soar extremely quickly.","However, this was not something that could be achieved by just absorbing the energy within. If there was too much energy, it would affect one’s development. Those who were rumored to have ascended overnight had absorbed too much of it. Even if they did not completely explode and die, they would lose the possibility of further progress.","No matter how pure one’s internal energy was, if the energy within the pearl wasn’t polished, it would still be mixed and incompatible with one’s own.","It would take a long time for an ordinary person to absorb this energy, but at this time, Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique, Thunderclap Physique, and Mighty Eternal Emperor Method were fully displayed.","Chu Yunfan refined the pearl’s energy at a crazy speed. His refining speed was dozens of times faster than that of ordinary people. It was as if he absorbed the energy and immediately transformed it into his own without the slightest bit of panic.","However, there was so much energy and all of it was swarming toward him rendering Chu Yunfan unable to care about anything else.","As time passed, he continued to devour this energy bit by bit, turning it into his own power and spent the rest of his time trying to break through to tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage.","A month passed in the blink of an eye. In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes, and a terrifying aura exploded from his body.","He had surpassed the limits of peak tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage.","A wave of power turned into a violent tide and soared into the sky.","“Finally, I’ve entered the tier five.”","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes and slowly let out a breath, which turned into a white sword and flew away."]},{"number":1003,"title":"Chapter 1003 Peak of Tier Five of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1003 Peak of Tier Five of the Divine Abilities Stage","After stepping into the fifth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan’s skills improved by leaps and bounds. Compared to before, he had reached a whole new realm.","The breakthrough this time took a month. This could be considered a very smooth breakthrough.","How many people would be stuck in a realm their entire lives, unable to advance or retreat?","Only now had Chu Yunfan discovered the magical effect of a legacy pearl. The huge power contained in the pearl was scattered into every cell to enhance one’s strength. Even if the person absorbing the power couldn’t fully digest it, they could remain in seclusion and slowly digest it.","This power was not the kind of energy that had not been polished like nature’s Spirit Energy, but a pure energy that had been polished thousands of times. Although it might not be completely compatible with one’s own energy, it cultivated great improvement when used.","Only someone like Chu Yunfan, who aspired to be at the peak, would pay special attention to something like this.","And he, who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, naturally had a very high vantage point. He looked at the problem from a high point of view, and it was definitely not a temporary thought.","The efficiency of absorbing and devouring this power far exceeded that of ordinary people.","Even so, there was still a huge amount of power flowing out of the legacy pearl.","Chu Yunfan did some calculations. Since there was still time, he decided not to come out of seclusion. He closed his eyes again and began to break through.","At this time, in mansion of Tianhe’s city lord, Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi were pacing back and forth in front of the door outside their father’s seclusion room.","“He hasn’t come out after so long. Did Father succeed or not?” Lin Haoren suddenly wondered out loud.","“Father will definitely succeed,” Lin Chenxi said firmly. Chu Yunfan’s image flashed through her mind. Since her master said that there was a seventy percent chance of success, then there should be no problem.","“You’re right.” Lin Haoren nodded. He was just a little anxious. Only they themselves knew how important a Divine was to their family.","And now, it was finally time to come out of seclusion. Success or failure would depend on this one move, and it would even affect whether Lin Haoren could step into the Divine Abilities Stage in the future.","All of a sudden, the Spirit Energy of the world began to shake violently as if it was being concentrated by an invisible force. Above the place where Lin Hongfeng was in seclusion, the Spirit Energy formed a huge canopy almost the size of the entire mansion.","“Father did it! He did it!” Lin Haoren cheered, almost losing his composure. He couldn’t help but be excited. Although he had never broken through to the Divine Abilities Stage, he knew some of the phenomenon that would happen when one broke through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","The canopy above his head was like the king of the human world. It was the scene of a Divine breakthrough.","Now that such a strange phenomenon had appeared in the world, there was no doubt that his father had broken through.","With his father’s breakthrough, their family’s ruling position had been stabilized. Not every city lord was in the Divine Abilities Stage.","To them, it was like a miracle.","Lin Chenxi was also extremely excited. She looked at the canopy in the sky and was extremely excited.","After another hour, the canopy finally disappeared. This meant that Lin Hongfeng had finally controlled the power to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage. However, compared to the previous days, the Lin siblings did not feel any suffering now. They only felt that time had passed in the blink of an eye.","“Hahahaha!”","With a burst of laughter, Lin Hongfeng slowly walked out of the room. Looking at his children who had been waiting outside the door, his’s face showed a hint of relief.","“Father, you’ve broken through, right?”","Lin Haoren seemed to be unable to accept it and asked this question.","“That’s right! I’ve broken through to the Divine Abilities Stage!” Lin Hongfeng nodded in relief. “After our ancestor, someone from the Lin family has finally broken through. Soon, it’ll be your turn. I have not let down my ancestors!”","“That’s great!” Lin Chenxi cried out in excitement. Her pretty face could not hide her excitement.","“Yes, but all of this is thanks to Mr. Chu. We’ve received too much from him,” Lin Hongfeng said as he choked up.","Chu Yunfan felt that he had gained more benefits and that his cultivation level had improved in a short period, it was more important than occasional studying.","However, Lin Hongfeng felt that without the legacy pearl, Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough would only be delayed. On the other hand, if he did not have the Divinity Nourishment Pill, he would never have broken through.","The difference between them was like the difference between Heaven and Earth.","Chu Yunfan, who had not been stuck at the peak of the Innate Stage for decades, could not understand that kind of gratitude.","Lin Hongfeng had just broken through and felt that he could go anywhere in the world now. But then, he felt Chu Yunfan’s aura coming from the room next door. Although it was not very clear, and he could only vaguely sense the situation inside, he could feel that the aura was like the vast ocean. It was unfathomable.","When he was in the Innate Stage, he couldn’t feel how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. He was like a bacteria, so how could he feel the vastness and magnificence of the ocean?","They did not exist in the same world.","But now, after Lin Hongfeng had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage and his strength had undergone a tremendous change, he didn’t feel that the gap between him and Chu Yunfan had lessened. On the contrary, he felt that the gap between them had gotten bigger.","Even though he had entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he still felt as small as an ant. If Chu Yunfan wanted to, he could probably kill him with a single slap.","This difference in power quickly dispelled the feeling of being able to control the world after just breaking through.","“By the way, Haoren, have you collected the herbs I asked you to?” Lin Hongfeng asked.","“It’s all done, but I can’t do anything about the inner core of a Divine monster,” Lin Haoren said.","In the Federation, even if there were no Divine to help, they could still kill a Divine monster using high-tech weapons as long as they were willing to pay the price. However, in the Holy Land, those who were not of the same level could not do anything to Divine monsters.","“All right.” Lin Hongfeng was not surprised. This was within his expectations.","“Get everyone to prepare and search for traces of Divine monsters. I will personally lead the hunt.”","“Yes, Father!” Lin Haoren said excitedly.","While everyone in Tianhe was looking for Divine monsters, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was increasing bit by bit.","In the blink of an eye, another two months had passed.","In two months, Chu Yunfan had reached the peak of tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage. His cultivation had skyrocketed, and he had finally absorbed all the power in the legacy pearl.","Suddenly, at this time, a terrifying pressure, accompanied by a loud roar, came from the distance and rushed straight to Tianhe."]},{"number":1004,"title":"Chapter 1004 Vulnerable to a Single Blow","paragraphs":["1004 Vulnerable to a Single Blow","Chu Yunfan furrowed his brows. Suddenly, the energy that was originally spreading out from his body and had transformed into all kinds of strange phenomena completely collapsed and was absorbed into his body.","His control over his own power had reached a peak.","Chu Yunfan’s strength improved further after he completely absorbed the power of the legacy pearl. He broke through from the peak of tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage to the peak of tier five.","This was because Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique required far more power to break through than ordinary people. If it was an ordinary Divine, it would be enough to break through two levels in a row.","If one had just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, it would not be strange for them to break through three levels in a row.","This step saved Chu Yunfan a few years of time.","With his current strength, he could even protect himself against a ninth-tier Divine. He could go anywhere in the world.","It was also at this moment that he felt a shocking aura coming from outside the city—like a giant wolf carried by a strong wind, sweeping through all of Tianhe in an instant.","Chu Yunfan dashed out of the chamber and flew into the sky above Tianhe. It was only then that he saw the endless demonic energy boiling in the sky.","He looked in the direction of the demonic aura and saw that it was coming from outside the city. In the air, the demonic aura condensed into a cloud and formed two huge, ferocious red eyes akin to two huge red lanterns.","‘A Divine monster!’","Chu Yunfan knew that the only monster that could cause such a huge commotion was undoubtedly a monster in the Divine Abilities Stage.","In front of this huge Divine monster, there were a few figures running away in a sorry state. Chu Yunfan took a closer look and saw that the person in the lead was none other than the city lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng.","Lin Hongfeng stepped on a layer of light and fled madly in the direction of Tianhe. Next to him were Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi. There were also a few other Innates.","Of course, these people couldn’t fly. They could only fly in the sky through Lin Hongfeng’s force.","The group was fleeing in a sorry state. The monster wrapped in demonic energy behind them was constantly blasting out terrifying energy balls. Although Lin Hongfeng was able to dodge some of them, he was still hit a few times. He staggered a few times and kept coughing up blood.","Everyone’s faces were filled with misery. They didn’t expect to have drawn out such a terrifying existence.","Suddenly, an extremely huge beast claw stretched out from the huge demonic energy cloud. It swept across the sky and ruthlessly clawed at the group.","Lin Hongfeng made a move, trying to stop the beast’s claw from falling, but at this point, he didn’t have much strength to stop it and was blown away.","‘I’m going to die,’ Lin Hongfeng thought in despair.","He had done his best, but he had no way to resist. He had just stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. His glory age had just begun, but now, he was going to die here.","Just as the group was about to make a move, a shocking sword light swept through the air.","Slash!","The sword light hit the beast’s claw and blood spurted out. The huge claw fell from the sky and hit the ground.","Boom!","The huge weight created a huge pit in the ground.","“Rrrraaaagh!”","After its claw was cut off, the beast in the demonic energy cloud roared at the sky, and countless demonic energy was scattered.","Finally, its true appearance was revealed. It was a silver-white monster with a body as big as a hill. It looked like a wild dog but had two huge heads and looked extremely ferocious.","This wild dog monster roared repeatedly as its entire front paw was cut off by this shocking sword light.","Just when it was about to succeed, it failed.","Lin Hongfeng and the others, who had been waiting for death with their eyes closed, suddenly found that they were actually fine.","When they opened their eyes again, they realized that a black-robed figure had appeared before them.","“Master!” Lin Chenxi shouted out the identity of the man in surprise.","It was none other than Chu Yunfan.","At this time, after confirming the identity of the man, Lin Hongfeng and the others breathed a sigh of relief. Especially Lin Hongfeng.","During the retreat, most of the attacks had fallen on him. He had already done his best. If Chu Yunfan had been a step later, he would have died a tragic death at the hands of this monster.","“Thank you for saving my life, Mr. Chu!”","Despite his injuries, Lin Hongfeng quickly got up and cupped his hands.","“What’s going on?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Only then did Lin Hongfeng explain what was going on. It turned out to be related to the Divinity Nourishment Pill that Chu Yunfan had mentioned previously. One of the most important ingredients of the pill was the inner core of a Divine monster.","Therefore, not long after Lin Hongfeng entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he planned to hunt down a Divine monster. It had not been easy to find one.","After paying a painful price, they finally killed it. Who knew that such a terrifying monster would be drawn out immediately after?","According to his speculations, the Divine monster that he had killed was the descendant of the monster in front of them.","After all, they were of the same race, and the one he had killed had been much smaller than the two-headed wild dog. It wasn’t hard to guess the relationship between them.","They had angered this monster, which was why it had chased them all the way back here.","“I see.” Chu Yunfan didn’t know if he should say that they were unlucky to have encountered such a situation. “We’ll talk after I kill this beast.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the monster rushed over. Its body, which was as big as a small hill, brought an extremely terrifying pressure with it that no one could block.","The terrifying demonic energy swept out and almost drowned the entire sky.","Shiing!","At the critical moment, Chu Yunfan’s fingertip released a sword light, which turned into a long rainbow and crossed the sky, hitting the wild dog.","Bam!","One of the wild dog’s heads exploded on the spot, and the remaining head exploded before a great golden roc.","It died instantly."]},{"number":1005,"title":"Chapter 1005 Taining City, Each With Their Own Plans","paragraphs":["1005 Taining City, Each With Their Own Plans","Although they were mentally prepared, when they saw Chu Yunfan easily exterminate the powerful monsters that had chased them to the ends of the earth, they were still shocked.","Lin Hongfeng still didn’t know what to say. The difference in strength was too great.","Previously, he felt that the difference between the Innate Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage was like the difference between Heaven and Earth. But today, he realized that the difference between each Divine Abilities Stage was just as great.","After Chu Yunfan put the monster’s body into the Mountain River Diagram, he turned around and looked at Lin Hongfeng and the others.","!!","“Thank you for saving us, Mr. Chu.” Lin Hongfeng’s face revealed a bitter smile. In just this short time, how many times had Chu Yunfan saved him?","“It’s fine. It’s just a small matter.” Chu Yunfan waved his hand.","As for Lin Hongfeng, Lin Haoren, and the others, they didn’t know what to say. For them, it was a matter of life and death. But for Chu Yunfan, it was just a matter of lifting his hand.","“By the way, did you get the inner core of the monster you killed? Send it to the place where I’m in seclusion. I’ll refine it for you.”","Chu Yunfan’s clear voice could be heard, but his figure had already disappeared.","Lin Hongfeng quickly led everyone and flew in the direction of Tianhe.","Not long after, Lin Haoren personally brought people to deliver the ingredients needed to make the Divinity Nourishment Pill, and personally waited outside Chu Yunfan’s seclusion room for his instructions.","Chu Yunfan was quite satisfied with Lin Hongfeng’s attitude. It wasn’t difficult for him to make the pill. In just three days, it was done.","However, he didn’t just make one pill.","He had planned to turn the monster’s inner cores into Divinity Nourishment Pills. It was because he was ambushed that he did not succeed. Now, he could take advantage of this opportunity to make them.","Helping Lin Haoren to make a Divinity Nourishment Pill was just something Chu Yunfan did in passing. But when he handed the pill to Lin Haoren, Lin Haoren was so excited that he couldn’t control himself.","He was extremely grateful to Chu Yunfan.","Not long after Chu Yunfan finished making the pills, the group from Tianhe that had been selected to participate in the final distribution of the spirit stone mine set off.","This time, in addition to Lin Hongfeng and Lin Haoren, Lin Chenxi also went together with them. This time, Lin Hongfeng did not use his Divines abilities but instead brought a large group of people with him.","Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry. He sat in the carriage and gave pointers to Lin Chenxi as they traveled.","Lin Chenxi was talented. With sufficient cultivation resources and Chu Yunfan’s guidance, in just three months, she advanced one step further and entered the third Innate Stage.","This level of cultivation surpassed that of even Chu Yunfan’s younger sister, Chu Qingxuan. However, Chu Qingxuan had started late, unlike Lin Chenxi, who had been able to build a solid foundation since young.","Three days later, the group arrived at the place where the grand meeting was held—Taining City.","Compared to Tianhe, Taining was clearly bigger and more prosperous. At the same time, it was also the leader of the neighboring cities. Every time the spirit stone mine was to be redistributed, Taining would be the first and the other cities would follow.","When Chu Yunfan and his group entered Taining, they were immediately led to the inn they were to stay at.","This inn was the most expensive in Taining. However, the city had booked all the rooms to entertain the representatives of the other cities.","As soon as Chu Yunfan entered the lobby, he immediately sensed several powerful auras of Divines. Although they were well hidden, they couldn’t hide from him.","A few divine wills instantly swept in their direction but they were focused on Lin Hongfeng, who had just reached the Divine Abilities Stage. As for Chu Yunfan, these wills sensed that he was just an ordinary person, so they naturally did not probe further.","Of course, all of this was done in secret. Among the people present, only Chu Yunfan knew. Lin Hongfeng could also sense that someone was spying on them, but he wasn’t as clear about it as Chu Yunfan.","“Hmph!” Lin Hongfeng snorted coldly and sent the divine wills flying.","Those who had sent out these divine wills knew when to stop and had no intentions of further angering Lin Hongfeng. After this wave of probing, it was already enough. They had already obtained a lot of information.","At this moment, in the office of Taining’s city lord, a square-faced, robust middle-aged man was listening to the report of a thin, ordinary-looking old man.","“That is all. According to our investigations, the city lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng, has already the Divine Abilities Stage,” the thin old man reported.","This old man was the Divine who had just used his divine will to probe Lin Hongfeng.","“I see. No wonder,” the middle-aged man said indifferently.","If the people of Taining saw him, they would know that this middle-aged man was the city lord of Taining, Zhou Buyi.","“I was wondering why he dared to come,” Zhou Buyi said, “Without the protection of the Fluttering Blooms, it’s already good enough that Tianhe isn’t swallowed up by others. Isn’t participating in the division of the spirit stone mine just seeking their own death?","“However, since Lin Hongfeng has already entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he’s qualified to participate.”","Zhou Buyi paused for a moment before continuing, “But we don’t have to worry about him. Though he has entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he’s at most a tier-one Divine. He won’t pose much of a threat to us. At most, he’ll be able to keep his current share.","“The real trouble is Tuoshan City. Their city lord, Lu Shuzhou, is not someone to be trifled with. I only received this information after a few of my spies died. It seems like they’ve invited an extremely powerful master this time.”","“It’s fine. With me around, it shouldn’t be a problem. In this region, there’s no one who’s a match for me,” the old man said indifferently with absolute confidence in his tone.","“Great. Now that the mine has been sealed, whoever wins first place will get to enter first. I can seal the mine for a few days. I hope that you’ll make this quick,” Zhou Buyi said.","“Don’t worry. According to our agreement, we’ll each get half of the benefits.”","The old man’s eyes lit up when he thought of the item in the depths of the spirit stone mine. He had never thought that such a treasure would be produced in this mine."]},{"number":1006,"title":"Chapter 1006 The Start of the Grand Meeting","paragraphs":["1006 The Start of the Grand Meeting","At the same time, in another courtyard of the inn.","The Tuoshan City group, which Taining was most afraid of, was discussing the arrival of the Tianhe group.","In a secret room, there were more than a dozen people. Without exception, all of them were martial artist experts with powerful auras.","The most powerful of them all was naturally the city lord of Tuoshan. He was a tall, slender, middle-aged man who looked rather cold.","!!","“I’ve looked into it. It matches the information obtained by our spies. Lin Hongfeng has entered the Divine Abilities Stage,” Lu Shuzhou, the city lord of Tuoshan said, “But he won’t be an obstacle for us. This time, our real opponent is Zhou Buyi. Taining has been the champion many times. This time, it’s our turn to win!”","Lu Shuzhou clenched the handrail in front of him. Among the cities in this area, Taining had always been the first, and Tuoshan was second.","The two sides competed in all aspects. However, Tuoshan had been suppressed by Taining all this time.","In Lu Shuzhou’s opinion, it was time for a change.","“Zhou Buyi thinks that I don’t know what’s happening in the mine. He sealed it and did not tell anyone about it. He’s too naive.” Lu Shuzhou sneered.","In his opinion, it was not that Zhou Buyi did not know that other people knew about it. It was that he did not care. According to the tacit understanding between the various cities, they had to divide the final share with their final strength.","“This time, it’s Tuoshan’s turn to reach the top!”","Due to the arrival of Tianhe, the whole of Taining was in turmoil.","This was because Tianhe was the last group to arrive. Many people thought that after losing the protection of the Fluttering Blooms, Tianhe would not send anyone here.","Without a Divine to hold the fort, they would not be able to hold on to their share and would only be asking for humiliation if they came.","Although there was a negotiation mechanism for the shares of the mine, in reality, the final share was still decided by one’s strength.","Without strength, it was useless to say anything.","In the Holy Land, the number and strength of Divines represented strength.","Who knew that the representatives of Tianhe would actually come? As time passed, the news that the city lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng, had entered the Divine Abilities Stage spread like wildfire. Too many people had sensed it, so it was impossible to hide it.","Many people suddenly realized that this was what happened.","However, everyone’s attention quickly shifted away from Tianhe, as the city was not the focus of this friendly competition.","All this time, the true focus of this friendly competition had always been between Taining and Tuoshan. It was never changing.","While the rumors continued, the Tianhe group settled down in the inn. After checking in, the first thing Chu Yunfan did was leave the inn. He didn’t stay for long. The conference hadn’t started yet, so he still had enough time.","As soon as he left the inn, he felt someone following him. However, the person following him was only at the Innate Stage, so of course, with his cultivation level, the person couldn’t keep up with him. After a few turns, he lost track of Chu Yunfan.","However, according to their intelligence, Chu Yunfan was not an important person, so no one really cared about him. No one knew what Chu Yunfan had done.","On the second day after the Tianhe group arrived, the competition began.","This time’s exchange meet would be held on a huge fighting ring and was open to everyone. This was mechanism was proposed by Taining. As they were the victors every time, they were willing to use this method to declare their strength.","Everyone was divided into small square formations according to their respective camps and swept into the ring one after another.","Below the stage, many people craned their necks to look at the big shots who were usually high and mighty, each with their own bearing.","Many of these people were residents of various cities. After all, the mine shares distributed to each city were directly related to the interests of many people in the city. Everyone wanted their city to improve. Although it couldn’t be compared to Taining, it would be good if it could improve.","At first, many people had placed their hopes on Tianhe, thinking that their share would be divided if Tianhe did not appear. Who would have thought that the representative of Tianhe would appear at this critical moment?","“Sure enough, the city lord of Tianhe has come. I thought he wouldn’t. This time, no one from Tianhe came to observe the ceremony. I didn’t expect the Tianhe group to suddenly arrive yesterday.”","“That’s right, but I heard that it’s because the city lord of Tianhe has entered the Divine Abilities Stage. They will at least be able to retain their shares.”","“The city lord himself is in the Divine Abilities Stage? This is rare!”","Many people began to discuss.","After discussing the sudden appearance of Tianhe, everyone’s eyes were on Lu Shuzhou of Tuoshan and Zhou Buyian of Taining. In many people’s eyes, the final victor would definitely be decided between these two forces.","This time, they wondered what kind of experts the two cities had invited.","“Everyone, this is a consultation meeting. We’ll use a royal rumble to determine the distribution of the spirit stone mine in the next few years. According to the rules of the Multi-City Alliance, any problems must be solved in the ring. After the battle, everyone must distribute the mine according to the results of the competition. No disputes are allowed. If there are any disputes, don’t blame me for being rude.”","At this moment, the city lord of Taining, Zhou Buyi, stood up and announced. He was the organizer and the champion of the competition over the years, so he naturally had the right to speak.","“That’s right, I agree as well. Everything will be decided by the results in the ring. A win is a win and a loss is a loss. You must be willing to accept your loss,” Lu Shuzhou suddenly said.","Everyone’s attention was drawn to Lu Shuzhou. However, everyone knew that he was not supporting Zhou Buyi. He probably had other intentions.","“In that case, let’s start the sparring. There’s nothing to be said about fists and legs. If you bump into each other, there’s no other way. Please think carefully before you step into the ring.”","With that, Zhou Buyi returned to his seat, his face calm and composed.","The other Divines and city lords also sat down.","“Lin Hongfeng, in the past, you had the Fluttering Blooms’s support, weren’t you very arrogant? Today, without the Fluttering Blooms, you still dare to appear? You’re really confident in yourself.”"]},{"number":1007,"title":"Chapter 1007 The Ghost Monkey King Suffered a Crushing Defeat","paragraphs":["1007 The Ghost Monkey King Suffered a Crushing Defeat","One of the city lords spoke up immediately after this shout.","“It’s the city lord of Tianxing City!”","Someone recognized the man who spoke. He looked to be in his forties and the muscles on his body bulged. He was clearly a martial arts master with a strong cultivation base.","“Hasn’t Tianxing always been the at the botton? They actually dare to provoke the city lord of Tianhe?!”","“Previously, Tianhe had the protection of the Fluttering Blooms. No matter what, they were always in the middle of the rankings. Now, they’re in a poor state. Why shouldn’t Tianxing take advantage of this opportunity to seize Tianhe’s ranking? After all, the ranking represents the share.”","“Sure enough, Tianhe has become a soft persimmon in the eyes of many people. It’s in high demand!”","Everyone’s eyes turned to the city lord of Tianxing and Lin Hongfeng.","Lin Hongfeng stood up and said, “What? Are you planning to fight me?”","Lin Hongfeng looked at Tianxing’s city lord with disdain. Although Tianhe was in a precarious situation, its city lord had still entered the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, Tianxing’s city lord was only at the peak of the Innate Stage. He hadn’t crossed the line. And the fact was that he hadn’t crossed it was the difference between Heaven and Earth.","“Of course not.”","Under Lin Hongfeng’s gaze, Tianxing’s city lord grew a little angry. He could read the meaning in Lin Hongfeng’s eyes. However, he quickly suppressed his anger. After all, this kind of competition didn’t require him to participate in person.","‘You’ll be crying when you’re defeated!’ Tianxing’s city lord thought to himself.","Then, beside him, a short figure suddenly jumped into the ring and stood on the opposite side of Lin Hongfeng.","“It’s you,” Lin Hongfeng said, but he was not very surprised.","There were only so many people who participated in the final consultation meeting. It was not surprising that each city had invited so many people.","This short man was the representative of Tianxing. He was wrapped in energy from head to toe, exuding an extremely dangerous aura.","“Ghost Monkey King!” Lin Hongfeng said the short man’s name.","It was said that Ghost Monkey King had eaten some kind of heavenly treasure that allowed him to step into the Divine Abilities Stage by chance. However, he had also exhausted all his potential and had not made any progress for many years.","However, this was the highest level of expert that Tianxing could invite. Otherwise, Tianxing wouldn’t have been at the bottom for so many years.","But now, Tianxing finally saw hope for further improvement, and that was to defeat Lin Hongfeng. Even if their rankings went up only by slightly, their share would still increase by quite a bit.","Boom!","Ghost Monkey King didn’t say a word and immediately attacked. In an instant, the entire world was filled with endless ghost energy, which began to condense madly. Then, the energy turned into an incomparably huge ghost, which rushed toward Lin Hongfeng.","The speed of this move was extremely fast. In an instant, it made the entire ring boil. In an instant, the barrier that had been buried in the ring long ago was awakened.","Lin Hongfeng’s reaction speed was also extremely fast. Back then, before he had broken through, he could feel that Ghost Monkey King was very strong. So strong that it was almost impossible to resist. But now that he had truly entered this level, he realized that everything was not so difficult to resist.","Bam!","Ghost Monkey King and Lin Hongfeng were engaged in a fierce battle. Outside the ring, many people were watching with great enjoyment. They could feel the entire ring shaking. If it wasn’t for the barrier, they would have been injured.","Ghost Monkey King and Lin Hongfeng attacked again immediately after their first attack failed. Their speed was so fast that even if an ordinary person concentrated all their True Energy in their eyes, their dynamic vision would not be able to keep up with the battle.","One could only hear the loud sounds of collision. Both sides engaged in a fierce battle, neither giving way to the other.","Many people were extremely surprised. After all, Ghost Monkey King had been famous for many years. Although his cultivation had not made much progress, he was considered a veteran Divine.","However, Lin Hongfeng was said to have just entered the Divine Abilities Stage not long ago, yet he was able to fight Ghost Monkey King to a standstill.","“How is this happening?” The city lord of Tianxing’s expression changed. He was no longer as confident as before. Although Lin Hongfeng had just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, Ghost Monkey King did not seem to be any better than him.","Many city lords were shocked by Lin Hongfeng’s sudden display of strength. Probably only Lu Shuzhou and Zhou Buyi didn’t take it to heart. In their eyes, they only considered each other as strong opponents. The others were nothing.","Lin Hongfeng became stronger as the battle progressed. In a short while, he had completely integrated his skills. Although no one in his family had entered the Divine Abilities Stage for many years, his ancestors had, after all, produced Divines.","There were Divine techniques in the clan, but no one had the qualifications to cultivate them. Lin Hongfeng had cultivated these martial arts techniques in the past few months, and his strength had increased greatly, even surpassing Ghost Monkey King.","“Father is going to win! That’s great!” Seeing that her father was not at a disadvantage, Lin Chenxi’s heart, which had been clenched all this time, finally relaxed.","“Yes.” Lin Haoren nodded. Although it wasn’t his first time seeing Divines fight, this time was different. One of them was his closest relative.","Bam!","In an instant, while everyone was still shocked by Lin Hongfeng’s sudden explosive strength, Lin Hongfeng’s attack landed on Ghost Monkey King’s chest.","Ghost Monkey King was sent flying and crashed into the barrier of the ring. He spat out a mouthful of blood and was instantly defeated.","Lin Hongfeng was gasping for breath. He had expended a great deal of energy, but in the end, he defeated Ghost Monkey King and established his position.","Countless experts outside the ring were shocked. However, the Divines in the ring were all calm. After all, they knew that Ghost Monkey King’s advancement was a fluke. It was fine if he was just bullying Innate Stage experts, but if he were to meet an expert of the same level, even if it was someone who had just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he might not be a match for them.","It wasn’t without reason that Tianxing had always been at the bottom for so many years.","‘Trash!’ Tianxing’s city lord cursed in his heart, but he did not dare to say it out loud.","Ghost Monkey King might not be able to deal with Lin Hongfeng, but he was more than enough to deal with him.","If he had other trump cards, he wouldn’t have to beg Ghost Monkey King to take the stage every time. Ghost Monkey King was unable to get more shares for him and could only ensure that Tianxing wouldn’t be eliminated.","Thinking of this, he was extremely sullen. He thought he had a chance this year, but who knew that Lin Hongfeng would suddenly rise and break all his fantasies."]},{"number":1008,"title":"Chapter 1008 The Confrontation Between Two Cities, Not Giving In","paragraphs":["1008 The Confrontation Between Two Cities, Not Giving In","“City lord of Tianxing, it seems like your scheme this time was in vain. You’d better obediently stay at the bottom,” Lin Hongfeng said without any mercy.","After all, when Tianxing’s city lord chose him to be the soft persimmon to pinch, both sides had shed all pretenses of cordiality. If he were to lose, then the words of Tianxing’s city lord would probably be even more unpleasant.","However, after defeating Ghost Monkey King and Tianxing’s city lord, the situation did not change for the better for Lin Hongfeng. In the eyes of the public, besides Tianxing, which had always been at the bottom, Tianhe was the weakest.","Tianxing’s share was the smallest, so defeating them wouldn’t get Tianhe any more shares. However, Lin Hongfeng was different. Tianhe was originally ranked in the middle. If they defeated him, they could replace his ranking and obtain more shares.","!!","As such, they all chose to challenge Lin Hongfeng, whose cultivation base was only at the early stages of the Divine Abilities Stage. Those who came to challenge him were all experienced Divines. Unlike Ghost Monkey King, who had made some mistakes in his cultivation, they were naturally stronger than Lin Hongfeng.","Only once did Lin Hongfeng tie with the other party, but that city’s ranking was still below them. Even if he defeated the other party, it was impossible to get more shares.","Tianhe, which was weak but had a good ranking, was naturally a target in the eyes of many people.","Lin Hongfeng could tell at a glance that most of those Divines were much stronger than him and that he could not deal with them at all. Therefore, he simply admitted defeat. As he admitted defeat, his ranking continued to fall, and soon, he fell to the last three.","At this point, no one challenged Lin Hongfeng anymore because it was not necessary. It would be a waste of time and energy.","Even if someone had a grudge against Lin Hongfeng and wanted to take the opportunity to cripple him, Lin Hongfeng would not make a move and simply admitted defeat.","They couldn’t do anything because of the rules. After all, this rule was set by everyone and it was impossible to break it openly.","Tianxing’s city lord glared at Lin Hongfeng fiercely. Seeing that Lin Hongfeng’s ranking had also fallen, he was extremely happy.","Only Lin Hongfeng looked at the experts who were constantly fighting in the ring with a livid expression. These people treated him as a soft persimmon. After using him, they kicked him away. His ranking continued to fall and his share also continued to decrease. The benefits he lost in the process made him feel like his heart was bleeding.","But no matter how angry he was, it was useless. No one cared about them anymore.","“When will Mr. Chu get back?” Lin Hongfeng suppressed the anger in his heart and asked his daughter, Lin Chenxi, next to him.","“I don’t know either. Master didn’t say where he went. He only said he was going out for a stroll.” Lin Chenxi’s face revealed a bitter smile. At this time, it could be said that it was the most critical moment, but her master was nowhere to be seen.","“Haoren, send someone to find Mr. Chu. Don’t alert the others,” Lin Hongfeng ordered.","“Understood.” Lin Haoren quickly turned around and exited the ring.","Lin Hongfeng looked livid. His original estimation had been too optimistic. He thought that with his strength, it would not be difficult to maintain Tianhe’s current share. Who knew that it was not the case at all.","He had only just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, so it was not difficult for him to defeat Ghost Monkey King. However, against the others, he was far from being able to do so.","Originally, he only wanted Chu Yunfan to hold the line for him, but now it seemed that Chu Yunfan had to do it. Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s demonic strength, he suddenly felt that there was hope. These people might be very strong, but compared to Chu Yunfan, they were far too weak.","What Innate? What Divine? He had personally seen Chu Yunfan kill another Divine with a single slap. That kind of terrifying power had left a deep impression in his heart.","He believed that as long as Chu Yunfan appeared, the situation would surely turn around.","Originally, Lin Hongfeng didn’t want to be in the limelight. After losing the protection of the Fluttering Blooms, Tianhe could be said to have entered an unprecedented period of decline, and Chu Yunfan couldn’t possibly stay in Tianhe forever.","He just wanted to keep his share and wait for his cultivation to improve.","But now, each and every one of these people was treating him as a soft persimmon, not giving him a way out at all. Each and every one of them wanted to step on him to rise up.","‘Don’t blame me for being impolite. Just you wait. You’ll all regret it when Mr. Chu returns!’","At this time, no one noticed Lin Hongfeng’s expression and were all looking at the ring.","The Divines took turns fighting each other, which made the audience extremely satisfied, because not everyone could see Divines fight.","Finally, after many experts took turns to attack, the main event of the competition arrived. It was the battle between Taining and Tuoshan that would decide the outcome of the conference.","Beside the city lord of Taining, a thin old man entered and said, “I’ve been watching for so long. It’s time to stretch these old bones!”","The appearance of this old man caused the atmosphere of the entire ring to freeze over. The weaker experts didn’t even consider making a move because this old man was the great expert who had always been ranked as the number one expert in Taining City, Xu Long.","In the nearby cities, there was not a single person who did not know him.","Seeing that no one dared to come forward, Xu Long’s face showed a satisfied smile. This kind of prestige was built up through countless battles.","In recent times, no one dared to challenge his authority. The other cities had to compete for their positions and rankings. However, the number one position in Taining had been acknowledged by almost everyone.","“Since no one has come out to challenge my city, then according to the rules, Taining will take first place. According to the rules, the mine will continue to be managed by Taining,” Zhou Buyi announced.","“Wait!”","Suddenly, Lu Shuzhou, the city lord of Tuoshan, spoke up.","Everyone’s breathing stopped for a moment. Everyone knew that the real collision was about to begin.","“What’s wrong? Do you have any objections to this result, Lord Liu?” Zhou Buyi said.","“Lord Zhou, in the past, it has always been your city that was in charge of the mine because you were the strongest. I have no objection to that. However, the situation is different this year. Since we’re going to divide the shares according to strength, I think Tuoshan should also have the right to be in charge of the mine,” Lu Shuzhou said.","Facing Zhou Buyi’s sharp gaze, Lu Shuzhou didn’t back down."]},{"number":1009,"title":"Chapter 1009 The Sect Leader of Great Joy? Chu Yunfan’s Appearance!","paragraphs":["1009 The Sect Leader of Great Joy? Chu Yunfan’s Appearance!","Lu Shuzhou looked at Zhou Buyi coldly and said, “I think that Tuoshan also has the right to control the mine. It doesn’t have to be Taining. What do you think, Lord Zhou?”","Lu Shuzhou was aggressive, but everyone knew that this time, Tuoshan was definitely prepared. They would not let this go easily.","“Oh?” Xu Long looked at Lu Shuzhou and said with a sharp gaze. “What? You have an objection, Lord Lu? Are you planning to fight me?” Xu Long looked at Lu Shuzhou with a disdainful expression.","He knew that Lu Shuzhou had also entered the Divine Abilities Stage but was still no match for him. He had helped Taining win so many times, so he was naturally not someone an ordinary Divine could compare to.","“You are no doubt powerful, Sir Xu,” Lu Shuzhou said, “I can’t compare to you. However, even though I can’t compare to you, there are people who want to spar with you.”","“Who is it? Come out!” Xu Long’s eyes swept across the crowd. He seemed to be wondering who would dare to stand out and provoke him. After all, with his strength, he was not afraid.","“It’s me!”","A figure descended from the sky with a loud shout.","It was an old man with white hair and a ruddy complexion. Although he looked very old, there was not a single wrinkle on his face. On the contrary, he had a strange exuberant vitality.","“It’s you!” Xu Long immediately recognized the old man.","The old man immediately put a great pressure on him. It instantly rushed from the soles of his feet to his head.","“Not bad, Xu Long. You remember me. Not bad.” The old man looked at Xu Long with a smile on his face.","“What’s wrong? Sir Xu? Who is that?” The Lord of Taining, Zhou Buyi, realized that something was wrong. This old man had just appeared, and he had already caused the expression of Xu Long, who he had spent countless resources to invite, to change drastically.","This man was clearly a great enemy.","“That’s the current sect leader of Great Joy, Li Tao.”","Xu Long’s words immediately made everyone at the scene suck in a breath of cold air. Many people didn’t know Li Tao, but the title of the current sect leader of Great Joy was enough.","Although the main sect of Great Joy was not here, it was undoubtedly a super sect that was comparable to the annihilated Fluttering Blooms.","Normally, even the Fluttering Blooms’s sect leader would not easily intervene in this competition because he also had to consider the opinion of others.","And now that the Fluttering Blooms had been destroyed, it naturally could not stop the coveting of the large sects outside. Li Tao might be the first, but he would probably not be the last.","Zhou Buyi sucked in a breath of cold air. In the past, he had always felt that the Fluttering Blooms was an eyesore, but now he realized that without the Fluttering Blooms blocking the way, many other sects would probably stretch their hands in.","Everyone knew of Great Joy’s reputation. The city lords of the other city didn’t look too good because they had already thought that if the other sects stretched their hands into the city in the future, they wouldn’t be able to have a good time.","Only Lu Shuzhou, the city lord of Tuoshan, sneered. He had long been dissatisfied with the situation of Taining’s monopoly.","And now, it was time to change all this.","“Since you know who I am, do you still dare to attack me?” Li Tao looked at Xu Long coldly. Compared with Xu Long’s arrogant attitude before, his attitude was even more so.","Li Tao was different from Xu Long. Xu Long was just an independent cultivator. Although it was very impressive that he had cultivated to this stage, an independent cultivator was still an independent cultivator. He could not compare to Li Tao.","“Although you’re powerful, Sect Leader Li, it’s not my style to retreat without a fight,” Xu Long said indifferently.","He knew very well that the ties between him and Taining were too deep. He had received too many benefits, so how could he just leave like that?","This was against the rules. At that time, he would have no foothold in the Holy Land.","At this time, many people were in a dilemma. Although they didn’t like Xu Long, Li Tao, the sect leader of Great Joy, who had suddenly appeared, was obviously not a kind person.","“You’re overestimating yourself,” Li Tao said with a sneer.","“Father, we’ve already reached this stage. Why does Sir Xu Long still want to take action?” Lin Haoren asked in a low voice.","Even he could see that the gap between Xu Long and Li Tao was not small. If not for this, Xu Long’s wouldn’t look so bad.","“Because there are some things that have to be done. When the time comes, you have to do it. Taining has supported him for so many years. It’d be easy for him to leave now, but there won’t be a place for him in the Holy Land in the future if he does,” Lin Hongfeng explained.","“But Sir Xu Long is clearly no match for Li Tao.” Lin Haoren still couldn’t understand.","Lin Hongfeng looked at his son and sighed a little. His son was still too young.","“That’s because Xu Long is going to use his divine power to force out his potential.” All of a sudden, a figure had appeared behind them.","After the initial shock, Lin Hongfeng was immediately overjoyed because the person was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Previously, he had been on tenterhooks, but now that Chu Yunfan was back, he finally felt relieved.","Without waiting for Lin Haoren to ask any more questions, as soon as Chu Yunfan’s voice fell, Xu Long’s aura began to rise madly. After reaching a limit, it soared again, breaking through and reaching the next level.","An extremely terrifying aura suppressed the entire scene.","As soon as he came up, Xu Long used all his strength and didn’t dare to hesitate. Even so, his expression was still solemn.","‘Tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage,’ Chu Yunfan determined as he glanced casually at Xu Long.","After Xu Long had unleashed all his strength and forced out all his potential, he had stepped into tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","It was no wonder he could suppress everyone for so many years. The experts present were generally only in tier two or three of the Divine Abilities Stage. Even if a tier four Divine was powerful, his strength was far from Xu Long’s.","However, even in the face of Xu Long, who had used all his strength, Li Tao’s expression still didn’t change. He simply said, “I’ll let you make the first move. Otherwise, you won’t have any chance to make a move.”","Xu Long’s face was unsightly. He was completely looked down on by the other party.","With a roar, the divine power in his entire body boiled. He raised his hand, clenched it into a fist, and punched at Lin Tao.","Roar!","The fist force condensed and turned into a long dragon. It tore through the void and blasted toward Li Tao."]},{"number":1010,"title":"Chapter 1010 I Killed Those Good-For-Nothings","paragraphs":["1010 I Killed Those Good-For-Nothings","This long dragon formed from divine power burst out with a terrifying light and headed straight for Li Tao.","The killing intent of this punch soared to the sky. The terrifying energy contained in it seemed capable of tearing the world apart.","Although Xu Long was also old, his qi and blood were not lacking.","With just one punch, Li Tao was instantly engulfed.","“You overestimate yourself.”","Li Tao’s evaluation was only these three words. The moment the long dragon bombarded his body, Li Tao pounced forward like an ape. His hands instantly turned into sharp claws that instantly tore apart the dragon.","That terrifying fist force could not cause any harm to Li Tao.","“How is this possible?!” Xu Long said in disbelief. He was unwilling to admit it. He knew that Li Tao’s strength was above his, but he couldn’t believe his full-force attack simply couldn’t do anything to Li Tao.","The gap was bigger than he had imagined.","“What’s impossible about it? Do you think you’re just a little weaker than me?” Li Tao sneered and put his hands behind his back. The qi and blood in his body boiled up and continuously shook the sky.","In the blink of an eye, he reached Xu Long’s level and then surpassed Xu Long. He charged straight into tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Even tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage was not his limit. After a series of breakthroughs, he broke through to tier eight. Although he remained in the early stages of this tier, it was enough to crush Xu Long.","The difference was too great.","When Lin Hongfeng saw that Li Tao’s cultivation reach tier eight, he felt his whole body tremble. Although they were both Divines, the difference between tier one and tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage was like Heaven and Earth.","If Li Tao wanted to kill him, Li Tao simply need to point his finger.","But when Lin Hongfeng saw Chu Yunfan’s calm expression, which clearly showed that he was not alarmed, he felt a lot more at ease.","With this kind of cultivation level, Xu Long could not possibly be a match for Li Tao, but that did not mean that Chu Yunfan was not either.","“Tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage? Impossible. You’re even stronger than Fluttering Bloom’s sect leader?!”","Xu Long couldn’t believe it. Tier eight Divines were considered impressive masters throughout the Holy Land. All of them were extremely powerful masters—a patriarch of a region.","“That’s right. I’ve just made a breakthrough too. In this area, I’m invincible. Daring to provoke me means you’ve asked for death.” Li Tao nodded his head. “I gave you a chance earlier but you didn’t cherish it.”","As soon as Li Tao’s voice fell, the divine power in his whole body condensed. He clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out.","Boom!","The fist force of this punch exploded like a storm.","Xu Long gritted his teeth. He knew that there was no way he could back down now. He stomped his feet into the ground and stabilized himself. Then, in the blink of an eye, he threw dozens of punches at the incoming fist force.","Boom, boom, boom!","After thunderous roars, everyone saw that Xu Long’s dozens of punches were extremely powerful, but they were still instantly scattered.","There was no way he could block Li Tao’s punch. The strength of a tier-eight Divine was not something a martial artist like Xu Long, who was only at the peak of tier-six after forcing out all his potential, could compare to.","“These are the consequences!”","This punch shattered Xu Long’s defense and he was hit head-on. He screamed out and was sent flying.","Bam!","Xu Long fell heavily to the ground and spurted out a mouthful of blood. This blow had broken all the bones in his body. The difference in strength was clear.","Meanwhile, the city lord of Taining, Zhou Buyi, was stunned. He had nothing to say. After all, he could see that Xu Long had used all his strength but still couldn’t stop Li Tao.","Li Tao intended to establish his might, so he held nothing back. He wanted to intimidate the heroes. Now, he was the key player among the key players.","Tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage. Who could stop him? Who could rival him?","Lu Shuzhou, the city lord of Tuoshan, had a smug look on his face. He had paid a huge price to invite Li Tao, the sect leader of Great Joy. It seemed like it was all worth it.","“I’ve already said that the gap between us is too great,” Li Tao said expressionlessly.","Defeating Xu Long was not something to be happy about, not to mention that Li Tao had just broken through. Even if he hadn’t, it would be as easy as lifting a finger for him to deal with Xu Long.","Lu Shuzhou could not wait to announce that Tuoshan would be in control of the mine for the next few years.","However, Li Tao’s interest was quickly piqued. He then turned to the group from Tianhe.","“You’re the Lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng? How dare you kill the disciples of my sect. Who gave you the guts to do that?” Li Tao said while looking at Lin Hongfeng coldly.","He only found out about the murder of his disciples after he came out of seclusion. This was simply unforgivable.","At this time, everyone finally knew that Lin Hongfeng had killed the disciples of Great Joy. If they didn’t think it was a big deal before, then now that the sect leader of Great Joy was present and had displayed his amazing strength, it was simply a disaster for Tianhe.","The Tianhe group suddenly felt a boundless pressure crushing down on them. They were almost out of breath, and just the questioning made them feel like they were about to collapse.","However, after Li Tao asked the question, he attacked again without waiting for Lin Hongfeng’s answer. He clearly never intended to wait for an answer. Knowing that Lin Hongfeng had killed his disciples was good enough.","A huge Qi-condensed hand appeared out of thin air and slapped down toward Lin Hongfeng and the people of Tianhe.","Lin Hongfeng and the others couldn’t move. They were intimidated by the aura, and the fear from the bottom of their hearts made them unable to move.","Just as the big hand made of Qi was about to kill the people from Tianhe, a big sword made of Qi appeared out of thin air and slashed at the big hand.","Slice!","The Qi-condensed hand was slashed apart and exploded.","“Who did that?!” Li Tao’s face suddenly changed as he opened his mouth and roared.","“It was me!”","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally made his move. He stepped forward and stood in front of the Tianhe group, shielding them from Li Tao.","“I was the one who killed those good-for-nothings,” Chu Yunfan said nonchanlantly.","“You’re looking for death!” Li Tao roared.","..."]},{"number":1011,"title":"Chapter 1011 Killing Li Tao With a Punch","paragraphs":["1011 Killing Li Tao With a Punch","Li Tao was furious. His eyes were cold and full of killing intent.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan.","There was no doubting Li Tao’s strength. He had suppressed them for so many years that no one dared to have any thoughts of challenging him. He defeated Xu Long with just one move. The strength of such a person was simply terrifying, so much so that they didn’t even dare to have any thoughts of resisting.","However, Chu Yunfan still decided to stick out his neck.","!!","Who was this person?","There had been too many twists and turns today. The side that was originally thought to be a soft persimmon produced another character. Li Tao’s extremely terrifying pressure didn’t have the slightest effect on this black-clad youth.","Chu Yunfan looked at Li Tao with eyes full of disgust, and said, “I can feel the resentment of countless people radiating from you. How many women have you destroyed to reach this stage?!”","Li Tao’s eyes showed a hint of surprise. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to be able to see through his situation.","It was true. His method of cultivation was based upon the taking of yin energy from countless women to reach this step.","A general’s success was built on ten thousand bones. To reach this level, he had used the tragic deaths of countless women as stepping stones.","Chu Yunfan’s words reminded many people of Great Joy’s cultivation method, which was to use women as human cauldrons, then finally pluck their essence and devour them.","“Hmph!” Li Tao snorted coldly. “You alone want to go against me? I think you’re overestimating your ability.”","“Make your move. Don’t say I didn’t give you a chance,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“Hahahaha! Very well, I’ve never met someone more arrogant than me. You’re the first!”","Li Tao was burning with anger. He noticed the disgust and disdain in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, and his heart burned with anger.","“You won’t have the chance to do so in the future,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Li Tao got serious. His entire body shined, distorting the air and forming an extremely strange power around his body. The terrifying aura overflowed into the sky like a violent tide, radiating out in all directions.","Li Tao clenched his five fingers into a fist. All the divine power in his body was instilled into this move. He swept out, unlike when he was dealing with Xu Long before, where he still held back.","Chu Yunfan had completely infuriated him. In his rage, he didn’t intend to leave Chu Yunfa any possibility of surviving.","In an instant, Li Tao’s hair stood up and his clothes fluttered. He looked extremely terrifying.","Everyone felt that they couldn’t breathe. It was as if the entire world was under Li Tao’s control.","Boom!","The fist energy boiled and exploded like a violent tide, blasting toward Chu Yunfan.","However, everyone immediately discovered that an even more mysterious power was surging out of Chu Yunfan, and the terrifying tide of Li Tao’s punch was frozen in mid-air.","This feeling was very abrupt, and it was something that no one could have imagined.","In an instant, it was as if time had frozen. However, none of the people present were ordinary people, so they naturally didn’t believe that time had stopped. It was Chu Yunfan who had stopped the punch.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying aura was being released. It was as if a ferocious beast that had been suppressed for many years was finally coming out of the fence.","“Oh no!”","Li Tao instantly felt an extremely sense of danger rising from his heart and spreading out at an astonishing speed.","He wanted to pull back, but he found that not only was his fist force been taken over, but even his fist was fixed in place. All of this happened in the blink of an eye, but it was enough for a fight between masters of this level.","He hurriedly roared and all the divine power in his body boiled. In an instant, he broke free from this inexplicable binding power.","However, Chu Yunfan also launched his attack. He clenched his fist and then simply threw a punch.","Boom!","A terrifying sound like a thunderclap suddenly burst out. This punch shook the entire world.","The fist intent evolved into a golden asura. This asura roared and punched Li Tao.","Li Tao hastily retreated to avoid the punch, but there was no way. He was completely locked down.","At this time, he finally felt what Xu Long had felt before. He had crushed Xu Long, and now Chu Yunfan was crushing him.","‘Impossible!’","Li Tao kept retreating, thinking that it was impossible. He didn’t believe that there would be such an unrivaled earth-shattering power. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was definitely much lower than his—at most tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, the density of Chu Yunfan’s divine power did not seem to be at the level of a tier-five Divine. Instead, it was far beyond this level.","However, regardless of whether Li Tao was willing to accept it or not, there was no room for him to retreat. The punch was already in front of him.","Boom!","He threw out a punch in an attempt to counter Chu Yunfan’s asura fist. However, all his counterattacks were instantly crushed and scattered.","Boom!","After shattering Li Tao’s attack, Chu Yunfan’s fist didn’t slow down, and continued to attack him. He didn’t have time to dodge and could only meet the attack head-on.","“He’s too strong!”","Li Tao instantly lost his fighting strength. At his level, how could he not distinguish the outcome of the battle?","Ever since he stepped out of the Dao, he had never encountered such a terrifying existence. Especially since he stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, he had never encountered an existence that he felt he could not fight against.","Li Tao’s plan didn’t succeed. Chu Yunfan was even faster than his. In a few flashes, Chu Yunfan had already arrived before him, blocking his escape route.","“Since you’ve forced me to this point, I’ll fight you to the death!”","At this time, Li Tao had been forced to the limit. The evil in his heart immediately began to circulate a secret technique, and all the divine power in his body was condensed, turning into a terrifying attack. This terrifying attack enveloped Chu Yunfan, trying to kill him.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, wasn’t afraid in the slightest. With a shake of his body, he turned into a golden roc that soared across the sky. That was the fist intent derived from the fist technique.","It burst out and instantly dispersed all of Li Tao’s attacks.","Boom!","...","Chu Yunfan’s punch hit Li Tao head-on.","Li Tao let out a blood-curdling scream as his body was torn into pieces and died on the spot."]},{"number":1012,"title":"Chapter 1012 Famous Throughout the Region","paragraphs":["1012 Famous Throughout the Region","A deathly silence fell.","It was as if someone was strangling their necks, and everyone felt like they were about to suffocate.","Everyone was dumbfounded. Today, all kinds of accidents had happened one after another, subverting everyone’s expectations.","Originally, everyone thought that even though Tuoshan and Taining would have a fierce battle, Taining would be the final victor. This had always been a tradition.","!!","However, Li Tao’s appearance broke this tradition. In this area, Xu Long, who was powerful enough to dominate, was easily defeated by Li Tao.","Li Tao, who was at tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage and was almost invincible, was easily defeated by Chu Yunfan.","Everything was like magic. Nobody could believe it.","This was especially true for Lu Shuzhou, the city lord of Tuoshan. He had paid a huge price to recruit Li Tao, but Chu Yunfan had easily killed Li Tao.","All of Lu Shuzhou’s efforts had gone to waste. He felt that the ups and downs of life were too fast.","There was another person who also felt this way, and that was the Lord of Taining, Zhou Buyi. He thought that victory was already in his grasp, but who knew that his expert would be defeated so quickly?","And the final victor was not his city’s old nemesis, Tuoshan, but Tianhe, which they had not even cared about before.","His eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan as if he wanted to imprint all of him into his eyes. Such a terrifying existence could kill him with a single slap. What if he offended Chu Yunfan in the future?","In fact, everyone present only had one thought. From now on, the rise of Tianhe would be almost unstoppable. Such a terrifying existence was enough to establish a sect in the Holy Land and become a Great Ancestor. He could also be ranked at the forefront of the Holy Land.","However, what made them feel even more strange was that an expert of this level couldn’t possibly be unknown no matter what. What era was it now? It wasn’t the kind of era where one could just find a deep mountain in an old forest to cultivate for hundreds of years.","Just the various resources used for cultivation alone made it impossible for people to live in seclusion. In theory, it was impossible for such an expert to exist unless they were from another world.","What they didn’t know was that the thought that flashed through their minds was the truth.","“If I’m correct, according to the rules, Tianhe is now the victor of this competition.”","Chu Yunfan’s words made everyone suddenly realize that not only had he killed Li Tao, but he had also won the negotiation. According to the rules, Tianhe was the champion and would receive the most shares.","“I assume nobody has any objections,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Since things had already come to this point, he didn’t mind standing up for Tianhe. After all, it was just a few words.","Everyone was intimidated by Chu Yunfan, so they naturally didn’t have any more objections. Even Zhou Shuzhou and Lu Shuzhou couldn’t help but quickly express their agreement.","Under such circumstances, even if they all worked together, they still wouldn’t be stronger than Chu Yunfan. It was clear from the fact that Chu Yunfan had easily killed Li Tao.","The people from Tianhe looked extremely excited. Before they came, they never dreamt that they would have such a big surprise. Even Lin Hongfeng only wanted to keep his share. He never thought that he would be able to defeat Taining and Tuoshan and obtain the largest share.","This was simply a golden pie that had fallen from the sky.","The news of Tianhe’s sudden rise and the fact that they had seized the largest share of the mine spread in all directions at an amazing speed.","This news stunned everyone. They all expected Taining to take first place again.","Even if there was a turn of events, it should have been Tuoshan. However, the true winner was Tianhe. This result was completely out of everyone’s expectations.","Everyone’s eyes were not on the city lord of Tianhe, but on the new Mr. Chu, the city’s protector.","No one had ever heard of Mr. Chu before. After his sudden rise, everyone began to investigate him but to no avail. It was as if he had popped out from a crack in a rock. No one knew where he had come from.","They didn’t even know his full name—only that his name was Mr. Chu. No one dared to ask him for his name, and Tianhe was not clear about Mr. Chu’s background.","The only thing they could find was that Mr. Chu had fallen on the side of the road and then been picked up by Lin Chenxi, the daughter of Tianhe’s city lord.","After that, Tianhe gained a super expert as their backer, who helped them solve various problems on many occasions.","Many people were rendered speechless when they discovered this.","It was as if gold had fallen from the sky.","Many were envious and jealous of Lin Chenxi. How could she be so lucky to have picked up a super expert on a trip?","Furthermore, this super expert had taken her in as a disciple.","However, they did not know that it was Lin Chenxi’s perseverance despite everyone’s opposition to bringing Chu Yunfan along that he was very touched and finally accepted her.","If it wasn’t for this, Chu Yunfan might have helped Tianhe, but he wouldn’t have interfered so deeply. After all, to him, whether it was Tianhe, Taining, or Tuoshan, the largest share of the mine was of no use to him.","Although they couldn’t find out Chu Yunfan’s background and it was as if he had suddenly fallen from the sky, all kinds of rumors about him came one after another.","There was also the matter of his helping the city lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng, to break through from the peak of the Innate Stage to the Divine Abilities Stage. This made countless people turn green with envy.","Once one entered the Divine Abilities Stage, their entire life would be completely different. Lin Hongfeng, on the other hand, had a change in fate just because Lin Chenxi had picked up a great master. How could this not make people envious?","While all kinds of rumors were spreading, the transfer of the mine was happening in an orderly fashion.","Three days later, after Tianhe had completely taken over the mine, a piece of news reached Chu Yunfan’s ears. There was a mysterious item in the mine, and he was needed to guard it."]},{"number":1013,"title":"Chapter 1013 Flood Dragon Spirit, a Great Opportunity","paragraphs":["1013 Flood Dragon Spirit, a Great Opportunity","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to leave Tianhe, news came from Tianhe that something extraordinary had appeared in the depths of the spirit stone mine, and Chu Yunfan had to go there in person to keep watch.","Although he had promised to support Tianhe, he had no intention to stay in Tianhe for long. Since he had come to the Holy Land, he naturally had to travel and investigate the situation here.","But now that Lin Hongfeng had asked Lin Chenxi to come in person, Chu Yunfan had no choice but to take it seriously. He did not hesitate and followed Lin Chenxi in the direction of the spirit stone mine.","The mine was buried deep underground and spanned hundreds of kilometers from East to West. It had always been the biggest source of cultivation resources for all the nearby cities.","!!","At this time, the entrance of the mine had been cordoned off. The people sent by Tianhe were responsible for taking over, while the people sent by other cities were doing only auxiliary work. This had always been the rule.","Chu Yunfan descended from the sky with Lin Chenxi, and Lin Haoren, who had been waiting at the entrance of the mine for a long time, quickly went to receive them.","“What’s going on?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Mr. Chu, come with us and you’ll know.” Lin Haoren looked embarrassed because he couldn’t explain it clearly in a short time.","Chu Yunfan followed Lin Haoren into the mine. The place had been mined for many years. And after many years of continuous expansion and reinforcement, it seemed very wide. Because many workers had worked and lived here for many years, it had even formed a small town.","The trio entered the deepest part of the mine. Before they got close, Chu Yunfan heard a deafening roar. The entire place shook slightly as if something incredible was in the distance.","The pressure made Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi feel uncomfortable. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan could use some of his divine power to help them get rid of the pressure.","Chu Yunfan soon spotted Lin Hongfeng. He looked a little tired and didn’t have the air of hitting the jackpot.","“Mr. Chu, you’re finally here.”","When Lin Hongfeng saw Chu Yunfan, he heaved a sigh of relief as if he finally had someone to rely on.","“What’s going on?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Lin Hongfeng quickly said, “We’ve found something amazing. It’s a spirit mine spirit! I’ve only seen it in ancient records, and it was only after some investigation that I was able to confirm that it is indeed a mine spirit!”","“A mine spirit?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes suddenly lit up.","Lin Hongfeng had only seen the records of mine spirits in ancient books, so he wasn’t very clear about it. But Chu Yunfan was different. He had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, so he knew very well what a mine spirit was.","There were many spirits throughout the world. No matter what kind it was, after being immersed in Spirit Energy for many years, it could transform into a nature spirit. These nature spirits were different from the monsters because they were born from the will and power of nature. So although there were not many of these nature spirits, each of them was often an extremely powerful existence.","Of course, the world was fair. It was because these nature spirits were extremely outstanding that the chances of them being born were very lowest. And for mine spirits that were formed in spirit stone mines, they were even rarer.","The most famous mine spirits were dragon spirits in earth mines. Once someone could extract the power of the dragon spirit for their own use, they could often achieve great things in a short time.","It could even boost one’s luck. Even in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, items that could boost one’s luck were extremely rare. The more powerful the sect was, the more such items would be available.","Among them, the dragon spirit was undoubtedly the most popular. Once one captured a dragon spirit, one could use its power for their own use. Not only could boost luck, but the place where the spirit was located was also a place where nature’s Spirit Energy gathered. Over time, it could form a blessed land, which was extremely amazing.","If it really was a mine spirit, then it was indeed an extraordinary thing.","“I was wondering why Tuoshan suddenly invited an expert like Li Tao. They must’ve found out about the mine spirit!” Lin Hongfeng said indignantly, “There’s no need to mention Taining. They must have known about it long ago, but they suppressed the news. They wanted to monopolize this mine spirit. It’s absolutely despicable.”","Lin Hongfeng finally figured out why both Taining and Tuoshan had put in so much effort in this year’s competition that was originally just a formality. It turned out that there were such great benefits.","If it wasn’t for him accidentally relying on Chu Yunfan to finally seize control of the mine, he probably wouldn’t have had the chance to know that there was a mine spirit inside.","Thinking that he had almost been deceived, Lin Hongfeng was furious.","“I think so too.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “No one would be willing to share it with others.”","Although according to the agreement, no matter what they harvested from the mine, the cities had to split it equally among each other. But when the time came, how many people would do this?","“I’ll go take a look.”","Chu Yunfan took a step and flew into the deepest part of the mine. He saw that there was a huge barrier protecting an area inside its depths.","Within the light purple boundary, a giant beast revealed itself. Upon closer inspection, it was a flood dragon spirit. Its entire body was made up of Spirit Energy and it looked extremely transparent as if it was carved out of jade.","The flood dragon spirit was about ten meters long, and its head reached the top of Chu Yunfan’s. It looked extremely terrifying.","It looked at Chu Yunfan apprehensively. There was no peace in its eyes—only a fierce intent.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was grave. He could tell that this was indeed a dragon spirit, but it wasn’t a fully formed one. It had only evolved to the level of a flood dragon and yet to become a real dragon.","The barrier was not only to prevent the flood dragon spirit from coming out, but also to protect it. After all, nature spirits were different from ordinary creatures and did not have a mother.","Chu Yunfan felt quite lucky. If this flood dragon spirit had become a real dragon, everyone would have probably died. A dragon spirit that had taken the full form of a dragon was no different from a real dragon.","It was a terrifying existence that far surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage.","Although it was only a flood dragon spirit that had yet to fully evolve, in terms of strength, it had probably entered the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Originally, this flood dragon spirit was supposed to be in a deep slumber until it transformed into a true dragon. However, before it could successfully transform, it was awakened by someone, and the transformation was a failure.","For the flood dragon spirit, this was a rare opportunity and it would hold a deep resentment for this interruption. Once it was born, it would inevitably set off a bloody storm and endless killing."]},{"number":1014,"title":"Chapter 1014 A Once-In-A-Thousand-Years Opportunity","paragraphs":["1014 A Once-In-A-Thousand-Years Opportunity","It was like a person who had the opportunity to step into the Divine Abilities Stage from the Innate Stage, but this opportunity was cut off by someone.","Anyone would hold a deep resentment for this interruption.","It was the same for this flood dragon spirit. The birth of nature spirits was much more difficult than the birth of any living creature.","Not every mine had the opportunity to form an earth spirit. An earth spirit that formed was affected by the region. This was only an ordinary dragon spirit, but only a few of these dragon spirits could produce their own will, which was the mine spirit.","It could be said that the birth of every nature spirit was a miracle of life. Once they were successfully born, they were often extremely impressive.","For example, once a nature spirit transformed from a dragon spirit successfully took human form, it would become a true dragon. In the universe, it would be a powerful branch of the dragon race.","However, at the same time, the birth of these nature spirits was also filled with disasters. Besides natural disasters, there were also human disasters.","And obviously, Chu Yunfan and the others had become the human tribulation of this flood dragon spirit. They had become the biggest obstacle in its path of transformation.","However, everything was relative. For the flood dragon spirit, this might be the greatest calamity. If it was not disturbed, it might take less than a thousand years to become a true dragon and ascend.","However, it had only just started taking the shape of a flood dragon and could not be considered to have taken shape at all. The more it was like this, the more monstrous its resentment was. Once it was released, it would definitely create a shocking sin. Only then could it calm the resentment in its heart.","And for Chu Yunfan, this was a huge crisis. The degree of danger was beyond doubt. Although this flood dragon spirit had not yet truly formed and only a part of it had been formed, its strength was already comparable to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Once it was released, even Chu Yunfan would be no match for it.","However, this was also a huge opportunity. If he encountered a fully formed dragon spirit, his only option was to run as far away as he could. He wouldn’t dare to get close to it.","However, this flood dragon spirit, which had not yet formed, became Chu Yunfan’s biggest chance.","Even in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, this was an extremely rare opportunity. In fact, in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, there was a method that could refine this kind of nature spirit into a great medicine. It was even possible to quickly ascend.","Of course, this was a top-grade medicine. Even if Chu Yunfan couldn’t refine a medicine of that level, it was enough to help him transcend the Divine Abilities Stage. That step was true transcendence.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","When the flood dragon spirit saw Chu Yunfan, its killing intent became even more intense, and its eyes filled with killing intent. It had just transformed, and its consciousness had just been formed. Now, it was devoured by its killing intent, and only the thought of killing was left.","Its only thought was to kill all the living beings it saw. Its huge body kept hitting the barrier, trying to break it.","“Mr. Chu, what’s going on?” Lin Hongfeng also saw the flood dragon spirit flying into a frenzy.","“You must have disturbed this flood dragon spirit while excavating the mine, interrupting its process of transforming into a true dragon,” Chu Yunfan explained, “It’s extremely difficult for this kind of nature spirit to be born and take form. It can be said that it’s in danger every day and is destined to fall. It’s not easy for it to grow to this stage, and you had destroyed its chance. Now, its only thought is probably to kill. If it’s released, I’m afraid it’ll instantly cause a blood storm.","“But according to the current trend, this barrier won’t be able to hold it for long. It’s only a matter of time before it escapes.”","Chu Yunfan knew that just touching the flood dragon spirit while excavating the spirit stones wasn’t enough to wake it up from its deep slumber. He was afraid that Taining was controlling the mine too heavily, and he didn’t know what they had done to interrupt the process and forcibly wake up the flood dragon spirit.","Needless to say, the consequences of doing were unimaginable.","With Taining’s strength, it shouldn’t be able to do this. There was probably a mastermind behind the scenes.","‘D*mn it!’ Lin Hongfeng cursed in his heart.","As an expert in the Divine Abilities Stage, he could naturally sense the horror of this flood dragon spirit. If he were to go head to head with it, he might not be able to last more than one exchange.","When he thought about how the person who had caused such a huge incident was the city Lord of Taining, Zhou Buyi, he gritted his teeth in hatred.","Whether it was Zhou Buyi or Lu Shuzhou, they were the same in his eyes. Because of their selfishness, they caused such a big problem. Once the flood dragon spirit was born, they would just leave. Who knew how many people would be killed?","Although they were known to be ruthless and had killed countless enemies along the way, those were their enemies.","However, once this flood dragon spirit was released, it would plunge humanity into misery and suffering. Bringing with it countless deaths and injuries—mountains of corpses and seas of blood.","Even with his mental fortitude, Lin Hongfeng still felt terrified.","“What do we do now? Should we invite the other major sects over?” Lin Hongfeng asked, “I’m afraid we can’t do anything with our strength alone. With the addition of Taining, Tuoshan won’t be of any use. The only way is to invite the top experts from the major sects. Perhaps we can still fight it. There’s no other way.”","This was the only plan he could think of.","“No. There’s no need to call on them.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes got brighter and brighter. This was a huge crisis, but it was also a rare opportunity.","“Leave it to me. I’ll subdue it,” Chu Yunfan said.","“You have a way to do so?” Lin Hongfeng looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise.","“Yes,” Chu Yunfan said. He would never miss this opportunity.","“Hurry up and give the order for everyone to leave this mine and seal off all the exits with formations and barriers. Unless I give the order, no one is allowed to approach,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“I understand,” Lin Hongfeng immediately said.","He didn’t ask Chu Yunfan what he was going to do and simply left with Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi because he knew that this battle was not something that the three of them could interfere with. If they got involved, they could get killed.","After Lin Hongfeng gave the order to retreat, the workers in the mine, who were still unaware of the imminent disaster, quickly followed suit and retreated. A large number of Tianhe’s experts were mobilized to seal the mine. A large number of array masters were mobilized to set up barriers and arrays to seal the entire mine.","Such news naturally could not be hidden from the other cities. In a short time, the events that happened here had spread."]},{"number":1015,"title":"Chapter 1015 Traces of the Mastermind, the Wei Clan of the Holy Land","paragraphs":["1015 Traces of the Mastermind, the Wei Clan of the Holy Land","Not every city knew what had happened in the mine. However, at this point, the mine had been sealed. No matter how slow they were, they knew that something must have happened.","However, they didn’t know what had happened.","Every city had arranged for people to guard the mine, but the number was different.","However, the news of a flood dragon spirit that had not yet fully transformed in the mine spread like wildfire throughout every city.","For ordinary people, they didn’t know what a flood dragon spirit that hadn’t completely transformed meant, but the high-level officials of each city were very clear about what it meant.","This was a huge crisis, but if they could subdue this flood dragon spirit, it would undoubtedly be an unimaginable opportunity.","Everyone understood that Taining, who had been in control of the mine, must have been hiding it from them. Tuoshan’s sudden bid for control of the mine this year probably meant that they had learned something.","However, the two cities had a tacit understanding to hide it from them. Clearly, they did not want them to know.","They didn’t have time to complain about the two cities hiding the news from them, because the news spread out at an amazing speed.","To each city, they did things their own way. In fact, there were no particularly top experts. They relied on the tacit understanding of all parties to maintain a certain degree of independence under the various major forces.","The emergence of an unformed flood dragon spirit might be a disaster for them, but for the major forces in the Holy Land, it was undoubtedly a huge opportunity.","Even if it was a dragon spirit that had not successfully transformed, it still held a huge attraction.","Almost at the same time, the forces in the vicinity of this area began to stir and take action.","For a time, all kinds of news spread.","Some people saw the carriage of the Sky Breaker Sect’s sect leader pulled by several strange beasts, approaching from the sky.","Some people also saw the First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maiden House flying across the sky on a snow lotus.","The president of the Azure Dragon Society appeared in a high-profile manner and moved into Tuoshan.","In addition to the three magnates of the nearby forces, there were also many experts from various sects and aristocratic families who appeared in the nearby cities to inquire about what was happening in the mine.","They clearly had only one goal, which was the flood dragon spirit in the mine.","These behemoths moved extremely quickly. They understood that as the news continued to spread at an astonishing speed, it might attract more and more experts. It was not impossible to really attract some old monsters. Only by seizing the flood dragon spirit before that could their forces have the possibility of further improvement.","This was a huge opportunity. Whoever grasped it would be able to rule the future.","The appearance of these behemoths made the higher-ups of each city anxious. After all, they could not afford to offend any of these forces.","Under such circumstances, the various cities began to form alliances. In the already turbulent situation, even more undercurrents bubbled up.","In a secret room in Taining of the city lord’s mansion resided the city lord, Zhou Wuji, and the revered elder, Xu Long.","These two supreme and powerful existences in Taining, were now standing with their heads lowered as if they were admitting their mistakes.","At this moment, the only person sitting in the secret chamber was a square-faced middle-aged man who was about forty years old. He was dressed in a magnificent robe and had on an angry expression.","“What happened? How did the news get out?”","“First Elder, we didn’t leak the news, but Tuoshan and Tianhe knew about it long ago. Maybe it was them who leaked the news.” Xu Long looked at the middle-aged man with a timid gaze.","At this time, his aura was much weaker than before. This was because the injuries he had suffered in the battle with Li Tao had yet to fully heal. He had only recovered a portion of his strength.","Li Tao’s strength was far above his, and he used a secret technique to stimulate his life potential. Now, being able to stand and speak was already a sign of his profound skill.","“That’s right, there hasn’t been any news from Tianhe. I’m guessing they’re trying to keep it a secret. That Mr. Chu probably wants to keep the flood dragon spirit for himself, so it’s most likely that Tuoshan leaked the news,” Zhou Buyi said directly.","After the news spread, he immediately sent people to investigate. However, the result of the investigation was that all the information came from Tuoshan, and Tuoshan’s purpose was obvious. They wanted to stir up the muddy water so that Tianhe could not get the flood dragon spirit.","The thought of it made him boil with anger. Tuoshan had ruined his plans time and time again. If it weren’t for them, he would have taken control of the mine long ago and there wouldn’t have been such a mess.","“I don’t care who spread the news. I only see the news being leaked!” the first elder said coldly, “That flood dragon spirit is what my big brother wants. It’s related to the great undertaking of my family. You should know what will happen if we lose it.”","The first elder’s eyes were cold, and Xu Long and Zhou Buyi shivered. The real scary thing was the person behind the first elder.","It was the behemoth known as the Holy Land’s number one family. Such a behemoth was not something they could provoke. They could even be crushed to death with a finger. No one knew that Taining had been able to sit firmly at the top of the nearby cities all these years because they had the support of a colossus like the Wei clan.","If it wasn’t for this, their Taining wouldn’t have developed so quickly.","However, the Wei clan’s support came with a price. Previously, the clan had sent people to forcibly revive the flood dragon spirit. They thought that it was foolproof, but who knew that they would lose control of the mine.","All his plans had been disrupted.","The first elder’s face showed a hint of anger. He had to speed up the operation. Otherwise, when more and more forces heard the news and took action, even the Wei clan would not be able to withstand the wolves.","The Wei clan was determined to get the flood dragon spirit. It was of great importance."]},{"number":1016,"title":"Chapter 1016 Clouds Moving in From All Sides, the Eye of the Storm","paragraphs":["1016 Clouds Moving in From All Sides, the Eye of the Storm","“Right, who is this Mr. Chu?” the first elder of the Wei clan asked.","According to what Xu Long and Zhou Buyi said, it was obvious that Mr. Chu who suddenly appeared was not an ordinary person. He must be an expert among experts.","Even Li Tao, who had entered tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage, had been defeated by the other party. Even as the first elder of the Wei clan, he had to pay attention to such an expert.","“We can’t find any information about him. It’s like he suddenly fell from the sky. We can’t find anything,” Zhou Buyi shook his head.","During this time, they had already done their best to find out Mr. Chu’s background. But in the end, they could not find any information. Therefore, the only source of information they could find was that Lin Chenxi had picked up Chu Yunfan.","They couldn’t find any more than that.","“This is getting interesting,” the first elder said in a playful manner, “According to logic, it was impossible for someone to appear out of thin air. That does not make sense.”","He believed that Xu Long and Zhou Buyi wouldn’t dare to lie to him, so there must be a big problem with Mr. Chu’s background.","After all, even in the Holy Land, there were not many who could kill a tier-eight Divine in seconds.","Chu Yunfan was one of the rarest people—one of the top few.","“What should we do now? Order Tianhe to hand over control of the mine immediately?” Zhou Buyi asked the first elder.","“It’s too late. If we had done that earlier, there would have been no problem. Now that the news has been leaked, if we do that, the other forces will definitely not restrain themselves like they are now. They will surely follow up immediately.” the first elder frowned.","“The Sky Breakers, the Divine Maidens, and the Azure Dragons are like dogs. They have sharp noses. But this is good. Let them go and check out the situation first.”","The first elder tapped his fingers on the armrest and said after a moment of thought.","“But won’t they get there before us?” Zhou Buyi said.","At this time, none of the three forces took Chu Yunfan to heart. In their opinion, the Sky Breakers, the Divine Maidens, and the Azure Dragons—the three major forces in the vicinity—had appeared at the same time in a high-profile manner. It was clear that they wanted to interfere, and this was the big trouble they were facing.","“As for Mr. Chu, it’s impossible for him to keep the flood dragon spirit.”","“It doesn’t matter. Hmph, let the three of them fight. The fiercer the fight, the easier it will be for us to fish in troubled waters. Who gets the flood dragon spirit will be dependent on their strength. Although the Sky Breakers, the Divine Maidens, and the Azure Dragons are powerful, they’re still nothing compared to me.”","At this point, the first elder’s face revealed absolute confidence as if he was the only one in the world who could do it.","“Pass down the order. Help me keep a close eye on the situation at the mine. I want to know everything that happens at the first moment,” the first elder said, “As for Mr. Chu, if he’s smart enough to retreat now, he might be able to keep his life. However, if he’s delusional, he’ll die there.”","The first elder knew all too well how powerful the flood dragon spirit in the mine was. Even with the Wei clan’s power, they had to be extremely careful, let alone others.","This was the reason why he was not very anxious at the moment. Whether he wanted to fish in troubled waters or swallow the flood dragon spirit for himself, it all depended on whether he had such a good appetite.","At this time, the outside world was a complete mess. Many people did not expect that a flood dragon spirit would eventually cause such a series of events.","In particular, the high-profile entry of the three major forces nearby made the matter even more confusing.","The other small and medium-sized forces also tried to fish in troubled waters, making the whole situation even more chaotic.","Everyone could feel that the arrival of a storm was inevitable. And as the center of this storm, the people of Tianhe felt even greater pressure.","Though the city lord, Lin Hongfeng, was personally stationed there, it was no exception. The representatives of various forces came one after another, either threatening or enticing Li Hongfeng to hand over the flood dragon spirit.","At this time, Lin Hongfeng finally felt the huge pressure that came with owning the mine. All this time, they had only participated in the sharing of the mine, and the one who was really under this pressure was Taining. After they took over, because of the existence of the great killer god, Chu Yunfan, no one in the other cities dared to say anything. They were basically all stunned by Chu Yunfan’s amazing performance.","But now that the flood dragon spirit had been exposed, and the nearby major forces had swarmed in, they instantly felt great pressure.","This was especially so for Lin Haoren. Each of the forces that had sent people here was famous, and there were even behemoths like the Azure Dragons and the Divine Maidens.","Normally, there weren’t many people that they could afford to provoke. After all, although they had obtained control of the mine this time around, it was essentially because of Chu Yunfan’s strength and not their own. This made them feel less confident.","“Father, what should we do? The Azure Dragons have already sent people to warn us that if we don’t hand over the flood dragon spirit, they’ll teach us a lesson.”","Outside the mine, Lin Haoren looked at Lin Hongfeng with a worried look.","Lin Hongfeng shook his head, a wry smile on his face. Then his expression became determined. “At this point, do you think that our city could possibly retreat? If we do so, not only will we offend Mr. Chu, but those people will also remember our cowardice.","“Besides, they want us to hand it over? How are we supposed to do that? If that flood dragon spirit gets out, the consequences will be unimaginable. No matter who it is, they will have to wait until Mr. Chu comes out of seclusion,” Lin Hongfeng said.","Compared to the nervous Lin Haoren, Lin Hongfeng could see the situation even more clearly. They had no way to retreat and could only stand on the same side as Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, they would definitely not have an easy time.","Moreover, the president of the Azure Dragons, the first divine maiden of the Divine Maidens, and the sect leader of the Sky Breakers were all famous and invincible. However, this mysterious Mr. Chu was no ordinary person. Who would win and who would lose was still unknown.","“Father, Brother, don’t worry. Master is very powerful. Those people are no match for him,” Lin Chenxi said confidently.","Chu Yunfan, who was inside the mine, didn’t know that the undercurrent was already raging outside. He was sitting cross-legged in the mine, and in front of him, the Thunder God Scepter was floating up and down.","Flames were constantly pouring out of his hand. He was refining the scepter.","The flood dragon spirit was too powerful. Only with the help of the scepter could it be subdued.","After a long time, he opened his eyes and the scepter flew into his hand."]},{"number":1017,"title":"Chapter 1017 Severely Injuring the Flood Dragon Spirit","paragraphs":["1017 Severely Injuring the Flood Dragon Spirit","While the outside world was in a state of chaos, Chu Yunfan was calmly refining the Thunder God Scepter in the mine.","After the flood dragon spirit was awakened, its strength was even higher than Chu Yunfan’s. It was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, which was much higher than Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level.","If he wanted to subdue the spirit, ordinary methods were clearly not feasible. Only with the help of the scepter could he possibly defeat and subdue it.","However, the quality of the scepter was extremely high. Even with his strength, Chu Yunfan was still unable to fully control it. It was an item that could only be controlled by someone who had already surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage.","Fortunately, the most troublesome part of the scepter was the thunder sigil, which Chu Yunfan had already refined into his body. Through the sigil, Chu Yunfan could temporarily control the scepter.","Even though it was only for a short period, it was enough.","This was the only possibility for him to subdue this flood dragon spirit.","In front of him, the scepter was emitting a burst of thunderlight, which was getting stronger and stronger. Meanwhile, the thunder sigil in Chu Yunfan’s body was activated again and burst out with light.","He reached out to grab the scepter. Almost instantly, it burst out with a terrifying thunderlight that filled the entire mine.","But this time, Chu Yunfan didn’t run into any mishaps and firmly held onto the scepter.","Chu Yunfan could feel powerful energy boiling within the scepter. At the same time, he could also feel that the seals he had forcefully placed on it when he was refining it were constantly being broken. He was afraid that he did not have much time left.","“It’s time.”","Chu Yunfan grasped the scepter and looked at the flood dragon spirit.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The flood dragon spirit was constantly hitting the barrier and cracks appeared on it as if it could be broken at any time.","When it saw Chu Yunfan walking over, the flood dragon spirit’s huge eyes showed a hint of apprehension. The energy fluctuations coming from the scepter that was emitting a thunderlight made it feel extremely afraid.","But now, all of its rationality had been swallowed by boundless resentment. Seeing Chu Yunfan walking over, it only felt even more furious and could not control itself.","As for Chu Yunfan, he walked up to the spirit and pointed the scepter at the barrier. Then, a huge crack was torn open in the barrier, and Chu Yunfan’s entered it.","The moment he entered the boundary, the flood dragon spirit opened its bloody mouth and pounced at him.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. He clenched his fist and turned into a golden roc, which pounced directly at the flood dragon spirit.","Boom!","A flood dragon and a golden roc collided in mid-air. The air instantly exploded, and the entire mine shook violently.","The energy that burst out turned into light and filled the dark mine.","Thud, thud, thud!","After one collision, Chu Yunfan was forced to retreat. He felt the muscles in his arms go slightly numb.","“You’re indeed a great beast.”","Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised. Instead, he was happy.","The dragons of the world were known for their tyrannical bodies. Even the flood dragons were known to be tyrannical. It was difficult for them to find an opponent on par with them.","Although this was only a flood dragon spirit, if it successfully ascended, it would be equivalent to the dragon clan and become a branch of the clan. They would not be worse than the average dragon clan.","After the collision, Chu Yunfan felt as if he had been hit by a small mountain. Even though he had cultivated the Imperial Physique and merged it with the Thunderclap Physique, he felt like he was at a disadvantage. If he had been an ordinary tier-five Divine, he would have been sent flying and exploded into pieces.","Even peak Divines would not easily clash with a flood dragon spirit. It would be unwise.","However, Chu Yunfan only felt his arm go numb. It was easy to imagine how powerful his body had become. If he and the flood dragon spirit were on the same level, it would be a piece of cake for him to take it down.","The flood dragon spirit was extremely terrifying to ordinary people, especially its terrifying physical body. But to Chu Yunfan, it was just a stepping stone to test his strength.","“Again!”","Chu Yunfan laughed and flew up again. He was not the slightest bit afraid of the flood dragon spirit.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In the entire mine, only the collision of a flood dragon and a golden roc could be seen. It was as if they had returned to primitive times when collisions between primitive beasts were happening.","The figures crossed each other, and Chu Yunfan appeared. Although he had been at a complete disadvantage in the confrontation earlier, it was difficult for the flood dragon spirit to hurt him. At this time, the strength of his physical body was fully displayed.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to leave, even though the flood dragon spirit’s cultivation level was far above his, it would not be able to do anything to him.","After this clash, Chu Yunfan felt his blood boil. During the process of the battle, his comprehension of physical cultivation improved. As expected, the fastest way to improve was through battle.","“There’s not much time left.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the flood dragon spirit in front of him and felt that it was a pity.","He raised the scepter in his hand up high and the flood dragon spirit instantly became alert. It let out a long roar and opened its bloody jaw. Countless spirit energy began to condense, turning into a terrifying spirit energy bomb that blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","All the air was crushed by the spirit energy bullet, and ordinary Divines would be instantly blown into pieces.","At this critical moment, a thunderbolt dragon came down, tore apart the spirit energy bullet, and suddenly bombarded the flood dragon spirit.","Boom!","The terrifying power of thunder exploded in the small space inside the barrier.","The terrifying tide annihilated everything, and even Chu Yunfan had to put up a defensive barrier in front of himself.","Scccrrreeee!","The flood dragon spirit let out a blood-curdling screech. Chu Yunfan could see a huge wound appear on its back. It had been injured by the thunderbolt dragon.","...","The power of the scepter had been truly unleashed. Previously, Chu Yunfan had come into contact with it and was almost forced to a dead end.","Now, it was the flood dragon spirit’s turn to bear it."]},{"number":1018,"title":"Chapter 1018 Tier Six of the Divine Abilities Stage, Invincible","paragraphs":["1018 Tier Six of the Divine Abilities Stage, Invincible","With just one blow, a big hole had been blasted through the flood dragon spirit’s back, and it was instantly seriously injured. Chu Yunfan had fought the flood dragon spirit for some time. Although the flood dragon spirit couldn’t do anything to him, on the other hand, he couldn’t hurt it either.","The difference between his cultivation level and the flood dragon spirit’s was too great. It was a miracle that he had been able to survive until now.","With the flood dragon spirit’s power, even ordinary Divines were no match for it.","Roar!","The flood dragon spirit was roaring madly as if it wanted to bite Chu Yunfan to death. Its huge body kept stirring inside the barrier, rolling on the ground in pain.","After struggling for a while, the flood dragon spirit let out a deafening roar and pounced toward Chu Yunfan again.","And Chu Yunfan obviously wouldn’t just stand by and do nothing.","He poured all his divine power into the scepter. With a loud bang, a thunderbolt dragon surged out from it.","Boom!","The thunderbolt dragon hit the flood dragon spirit in the chest.","Bam!","The flood dragon spirit fell to the ground, creating a huge crack.","This attack was terrifying. It tore open a huge wound on the flood dragon spirit’s chest. There was no doubting the might of the Thunder God Scepter.","This time, the flood dragon spirit didn’t have the energy to counterattack like before. This attack was a heavy blow to it. It struggled for a while on the ground before slumping onto the ground.","Chu Yunfan could see a large amount of spirit energy flowing out of the wounds on its chest and back. It was almost impossible for the flood dragon spirit to maintain its form.","This flood dragon spirit seemed to have taken shape, but it was only an embryonic form. Its body was composed of countless pure spirit energy essence.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan was also panting heavily. It had only been two attacks, and his vigorous divine power had been completely exhausted.","Fortunately, the effect was as he had expected. It was outstanding.","He quickly put away the scepter, then sat cross-legged in the air, brazenly recovering his cultivation. He proceeded to absorb the spirit energy leaking out of the flood dragon spirit.","This source of pure spirit energy allowed Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to recover rapidly.","It didn’t take long for him to recover his strength. Then, he made a hand seal and countless divine power began to boil in his hands, which then turned into huge steel needles.","The steel needle fell from the sky and accurately pierced the flood dragon spirit’s shoulder blade.","The flood dragon spirit tried to resist, but it was too late. It was severely injured and had no ability to resist. It was nailed to the ground and couldn’t move.","If it was just an ordinary nature spirit, it would not be a big deal to be stabbed in the shoulder blades. However, when a creature had a physical body, no matter what kind of life form it was, be it a human, a monster, or a member of the marine folks, once the shoulder blades were locked, the divine power of the entire body would also be locked. There was no difference between them.","Chu Yunfan landed on the ground. However, when he touched the flood dragon spirit, the originally quiet godhead in his body suddenly burst out with a brilliant light.","Immediately after, the flood dragon spirit let out a blood-curdling screech, and Chu Yunfan started to absorb the spirit energy in its body at an astonishing speed.","To be more precise, it was being absorbed into the godhead.","The godhead, which had been dormant for a long time, seemed to have been greatly stimulated and began to burst out with rays of light.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan could see through the essence of these rays. They were not rays of light, but countless pieces of information that had been transformed into rays of light and released.","Countless pieces of information suddenly poured into Chu Yunfan’s mind. They were all information about the essence of the great Dao, and even touched the edge of some laws.","This was something that Chu Yunfan shouldn’t be able to touch at his level, but now it was all happening in front of him.","Coupled with the memories of the Alchemy Emperor that Chu Yunfan had obtained, Chu Yunfan felt that his comprehension was increasing at an astonishing speed.","The unstable foundation caused by his rapid improvement during this period also stabilized at an astonishing speed. All aspects and various comprehensions were constantly improving, making his foundation incomparably solid.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan also felt that his cultivation level was improving. He had already reached the peak of tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage, and now he was directly charging toward tier six.","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes, grabbed the flood dragon spirit, and started to operate the Celestial Devouring Art.","He absorbed the pure spirit energy of the flood dragon spirit.","The flood dragon spirit kept letting out angry roars and it kept trashing, but it couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan from plundering the spirit energy in its body.","This was the essence of the entire mine that had been condensed for tens of thousands of years, and now all of it had been plundered by Chu Yunfan.","To be more precise, it was split into two. The majority of it was absorbed by the godhead, and only a small portion was absorbed by Chu Yunfan himself to break through to tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know how much time had passed, but he felt that his comprehension of the great Dao had reached another level. At his level, his comprehension of each level was not just a little bit. It could even be said that it contained a lot of comprehension and understanding of an extremely wide field.","This kind of comprehension had to be accumulated bit by bit, but Chu Yunfan was different. It was as if he was sitting on a rocket.","Under such circumstances, it was inevitable that his foundation would be somewhat unstable, but this point had been completely made up for now.","Boom!","Finally, after countless breakthroughs, Chu Yunfan’s comprehension continued to improve, and his martial arts that had originally reached a bottleneck also seemed to have broken through a cage, directly breaking into a whole new level.","Tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Only then did Chu Yunfan finally stop. The godhead in his mind had also stopped absorbing spirit energy.","At this time, the originally huge flood dragon spirit had become only five meters long, much smaller than before. It was no longer as arrogant as before and was on its last breath.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation and realm were perfectly integrated. Although he had just broken through, it was as if he had broken through countless times.","After entering tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, even an ordinary tier-nine Divine would be no match for him. He was now one of the few people who were truly at the top of the world.","Chu Yunfan was invincible."]},{"number":1019,"title":"Chapter 1019 Three Great Forces Join Hands, a Shocking Sword Strike","paragraphs":["1019 Three Great Forces Join Hands, a Shocking Sword Strike","After stepping into another level, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan’s overall strength had increased. Though he was not truly invincible, he was not afraid of anyone. There were only a few people who could stand shoulder-to-shoulder with him.","It was only a matter of time before he became invincible as he improved further.","In front of him, the flood dragon spirit had almost been completely absorbed. It was unable to fight back, mainly because it was absorbed by the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind.","With the further improvement of the godhead, Chu Yunfan could feel that his entire being was now different. If he had to put it into words, it would be that the way he looked at things was more essential, not just superficial.","A faint light flowed through his eyes. If someone used a martial technique in front of him, he would be able to instantly capture it, interpret it, and absorb it into his own martial Dao system.","This was an ability that was a step further than his original photographic memory. It was a terrifying ability to be able to see the source directly.","Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying in this state. He was extremely calm, like a supercomputer, rapidly analyzing everything in the world. The advancement of his cultivation was now easier and faster than before.","It was as if he had been reborn. This was much more useful to him than simply increasing his cultivation level.","After restraining his aura, Chu Yunfan walked out of the mine and found that the entire place was in a state of chaos. The barrier around it was on the verge of collapse.","In the sky, three figures were frantically attacking the barrier, trying to break it.","Under these attacks, the barrier was on the verge of collapse, It looked as if it would completely collapse in the next moment.","Lin Hongfeng was maintaining the barrier, but his divine power was almost depleted. Maintaining such a large barrier had exceeded the limit of his ability.","Chu Yunfan took a closer look and saw that one of the figures was a knight. The knight’s entire body was covered in steel armor. He was tall and held a long spear in his hand. He rode a blood-red warhorse that looked extremely fierce.","The knight’s cultivation was extremely high, and even his blood-red warhorse had entered the Divine Abilities Stage. Such cultivation could only be described as terrifying.","The other figure was a thin old woman. She held a dragon-headed walking stick in her hand. When she swung it down, it turned into a long dragon that smashed the barrier, causing a huge crack to appear.","The last one was a middle-aged man with a square face and a tall figure. With a simple punch, he blasted out a huge sun and burned a hole in the barrier.","Apart from these three people, a large army was gathering on the ground and surrounding the mine. It was clear that once the barrier was broken, this army would rush in.","“Lin Hongfeng, why don’t you surrender? Don’t you value your daughter’s life?” the old woman said coldly.","“You people are despicable!” Lin Hongfeng gritted his teeth.","He knew that he couldn’t back down now. If he did, it would only be a matter of time before the entire defense line collapsed.","Behind him, the various experts and troops of Tianhe held their weapons tightly, waiting for the moment when the barrier would break.","At that time, the real battle would begin.","“Anyone who dares to oppose the Azure Dragons will be killed!” the knight on the blood-red warhorse roared, raised his spear high, and struck the barrier.","On the periphery of the battlefield, many experts had already approached from a distance.","“The three forces are attacking at the same time, but Lin Hongfeng is still resisting. He’s seeking his own death!”","“That’s right. Lin Hongfeng can’t fight against the Azure Dragons, the Sky Breakers, or the Divine Maidens, but he’s trying to hold out.”","“He must have gone crazy for that flood dragon spirit. He doesn’t even know if it’s something he can touch!”","These experts came from various cities. After some time, the three major forces finally couldn’t bear it anymore and wanted to attack the mine. Although it wasn’t the leaders of the three major forces, the status of these three was no small matter in the three major forces.","Because none of them trusted the other, the three major forces joined forces and brought a large number of masters. In addition, there were masters from other small and medium-sized forces wandering around the periphery, among which there was no lack of Divines.","If one were to count carefully, there were more than a dozen Divines on the scene. Such a scale was truly terrifying.","It was already a great feat for Lin Hongfeng to be able to persist until now. Of course, if he didn’t rely on the barrier, he wouldn’t be able to resist the blow of these three masters.","The difference between the two sides was too great.","However, they didn’t understand that they had obviously reached the end of the line. Even his daughter, Lin Chenxi, had been captured, but Lin Hongfeng gritted his teeth and refused to give in. He was unwilling to lower the barrier.","Many people couldn’t understand this. After all, even if Lin Hongfeng gritted his teeth and persevered, he could only persist for a short time. He couldn’t change the fundamental gap.","“You’re so stubborn!” The tall middle-aged expert from the Sky Breakers sneered and punched out. His fist was like a huge sun, hitting the barrier head-on.","The barrier, which was already riddled with scars and on the verge of collapse, was turned into nothingness by this blow. It shattered on the spot.","“Kill them all. Don’t leave even a single piece of armor!” The Azure Dragon knight shouted as he raised his spear.","Below, the experts of the three major forces who had been waiting for a long time rushed toward the mine.","Spurt!","Lin Hongfeng spat out a mouthful of blood. The barrier was broken and he suffered a backlash. He was thrown backward.","“Father!”","Not far away, Lin Haoren quickly caught Lin Hongfeng.","“Stop them! Don’t let them disturb Mr. Chu!” Lin Hongfeng said through gritted teeth.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was their only hope of turning the tables. If Chu Yunfan was affected, no one would be able to save them.","“Understood!” Lin Haoren clenched the weapon in his hand. The allied forces flooded over like a tide.","Just as he decided to fight to the death, a shocking sword light swept out from the mine behind him.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The experts who were sweeping over like a tide were hit. Thousands of people instantly exploded and died tragically."]},{"number":1020,"title":"Chapter 1020 Annihilating the Divine Maiden Army in One Strike","paragraphs":["1020 Annihilating the Divine Maiden Army in One Strike","This simple sword light swept across, and thousands of experts, no matter what level they were at, were all cut down by it.","The sudden attack attracted everyone’s attention. They all looked in the direction of the mine and saw a young man in a black robe walking out.","He was the one who had unleashed that earth-shattering sword strike, and he didn’t even have a sword in his hand. He had only put his index and middle fingers together to form a finger sword, and he had wiped out over a thousand experts with a single sword strike.","The first reaction in many people’s minds was, ‘Who is this person?’","!!","Killing thousands of Innates with a single sword strike was something that even an ordinary Divine would never be able to do.","As for the experts from the various cities, they all recognized Chu Yunfan. The previous battle had been too amazing for them.","Chu Yunfan’s appearance stunned all of them. He had helped Tianhe gain control of the mine, and the battle had shocked the world.","“It’s Mr. Chu. I now understand why Lin Hongfeng was so determined to maintain the barrier. Is it because Mr. Chu was inside?”","“Mr. Chu is going to try to subdue the flood dragon spirit? This is going to be interesting!”","“However, Mr. Chu is too arrogant. Does he think that he can deal with the three major forces by himself?”","Many people were discussing among themselves, and when they saw Chu Yunfan, it was as if a pot had exploded and was boiling over.","As for the allied forces, although they didn’t know who Chu Yunfan was, the power of that sword strike was amazing. They were instantly frightened, especially the experts, who didn’t dare to come forward.","Although they weren’t afraid of death, it was too aggrieving to be killed in a single strike.","It was obvious that for Chu Yunfan, no matter how many people there were, it was meaningless and would not affect his attack.","Chu Yunfan walked forward step by step. He had killed thousands of Innates with one sword strike. It was not a big deal for him to severely injure this allied army. Back in the Kunlun Realm, how many masters had he killed?","“Mr. Chu, you’ve come out of seclusion. That’s great!” Lin Haoren turned around and saw Chu Yunfan. He was overjoyed.","This time, to stop the attack of the outsiders and buy time for Chu Yunfan, Tianhe paid a great price.","“Where’s Chenxi?” Chu Yunfan frowned.","“The Divine Maidens captured Sister. They’re trying to force us into submitting,” Lin Haoren quickly said.","He was in despair when his sister was captured, but he was too weak. He had no way to save anyone. He had never hated his powerlessness as much as he did today.","Chu Yunfan looked to be about the same age as him, but Chu Yunfan was already able to rule the world while he couldn’t even protect his own sister.","“You’re looking for death!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly, and the aura he emitted almost made the whole world freeze. He was affecting the whole world with his power.","Then, Chu Yunfan walked to Lin Hongfeng’s side and started to treat him.","Lin Hongfeng’s injury wasn’t serious. He only suffered from the backlash of the broken enchantment. After Chu Yunfan’s treatment, he felt that his injury quickly healed. He felt Chu Yunfan’s unfathomable deep martial power.","Compared to before, Chu Yunfan now gave off an even stronger aura as if he could kill him with a single thought.","“Mr. Chu, did you break through again?” Lin Hongfeng asked tentatively. After all, whether one broke through or not was personal privacy.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention to hide this, because there was no need to. He immediately said, “Yes, I gained something. Wait for a moment. Let me kill the enemies before we talk.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, a layer of light appeared under his feet and he flew straight into the sky. Facing the experts of the three major forces, he didn’t have the slightest fear and only looked at them coldly.","“Who captured Lin Chenxi?” Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold, but his tone was unquestionable.","“You’re Mr. Chu?” the old woman slowly said, “I advise you to be tactful. That flood dragon spirit is not something you can touch. You better hand it over obediently. Otherwise, it’s hard to say whether your disciple will live or die.”","“So, my disciple was taken away by the Divine Maidens?” Chu Yunfan squinted at the old woman.","“That’s right. If you don’t know what’s good for you and provoke the First Divine Maiden to attack you, you’ll suffer the same fate!” the old woman didn’t hesitate and said directly.","From the beginning to the end, she had never taken Chu Yunfan seriously. In her heart, as long as the Divine Maidens were mentioned, even if this Mr. Chu had some background, he would have to bow his head.","One had to lower one’s head when one passed under a roof.","“Hmph, you’re looking for death. Go to hell!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly. He put his index and middle fingers together to form a finger sword and swept them out.","Suddenly, a wave of divine power gushed out and turned into a shocking sword light. This sword light was several kilometers long and it fell like the sky. It instantly blasted into the Divine Maiden army.","Boom!","Thousands of Divine Maidens screamed and instantly turned into a bloody mist. With a simple strike, the remaining thousands of experts—some Acquired and some Innate—were completely annihilated.","Under the sunlight, Chu Yunfan flew high in the sky like a god.","This attack was simple, but its power was terrifying. For a moment, no one could react and the scene fell into a dead silence.","Everyone looked at the scene in front of them in a daze.","Even though many knew of Chu Yunfan’s reputation and had seen him fight with their own eyes, they still underestimated him. Even though the Divine Maidens were famous, they couldn’t make him hesitant to attack them.","They didn’t know that Chu Yunfan wasn’t from this world. No matter how famous the Divine Maidens were, he wouldn’t feel anything. Moreover, even against the famous Jiang clan of the Federation, he had never been soft-hearted in his attacks.","“You... How dare you!”","The old woman was so angry that she was about to go crazy. Although these were only Acquired and Innate experts, they were the elites of the Divine Maidens. After all, it was impossible for experts to appear out of thin air. They were all born from these elites.","But now, Chu Yunfan had killed them all in one strike, causing them to suffer a great loss.","“You’re seeking death!” The old woman raised her dragon-headed walking stick high and smashed it down on Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan raised his arm and caught the stick with his bare hands, but it did not affect him at all.","Swish!","At this critical moment, Chu Yunfan’s hand shot out a ray of sword light. The old woman didn’t have time to dodge and was instantly pierced through, dying a tragic death."]},{"number":1021,"title":"Chapter 1021 The Allied Army Was Completely Annihilated","paragraphs":["1021 The Allied Army Was Completely Annihilated","The old woman’s eyes were wide open in shock. When her body was pierced, she didn’t even react. Perhaps she didn’t expect that she would die so suddenly without any warning.","She was so proud of her tier-six Divine Abilities Stage cultivation. But in front of Chu Yunfan, it was like paper. He easily killed her.","In terms of cultivation level, she was almost the same as Chu Yunfan. But in terms of combat power, she was far inferior. They were not on the same level.","Even in the Divine Abilities Stage, the difference in combat strength between each level was like Heaven and Earth.","Boom!","The old woman lost all signs of life and fell from the sky.","At this point, the Divine Maiden army and experts had been completely annihilated.","Chu Yunfan’s ferocity was far beyond everyone’s imagination.","Everyone gulped. At that moment, they felt that even breathing was difficult. They could not breathe at all.","“Looks like Mr. Chu became even stronger. He’s even more terrifying than the last time he fought!”","“Who is this man? How could such a terrifying expert suddenly appear without any warning?”","“This is absolutely terrifying. He annihilated an army of a thousand with a single strike and a Divine with a single strike. Where did he come from? Why does it feel so terrifying?”","Many people were secretly terrified. They didn’t know what Chu Yunfan’s background was, but he was absolutely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan killing the old woman with a single sword strike truly shocked the other two experts on the field—the middle-aged man from the Sky Breakers and the knight from the Azure Dragons.","The two of them were also experts, but in terms of cultivation, they might not be stronger than the old woman. The three of them were basically on the same level.","Now, Chu Yunfan had instantly killed the old woman with a single strike. Although the old woman hadn’t been paying attention for just the briefest of seconds, the fact that she didn’t manage to dodge Chu Yunfan’s casual attack showed the severity of the problem.","Under such circumstances, if the two of them were to face Chu Yunfan alone, the result would probably not be any better.","They didn’t even need to communicate. The two of them attacked at the same time. The Azure Dragon knight attacked from the front while the Sky Breaker middle-aged man attacked from the side.","Both sides were extremely fast, and in an instant, they had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","The Azure Dragon knight was exceptionally fast. The warhorse under his command was a Divine monster. When he charged, his aura was completely released. He single-handedly charged out of the gallop of thousands of soldiers and horses.","In the process of charging, his power and momentum continued to improve. What he had learned was the martial arts of the battlefield, which was completely different from the martial arts that ordinary people learned.","However, in terms of strength, it was even more powerful in this situation.","Beside Chu Yunfan, the Sky Breaker expert also threw a punch at him. The force of his punch swept out and half of the sky started to shake violently like a painting.","Boom!","This punch landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but it was unable to hurt him. It only caused his body to glow with a jade-colored light.","“What? How is this possible?” The Sky Breaker expert turned pale with fright. He knew that Chu Yunfan was powerful but he never thought that Chu Yunfan’s defensive power would be so strong that he could take his attack without changing his expression.","“Sh*t!”","The Sky Breaker expert quickly reacted. He knew that things were not looking good for him, so he hastily retreated, trying to avoid Chu Yunfan.","But this time, Chu Yunfan’s eyes were already on him. He immediately took a step forward and caught up with the man. Then, he clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out.","Boom!","A terrifying loud noise was heard as a terrifying fist force swept across the sky. It was at least several times stronger than the punch from the Sky Breaker expert.","This punch shattered all the Sky Breaker expert’s defenses. In an instant, the air was shattered.","Boom!","Finally, the punch hit the Sky Breaker expert. He let out a miserable cry before his body was shattered in mid-air. He was unable to resist.","It was simply tragic. Even an expert of that level couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s punch.","‘Sh*t! I have to get out of here!’ the Azure Dragon knight thought.","Chu Yunfan had killed an expert of the same level as him with a single punch, and the Sky Breaker expert couldn’t do anything to him.","The Azure Dragons knight only had one thought in his mind, and that was to flee. He couldn’t care less at this point. The glory of the Azure Dragons was nothing.","At this moment, the only thing he could do was run.","“It’s too late to leave now!”","Chu Yunfan raised one of his hands up high and countless sword lights began to condense in his palm. They instantly turned into a terrifying long sword that was hundreds of meters long.","The long sword expanded in the wind, growing larger and larger, and then suddenly fell down fiercely.","Boom!","The sword split the sky and shattered everything in its path. Then, it struck the Azure Dragon knight.","The knight’s steel armor was cut into pieces. Then, he and his horse were cut in half.","Even his Divine warhorse was cut in half and instantly died. Then, the two halves of his body fell to the ground with a loud bang, creating a huge hole in the ground.","All of this seemed to take a long time, but in fact, it ended quickly.","Many people didn’t even have time to recover from the shock of Chu Yunfan killing the old woman of the Divine Maidens before they witnessed Chu Yunfan kill the other two top-tier masters with lightning speed.","In front of him, Divines were like decorations. They were no different from Innates. He could kill them with one blow.","The first to react was the armies of the Sky Breakers and the Azure Dragons. Seeing that their leaders had been killed so easily, they didn’t dare to stay any longer and immediately dispersed.","The usual training was of no use. No matter how courageous a person was, when facing a demon like Chu Yunfan, it would be useless. Only death awaited them.","However, Chu Yunfan, who was angry at their despicable actions, had no intention of letting them go. He attacked them with his sword twice.","The two swords were like world-destroying swords. The two armies of more than two thousand people were instantly killed. They evaporated and turned into a bloody mist. Not even a speck of blood was left.","At this moment, the experts who were watching the battle from afar finally reacted. The allied army of the three major forces had been completely annihilated.","..."]},{"number":1022,"title":"Chapter 1022 Gathering of the Wind and Clouds at Tuoshan","paragraphs":["1022 Gathering of the Wind and Clouds at Tuoshan","In just a few short slashes, the allied army of the three major forces was completely annihilated.","Such terrifying killing efficiency made the crowd associate Chu Yunfan with the legendary demon god in their hearts.","“Is... Is he even human?” Many people said with fear and trepidation. In front of this demon god, even Divines were nothing.","“No wonder he has such strength. He didn’t even flinch when facing the three great forces!”","“He’s so strong! Tianhe has found a super backer!”","The crowd was in a heated discussion, but many of them didn’t even dare to look Chu Yunfan in the eyes for fear that he would sense them. If they merely glanced at an expert of that level, he would be able to sense it with his extremely sensitive senses.","An expert of that level was no small matter.","However, the ones who were the most dumbfounded were the Tianhe experts. They had planned to fight to the death to buy time for Chu Yunfan. After all, their families were in Tianhe and there was no way for them to retreat.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would sweep across the entire area as soon as he appeared? The allied army, which seemed unstoppable, was easily destroyed by Chu Yunfan.","Only now did they truly feel the difference between themselves and him. The stronger one’s cultivation was, the more one would break away from the realm of mortals.","If Chu Yunfan was still in the Innate Stage, he would have no choice but to turn around and run away from thousands of Acquired masters. It would be impossible for him to kill thousands of them with one strike.","That was close to the level of a god.","There was a fundamental difference between Divines and Innates. It was an existence that transcended the level of ordinary life.","Chu Yunfan withdrew his divine power and landed beside Lin Hongfeng and Lin Haoren.","“Are you okay?” Chu Yunfan looked at Lin Hongfeng.","Lin Hongfeng shook his head and said, “I’m fine. You don’t have to worry. Thank you, Mr. Chu. Otherwise, I’m afraid I would have been killed today.”","Chu Yunfan said, “You were only fighting so hard to help me buy time. This is nothing. The most important thing now is to save Chenxi.”","Although Lin Chenxi was only Chu Yunfan’s in-name disciple and could not be considered an official disciple, she was still Chu Yunfan’s first-ever disciple. To him, she held an extraordinary significance.","“Okay.” Lin Hongfeng nodded.","He was burned with anxiety when his daughter was taken away. The reason he managed to remain calm and not rush to save her was that he knew it was impossible for him to save his daughter alone. His only hope was Chu Yunfan.","“You stay here and deal with the aftermath. Lord Lin and I will save Chenxi,” Chu Yunfan said to Lin Haoren.","Lin Haoren nodded. If he had some doubts about his father’s decision before, then he no longer had any now. His father was right, only by relying on this mysterious Mr. Chu could they possibly save his sister.","After making all the arrangements, Chu Yunfan disappeared with Lin Hongfeng and flew into the sky.","At this time, the experts who were watching the battle from a distance finally felt relieved. When Chu Yunfan was there, although he didn’t move much, they still felt an invisible pressure. It had made them breathless.","It was as if they were being stared at by a ferocious beast. Now, they could finally take a deep breath.","“Mr. Chu and Lin Hongfeng are probably heading to Tuoshan.”","“That’s right. It’s definitely Tuoshan. Right now, the three great forces are gathered there to discuss the ownership of the flood dragon spirit.”","“Now that the Divine Maidens have captured Lin Chenxi, I’m afraid Mr. Chu won’t let this go. After all, I heard that he has taken her as his disciple, isn’t that so?”","While the crowd was discussing, Chu Yunfan and Lin Hongfeng had already flown into the sky.","At this time, Chu Yunfan finally asked Lin Hongfeng about the specifics. “Do you know where Chenxi is being held?”","“She should be locked up in Tuoshan right now. The three forces have no foothold in our area, so they’re all gathered in Tuoshan. They’re trying to find a way to split the flood dragon spirit,” Lin Hongfeng said after some thought.","“I didn’t expect Chenxi to be captured on her way back to Tianhe.” Thinking of this, Lin Hongfeng was crestfallen. “I was too careless.”","Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “No, it’s not your carelessness. They’re aiming for me, and Chenxi was implicated. They want to use Chenxi to force me to give in.”","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan sneered. “Since they want to force me to show myself, I’ll go and meet them. I’d like to see how capable they are!”","From Lin Hongfeng’s report, Chu Yunfan learned about the situation of these three major forces. Whether it was the Sky Breakers, the Divine Maidens, or the Azure Dragons, they were the three most powerful forces near this city, and the leaders of these three forces were famous for their strength.","Of course, they normally would not pay any attention to this place. After all, compared to the rest of the Holy Land, this place was poor and remote.","The reason there had never been any intervention from major forces here was that in addition to the tacit understanding between the cities to reject the intervention, the most important was that there were no particularly large resources here that could attract the coveting of these forces. That was how they had been able to maintain their independence until now.","But it was different now. With the emergence of the flood dragon spirit, the three major forces got involved, not to mention the other small forces.","It was clear that the three forces didn’t care about anyone else—not even about Chu Yunfan or Tianhe, who were the current owners of the mine.","They believed that as long as the three major forces reached an internal agreement, no one else would have any room to resist. They didn’t know that while they were negotiating and thinking of ways to divide the flood dragon spirit, Chu Yunfan had already taken it.","“They’re here, but not at Taining and are at Tuoshan instead? Interesting,” Chu Yunfan sneered. He already had a rough idea of who leaked the news, but it was meaningless to say it out loud now.","To him, no matter which of the three forces it was, he would kill them all if they dared to get in his way.","In the time it took to speak, Chu Yunfan arrived outside Tuoshan."]},{"number":1023,"title":"Chapter 1023 The Allied Army Was Wiped Out? Everyone Was Shocked!","paragraphs":["1023 The Allied Army Was Wiped Out? Everyone Was Shocked!","Tuoshan had become a gathering point for the outside forces.","All sorts of experts had gathered in the city. The more powerful an expert was, the more powerful their qi and blood would be.","From the sky, Chu Yunfan could see streams of qi and blood rushing up into the sky. Ordinary people would not be able to detect it, but to his eyes, they were like lanterns in the dark, unable to be hidden.","Among the qi and blood streams, there were a few especially powerful ones. Their qi and blood had condensed into pillars. If an ordinary person’s qi and blood were like candles, then these figures were like small suns.","These people didn’t have any thoughts of holding back.","These experts were like beacons of light. Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to ask to know where he should go.","At the same time, in the mansion of Tuoshan’s city lord, experts from all over the world had gathered.","The city lord, Lu Shuzhou, was standing at the edge of the reception hall. He didn’t even have the right to speak in front of this group of top-tier masters.","Although he had reached the peak of the Innate Stage, Inmates did not have the right to speak in front of a group of Divines. He could not afford to offend any one of them.","As the host, he was driven to the side and left without even a chair as the Divines in the hall began to quarrel.","The fluctuations unintentionally emitted by these Divines made a chill run down his spine. The aftermath of a casual battle between them could severely injure him. They were extremely terrifying and powerful.","However, he didn’t regret it. If the flood dragon spirit fell into the hands of these people, he could still be the city lord of Tuoshan. However, if it fell into the hands of Lin Hongfeng of Tianhe, it would be impossible for him to be the city lord in peace.","The tacit understanding between the cities was that they couldn’t do anything to each other and couldn’t resist the attack of everyone. However, if the flood dragon spirit was devoured by Tianhe, this balance might be broken.","Now that these experts had gathered here and Tuoshan wasn’t the leaders of the three major forces, they naturally couldn’t get a big share. However, even if it was just a small portion, it was enough for them.","Among these experts, there were three who were the strongest. They were the leaders of the crowd and the core of the discussion.","The First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maidens was a well-developed and beautiful woman in her thirties. She was dressed in white and had an outstanding figure.","The president of the Azure Dragons was a man in full battle armor. Just by sitting there, he exuded the aura of an iron stallion as if he were a battlefield.","The last one was the sect leader of the Sky Breakers. He was dressed in a magnificent robe and looked graceful and noble. He had an extraordinary bearing, but the aura he emitted was chilling.","These three were the focal point of the entire hall. No matter what the crowd said, the final decision had to be made by these three.","“It’s impossible for the three forces to divide this equally!”","“That’s right. You guys can eat the meat, but you should at least leave some soup for us!”","“It’d be greedy of you to keep the flood dragon spirit all for yourselves!”","Everyone was filled with righteous indignation as if they were afraid that the three forces would decide to divide up the flood dragon spirit only among themselves and kick them out completely.","“You people are so stupid. Do you think it’s easy to compensate for the flood dragon spirit?” The Azure Dragons’ president sneered at the crowd.","His words made everyone quiet down. They finally remembered that they had not got their hands on the flood dragon spirit yet.","The spirit of a flood dragon was not ordinary. It was a nature spirit. Even if it had not fully developed, it was not something that ordinary people could deal with.","Under such circumstances where they had not even gained control of the flood dragon spirit, they were already trying to get a share. Wasn’t that ridiculous?","“We have so many experts here. Even if the flood dragon spirit is extremely powerful, we can still kill it. It’s only a matter of time before we take it. That’s why we need you to make it clear now.”","“That’s right. If you want to kick us out and take the flood dragon spirit for yourself, we won’t agree to it!”","“You think we don’t know? You’ve already sent your most trusted subordinates to fight for control of the mine!”","These experts clamored one after another. They weren’t stupid. It was impossible for the three major forces to hide their actions from them on such a large scale.","“We’ll discuss how to distribute it after we gain control of it. It’s ridiculous to talk about this before that,” the First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maidens spoke.","Although she was a woman, no ordinary person could compare to her in terms of status or strength. Everyone had to listen to her words.","“That’s right. we’ll talk about it after we take it down,” the sect leader of the Sky Breakers said in support.","The three of them had reached a tacit understanding. They were not giving the others a chance to sow discord. No matter what the final situation was, they couldn’t fall out with everyone at this time. Otherwise, even if these people weren’t their opponents, they still had many ways to cause trouble for them.","According to the time, the experts they had sent out should have already succeeded, but there had been no news. They hadn’t even received a letter.","Suddenly, a flying sword flew straight into the main hall. It flew into the sect leader’s hand, then shrank to the size of a palm and disappeared into his body, leaving only a letter in his hand.","It was a Divine ability—the Flying Sword Mail.","He opened the letter and read it. At first, his expression was indifferent, but then his entire expression changed completely.","“How is this possible? Completely annihilated?” The sect leader of the Sky Breakers was completely shocked when he read the letter.","He didn’t want to believe it, but the letter was signed by someone he absolutely trusted. He knew that the other party would not lie to him, let alone about this.","In the letter, it was said that Chu Yunfan had killed the entire allied army in front of the mine. If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he would also find it hard to believe that such a ridiculous thing had happened.","Beside him, the First Divine Maiden and the Azure Dragons’ president also read the contents of the letter. Their expressions changed drastically.","“What?! How is this possible?!”","“D*mn it! This is impossible!”"]},{"number":1024,"title":"Chapter 1024 I Think You’re Seeking Your Own Death","paragraphs":["1024 I Think You’re Seeking Your Own Death","The expressions on the trio’s face changed drastically when they saw the words on the letter. According to it, the three armies that they had sent were completely annihilated.","Thousands of elites and even Divines. For the three great forces, such a lineup was extremely impressive. However, now that they were all annihilated, how could they not feel heartache?","The others weren’t idiots. On the contrary, they were all extremely intelligent people. They had already guessed what had happened.","It was no secret that the three major forces had sent out their armies to occupy the mine. It was because of this that they had rushed here to ask for an explanation. If they didn’t say it now, they wouldn’t have the chance to interfere after the three families finished dividing the loot.","!!","This was the weakness of original sin. They were no match for any of the three. They could only do it by relying on the strength of everyone.","And now, the armies of the three clans had been completely annihilated. This was not good news for them.","The Divines leading the three forces were much stronger than most of them. If even these three were completely annihilated, what more of them?","At this time, everyone realized that a top master had probably made a move. Otherwise, it would be impossible to achieve this.","However, they were also very curious about the background of this expert. He dared to ignore the three major forces and all of them. That wasn’t something an ordinary person could do.","“Such great courage!” The sect leader of the Sky Breakers slapped the armrest of his chair in anger.","Sky Breakers’ losses this time could be said to be enormous. Just the thought of it made one’s heart ache.","The Azure Dragons’ president’s expression was also extremely unsightly. The losses were huge. Those were all elites who had been sent to fight for benefits. Who knew that they would suffer such heavy losses?","The First Divine Maiden, who had originally been confident of winning, now had a livid expression. The loss of a large number of experts made her feel extremely distressed.","The three of them didn’t have any intention of hiding it, because it had already happened. With such a large scale, it was impossible to hide it.","Therefore, everyone quickly found out about this and gasped.","Everyone here except Lu Shuzhou was a Divine. It was because they were Divines that they understood how terrifying it was to destroy three armies with a few slashes.","This person was definitely much more powerful than them.","“Do any of you know who this Mr. Chu is?” The Azure Dragons’ president asked coldly.","When everyone heard his question, they were all at a loss. They had heard of this Mr. Chu recently. After all, the mine was currently controlled by Tianhe.","When it came to Tianhe, Mr. Chu was a person that could not be avoided.","But that was all. Everyone was a little dumbfounded when they learned more about him.","At first, they thought that they were the only ones who didn’t know, but now they realized that no one knew who this Mr. Chu was.","However, how could no one know the background of such a powerful expert? This in itself was inconceivable.","“No one who Mr. Chu is?” The Azure Dragons’ president looked to the First Divine Maiden as he spoke, “Didn’t you question Lin Chenxi?”","Everyone’s eyes also turned to the First Divine Maiden. Everyone knew that the she had captured Mr. Chu’s disciple. They thought that Lin Chenxi was just an insignificant chess piece at first, but now, with Chu Yunfan’s strength, this insignificant chess piece might actually be a very important one.","The First Divine Maiden’s expression turned awkward. Although she had ordered her people to capture Lin Chenxi, she did not take it to heart. She had only ordered them to interrogate her to obtain some information.","With her status, how could she ask about these things personally?","“I’ll get someone to bring that b*tch here right now,” the First Divine Maiden said coldly through gritted teeth.","At this time, she also hated Chu Yunfan to the core, so she naturally took her anger out on his disciple.","After a while, Lin Chenxi was brought forth. Her clothes were in tatters and she looked dispirited as if she had been tortured.","She could feel everyone’s eyes on her. Although she did not know the reason, she knew that it must have something to do with her master. After all, these were all Divines. There was no need to target her. She knew in her heart that in the eyes of these Divines, she was no different from an ant.","“Hmph, I will now ask you a question and you will answer. If you hide anything, you’re dead meat,” the First Divine Maiden said coldly.","“Who is this Mr. Chu? What’s his background?” the Azure Dragons’ president asked with an ashen face.","“If you want to know, why don’t you ask my master directly? What’s the point of asking me?” Lin Chenxi said.","Regarding these things, even she was not clear about it because Chu Yunfan had never talked about it. Plus, she had no intention of prying into his personal life. She only knew that Chu Yunfan was her master, and that was enough.","“Hmph, stubborn. Let’s just kill her,’ the Sky Breakers sect leader said coldly, “No matter where that fellow comes from, he’s dead for killing members of the Sky Breakers. Even the gods of the great all-embracing Heaven can’t save him!”","As he spoke, he was about to make his move.","All of a sudden, everyone looked up at the sky. Although the roof was blocking them, it couldn’t block their vision. They didn’t rely on their vision, but on their divine will.","At that moment, two figures appeared in the sky above the residence of Tuoshan’s city lord.","“Since you have something to ask, just ask me directly. Why make things difficult for a junior?” Chu Yunfan boomed as he looked down from above.","“Good, good, good, you came just in time!”","The sect leader of the Sky Breakers had originally planned to kill Lin Chenxi with a slap, but now that Chu Yunfan had arrived, he immediately changed his plan and flew into the sky to face Chu Yunfan.","After him, the president of the Azure Dragons, the First Divine Maiden, and many other experts also flew up into the sky, facing off with Chu Yunfan and Lin Hongfeng.","“You’re Mr. Chu?” the sect leader of the Sky Breakers said as he grabbed Lin Chenxi’s neck.","“I am.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","When he saw Lin Chenxi’s condition, he frowned and said, “I think you’re seeking your own death.”"]},{"number":1025,"title":"Chapter 1025 Killing the First Divine Maiden With a Single Strike","paragraphs":["1025 Killing the First Divine Maiden With a Single Strike","“Chenxi!”","Seeing Lin Chenxi being grabbed by the neck, Lin Hongfeng became anxious, but he didn’t do anything. He endured it and just followed behind Chu Yunfan.","He knew how terrifying the middle-aged man in front of him was. The man could kill him with a single slap and was not someone he could fight against. If he wanted to save Chenxi, he had to rely on Chu Yunfan.","“If you want to find trouble with me or want to ask me something, you can come right at me if you have the ability. It’s too low a blow to capture my disciple,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at the Divines.","“Which one of you is the First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maidens?”","Everyone’s eyes naturally fell on the First Divine Maiden. They knew that Chu Yunfan was not going to let this matter go easily.","The First Divine Maiden felt a little embarrassed and angry. Chu Yunfan’s cold attitude showed that he didn’t take her seriously, which made her feel a bit angry.","“That’s right, I’m the First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maidens. You’re that Mr. Chu? How dare you! Do you know what heinous crime you’ve committed?” The First Divine Maiden gritted her teeth.","A pair of beautiful eyes stared at Chu Yunfan, revealing a bone-deep killing intent within.","“A heinous crime?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “It’s just a matter of our own methods. You guys also want the flood dragon spirit, right?”","“That’s right. If you’re smart, you’ll leave now. Otherwise, I’m afraid you’ll die today!” the president of the Azure Dragons spoke up.","Before, he had wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, but after seeing Chu Yunfan in person, he suddenly had other thoughts. It was clear that Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person.","Chu Yunfan was unfathomable, and he could not detect Chu Yunfan’s depths. Because of this, if it was possible to scare Chu Yunfan away, it would naturally be the best.","“Hahaha, you want me to leave? The flood dragon spirit is now in my hands. If you have the ability, come and take it. If you don’t have the ability, all of you will die!”","Chu Yunfan laughed out loud, not taking the Azure Dragons’ president’s invisible threat to heart.","Although the other party didn’t say their names, Chu Yunfan could feel that the Azure Dragons’ president, the sect leader of the Sky Breakers, and the First Divine Maiden were different from the others.","Naturally, it wasn’t difficult to distinguish them.","Chu Yunfan looked at Lin Chenxi, who had been captured and had clearly suffered a great deal of torture, and his eyes suddenly burst with a sharp light. These people’s actions had touched his bottom line. The anger in his heart exploded, and he was unable to restrain it.","“Very well, since you want to die, don’t blame us for not being polite!” the sect leader said coldly.","Lin Chenxi was standing in front of him. He started to exert more force in his palm to strangle her to death.","At this critical moment, a sword light pierced through the sky and swept out with a light that was hundreds of feet long. In an instant, it had swept toward the arm of the sect leader.","Though he was able to kill Lin Chenxi in one go, his entire arm would be cut off by the sword light.","The sword light carried an oppressive power, which made him instinctively feel extreme danger. Under such circumstances, he did not dare to risk it and immediately withdrew his hand.","He made his decision at the critical moment.","Swish!","The sword light flashed past his eyes, and the strong wind that was set off in the surroundings sliced ar his skin as if he had been cut by a knife.","Lin Chenxi fell from the sky. However, at that critical moment, a figure flew over a thousand feet and caught her.","“Master!”","Lin Chenxi finally came back to her senses after almost dying at the hands of the sect leader. Everything had happened at the last moment. If Chu Yunfan had been a little slower, she would have died.","The process was extremely exciting.","“Are you all right?” Chu Yunfan asked. He was the only one who could act so quickly.","He had been observing the sect leader the whole time, looking for the best time to make a move. The moment the sect leader was about to crush Lin Chenxi to death, he made his move.","As expected, the sect leader did not dare to fight Chu Yunfan head-on. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would have chopped off his arm.","“I’m fine, I’m fine.”","Leaning into Chu Yunfan, Lin Chenxi suddenly felt much better. A warm current flowed through Chu Yunfan’s body, and wherever the warm current flowed, her body relaxed. All the injuries she had suffered also started healing.","Chu Yunfan’s body had a faint scent of soap, which made Lin Chenxi’s heart beat wildly. Her pretty face blushed slightly, but in this situation, no one would care.","“It’s good that you’re fine.”","Chu Yunfan naturally didn’t know how much of a shock the incident just now had caused Lin Chenxi. After sending her to Lin Hongfeng’s side, he looked at the people in front of him.","“Your actions have completely infuriated me, so you will die.” Chu Yunfan pointed at the First Divine Maiden and the other two. “Since you’re the one who captured my disciple, I’ll start with you.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, the First Divine Maiden felt all the hairs on her body stand on end as if she was being stared at by some peerless monster. It was extremely terrifying.","This was her sixth sense, and in it, Chu Yunfan was like an extremely terrifying beast.","Boom!","As soon as Chu Yunfan’s voice fell, his whole body moved. In the next second, he disappeared from his original spot, and the air where Chu Yunfan had been standing exploded as if it had experienced a violent explosion.","When the crowd saw him again, they realized that he had already arrived in front of the First Divine Maiden.","He didn’t make any fancy movements. He just put his index and middle fingers together to form a finger sword, which then slashed down at the First Divine Maiden.","The sword light from this strike shook the Heaven and Earth. It turned into a thousand feet long sword and slashed down. The light of Heaven and Earth was seized by the sword light. At this moment, the place where the sword had slashed down was the center of Heaven and Earth.","The First Divine Maiden felt as if she had been struck by lightning. She could sense an extremely terrifying aura, but it was too late for her to escape.","With a loud shout, she thrusted out her sword. The sword light turned into a huge woman’s shadow. The shadow held a long sword in her hand, and it swung its sword to meet Chu Yunfan’s.","Boom!","The shadow sword exploded in mid-air as Chu Yunfan’s sword light slashed down, killing everything in its path.","The shadow woman was cut into two pieces, accompanied by blood. It was only then that everyone realized that the First Divine Maiden had been killed by the strike before they even realized it."]},{"number":1026,"title":"Chapter 1026 Slaughtering Tier-Eight Divines Like Chickens","paragraphs":["1026 Slaughtering Tier-Eight Divines Like Chickens","They had only exchanged a single move.","No one had expected that the First Divine Maiden would be completely caught off guard. Just like that, Chu Yunfan cut her in half, and her corpse fell to the ground.","Facing such a charming woman, Chu Yunfan didn’t show the slightest mercy and gave her a ruthless blow.","The fact that the First Divine Maiden had taken Lin Chenxi away had crossed the line. Everyone had a bottom line, and anyone who touched it would suffer the aftermath.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air, and the Divines scattered almost instantly. Chu Yunfan’s sword attack showed that the scene described in the letter was not fake.","Chu Yunfan indeed had the ability to annihilate a few armies with a few slashes.","No one could resist such a terrifying existence.","What kind of status and strength did the First Divine Maiden have?","Although the crowd was not particularly clear about it, they were certain that she must have reached above tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage, or even the peak of tier eight.","However, such a person had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands in just a single blow.","The First Divine Maiden didn’t even have time to react and could only hurriedly face the attack.","Of course, they would run as far away as possible from such a fiend. If they had wanted to get a share of the loot before, they didn’t dare to have such thoughts now.","Facing the three major forces, they still dared to make a fuss. Although the three major forces were powerful, they had many concerns.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He didn’t care about the things that ordinary people would care or worry about. He didn’t care about the impact at all.","As for the other two, the Azure Dragons’ president and the Sky Breaker’s sect leader, they immediately assumed a defensive stance.","Only they knew the shock in their hearts best. The reason why the three of them couldn’t get over it was because their strength was almost the same.","If they were to fight to the death, it would only benefit Chu Yunfan.","It was precisely because of this situation of mutual restraint that it finally led to such a situation.","Their strength had long entered the peak of tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage, and they were more than a notch stronger than the sect leader of Great Joy, who had just entered tier eight.","It could even be said that they were more than twice as strong as him because the Great Joy’s sect leader had relied on unorthodox methods instead of his own cultivation.","Such an expert would naturally be invincible when facing cultivators who were of a much lower level than him. However, when facing experts of the same level or higher, they would basically be defeated. They were not on the same level.","Therefore, even though there were all kinds of rumors that Chu Yunfan had easily killed Great Joy’s sect leader, they didn’t take it to heart. If it were them, although they couldn’t do it lightly, they could still do it. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan’s strength was about the same as theirs. Even if he was slightly stronger, it was only by a little.","However, when they just fought today, they realized that they were completely wrong. Compared to Chu Yunfan, they were more than just a little bit weaker.","What they didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan had just absorbed the flood dragon spirit, and his power had increased greatly. He had also entered tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, and his strength was more than several times stronger than before.","Therefore, although they were much stronger than Great Joy’s sect leader, they didn’t know that there was no difference in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","Azure Dragons’ president and Sky Breaker’s sect leader looked at each other and immediately realized that they had encountered an extremely difficult enemy.","After a moment’s hesitation, they made a decision. They couldn’t wait around to be killed. Only by attacking and defending would they have hope.","Boom!","The president took the lead in attacking. He was clad in a suit of metal armor, which was also a magic tool. It could protect his body, making it difficult for any kind of attack to hurt him.","Therefore, he took the lead in launching a frontal attack with a spear in his hand. Although he wasn’t riding a horse, he brought out the terrifying scene of thousands of soldiers galloping.","Compared to the Azure Dragon expert who had been killed by Chu Yunfan, he was much stronger. At least twice stronger.","Beside him, the sect leader of the Sky Breakers also made his move. However, he attacked from the side. The two of them were going to surround Chu Yunfan from the front and the side.","Suddenly, at this moment, Chu Yunfan also made his move. He didn’t seem to have made any big movements, but the terrifying fist of the sect leader passed through Chu Yunfan’s body.","“Not good. It’s an illusion!”","The sect leader immediately realized that something was wrong. But when he was about to counterattack, he suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan’s figure had split into nine figures. All of them looked real.","The Nine Cyclone Phantoms!","This amazing movement technique finally showed its amazing power. Previously, Chu Yunfan’s internal energy was limited, and even when he used the Nine Cyclone Phantoms, even with all his might, he could only use a part of its power.","But now, Chu Yunfan was able to fully use it. This was a world-shaking change from when he used it in the past.","At this moment, he had already arrived in front of the president. He clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out. A terrifying fist force formed a terrifying storm with Chu Yunfan’s body as the center.","This storm turned into a huge golden asura.","The golden asura threw a punch, and the Azure Dragon army was unable to pose any threat to Chu Yunfan. In an instant, they were reduced to nothing.","The momentum of the impact dissipated, revealing the Azure Dragons’ president.","Chu Yunfan’s punch had hit him in the chest.","Boom!","The president took the blow, and the smile on his face froze. He thought that his armor would be able to defend against a Divine’s full-powered attack, but a huge hole had actually been punched through his magic armor.","There was a huge hole in his chest, and his life force was flowing out crazily. The smile on his face fell, and his eyes were filled with disbelief. He couldn’t believe that he had died like this.","“Sh*t!”","At this time, the Sky Breakers’ sect leader suddenly realized that something was wrong. He wanted to escape. He didn’t dare to continue to oppose Chu Yunfan.","“You want to leave now? It’s too late!”","Chu Yunfan raised his arm high and grabbed a bolt of thunder. It transformed into a long spear and he threw it out.","Whoosh!","The spear pierced through the sect leader and nailed him to the ground."]},{"number":1027,"title":"Chapter 1027 The Opportunist, Identity Exposed","paragraphs":["1027 The Opportunist, Identity Exposed","Chu Yunfan had killed three leaders in a row.","The speed at which he had done so was so fast that it dazzled everyone. Before they could even react, the battle was already over.","There was a dead silence. Everyone was dumbfounded by this scene.","Many people began to tremble. This wasn’t a battle, but a one-sided slaughter.","The party that was being slaughtered were some of the few tyrannical existences among the nearby forces. It could even be said that in the vast area nearby, these three were the strongest.","With their peak tier-eight Divine Abilities Stage cultivation, they only needed to take one more step to enter the ranks of the top existences of the world and become invincible.","There people were existences that no one could contend against, but they had died so easily at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","At the same time, this showed how amazing Chu Yunfan was. The information they had previously received was wrong. Chu Yunfan was not just slightly more powerful. It was an overwhelming advantage.","However, what they didn’t know was that when they received the information, Chu Yunfan was only in tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage. His strength was far from what it was now.","Although he was stronger than the First Divine Maiden, the president of the Azure Dragons, and the leader of the Sky Breakers at that time, it was impossible for him to kill the three of them so easily. On the contrary, he had to cripple their hands and feet.","Although the final effect was the same, the shock it caused would not be as great as it was now.","At this time, everyone was hiding far away. They didn’t even dare to come close or look Chu Yunfan in the eye. If he came close, their first reaction would not be to fight, but to run away.","At this moment, the only chance of survival was to escape.","After Chu Yunfan killed the trio, their corpses naturally fell into his hands. The corpses of experts of this level were naturally priceless, not to mention the wealth they had on them.","In the past, when Chu Yunfan was still in the Innate Stage, he naturally couldn’t use any spatial equipment, because other than his Mountain River Diagram, all spatial equipment could only be opened using divine power after reaching the Divine Abilities Stage.","Even if Chu Yunfan’s strength was comparable to the Divine Abilities Stage at that time, he did not have any magical power. But now it was different. Although spatial rings could only be opened by the original owner, Chu Yunfan was different.","In the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, there was more than one way to forcefully break open an spatial ring.","After all, spatial rings were not magic tools at the level of the Mountain River Diagram. It was impossible for it to be completely unbreakable. Spatial rings could be carried on one’s body. If a spatial ring or a spatial bag was forcibly cracked open, it meant that the original owner was dead.","Naturally, there was no way to care about it.","If he could open these spatial equipment, the wealth inside would naturally fall into Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The three of them were all well-known figures in the nearby major forces, and their wealth was probably also an extremely huge figure, which was just right for Chu Yunfan at the moment.","However, he didn’t have the time to check the wealth on them. Instead, he looked into the distance and said, “Friend, you’ve been watching for a while now. It’s time for you to come out.”","Everyone shuddered. There was actually someone hiding here, and they didn’t even know.","Everyone instantly understood that someone was trying to try advantage of the situtation. However, that person probably didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so ruthless.","The leaders of the three major forces all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","In a short period of time, everything had changed. The entire scene had undergone earth-shaking changes. The situation had become very clear. There was no longer any chance for the person to fish in troubled waters.","From the void, a figure appeared. It was none other than the first elder of the Wei clan.","At this moment, the first elder looked at Chu Yunfan with an extremely ugly expression.","“It’s the Wei clan’s first elder!”","Among the Divines, someone recognized the man.","In the Holy Land, the Wei clan could be said to be a first-class existence, and the first elder was a first-class existence in the Wei clan. Naturally, he was a well-known existence throughout the Holy Land.","After reaching the Divine Abilities Stage, one would naturally have the opportunity to get to know the Wei clan’s first elder.","“First elder?” Chu Yunfan had also heard the words of the Divine who had cried out in surprise.","He and the Wei clan were old acquaintances and had fought many times. There were endless grudges between them.","Looking at the first elder’s expression, Chu Yunfan said, “Judging by your expression, you know who I am.”","“That’s right. I didn’t expect to see you here, chief of Special Ops,” the first elder said with a cold expression.","It could be said that he was very familiar with Chu Yunfan. All along, there had been a saying in the Holy Land, which was to take over the Federation.","The Wei clan was naturally the vanguard of this force, but Chu Yunfan was different. He was the representative of the Federation against the Holy Land’s invasion, and he was the number one expert of the current Federation.","Chu Yunfan’s position in the Federation was very important. Now that the Federation didn’t even have a president, Chu Yunfan’s influence had risen to the extreme.","Chu Yunfan’s idea was that the Holy Land could join the Federation, but only integrate into the Federation’s existing framework. After all, the Federation couldn’t possibly invite a group of retired emperors to work for them.","Under such circumstances, the conflict between the two sides had reached an intense level, and Chu Yunfan, as one of the top figures in the Federation, was naturally the target of their attention.","Chu Yunfan’s image was also imprinted into the first elder’s mind, but he never thought that Chu Yunfan would find a way to enter the Holy Land.","This was the most terrifying part!","What surprised him even more was that according to their intelligence, Chu Yunfan should have just entered the Divine Abilities Stage not long ago. But now, killing a tier eight Divine was as easy as slaughtering chickens and dogs to him.","He did it so easily.","This made the first elder realize a very serious problem. There was a huge problem with the information he had on Chu Yunfan.","The words of the first elder immediately caused an uproar among the Divines. They were all Divines and were the supreme group of people in the Holy Land.","They were no stranger to the Holy Land’s attempt to take over the Federation, regardless of whether they were involved or not.","It wasn’t that they didn’t know anything about the Federation, but they have never met Chu Yunfan.","And now, Chu Yunfan, whose identity had been a mystery, had finally been revealed. He was the head of the Special Operations Department of the Federation in the Kunlun Realm, one of the top officials of the Federation."]},{"number":1028,"title":"Chapter 1028 The Strength of a Tier-Nine Divine","paragraphs":["1028 The Strength of a Tier-Nine Divine","Many people changed the way they looked at Chu Yunfan. The Holy Land had been constantly infiltrating the Federation all this time, but now they were caught off guard by him as he killed his way into their lair.","At this time, many people finally understood why they couldn’t find out anything about such a terrifying expert. It was because he wasn’t part of this world. It was naturally impossible for them to find out about him.","Even Lin Hongfeng’s expression, who was standing behind Chu Yunfan, changed. He finally understood why he knew nothing about Chu Yunfan before.","So there was such a factor in it.","The Federation!","It was a force that all the major forces in the Holy Land knew, but they only knew about the general situation. According to the rumors from the major forces, the Federation was a force with a population of tens of billions and developed a system called science and technology. However, there did not many top martial experts, and the strength of the ones at the top was not all that great.","But now, Lin Hongfeng really wanted to tear the mouth of the person who said that. How could Chu Yunfan not be powerful?","Experts in tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage were killed as easily as chickens and dogs.","This kind of person was rare even in the Holy Land—an unparalleled existence.","The Federation clearly in their impression should not be like this.","However, he also thought of one thing. Everyone wanted to move into the Kunlun Realm, and many people even clamored to take over the Federation. Because they were all humans, it was much easier to deal with them than dealing with Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","The Holy Land was on the verge of destruction and did not have many years left. If they did not make a move before then, they would be destroyed along with the Holy Land. Now was the time to make their move.","Chu Yunfan was clearly a high-ranking official in the Federation. With his recommendation, Tianhe would have a way to integrate into the Federation.","After all, those who wanted to enter the Federation were the top forces. For small forces like them, not to mention entering, even integrating was acceptable. After all, even if they entered the Federation, it would not be up to them to make the decision. In that case, it naturally did not matter.","And Chu Yunfan’s existence was undoubtedly the best opportunity. Moreover, their relationship with Chu Yunfan was too deep, so it was already too late for them to leave.","“You really do know me.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“It seems that this flood dragon spirit was your doing. I originally wanted to say that if Taining had only touched the flood dragon spirit when excavating it, they wouldn’t have been able to interrupt its evolution process no matter what. It’s not that I look down on them, but they don’t have the strength to do so.”","When Chu Yunfan saw the First Wei Elder, he had already figured out many things. The Wei clan must have been behind the flood dragon spirit. Only the Wei clan’s strength could have done this.","“That’s right. The flood dragon spirit is something that the Wei clan wants. You better hand it over. Otherwise, you won’t be able to bear the consequences,” the First Wei Elder threatened coldly.","“Hahahaha, the Wei clan has such a big appetite. The flood dragon spirit is already in my hands. What? You want to take it back? I don’t think you have the strength to do so. Get your clan leader to come and talk to me.”","Chu Yunfan laughed out loud and didn’t take the First Wei Elder to heart.","“You’re forcing my hand!","“I’m different from the three of them, ” the First Wei Elder said coldly, “If you think you can threaten me by killing the three of them, you’re gravely mistaken.”","“What’s the difference between you and them?” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","Now that he had sucked the flood dragon spirit dry, he naturally couldn’t give it away, especially since it was important for his future.","“Anyway, it’s impossible for you to take the flood dragon spirit from my hands with just your empty mouth!”","Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. He didn’t seem to be affected by the First Wei Elder’s threat.","In the distance, the Divines were looking at Chu Yunfan with fear. No matter how they looked at him, he had not come with good intentions. If they wanted to take over the Federation, then Chu Yunfan was obviously an obstacle that they could not bypass.","Many people hoped that the First Wei Elder would be able to defeat Chu Yunfan because they themselves had no hope. Even if they were twice as strong, they still had no chance of winning against such a terrifying person.","“Stubborn. If you refuse to accept the gift, then accept the punishment!”","The First Wei Elder looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and made his move. His divine power was boiling like the ocean around him and his terrifying aura was monstrous.","“This is a confrontation between top experts!”","The Divines could feel their bodies trembling, not to mention the ordinary people in the city. They could not help but kneel down and shiver, not daring to get up.","This was a battle between top-tier experts that even Divines were afraid of. If one was not in the Divine Abilities Stage, they would not even have the ability to resist. However, even if they had, it would not be of much use.","Swish!","At that moment, the First Wei Elder grabbed at the air and pulled out a treasure saber. A dragon’s roar reverberated from the blade.","In an instant, the First Wei Elder’s strength surpassed tier eight of the Divine Abilities Stage and entered tier nine.","Compared to the president of the Azure Dragons, the sect leader of the Sky Breakers, and the First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maidens, who were at the peak of tier eight, he was one realm stronger.","It was only a step away, but the difference between the two sides was at least double. The gap between each level in the Divine Abilities Stage was too far apart.","Shiing!","The treasure saber produced a huge blade light. The blade light had a spirit, and it almost tore the air apart. Among magic weapons, this saber was considered the best and most powerful.","The First Wei Elder had been a strong man all his life and had never backed down. He was one of the top masters of the Holy Land and had seen countless experts. Since he wanted to seize the flood dragon spirit, he naturally would not give up easily.","If Chu Yunfan had not so easily killed the three tier-eight Divines, he would not even bother to talk to Chu Yunfan and would just kill him with one strike.","He was strong, but Chu Yunfan was even stronger.","The First Wei Elder took a step forward, and the qi and blood in his body condensed into a pillar, soaring into the sky. He didn’t dodge but took the attack head-on."]},{"number":1029,"title":"Chapter 1029 Killing the First Wei Elder in One Punch","paragraphs":["1029 Killing the First Wei Elder in One Punch","Boom!","Chu Yunfan stretched out his palm. It was as if he wanted to cover the entire world. His large palm, which was shining with a jade-colored light, met the saber.","The terrifying explosion instantly shattered the air. The shockwaves of the explosion activated the barrier above Tuoshan and it shook violently.","The barrier’s surface rippled like water. One could only imagine how terrifying this attack was.","The residents of the city trembled in fear, but they didn’t dare to get up. They were suppressed by the terrifying auras of both sides and couldn’t get up.","Only the Divines took to the air and hid as far away as they could, not daring to get close for fear of being killed in the aftermath of the battle.","This wasn’t a joke. From the attack, they could feel that if they didn’t dodge in time, they would be killed. That would be terrifying.","In the distance, Lin Hongfeng’s face was unsightly.","The Wei clan’s First Wei Elder was far more terrifying than he had imagined. It was so terrifying that the First Wei Elder could break him with a single slap.","The First Wei Elder’s divine power materialized into streaks of auspicious light that danced through the sky. He was calling upon all his power and did not hold back in the slightest.","It was because of his fear of Chu Yunfan that he made the decision to use his full strength. Otherwise, at his level, there were not many in the Holy Land who could make him use his full strength.","What shocked him further was that Chu Yunfan’s strike had shattered his falling saber light. No one could see it clearly in the aftermath of the explosion—not even the Divines—he could see it clearly.","He could feel the terrifying force when the saber light was shattered.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, had not used any divine powers. He had only relied on his physical body to achieve this. This showed that Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying than he had expected.","“The Wei clan is so famous in the Holy Land that I’ve even heard of them in the Federation. Is this all they can do? It seems that the Wei clan doesn’t live up to their name!” Chu Yunfan said in a clear voice as if he didn’t care about the Wei clan.","The Divines in the distance were all in an uproar. The top expert in front of them was probably the only one who dared to ignore and even look down on the Wei clan, the number one family in the Holy Land.","“You’re too arrogant!” the First Wei Elder roared. The divine power in his body rose sharply. In the next moment, he unleashed his secret skill.","His strength kept rising.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was excited. Seeing the First Wei Elder doing his best, he didn’t show any fear. On the contrary, his face showed a bit of surprise and eagerness.","Ever since he had broken through to tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, he had not used his full strength. Even the president of the Azure Dragons, the sect leader of the Sky Breakers, and the First Divine Maiden of the Divine Maidens could not withstand a few of his attacks.","However, compared to those three, the First Wei Elder was clearly much stronger. It was enough for him to show off his skills.","“World Savior Saber!” the First Wei Elder roared.","In the blink of an eye, the entire world seemed to freeze. Even the air stopped flowing. Everything had been frozen by his Qi.","Even Chu Yunfan could feel it. This aura that froze everything was also affecting his body. However, with his cultivation, without any divine power, relying on just his physical body, he took a step forward and broke through the shroud of this aura.","Chu Yunfan’s momentum had also risen to the extreme, echoing the First Wei Elder’s momentum. He was not at a disadvantage and was even more tyrannical than the First Wei Elder, who had already used a secret technique to boost himself.","At this time, the First Wei Elder looked livid. He knew how difficult it had been for him to use this move after upgrading all his strength.","He felt the difficulty, and even his physical body was starting to tear apart. The burden of this move was too great. He had to end the battle and defeat Chu Yunfan quickly.","There was a sharp killing intent in his eyes. Chu Yunfan could not be allowed to live. Even though Chu Yunfan’s strength did not match the information he had received, he believed that his information was correct. That only left one possibility, and that was that Chu Yunfan’s strength had improved again.","What was even more terrifying was that Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. What level had the First Wei Elder cultivated to when he was in his twenties? At that time, he had just entered the Innate Stage and was already an outstanding person among his peers.","But compared to Chu Yunfan, he was simply dog sh*t. He had lived his life in vain.","Boom!","The saber light suddenly expanded, turning into a terrifying force that slashed down.","“Excellent!” Chu Yunfan laughed, then clenched his fist and punched out.","In the blink of an eye, he turned into an incomparably huge golden roc, and then suddenly swept out. The fist force hit the saber light, tearing it apart.","The saber light landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but it didn’t hurt him in the slightest.","“How is this happening?! I’m going all out!”","The First Wei Elder realized that his attack couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan at all. It was too weak in front of Chu Yunfan and was easily torn apart.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was clearly much higher than his.","He couldn’t understand and couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had reached such a tyrannical level at such a young age.","However, he didn’t have a choice. He turned his hand and slashed out another saber light.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The First Wei Elder desperately slashed out saber lights in an attempt to block Chu Yunfan’s attack. The offensive and defensive positions had completely changed.","However, the more Chu Yunfan fought, the more imposing he became. He punched the saber lights into fragments.","For Chu Yunfan, this was just an ordinary attack, but for the First Wei Elder, he was overdrawing his life force every time he struck out.","And every time, a large amount of qi and blood was drawn out from the First Wei Elder’s body. Finally, he could not hold out any longer.","After slashing out with his saber, he lost his strength and was unable to immediately slash out again. The originally airtight network of saber lights immediately showed flaws.","Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t let go of this opportunity. He threw out a punch that penetrated everything and instantly shattered these blade lights into pieces.","The force of the punch didn’t slow down and instantly pierced through the First Wei Elder’s chest.","In the blink of an eye, he died a tragic death."]},{"number":1030,"title":"Chapter 1030 Causing a Stir in the Holy Land","paragraphs":["1030 Causing a Stir in the Holy Land","Chu Yunfan’s aura rose to its peak as he killed the First Wei Elder, who was in tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage, with a single punch.","In everyone’s eyes, he was a demon god who was invincible.","The Divines who were watching the battle scattered. They didn’t dare to stay any longer for fear that Chu Yunfan would change his mind and kill them all.","They did not doubt Chu Yunfan’s strength.","In less than a moment, these people had completely disappeared. Not a single one was left.","Chu Yunfan put the First Wei Elder’s body into the Mountain River Diagram.","At this time, only Lin Hongfeng and Lin Chenxi had not left.","“I didn’t expect you to be a higher-up of the Federation, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfeng said with a bitter smile.","“Why? Do you regret your actions now?” Chu Yunfan asked with a faint smile.","“You must be joking, Mr. Chu!” Lin Hongfeng quickly said, “Tianhe will support you unconditionally!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. Lin Hongfeng was smart. At this point, Lin Hongfeng had no other choice, and it was too late for him to draw a line.","“Rest assured, Lord Lin. I have some sway in the Federation. If the Holy Land doesn’t accept Tianhe, you will be able to move into the Federation.” Chu Yunfan smiled. “It’s only a matter of time before the Holy Land moves to the Kunlun Realm. After all, the Holy Land doesn’t have many more years left, does it?”","Chu Yunfan looked at the cracks in the sky. They were even bigger than when he had first entered the Holy Land. That was not an illusion, but a fact.","The cracks were constantly expanding, and once they reached a certain point, the collapse of the entire Holy Land was inevitable.","It was because the Holy Land was about to collapse that all the forces in the Holy Land were in a hurry to move to the Kunlun Realm.","However, this kind of relocation process was very long, because there were not just one or two sects in the Holy Land. If they wanted to move all of the Holy Land’s sects, they couldn’t wait until it was about to collapse before taking action.","If that happened, at most, only the higher-ups of the major forces would be able to escape. The ordinary people would be completely annihilated.","Unless the Holy Land could suppress the Federation and make them accept their claim, the initiative would be in the hands of the Federation. Without the cooperation of the Federation, it would not be easy for the Holy Land to safely withdraw even one-tenth of its people.","This was a huge project that required the full cooperation of both sides.","For the Holy Land, being able to take over the Federation was the best outcome. However, for the Federation, it was the opposite. The best outcome would be for the Holy Land to integrate into the Federation.","The Federation’s high-end combat power was flawed, and it was impossible for it to cultivate Divines in a short time. Now that they had roped in the Holy Land, they could make up for the lack of high-end combat power.","The last shortcoming of the Federation would be made up. Even if they were to face the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain, they would not be at a disadvantage. On the contrary, they would even gain the upper hand.","This was also an opportunity that Chu Yunfan was giving to the Holy Land. If the Holy Land insisted on becoming the leader of the Federation, then it would undoubtedly be rejected by the Federation.","In a few more years, when the Federation’s top experts caught up, the Holy Land would be useless to the Federation. It would be impossible for them to show off as they could now.","“We are at your mercy, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfeng said through gritted teeth.","Since things had already come to this, he could only bet all his fortune on Chu Yunfan—betting that he would be the final winner.","“Very well. You won’t be disappointed,” Chu Yunfan promised.","“Master, no matter what others say, I will definitely support you!” Lin Chenxi’s petite face was serious as she spoke. When she thought of the fabled and wonderful Federation, her petite face could not contain her excitement.","Chu Yunfan smiled and patted her little head, then said, “Let’s head back to Tianhe first. As for the mining work of the mine, we can resume it. Without the obstruction of the flood dragon spirit, all work must be resumed as soon as possible.”","“Understood,” Lin Hongfeng said.","As the Divines fled, a shocking piece of news spread among the major forces of the Holy Land.","A top master from the Federation had entered the Holy Land and killed a large number of Divines, including the first elder of the Wei clan.","There was an uproar when the news came out. The Holy Land had always been the dominant force. They could infiltrate the Federation if they wanted to and return to the Holy Land if they wanted to.","This was the first time that an expert from the Federation had come to the Holy Land. It was unprecedented.","Overnight, the entire Holy Land was in an uproar, all because of Chu Yunfan.","The first to react was naturally the number one family of the Holy Land—the Wei clan.","As the vanguard in taking over the Federation, the conflict between the Wei clan and Chu Yunfan was naturally irreconcilable.","Not to mention that this time, one of their elders had been killed. He was one of the top few experts in the entire Holy Land, and it was extremely difficult to cultivate even one. But now, he died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","And according to the records, the number of Wei clan members who died at Chu Yunfan’s hands in the Federation was more than this.","The entire Wei clan was furious.","The clan leader of the Wei clan declared that since Chu Yunfan dared to come to the Holy Land, he would kill him there.","It was understandable for the entire Wei clan to be furious. After all, even their first elder had fallen at Chu Yunfan’s hands. This kind of loss could only be described as terrifying.","Under the Wei clan’s relentless propaganda, everyone in the Holy Land came to know Chu Yunfan’s status in the Federation.","Chu Yunfan held great power in the Federation and was in charge of the Special Operations Department.","Special Ops had high authority and had connections all over the Federation. In terms of strength, apart from the lack of Divines, their overall strength was above some of the top forces of the Holy Land.","In terms of status and strength, Chu Yunfan was on the same level as a small group of big shots in the Holy Land. Chu Yunfan was even known as the number one expert of the Federation.","Most importantly, he was only in his twenties. What were they doing when they were in their twenties?","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, had already become one of the top experts in the world at this age. There was no doubt about the huge gap between them.","There was a huge difference.","This made many people who knew about it exclaim in surprise. They felt as if they had wasted their lives."]},{"number":1031,"title":"Chapter 1031 If You’re Not Convinced, You’re Welcome to Fight Me","paragraphs":["1031 If You’re Not Convinced, You’re Welcome to Fight Me","Although the Holy Land and the Federation were in two completely different worlds, it was relatively easy for many people to obtain some information about Chu Yunfan.","After all, there were many people from the Holy Land who had infiltrated the Federation. Just the basic information about Chu Yunfan they could find had already caused a great uproar throughout the Holy Land.","If they were just lamenting about Chu Yunfan’s youth before, when they saw his many achievements, they were completely shocked.","There was no doubt that he was a peerless genius. Even in the usually proud Holy Land, there had never been such a figure.","The Holy Land had always looked down on the Federation’s martial arts development. Although the Federation’s development was fast, it was clearly still far behind the Holy Land.","Based on the Federation’s current rapid development, it would surpass the Holy Land in a hundred years at the latest. Although a hundred years was a long time, it was not worth mentioning when compared to the long development of the Holy Land.","One could only imagine how fast the Federation was developing. However, the Federation’s martial arts were still not comparable to the Holy Land at this moment, especially in terms of Divines.","However, the Federation had managed to cultivate a peerless genius that even the Holy Land could not.","This made many people think of the previous number one expert of the Federation, the Federation President. Many people even exclaimed that Chu Yunfan would be the next president.","The president was the first person to truly make a name for himself in the Holy Land, and Chu Yunfan was the second person after him.","The leading family of the Holy Land—the Wei clan—had many buildings in the ancestral land. This was the core of the family and the place where most of the Wei clan’s descendants lived.","At the same time, in the depths of the Wei clan’s ancestral land, a meeting of the highest level was being held.","The Wei clan’s high-ranking officials scattered all over the country came one after another. More than a hundred people attended the meeting, which was enough to decide the major events of the clan.","Among them, only masters at the peak of the Innate Stage and above were qualified to participate in this meeting. There were even Divines among them, which was a testament to the Wei clan’s legacy.","At the head of the meeting, a middle-aged man of about forty years old with a pale face and no beard sat there. He had a serious expression on his face and exuded a sense of majesty.","He was the current head of the Wei clan, Wei Wuyan.","“Chu Yunfan must die!”","“That’s right! We can’t let him continue to be so arrogant. We have to avenge the first elder!”","“Forget about vengeance. This person is the leader of the Federation’s hardcore anti-Holy Land faction. Once he’s dead, those stubborn people in the Federation will all fall apart!”","The entire meeting was hyped up and filled with murderous intent.","The clan leader, Wei Wuyan, was indifferent and didn’t say anything. The First Wei Elder was his younger brother, and now that he had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, Wei Wuyan couldn’t wait for Chu Yunfan to die.","“Even so, that fellow’s strength is no small matter. I believe everyone knows the first elder’s strength. It’s said that he could not even last more than a few moves against that fellow. I’m afraid that Chu Yunfan’s strength has entered tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage. Maybe even the peak. It won’t be easy to kill him.”","Some of the more rational elders surmised this.","Everyone calmed down. They had also thought of this. The First Wei Elder was not afraid of anyone in the Wei clan unless it was Wei Wuyan himself.","No one was his match.","And such a person was no match for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan did not even have to try very hard and completely crushed the First Wei Elder.","With such strength, even the current clan leader, Wei Wuyan, might not be able to defeat him.","It was too difficult to kill such a person.","Everyone turned to look at Wei Wuyan, but his face was also ashen and he didn’t say a word. In fact, he was also somewhat afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength. If he had confidence, he wouldn’t have waited until now and would have gone up to Chu Yunfan’s door and killed him.","But Chu Yunfan’s existence made him feel greatly threatened.","“How about we spread a story? The Wei clan wants to take over the Federation, but we’re not the only one who wants to do so,” one of the elders said, “Chu Yunfan’s strength is not only a thorn in our side but also a thorn in the other forces.”","His words made the eyes of many of the elders and high-level executives light up. It was because of this that Chu Yunfan’s performance was amazing.","Just relying on the family might not be enough to guarantee their safety. But if Chu Yunfan injured other people, it would be a different story.","“That’s right! Let’s do that!” Wei Wuyan said. Without absolute confidence, even he was not willing to stand out for others.","“Use all the channels to spread the news about Chu Yunfan. The more people know, the better. I don’t believe that he can fight against the entire Holy Land by himself.”","After Wei Wuyan’s command, the Wei clan’s various channels began to operate. The Holy Land was the Wei clan’s home ground, and they had been rooted there for many years.","Overnight, Chu Yunfan’s name spread throughout the Holy Land. Because of the Wei clan, everyone knew that a high-ranking official of the Federation had come to the Holy Land.","However, it was obvious that the Wei clan didn’t want to create support for Chu Yunfan because as his information was disclosed, while many people were shocked, it also made many people determined to kill him.","The Wei clan was not the only one who wanted to take over the Federation. There were many other forces as well. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan, who was powerful and had an extremely firm attitude and ruthless methods, was simply a thorn in their side.","If they were in the Federation, he would prove troublesome. However, it would be different if they were in the Holy Land. After all, this was their home ground.","Once the killing intent rose, it could no longer be suppressed. A person’s killing intent could overturn the heavens and earth.","At this time, when everyone’s eyes were on Tianhe, Chu Yunfan, who was already a cornered mouse in many people’s eyes, suddenly announced through Lin Hongfeng that he was willing to represent the Federation and discuss with the Holy Land how to integrate into the Federation.","“If you’re not convinced, you’re welcome to fight me!”","This single sentence ignited the entire Holy Land."]},{"number":1032,"title":"Chapter 1032 Chu Yunfan’s Trump Card, Numbers Was Meaningless","paragraphs":["1032 Chu Yunfan’s Trump Card, Numbers Was Meaningless","Chu Yunfan’s words ignited the atmosphere of the entire Holy Land. In many people’s eyes, he clearly didn’t take them seriously.","Or rather, the Holy Land was nothing o him.","Many people who harbored evil intentions kept clamoring to ensure that Chu Yunfan dies.","Chu Yunfan’s declaration was like a letter of challenge, and the higher-ups of the major forces collectively fell silent. For a while, none of the various forces came forward to respond.","In the city lord’s mansion of Tianhe, Chu Yunfan stood by a pond. He stood still and unmoving, trying to comprehend the way of nature.","Lin Chenxi was behind him.","It had been ten days since Chu Yunfan announced his offer. Ten days was enough for a lot of things to happen. After the previous disaster, Lin Chenxi profited from the disaster and her cultivation improved.","However, standing next to Chu Yunfan, she could still feel the terrifying power that was as vast as the ocean. It was not something she could compare to.","“Master, the Holy Land is boiling because of your words. Everyone is talking about it,” Lin Chenxi said as she looked at Chu Yunfan.","“Hmm.” Chu Yunfan nodded, seemingly not taking it to heart.","He knew that it was normal that it would cause such a stir. No matter what the result was, it would affect the future of the entire Holy Land. Anyone with a little insight could understand.","“But many people don’t think highly of you, Master. I’m afraid that many people in the Holy Land don’t like you.” Lin Chenxi continued. In fact, it wasn’t just that they didn’t like Chu Yunfan. All kinds of rumors were spreading, chiding Chu Yunfan for being arrogant and despotic.","“It doesn’t matter,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “Don’t you see that the forces that can really make decisions are all silent? As for those people who are clamoring, what’s there to be afraid of? When I settle everything, they’ll have to agree even if they don’t want to. At that time, they’ll turn around and hug my thigh.”","The corner of Chu Yunfan’s mouth lifted into a smile. He didn’t care about those people at all.","Lin Chenxi seemed to have understood the situation. To her, the pressure that was formed by the denouncement of the entire world was simply terrifying.","However, to Chu Yunfan, it didn’t matter whether those people agreed or not. They couldn’t affect the overall situation.","This was the difference in their levels. For Lin Chenxi, those who had scolded Chu Yunfan were all famous elders. Every one of them could destroy Tianhe with a single stomp of their feet.","Their determination could not be ignored, but for Chu Yunfan, they were just insignificant passers-by. The real important things were those behemoths that could decide the fate of the Holy Land.","The ones who could decide everything were the top existences among the behemoths. As long as he could suppress them, the others would naturally fall in line without a fight, and this seemingly dangerous situation would be resolved.","The key to breaking out of this situation was one’s strength. Only then would one be able to sweep away everything.","“There are six superpowers in the Holy Land. Aside from the number one family, the Wei clan, there are the Green Lotus Sect, Hellfire Faction, Moonfall House, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp,” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself.","He learned a lot about the situation in the Holy Land through Lin Chenxi.","When Chu Yunfan was in the Federation, he only knew a little about the Holy Land. Only after personally visiting the place did he truly understand the situation there.","There were a total of six superpowers in the Holy Land, and these six forces divided up all aspects of the Holy Land. The other forces had to rely on these six forces to exist.","All of them were in some way related to the six superpowers, and those who were not were exterminated a long time ago.","And among these six forces, there was no doubt that the Wei clan was the enemy force. There was no doubt about it.","The Wei clan was the force that was denouncing Chu Yunfan the most these days. They had been the greatest force in creating this overwhelming situation.","Therefore, the Wei clan would definitely be Chu Yunfan’s first target. At the same time, the Wei clan saw him as a thorn in their side. It was impossible for the two sides to resolve their enmity. It would only be possible if one side completely fell.","As for the remaining five powers, how many of them would stand on the side of the Wei clan, and how many would remain neutral? This was the question Chu Yunfan had to consider.","As for standing on his side, he had never even considered it. That was unrealistic. These powers had dominated the Holy Land for countless years and had never bowed their heads. It was impossible to make them bow their heads for no reason.","“Master, what if the six superpowers jump out to oppose us?” Lin Chenxi said worriedly.","The six superpowers were deified throughout the Holy Land. No one dared to ignore their wills.","If they wanted to deal with Chu Yunfan, it meant that the entire Holy Land wanted to deal with him.","If one wasn’t careful, there would be a disaster.","“That won’t happen.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","The six superpowers have been scheming against each other for many years, and he didn’t believe that they would cooperate with each other without any ill feelings.","Moreover, he also noticed that not all the powers had participated in the denouncement of him during this time. In other words, there must be someone behind the scenes who did not agree with it.","The six superpowers weren’t of one mind. Of course, that didn’t mean that they would be of the same mind as him, but that was enough.","“A few of their major forces might join hands, but the possibility of the top six joining forces isn’t high.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “But it doesn’t matter. No matter how many forces make a move, no matter what kind of means they have, they’re not my match.”","Lin Chenxi looked at Chu Yunfan with curiosity. She didn’t know what methods her master had to deal with the six superpowers that had been deified.","“Hmph, the people of the Holy Land probably don’t know what kind of weapon a nuclear bomb is.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","In terms of strength, he naturally had nothing to fear, but if several major forces joined forces, it would definitely not be just one or two people. However, as long as he had a nuclear bomb, so what if they had more people?","In the face of a nuclear bomb, numbers were meaningless.","As the head of Special Ops, it was not difficult for him to get a nuclear bomb. He had the authority to do so.","At that time, many would be caught off guard, and it would be enough to make them suffer.","Then, a series of hurried footsteps interrupted Chu Yunfan’s thoughts.","Lin Hongfeng strode over from a distance.","“Mr. Chu, the six superpowers have replied!”"]},{"number":1033,"title":"Chapter 1033 Even With Thousands There, I’m Still Going","paragraphs":["1033 Even With Thousands There, I’m Still Going","Lin Hongfeng rushed over and arrived before Chu Yunfan.","“Mr. Chu, the six superpowers have replied!”","“What did they say?” Chu Yunfan turned to Lin Hongfeng.","“They have jointly invited the leaders of all the forces to the Holy Mountain to discuss the future of the Holy Land, including when to invade the Kunlun Realm,” Lin Hongfeng said.","Then, he took out an invitation from his sleeve and handed it to Chu Yunfan, saying, “This is an invitation for you, Mr. Chu. I don’t think it’s a sincere invitation.”","Chu Yunfan received the invitation and glanced at it. It was under the name of the six superpowers, and this invitation was addressed to him.","Without a doubt, the six superpowers, especially the Wei clan, would love to tear him to pieces. And now, the negotiation meeting jointly organized by the six superpowers must be a trap.","He could even guess the Wei clan’s thoughts. They probably didn’t have full confidence in dealing with him, so they needed to use the entire Holy Land’s strength to deal with him.","In the Holy Land, there were probably many people who had the same idea.","“That’s right, Master. I don’t think they have good intentions. Let’s not go,” Lin Chenxi advised.","This negotiation initiated by the six superpowers was not in Chu Yunfan’s favor no matter how he looked at it.","“No, I want to.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","He knew that this was a trap set up by someone with ill intentions, but he had to show up because he wanted to make use of the Holy Land’s power and integrate it into the Federation to make up for the last shortcoming.","If he didn’t participate, this negotiation would definitely be controlled by the six superpowers. The final conclusion would definitely not be in the Federation’s favor.","At that time, not only would the Holy Land not help the Federation, but it would also stand on the opposite side of the Federation. It would become the third strongest enemy of the Federation after Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had no choice but to participate in this negotiation as the representative of the Federation.","“But they’ll set up an inescapable net!” Lin Chenxi said worriedly.","“They will, but that also depends on whether their net is strong enough,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“Don’t worry, they won’t be able to stir up any waves. Moreover, on the road of cultivation, you have to overcome all obstacles. If you don’t step up when you encounter a little difficulty, then the road will end just like that.","“There are more than one or two forces in the Holy Land that want to invade the Federation. There must be a large number of supporters. Now is the time to completely eradicate them.”","Hearing this, Lin Hongfeng’s pupils contracted slightly, and he looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of horror in his eyes.","Unlike many people, Chu Yunfan didn’t treat this negotiation as a trap. On the contrary, it was a great opportunity to eradicate the anti-Federation forces throughout the Holy Land.","If Chu Yunfan could really do it and capture all the big and small leaders who wanted to take over the Federation, then the Holy Land would be in for a bloody storm.","But Lin Hongfeng didn’t feel that there was anything wrong with this. He had already decided to fully support Chu Yunfan in exchange for the future of Tianhe, so he naturally hoped that Chu Yunfan would be as strong as possible.","“I’ve taken note of the date. The negotiation will be held in three months. I can go into secluded cultivation again before that,” Chu Yunfan said.","This time, the negotiation involved the entire human realm, and the scope was beyond imagination. Therefore, it was naturally not possible to hold it any time soon. It was already very impressive to arrange it to take place in three months.","And this was good timing for Chu Yunfan.","Now that he had entered tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, it was equivalent to him reaching the peak of tier nine in a single step. Therefore, the First Wei Elder could not even withstand a single blow from him.","However, he still had enough time to improve. By that time, his combat power would also improve, heading straight for the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. By then, unless a terrifying existence beyond the Divine Abilities Stage appeared, he wouldn’t be afraid. As far as he knew, there didn’t seem to be such an expert in the world.","“I’ll get everything ready for you immediately, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfeng quickly said.","The six superpowers’ joint negotiation shook the entire Holy Land. They were the rulers of the entire land, and every force was somehow related to them.","Now that the six superpowers had jointly invited them, they naturally did not dare to refuse. Moreover, the topic of discussion this time concerned the future of the Holy Land.","The Holy Land’s environment was getting worse and worse, and it would collapse soon. Many people knew this, but many people couldn’t deal with it. Entering the Kunlun Realm was undoubtedly a good way to go. Or even, the only way.","If they didn’t go now and were stopped from leaving the Holy Land, they could only wait for death here. Therefore, this time, unexpectedly, all the forces responded to the call and sent large delegations to participate in the negotiation.","This time, the place of negotiation was at the core of the Holy Land, which was the Holy Mountain. This was the spiritual center of the entire Holy Land.","Everyone rushed toward the Holy Mountain with all their might. The forces that were further away set off as soon as they received the news. They were afraid that they would be abandoned if they didn’t make it in time for the negotiation.","Everyone knew that the result of this discussion would determine how the Holy Land would enter the Kunlun Realm.","To choose to integrate into the Federation, or choose to declare war against the Federation, defeat them, and finally take over the land. These different choices would lead to different results.","It was related to everyone.","What many people were more concerned about was whether Chu Yunfan, who came from the Federation, would appear at the negotiation.","The six superpowers had jointly issued an invitation to him, and this was also known by many people with ulterior motives.","The Wei clan and the other forces wanted to use public opinion to force Chu Yunfan to appear, so they naturally continued to add fuel to the fire behind the scenes, making this matter widely known.","Whether Chu Yunfan would appear or not was also the matter that many people were most concerned about. After all, this matter had a lot to do with the Federation, and Chu Yunfan’s attitude would, to a large extent, represent the Federation’s attitude."]},{"number":1034,"title":"Chapter 1034 All Parties Are Here, but Chu Yunfan Is Missing?","paragraphs":["1034 All Parties Are Here, but Chu Yunfan Is Missing?","Three months passed in the blink of an eye, and news of this negotiation meeting spread throughout the Holy Land.","All the forces waited eagerly for the outcome as it would determine the Holy Land’s future.","What everyone was paying attention to, other than the outcome of the meeting, was whether Chu Yunfan—the current representative of the Federation—would dare to appear.","After all, everyone knew that the Wei clan had a blood feud with Chu Yunfan, so how could they really be willing to invite Chu Yunfan to participate in the negotiation?","!!","Anyone with the slightest intelligence would understand that the Wei clan and the other anti-Federation forces had probably prepared an inescapable net for Chu Yunfan.","Since they could all see it, there was no reason that Chu Yunfan couldn’t. So whether he would appear or not was naturally a mystery.","The Holy Mountain was located in the center of the Holy Land and stretched for thousands of miles. The peaks of the mountain reached into the sky, and the strange trees covered the sky.","On this day, the leaders of the Holy Land’s forces gathered there. At the foot of the mountain, a huge area had been arranged for the various forces to rest.","On the peak, there was a large area that was thought to have been flattened. The leaders of various great sects and aristocratic families had gathered on the peak.","Powerhouses from all sides gathered and looked from afar. If one looked at it with the aura observation technique, one could see terrifying waves of qi and blood shake the air.","Among these experts, the weakest were in the lower levels of the Divine Abilities Stage. Innates were not qualified to participate in such a discussion.","This time, the forces participating were the combined forces of the entire Holy Land, and there were actually hundreds of Divines. The strength of the Holy Land’s foundation when they truly worked together was staggering.","Although there might only be one or two in each force on average and the stronger forces like the six superpowers having more, their numbers were still terrifying. It was not something that the current Federation could compare to.","The number of Divines was enough to crush the Federation. This was the fundamental reason why the Holy Land was confident in suppressing the Federation despite knowing that the Federation had various high-tech and sophisticated weapons.","However, at this moment, hundreds of Divines were silent. Some of them even looked pale.","They had already been waiting here for an entire day, but the person they were waiting for, Chu Yunfan, had yet to appear.","For many people, this was undoubtedly a very regretful result, even though some people had bad intentions and hoped that Chu Yunfan would come to die.","But seeing that it didn’t seem like he was going to show up, they started cursing in their hearts.","Many people knew that there was an inescapable net prepared here. If it were them, they too would not have come to die.","In the center of the crowd, there were six figures sitting on thrones. Their thrones were higher up than the thrones of ordinary Divines.","Everyone was not surprised by this, because these six people could be said to be the true rulers of the entire Holy Land.","They were the leaders of the Wei clan, Hellfire, Green Loti, Infinity Camp, Moonfall, and Longevity Faith.","“Chu Yunfan’s words were so impassioned, but he’s just a coward!” Clan Leader Wei slammed the armrest of his throne.","His expression was extremely unsightly. He had carefully prepared an inescapable net for Chu Yunfan, but the target did not appear. This was equivalent to a punch landing on cotton, and it was really uncomfortable.","However, everyone present had an expression of being used to this. If someone knew that they were here to die, would they still came to die? Was that a true hero?","“That’s right. I thought he had some courage, but now it seems that he’s just so-so.”","A figure on the left of Clan Leader Wei spoke.","This figure was an old man who looked to be in his fifties or sixties. This old man looked extremely astonishing, and his hair and beard were made up of balls of flames.","These flames burned fiercely on the surface of his body, but they didn’t hurt him in the slightest.","Everyone knew that this was the leader of the Hellfire Faction of the Holy Land, the Hellfire King, who had made countless children stop crying.","In the Holy Lands, Hellfire had always been tyrannical and ruthless, killing people like flies. They cultivated demonic techniques, and the Hellfire King’s demonic techniques were earth-shaking.","“It doesn’t matter. Now that the teleportation array is in our hands, we can search for him without restraint after the negotiation is over. He can’t run away. If we join forces, even the gods of the great all-embracing Heaven will die.”","On the right side of Clan Leader Wei, another middle-aged man spoke. He was dressed in green and looked ordinary, but his tyrannical sword energy was extremely terrifying.","This was the sect leader of the Green Lotus Sect, which was a sect that focused on sword cultivation.","Beside him was a graceful middle-aged woman. She was dressed in a moon-white robe and had an unfathomable aura that could not be underestimated.","Everyone knew that this was the sect leader of Moonfall House.","Next to the sect leader of Moonfall was a middle-aged man in a magnificent robe. He had an aura of the boundless nature, which allowed him to fight against the few of them without being at a disadvantage. He was the sect leader of Infinity Camp.","Beside the sect leader of Infinity Camp was a well-built old man. He had white hair and a ruddy complexion. He looked energetic and his qi and blood were equally exuberant. He was the sect leader of Longevity Faith, the last of the six superpowers.","“Since Chu Yunfan hasn’t appeared, we’ll process with the negotiation on our own. There’s no need to wait for him,” Longevity Faith’s sect leader continued.","“That’s right. Whether he comes or not is a small matter. The important thing is how the Holy Land will mvoe forward,” Moonfall’s sect leader said.","Everyone agreed and put Chu Yunfan aside.","However, even on the third day of the negotiation, there was still no sign of Chu Yunfan. Not even his shadow could be seen.","Everyone naturally came to the same conclusion, and that was that Chu Yunfan definitely wouldn’t dare to show up. After all, in this situation where he clearly knew that there were tigers on the mountain, if he decided to appear in the tiger den, it would be extraordinary.","Although they knew that Chu Yunfan didn’t want to fall into a trap, all kinds of rumors against the Federation spread out.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even dare to show up, so how could he represent the Federation to negotiate with them? There was only one way now, and that was to defeat the Federation. Only then could they take over the Federation.","Given the massive size of the Federation, it would not be easy to make it submit. It would require the cooperation of various forces of the Holy Land.","The forces that had originally been inclined to a peaceful resolution and co-prosper with the Federation naturally couldn’t talk about it when Chu Yunfan himself didn’t appear.","For a time, the entire atmosphere seemed to be moving in one direction—to take over the Federation.","After Chu Yunfan’s no-show, the eyes of the Holy Land’s various parties shifted from Chu Yunfan to each other. They argued about who would move first, who would send troops to attack the Federation, and the proportion of combat power each party had to bear. No one was willing to lose. Even within the six superpowers, they were in a deadlock and neither side was willing to give in."]},{"number":1035,"title":"Chapter 1035 Chu Yunfan Finally Appears and Is Being Looked Down Upon?","paragraphs":["1035 Chu Yunfan Finally Appears and Is Being Looked Down Upon?","Without Chu Yunfan attracting the attention, the forces of the Holy Land were in a deadlock, especially since many forces had deep grudges against each other and refused to give in to each other.","While the crowd was arguing, a carriage arrived leisurely.","It was an extremely ordinary-looking carriage. Even if it were to travel in the countryside, it would not attract much attention.","However, the only thing that caught everyone’s attention was a pretty girl with a slim figure driving the carriage.","The young girl had an extraordinary bearing, and it was obvious that she was not from a small family. However, such a young girl was driving the carriage.","Moreover, she didn’t seem to be unwilling.","The carriage quickly stopped at the foot of the mountain and pulled to the side. Then, the girl lifted the curtain and shouted, “Master, we’re here!”","As soon as she finished speaking, a young man in a black robe, who was about twenty years old, with a strong face and a slender figure, emerged from the carriage.","“Have we finally arrived?” The black-robed young man looked calm. In his eyes, he could even feel endless energy spewing out of the entire mountain. It was a sign of a warrior’s strength to a certain extent.","In this kind of place, ordinary evil beings didn’t dare to approach. Once they got close, they would only be instantly scattered.","The two black-robed young man and young girl were none other than Chu Yunfan and his disciple, Lin Chenxi.","It wasn’t until several days after the negotiation had started that Chu Yunfan finally arrived. It was because he hadn’t managed to break through to the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage in one go as planned.","But now, Chu Yunfan was using all his power, desperately circulating the Emperor Method, refining a huge amount of spirit energy for his own use. In the Mountain River Diagram, many low-grade spirit stones were being absorbed by Chu Yunfan one by one and turned into powder.","After three months of hard work, Chu Yunfan had not yet reached the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, but he was almost there.","Since he was breaking through, he did not need to try too hard. He only needed to convert and accumulate enough power to naturally break through.","When he arrived at the Holy Mountain, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had already entered the final stage, and he was only a few moments away from breaking through to the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","He was not worried about whether the major forces would come up with anything unfavorable for the Federation in the next few days.","Because he would not allow it.","Chu Yunfan looked around and saw that the entire mountain was like a stabilizing needle, piercing straight into the sky and firmly locking the spirit energy of the entire world.","No wonder it became the Holy Mountain of the entire Holy Land.","Their arrival attracted the attention of many people at the foot of the mountain. After all, there were not many people who had just arrived at this time.","Suddenly, at this moment, a crisp voice came from the distance.","“Xixi!”","Immediately after, a fiery red figure appeared before the duo at lightning speed.","It was a woman in her twenties. She was dressed in a fiery red dress and had a pretty face. Her facial features were exquisite, and there was a heroic spirit in her beautiful eyes. She was different from ordinary women.","“Sister Min!” When she saw the young lady, Lin Chenxi immediately shouted out in surprise, “When did you come out of seclusion?”","When the woman in the fiery red dress saw Lin Chenxi, a smile of joy appeared on her face. “I just came out of seclusion not long ago. I was just thinking of going to Tianhe to visit you after the negotiation. Why isn’t your father herre? The leaders of all the forces in the world should have been invited to this negotiation.”","Lin Chenxi didn’t know how to answer the woman’s question. Lin Hongfeng was determined to support Chu Yunfan and had been seen as a traitor by many people. If Chu Yunfan didn’t come, why would he?","“He’s busy and can’t get away,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t talking nonsense. In fact, Lin Hongfeng was busy preparing to move Tianhe to the Kunlun Realm.","“And you are?” The woman looked at Chu Yunfan with some doubt in her eyes.","“Sister Min, this is my master.”","Because Chu Yunfan was now hated by everyone in the Holy Land, Lin Chenxi was careful not to mention his name.","“Master, this is my cousin, Nie Simin. She’s my aunt’s daughter and has been very good to me since she was young. She’s one of the most outstanding legacy disciples of Moonfall, one of the Holy Land’s six superpowers. She’s very likely to enter the Divine Abilities Stage in the future.","“Hello.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Nie Simin’s cultivation was pretty good. She was in her early twenties, about the same age as him, and she had already entered level nine of the Innate Stage. She was only one step away from the peak.","For someone of her age, she was indeed impressive.","In terms of martial arts, even Chu Yunfan had to admit that the Holy Land was indeed much stronger than the Federation. The Federation had only developed for hundreds of years. No matter how fast they advanced, there was still a gap between them and the Holy Land, which had existed for tens of thousands of years. However, this was also the reason why he did not allow this force to go against the Federation.","Nie Simin looked at Chu Yunfan suspiciously. She remembered that before she went into seclusion, she had received news that her uncle was planning to send Lin Chenxi to the Fluttering Blooms, but now, she had suddenly accepted a guy of unknown origin.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan only seemed to have some faint energy fluctuations in his body. According to her senses, he was at most at level seven of the Innate Stage, which was much weaker than her.","This kind of cultivation might be considered good in the eyes of ordinary people, but how could he be qualified to be her cousin’s master?","No matter how she looked at it, Lin Chenxi seemed to have been deceived.","What she didn’t know was that she could only sense some energy fluctuations because Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had entered a critical final stage, which was why some of the energy was out of control.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t be able to sense any energy fluctuations even if she saw death.","Nie Simin did things quickly, so she didn’t hide her suspicions and said, “Xixi, why did you choose an Innate as your master? Although the Fluttering Blooms have been destroyed, if you wanted a master, with your talent, it’s possible for you to join Moonfall. It just so happens that my master is also here. My master is the sect leader. I can ask her to recommend you a master in the Divine Abilities Stage.","Nie Simin was straightforward and cared little for Chu Yunfan. She spoke directly, but Lin Chenxi was anxious. Her cousin had no idea how powerful her master was, and thought that he was just an ordinary Innate.","She was very clear about the fate of those people from Great Joy who had said the same words before.","If her master got angry, her cousin would be in trouble."]},{"number":1036,"title":"Chapter 1036 The Six Great Geniuses? They’re Nothing!","paragraphs":["1036 The Six Great Geniuses? They’re Nothing!","“Master, don’t be angry. My cousin didn’t do it on purpose. She just did it for my own good,” Lin Chenxi said hurriedly.","Chu Yunfan just smiled and shook his head. He wasn’t stupid, and he could tell the difference between Nie Simin and those people from Great Joy. They were completely different.","Seeing that her master wasn’t angry, Lin Chenxi heaved a sigh of relief. Chu Yunfan’s demonic attitude had really shocked her too deeply.","One by one, people who could shake the world with a stomp of their feet in the Holy Land were killed by their own masters in three to five moves.","Although they had not known each other for a long time, this trust was deeply rooted.","That was why when Chu Yunfan said that he had a way to go against the people at the negotiation, Lin Chenxi followed him without hesitation.","Seeing how nervous her cousin was, Nie Simin was even more displeased. She felt that Chu Yunfan must have lied to her cousin, otherwise she wouldn’t have become like this.","“Forget it. Since you’re here, come with me. It just so happens that we’re about to hold a small Dao discussion,” Nie Simin said, “The disciples of all forces will come to participate, and even the elders of various sects will come. They will pay attention to this small Dao discussion while participating in the negotiation. I can recommend you to the discussion.”","Nie Simin did not give up on the idea of introducing a new master to Lin Chenxi.","Then, she looked at Chu Yunfan vigilantly. She decided that if Chu Yunfan dared to say anything more, she would teach him a lesson, even if she had to risk being blamed by her cousin.","In her heart, Chu Yunfan was a swindler. The key point was that Chu Yunfan was too young. He was about the same age as her, but his cultivation level was lower than hers.","How could such a person be qualified to be her cousin’s master? It was probably because his cousin lived in a remote place like Tianhe and had never seen the world, so she regarded a level seven Innate as a great master.","However, she was different. As a true disciple of Moonfall, the world she could come into contact with was far stronger than that of her cousin.","Lin Chenxi, on the other hand, carefully glanced at Chu Yunfan. Seeing that he was not angry, she nodded. She was also eager to meet the most outstanding geniuses of the Holy Land.","In the past, she might not even have had the chance to see these geniuses.","This might be the first time she had truly come into contact with these peerless geniuses.","Seeing that her cousin had agreed, Nie Simin immediately pulled Lin Chenxi’s hand and walked into the crowd.","“This is a rare scene that has not been seen for many years. After all, these geniuses are usually scattered all over the place. No matter what kind of gathering it is, it is impossible to invite so many people at the same time as this negotiation had.","“This generation of the Holy Land has many experts and countless heavenly talents. You must have heard of our generation’s Senior Sister, Moonfall Protege,” Nie Simin said.","“I have, I have!” Lin Chenxi’s eyes lit up.","“Senior Moonfall Protege is usually in seclusion. This time, she came out of seclusion because of the negotiation. I heard that she has already entered the Divine Abilities Stage!” Nie Simin said.","Lin Chenxi suddenly exclaimed. During this period of time following Chu Yunfan, she didn’t learn much, but she had learned to distinguish these things. For the age of their generation, it was truly amazing to be able to step into the Divine Abilities Stage.","According to her master, as long as she cultivated in peace, she could eventually step into the Divine Abilities Stage. However, that was because she had a good master. Back then, her father had spent a lot of effort but was still stuck at the peak of the Innate Stage. She had seen this with her own eyes.","“Other than Senior Moonfall Protege of Moonfall, the senior brothers of the other five forces will all be here. Divine Hell Protege of Hellfire, Li Jianlian of Green Loti, Zhang Kuang of Infinity Camp, and Wei Wugou, the chief disciple of the Wei clan, and Longevity Protege of Longevity Faith will all be here!”","Nie Simin’s face showed a look of fascination as she called out these names one by one. These people had illustrious reputations throughout the Holy Land. Although they were of the younger generation, their reputation was comparable to the sect leaders of some sects. All of them had entered the Divine Abilities Stage and had the qualifications to establish a sect.","“Amazing!” Lin Chenxi also yearned to see them.","Unlike outsiders like Chu Yunfan, Lin Chenxi had grown up hearing about these famous geniuses. She had already fallen in love with them before even meeting them.","“It’s just stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage. That’s nothing. As long as you cultivate the technique I’m going to pass on to you, stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage will be as easy as flipping your hand. Even surpassing them is only a matter of time,” Chu Yunfan said.","He did not speak without thinking. Although Lin Chenxi was only his in-name disciple, she was still the first disciple he had accepted in his life. Chu Yunfan did not relax in teaching Lin Chenxi.","Based on Lin Chenxi’s physique, he had imparted her with the Ziwei Heaven Seeking Art. This was naturally a cultivation technique recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book.","It was once cultivated by an extremely powerful expert. However, he was defeated by the Alchemy Emperor and his cultivation technique was recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book","Although he lost to the Alchemy Emperor, it didn’t mean that the Ziwei Heaven Seeking Art was weak. In fact, this technique could be considered powerful and it even pointed to the emperor-level great Dao. It was just that people nowadays didn’t know what it was.","If it was in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, once a cultivation technique that pointed to the emperor-level great Dao appeared, it would cause a bloody storm and countless people would fight for it.","Lin Chenxi’s physique was unexpectedly in line with the qualifications to cultivate the Ziwei Heaven Seeking Art. In a short period of time, Lin Chenxi had broken through again and again and now in just a few months, she had stepped into level fur of the Innate Stage.","It was only a matter of time before Lin Chenxi, who had cultivated this technique, stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. In the future, it would be easy for her to surpass these so-called geniuses.","“What big words! The Six Great Geniuses are the peerless figures of the Holy Land. What kind of people are they? Who do you think you are? How dare you talk so shamelessly? Do you have no respect for them?”","Suddenly, an arrogant voice came from not far away, followed by the sound of hurried footsteps. Chu Yunfan turned around and saw a young man in a black robe surrounded by a group of young men and women.","This group of people sneered at Chu Yunfan, and the young man in black leading them was the one who had spoken just now.","“I’d like to see who’s so arrogant to say those words.”"]},{"number":1037,"title":"Chapter 1037 What I Do Is None of Your Business","paragraphs":["1037 What I Do Is None of Your Business","The commotion quickly attracted the attention of many people. When someone saw the young man in black, he immediately exclaimed.","“Isn’t that Yan Lei of Hellfire? Why is he here?”","Many people backed away. Hellfire didn’t have a good reputation in the Holy Land. It was known as the number one sect of the demonic path in the Holy Land. Many demonic path sects and families of the Holy Land were dependent on Hellfire.","On the other hand, the disciples of Hellfire were all arrogant and domineering. They were violent and would kill people at the drop of a hat. This was why many people were not willing to provoke the disciples of Hellfire.","!!","Yan Lei was even more notorious than the chief disciple of the Hellfire, Divine Hell Protege. It was said that he was temperamental and killed people as if he was cutting grass.","“It seems like he’s going to kill again!” someone exclaimed.","More people were looking at Chu Yunfan. Many people had heard what he said just now, so they were all curious. Who exactly was this guy that didn’t respect the Six Great Geniuses?","Te Six AGreat Geniuses were unrivaled existences who had suppressed a whole generation of young geniuses.","Yan Lei strode over and looked at Chu Yunfan with a half-smile. “Boy, who are you? Tell me your name. I want to see who’s so arrogant that he dares to look down on the Six Great Geniuses!”","The others were also curious. After all, there weren’t many who dared to belittle the Six Great Geniuses.","They might have heard of Chu Yunfan’s name before, but it was rare to see him in person.","“What I say is none of your business.”","In the face of Yan Lei, who was a fierce and powerful existence in other people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan didn’t even give a d*mn.","Everyone was shocked. Yan Lei’s ferocity was not only because of his violent nature but also because of his strength. In the Holy Land, he was second only to the Six Great Geniuses.","But Chu Yunfan actually dared to provoke him to his face. He had no respect for Yan Lei.","“You’re seeking death!”","Yan Lei’s face fell. He had never been looked down upon like this before.","Boom!","Yan Lei’s aura exploded. A terrifying aura shot up into the sky, almost freezing the sky. He rushed to the peak of the Innate Stage and then took a step further into the Divine Abilities Stage.","“What? Yan Lei has reached the Divine Abilties Stage too!” many people exclaimed.","In the Holy Land, the Divine Abilities Stage was also a natural chasm that separated immortals and mortals.","Among the younger generation, it was a big deal for anyone to enter the Divine Abilities Stage. The Six Great Geniuses had entered the Divine Abilities Stage long ago and were high above everyone else. Everyone was used to it.","However, other than the Six Great Geniuses, the others seemed to be stuck at the peak of the Innate Stage, unable to cross over. No one had expected Yan Lei to step into the Divine Abilities Stage.","No wonder he dared to act so arrogantly. With this cultivation level, even if he provoked some old monster, they would have to give face to Hellfire and not dare to do anything to him.","“Hmph!” Yan Lei sneered, a playful expression on his face. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was already a dead man, and his eyes shined with a bloodthirsty light.","Yan Lei was about to make a move, and Chu Yunfan’s eyes glinted with a sharp light. He planned to kill Yan Lei.","Yan Lei’s body reeked of blood. It was unknown how many people he had tortured and killed. He even took pleasure in killing. If such a person were to be placed in the Federation, he would be a homicidal maniac.","According to the Federation’s laws, Hellfire’s actions were enough to get them shot ten times over.","In the Federation, even those who cultivated demonic techniques had to pay attention to the basic laws and did not dare to act recklessly.","However, just as Chu Yunfan was about to make a move, Nie Simin, who had been indifferent to him, gritted her teeth and stood in front of Yan Lei. She shouted, “Yan Lei, this man is a guest of Moonfall! What are you trying to do here?!”","Yan Lei looked at Nie Simin unscrupulously and sized her up, which made her feel uncomfortable all over. Yan Lei sneered.","He and Nie Simin were originally on the same level. However, now that he had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, he was forever separated from lowly mortals.","Nie Simin was only a well-known figure among the younger generation, while he was comparable to the sect leaders of medium-level sects. Who would dare to look down on him?","“Nie Simin, I advise you to move aside. You don’t have the right to talk to me.” Yan Lei looked at Nie Simin with a sneer, and then his eyes fell on Lin Chenxi, who was standing behind Chu Yunfan. His eyes rolled and a hint of lust flashed through them.","“Yan Lei, do you want to have Senior Moonfall Protege come and have a little chat with you?!” Nie Simin shouted.","At the mention of Moonfall Protege, Yan Lei’s spirit jolted. He seemed to have thought of something and his expression became more serious. “Nie Simin, I’ll give Moonfall Protege face today, but I’ll remember this person. Let’s see if Moonfall will be able to protect him for the rest of his life.”","Yan Lei’s voice was low and cold, and it made people shiver.","Lin Chenxi, in particular, felt all the hair on her body stand on end. She couldn’t help but hide behind Chu Yunfan to avoid Yan Lei’s gaze.","Yan Lei turned around and left.","Nie Simin let out a sigh of relief. She then turned around and looked at Chu Yunfan in disgust. “I’m warning you. Where do you think you are that you can do as you please? Your self-righteous cultivation is nothing here. If it wasn’t for Xixi, I wouldn’t have cared whether you live or die.”","Nie Simin didn’t have a good impression of Chu Yunfan, who had caused this trouble. Yan Lei wasn’t someone to be trifled with. If she hadn’t brought up Senior Moonfall Protege, how could Yan Lei have been scared away?","The reason why she mentioned Senior Moonfall Protege was that she knew Yan Lei had once tried to hit on Moonfall Protege, but he got beaten up badly by her and only managed to escape after losing an arm.","It seemed like she had guessed it right. Yan Lei was still in shock.","She thought that Chu Yunfan dared to act so unscrupulously because of his seemingly decent cultivation.","“Xixi, you’ll follow me for the time being. That Yan Lei has always been lawless. Although he’s been scared away, he might come back again,” Nie Simin said.","After saying this, Nie Simin didn’t bother to say anything more and walked straight into the depths of the crowd with an icy look on her face.","Lin Chenxi looked at Nie Simin and then at Chu Yunfan, feeling a little troubled.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, just smiled. Nie Simin was cold on the outside but warm on the inside. She wasn’t a bad person.","Then, Chu Yunfan called Lin Chenxi and followed after Nie Simin."]},{"number":1038,"title":"Chapter 1038 Since You Want to Die, I’ll Fulfill Your Wish","paragraphs":["1038 Since You Want to Die, I’ll Fulfill Your Wish","As Chu Yunfan and Lin Chenxi followed Nie Simin deep into the gathering place, they found that the deeper they went, the more masters there were.","At the center, a huge open space had been opened up. And around the space, many people had gathered, waiting for the beginning of this small Dao discussion.","In the arena, there were already some otherworldly or arrogant figures that attracted everyone’s attention.","Chu Yunfan and the other two quickly arrived at the edge of the empty space. By this time, it was already very noisy.","Compared to the negotiation at the peak of the Holy Mountain, most of the people here were not qualified to participate. That was the peak of the power of the entire Holy Land.","And now, this place might represent the Holy Land’s peak of power in the future.","At this moment, the crowd on the sidelines was in a heated discussion.","“That man in green must be Li Jianlian from Green Loti. His sword cultivation is indeed earth-shattering. I can feel the tremendous pressure from far away!”","“There’s also Moonfall Protege from Moonfall. She’s indeed as beautiful as the rumors say. Now that I’ve seen her, I have no regrets in this life.”","“If it wasn’t for this negotiation, I’m afraid these geniuses wouldn’t be here. That’s Zhang Kuang from Infinity Camp, right? I heard that he’s just like his name—wild and unruly!”","“Longevity Protege of Longevity Faith, Divine Hell Protege of the Hellfire, and most importantly, Wei Wugou of the Wei clan, are also in attendance!”","“He actually came? It’s said that after he defeated Longevity Protege five years ago, he went into seclusion. I didn’t expect to see him here.”","“That’s only natural. As the initiator of this discussion, Wei Wugou naturally has to appear.”","The crowd was in a heated discussion, and the Six Great Geniuses were the absolute focus of the discussion.","Chu Yunfan discovered that Wei Wugou seemed to be the core of the Six Great Geniuses. It was difficult to distinguish who was more powerful among them, but Wei Wugou’s cultivation seemed to be above everyone else.","This position had already been confirmed for some time, and the focus of everyone’s discussion was whether or not anyone would challenge his position.","Everyone knew that these Six Great Geniuses were the best of the Holy Land’s next generation, and whoever crowned as the number one would determine the growth and decline of the next generation of the six superpowers.","But soon, Chu Yunfan felt that he and the others were being stared at. He followed the gaze and saw Yan Lei, who was sitting on a chair, staring at him.","“Sister Min, is this small Dao discussion purely about Dao?” Lin Chenxi asked.","“Of course, it isn’t just purely a discussion,” Nie Simin explained, “Those are the best of our Holy Land. If they want to decide who’s the winner, it’s not something that can be decided with words alone. They have to compete.”","Lin Chenxi thought about it and agreed. Every legacy was different. It was impossible to convince the others just by talking.","“These are the true geniuses of the Heavens!” Nie Simin looked at Chu Yunfan as if she wanted him to understand that he was just a frog at the bottom of the well.","Just the aura of these people was enough to make everyone understand that the gap between them and these people was like the difference between Heaven and Earth.","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. He could clearly see what Nie Simin was thinking, but he wasn’t angry.","Nie Simin couldn’t help but grit her teeth in anger when she saw Chu Yunfan’s expression that said, “You can say whatever you want but I won’t admit defeat.”","“Fellow martial artists, it’s rare for us to be gathered here today, which is why we are having this small Dao discussion. I hope to make progress with all of you!”","Wei Wugou was the first to speak. He was the center of attention, and if the Six Great Geniuses were the center of attention, then he was the main focus of that attention.","After Wei Wugou finished speaking, two young experts entered the ring in the middle of the stage. One was an expert from the Wei clan, and the other was a young expert from the Hellfire.","Both their cultivation levels had entered the peak of the Innate Stage. Every move of their hands and feet contained great power, causing the air to collapse on a large area. It was an extremely terrifying scene.","“Amazing!” Lin Chenxi, who was watching from the side, exclaimed in surprise.","Chu Yunfan was also amazed. Although these two people were not worth mentioning in his eyes and were only in their thirties at most, they had already reached the peak of the Innate Stage. If they were placed in the Federation, they would be top geniuses.","Even his instructor had been in his fifties when he had reached the peak of the Innate Stage. From this, it could be seen that although the Federation seemed to have produced many experts, and there were many peak Innate experts, that was because of the entire system.","Almost everyone there cultivated and was like a dragon. In addition, the Federation had tens of billions of people. If one were to only talk about the proportion of experts, the Federation was much lower.","“You’ll surpass them sooner or later. This is nothing,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Nie Simin was even more speechless. Even at this time, Chu Yunfan still didn’t forget to brag. In her eyes, he was only at the seventh Innate Stage, but he still had the galls to look down on the experts in the ring.","After the battle between the two masters ended, Yan Lei, who was sitting by the side of the ring, could no longer sit still.","He leaped down from the stage, pointed at Chu Yunfan, and said, “Hey, do you dare to step in and fight me? Or are you going to hide behind a woman?”","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with some curiosity. Who was this person? Though some of the people present had not witnessed Yan Lei’s reputation with their own eyes, they had heard of it.","His cultivation was just below the Six Great Geniuses. And for some reason, he was challenging someone they didn’t recognize.","Even the Six Great Geniuses looked at Chu Yunfan with curiosity. They didn’t recognize him either.","Among them, Wei Wugou’s brows were tightly furrowed. He discovered that he couldn’t completely see through Chu Yunfan. He felt that Chu Yunfan looked a little familiar.","“Yan Lei, what are you doing?! Don’t tell me you still want to pursue this matter?!” Nie Simin suddenly shouted.","“Nie Simin, can you really protect this guy forever? When I catch him, I’ll make him beg for death!” Yan Lei grinned, his eyes filled with killing intent.","“Since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish,” Chu Yunfan said as he strode out of the crowd."]},{"number":1039,"title":"Chapter 1039 Killing Yan Lei in Seconds","paragraphs":["1039 Killing Yan Lei in Seconds","Chu Yunfan strode out and entered the ring.","“Hahaha, good! This feels good! I’d like to see how long you can hold out. When all the bones in your body are broken, I’d like to see if you can remain so unyielding.”","Yan Lei’s eyes flashed with cold killing intent.","“Hey, what are you doing?! Are you trying to get yourself killed?!” Nie Simin quickly shouted.","Seeing Chu Yunfan rush forward so rashly, she suddenly became very anxious.","But Chu Yunfan was not moved. Nie Simin quickly looked at Lin Chenxi and said, “Xixi, quickly persuade him. He’s walking toward his death!”","“Don’t worry, Sister Min. My master is very strong.” Lin Chenxi grabbed Nie Simin’s small hand and comforted her.","“What do you mean he’s very strong? Xixi, Yan Lei aren’t like any of the geniuses in Tianhe. He’s even stronger than that. Not even your father can’t last one move against him,” Nie Simin said hurriedly.","She had thought that Lin Chenxi had never seen any real experts.","She was comparing Yan Lei to a genius from a remote and backward place like Tianhe.","Yan Lei wasn’t someone that could be compared to. Divine existences were the most powerful existences across the entire Holy Land.","“Don’t worry, Sister Min. I know that Master is very strong. That guy is no match for him,” Lin Chenxi said.","“Divine Hell Protege, Hellfire is really interesting. Yan Lei has already entered the Divine Abilities Stage, but he’s challenging a nobody?” Li Jianlian said to Divine Hell Protege who was sitting beside him.","“Hmph. What do his actions have to do with me?” Divine Hell Protege said coldly. He didn’t have a good relationship with Yan Lei. They were rivals and had fought many times in the past.","Later on, Divine Hell Protege proved to be more outstanding and he slowly stood out, leaving Yan Lei behind.","However, now that Yan Lei had entered the Divine Abilities Stage and was on the same level as him again, he naturally wasn’t happy.","Seeing that the others didn’t quite understand, Yan Lei said, “You guys probably don’t know, but this guy claimed that the Six Great Geniuses are nothing.”","Hearing this, everyone was in an uproar. Before this, they were all wondering why Yan Lei was acting this way. But now, they were looking at Chu Yunfan with hostility.","Especially the Six Great Geniuses who were originally high and mighty and didn’t have anything to do with this matter. At this time, they too were frowning and glaring at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan dared to look down on them, which made them very angry. Since they started cultivating, no one had ever dared to look down on them like this.","“That’s right, I said that,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. Since he had said it, there was no point in hiding it.","Everyone was in an uproar. How dare he look down on the Six Great Geniuses? Which mountain did he come from? He didn’t understand the immensity of Heaven and Earth.","“He’s finished. He’s dead.” Nie Simin said. In her eyes, Chu Yunfan was a dead man walking.","“That’s my business and not yours. You keep saying you want to kill me. If it wasn’t for my disciple and her cousin, do you think you’d still be able to stand there and talk?” Chu Yunfan looked at Yan Lei coldly.","As for the gazes of the others, he didn’t care at all.","“He’s mad!” Moonfall Protege said as she looked at Chu Yunfan.","“This is really interesting. Everyone says I’m arrogant, but it seems like this guy is even more arrogant than me,” Zhang Kuang said slowly.","“Great. Let’s see how you die!” Yan Lei looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","As soon as he finished speaking, Yan Lei made his move. He flew up into the sky, and a terrifying Qi burst out from his body. Balls of hellfire burst out from his body.","It was the flames of hell. A flame that could only be learned by learning the hellfire cultivation method.","Boom!","In the blink of an eye, the flames were like a monstrous tide, blasting toward Chu Yunfan.","He intended to kill Chu Yunfan as soon as he made his move. His eyes flickered with a hint of madness, and his brutal character burst out.","“Oh no!”","Nie Simin, who was watching from the side, was extremely anxious, but she didn’t dare to step forward. The gap between Divine Abilities Stage and peak Innate Stage was too big.","It was so big that if she dared to step forward, death would be the only thing that awaited her.","Everyone was shocked by Yan Lei’s attack, especially when many of them thought that he was only at the peak of the Innate Stage. This attack was already at the Divine Abilities Stage and was far beyond ordinary.","Only Lin Chenxi was very calm. During the time she had been with Chu Yunfan, she had seen many things.","She had seen things that were far bigger than this, so naturally, this was nothing.","As for Chu Yunfan, he smiled faintly and formed a claw with his fingers. Then, he swiped at the air, and the flames that were falling from the sky were turned into nothingness.","Chu Yunfan’s move stunned everyone. The eyes of the Six Great Geniuses who had originally thought nothing of it suddenly lit up. Chu Yunfan’s move was extraordinary.","“Yan Lei, you’re famous for your ferocity. Many people have said that you’re amazing, but in the end, you’re weak. It’s so disappointing,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","At this time, Yan Lei’s expression changed. Although he was arrogant and despotic, he was not stupid. He could naturally see that Chu Yunfan was not a simple person.","However, he had no other choice now that things had come to this. He condensed all the divine power in his body into a point which suddenly turned into a long flaming saber.","This flaming saber immediately slashed down. The entire world seemed to be cut in half and the air was torn apart.","As for Chu Yunfan, he simply grabbed the flaming saber and gently squeezed it.","Boom!","The flaming saber shattered in mid-air.","“You’re only so-so. Now, it’s my turn,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","He clenched his five fingers into a fist and threw out a punch. A terrifying fist force swept through the air and instantly hit Yan Lei.","The speed of this fist force was fast and fierce. So fast that it was beyond the imagination of ordinary people. In the blink of an eye, Yan Lei was hit. With a miserable scream, his body exploded and he died a tragic death.","All of this happened too quickly. In just a moment, Yan Lei, who had been acting like he was the king of the world, died a tragic death at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","A deathly silence fell over the entire place. Everyone was completely dumbfounded. A Divine expert had been instantly killed.","How strong was Chu Yunfan?","..."]},{"number":1040,"title":"Chapter 1040 Too Arrogant? He Actually Has Strength!","paragraphs":["1040 Too Arrogant? He Actually Has Strength!","Killing Yan Lei with a single punch instantly caused an uproar.","After a deathly silence, everyone was in an uproar.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan in shock.","Although Yan Lei was strong and he had entered the Divine Abilities Stage, there were many people in the Holy Land who could kill him. However, he had been safe until now.","!!","He had once tried to attack Moonfall Protege, but she had only cut off one of his arms and let him escape.","It was because Yan Lei had Hellfire behind him. They were a famous demonic sect throughout the entire Holy Land, so no one dared to injure him seriously.","However, this Chu Yunfan was different. He had no respect for Hellfire. The so-called Hellfire was probably nothing in his eyes.","“He killed Yan Lei?!” Nie Simin was a little dumbfounded, still in complete disbelief.","She thought that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was at most at the seventh Innate Stage, but now that Chu Yunfan had made a move, she realized that his cultivation was so amazing that even a Divine couldn’t withstand a single blow from him.","It was only at this moment that she realized what her cousin meant by her master being very powerful. And from the looks of it, it was not just an ordinary kind of power.","It was simply terrifying.","Even the Six Great Geniuses of her heart couldn’t instantly defeat Yan Lei.","She then looked at Lin Chenxi. As expected, Lin Chenxi acted as if this was a matter of course. It was obvious that she was used to it.","Nie Simin’s pretty face suddenly turned slightly red, and she suddenly felt that she had acted like a clown. She wanted to find a better master for her cousin, but she didn’t know that Chu Yunfan was so amazing.","At the same time, she was also shocked. Chu Yunfan clearly looked about the same age as her, so how could he be so terrifying?","However, she quickly became anxious again. If it was during normal times, it would be fine, but now, many experts of the six superpowers were gathered here.","All the top experts were all here.","Even if Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was extremely high—even comparable to the Six Great Geniuses—it was still nothing in the eyes of the experts of the six superpowers. This was because the Six Great Geniuses were still young and had not fully matured.","However, when she looked at Chu Yunfan, who had no intention of backing down, she felt powerless. This matter was not something she could interfere with.","Clatter!","Divine Hell Protege shot up from his seat. Although he didn’t have a good relationship with Yan Lei, Chu Yunfan’s actions were like a slap to his face.","“How dare you kill a disciple of Hellfire!”","Divine Hell Protege’s roar shook the mountains.","Everyone’s eyes turned to Chu Yunfan. At this time, no one would think that he was overestimating himself, and no one would think that he was not qualified.","“What can you do about it?” Chu Yunfan looked at Divine Hell Protege with a sneer.","He had come here today prepared for a massacre. It was killing a disciple of Hellfire. What was the big deal?","Moreover, although he was late, he was not completely clueless about the past few months. Through his connections in Tianhe, although he could not find out the details of the situation, he still knew the general situation.","Among the six superpowers, three of them were the vanguards who advocated entering the Federation. They were the Wei family, Hellfire, and the Green Loti.","The other three powers wanted to wait and see what happened. Although they might not have no intention of entering the Federation, they were just not so unyielding.","But for Chu Yunfan, this was enough. The most important question was who were his enemies and who were his friends.","It was precisely because he knew about Hellfire’s attitude that he attacked without any scruples.","“Such great courage. Do you think you can do whatever you want just because you killed Yan Lei?” Divine Hell Protege said coldly.","“Who is Yan Lei? In my eyes, he’s just a dog.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Divine Hell Protege, I think you’ve been in the Holy Land for too long. You’re like a frog at the bottom of a well. I’m not even afraid of your master, Hellfire King, let alone you.”","Chu Yunfan spoke, but he did not move. He was still using his Emperor Method to reach the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","“What?”","Divine Hell Protege seemed to have noticed something. He found that Chu Yunfan was cultivating in the ring.","“How bold. Even at this time, you dare to cultivate here. Are you trying to make a breakthrough?!” Divine Hell Protege’s loud shout made everyone’s eyes focus on Chu Yunfan again.","They finally realized this as well. As Chu Yunfan got closer to the final success, the aura on his body gradually became stronger.","Everyone understood that Chu Yunfan was in the middle of a breakthrough.","Nie Simin, in particular, finally understood why Chu Yunfan had looked so strange before. It turned out that he was breaking through. No wonder his aura was so unstable.","“What a powerful fellow!”","Longevity Protege of Longevity Faith felt a chill down his back.","“He does have some ability, but he’s too arrogant to break through in the ring. Even I wouldn’t dare do that.”","Zhang Kuang of Infinity Camp was also amazed.","Divine Hell Protege didn’t know what level Chu Yunfan was breaking through to, but he knew that this was the best chance to launch a surprise attack. As a demonic cultivator, he attacked without any hesitation.","Countless hellfires burned around his body, instantly burning the sky and forming a cloud of fire.","The cloud of fire rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","“No wonder Divine Hell Protege is one of the Six Great Geniuses. His divine ability over hellfire is on par with the elders of Hellfire,” Wei Wugou commented on Divine Hell Protege’s strength.","Among all the people present, even the experts of the other Six Great Geniuses were only at a similar cultivation level to Divine Hell Protege and were not qualified to evaluate him. Only Wei Wugou was different and was faintly above everyone else.","“No matter how strong this person is, the only outcome for him will be death.” Wei Wugou cast a cold glance at Chu Yunfan.","Everyone trembled. It seemed that Chu Yunfan couldn’t escape death. But thinking about it, it made sense. If he dared to try to break through at this time, wasn’t he just seeking death?","“Petty tricks.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t move. He formed a claw with his fingers and grabbed at the air, instantly tearing the fire cloud apart.","“Don’t say I didn’t give you a chance. Wei Wugou, Li Jianlian, you can come at me together with him. Don’t waste my time!” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","...","At this moment, Wei Wugou’s expression changed. It was completely different from what they had agreed on before. Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond ordinary.","“Just who do you think you are?!”"]},{"number":1041,"title":"Chapter 1041 Killing Two People in a Row Was Just an Appetizer!","paragraphs":["1041 Killing Two People in a Row Was Just an Appetizer!","Following Wei Wugou’s loud shout, everyone’s attention focused on this issue.","Chu Yunfan had named Wei Wugou, Divine Hell Protege, and Li Jianlian as his opponents and didn’t do it on the spur of the moment. It must have been premeditated.","This person couldn’t be a nobody.","In fact, Wei Wugou had only just realized that Chu Yunfan’s face was blurry. He had not noticed it before.","!!","He understood that there was only one possibility, and that was that Chu Yunfan didn’t want him to see it. He used his own power to distort the image of his face so that Wei Wuguo wouldn’t recognize him.","This also meant that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was very likely above his, which was how it was able for him to do this.","Wei Wuguo’s expression immediately turned serious.","Not far from him, Li Jianlian’s expression also became serious, because Chu Yunfan had asked to fight him.","“You’ve been surrounding me and trying to capture me. Don’t tell me that you don’t recognize me now that you’ve seen me?” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud, not caring about the image of his face being distorted by divine power.","Only now did everyone see his appearance.","Although not everyone knew what he looked like, many of the people present were the higher-ups of various forces, so many of them immediately recognized him.","“Chu Yunfan! It’s Chu Yunfan!” someone exclaimed.","At this moment, everyone was in an uproar.","During this period of time, apart from this negotiation being the focus of everyone’s attention, the other person was Chu Yunfan.","It was just that Chu Yunfan hadn’t appeared in the past few days, so everyone slowly forgot about him. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan probably wouldn’t dare to appear.","Who would have thought that just when everyone thought that he definitely would not appear, he would?","Therefore, everyone was in an uproar.","At this time, whether it was Divine Hell Protege, Li Jianlian, or Wei Wugou, all three of them felt their hair stand on end when Chu Yunfan directly called them out. It was because they were the higher-ups of the six superpowers that they knew far more than ordinary people.","They all knew that Chu Yunfan had once killed the first elder of the Wei clan.","They were well aware of the First Wei Elder’s strength. He was far stronger than them.","However, such a powerful elder had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands just like that. This made things even more clear.","Even the powerful Wei clan didn’t dare to rashly look for trouble with Chu Yunfan after knowing his strength.","Thinking of this, the three of them felt their hair stand on end as if they were being stared at by a peerless beast.","Even Zhang Kuang, Moonfall Protege, and Longevity Protege, whose names were not called by Chu Yunfan, felt their hair stand on end, let alone the three of them.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t name them, they were also standing on the opposite side of Chu Yunfan.","“Didn’t you guys always want me to come? Well, here I am!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Meanwhile, Wei Wugou and the other two suddenly came back to their senses. Why did Chu Yunfan pick the three of them? iI was obvious that he had heard that their three sects were making preparations to deal with him.","Now that he had appeared, he was definitely going to find trouble with them.","“Sh*t, let’s get out of here!”","Divine Hell Protege immediately realized that something was wrong, and his first reaction was to flee.","The direction in which he had fled was the peak of the mountain where the leaders of the major forces were.","He only needed a short time to get to the peak.","Boom!","Powerful flames burst out of Divine Hell Protege’s body. He stepped on a ray of light and tried to escape.","“You’re only thinking of escaping now?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He grabbed at the air and pulled out a ball of thunder energy. The energy turned into a thunder spear.","Whoosh!","The thunder spear tore through the sky and flew toward Divine Hell Protege.","Divine Hell Protege immediately sensed that the thunder spear was coming at him at lightning speed, and he was shocked.","Chu Yunfan didn’t give him any chance to escape. He could only turn around and suddenly, all the divine power in his body boiled. The flames around him swept out toward the thunder spear.","Boom!","The thunder spear instantly pierced through the flames. Divine Hell Protege screamed in pain as he was pierced through and nailed to the mountain. He wailing continuously.","After a while, Divine Hell Protege was dead.","The power of Chu Yunfan’s thunder spear could be imagined.","Divine Hell Protege had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage and was at tier four. Such a cultivation base was not considered weak among Divines, and his vitality was extremely strong.","Yet he was killed by a single strike. How shocking was this!","Li Jianlian and Wei Wugou’s faces turned pale. With the lesson learned from Divine Hell Protege, they would not dare to run away. Once they did, they would leave their backs open to Chu Yunfan.","The two of them silently exchanged a glance and immediately made a decision to stall for time. Now that the elders of their respective sects were attending the negotiation on the peak of Holy Mountain, such a big movement here would soon alert them.","To be more precise, they would be alerted immediately. They only needed to hold out for a short while.","The divine power in their bodies began to burn. In front of Chu Yunfan, who was able to kill the First Wei Elder, it was very difficult for them to even stall for time.","The two of them planned to go all out and replace defense with offense. In an instant, the long sword on Li Jianlian’s back was unsheathed.","The sword instantly tore open a shocking sword light. The sword light swept out hundreds of feet of light, tearing through the sky and blasting toward Chu Yunfan.","While he was fighting for time, Wei Wugou planned to make a move from the side.","Li Jianlian’s cultivation was no less than Divine Hell Protege’s, but it was of no use against Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan casually pointed his finger, and a sword light even more shocking than Li Jianlian’s spurted out, forming a sword light hundreds of feet long. It shattered Li Jianlian’s sword light with one strike.","...","“How is this possible?!”","Li Jianlian couldn’t believe that his full-strength sword attack couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t give him any time to react. The sword light came down on his head.","Slice!","Li Jianlian didn’t even have time to react before he exploded into a bloody mist.","From Li Jianlian’s attack to his death, only moments had passed.","Everything was already over.","The entire place was dead silent."]},{"number":1042,"title":"Chapter 1042 Killing Right Before Your Eyes","paragraphs":["1042 Killing Right Before Your Eyes","Chu Yunfan was fast.","So fast that no one had time to react.","When Chu Yunfan killed Divine Hell Protege, it could be said that Divine Hell Protege exposed his back to Chu Yunfan, was caught off guard, and nailed to the mountain by Chu Yunfan’s lightning spear.","However, Li Jianlian had been killed by Chu Yunfan in a single strike. The gap between the two was clear.","“How is he so strong?!”","Nie Simin was a little dumbfounded when she saw this scene. It could be said that her mind was a mess. She never thought that Chu Yunfan would be so powerful. Even though she had seen it with her own eyes, she still felt like she was dreaming.","It wasn’t just Nie Simin, even Wei Wugou was scared to death. He knew that they weren’t invincible, but he was confident in his strength. Even if he encountered his own clan leader, who was a top expert throughout the Holy Land, it was impossible for his clan leader to kill him with just a simple sword strike.","This proved that Chu Yunfan’s strength had reached a peak. Previously, the clan leader didn’t rashly look for trouble with Chu Yunfan, and many people in the family doubted his decision. But now, it seemed that he was right.","Moonfall Protege, Longevity Protege, and Zhang Kuang, who had been watching the show, immediately retreated more than a thousand meters away. They did not dare to continue watching and could only hide far away.","Who knew how many people Chu Yunfan planned to kill today? If he got too worked up and killed them all, who would they cry to then?","Wei Wuguo felt that Chu Yunfan wasn’t human, but a monster in human skin. The divine power in his body was endless like the vast ocean, and it was impossible to guess its depths.","Previously, they thought Chu Yunfan was in the midst of a breakthrough and that this was a great opportunity. But now, they realized how wrong they were.","An expert at Chu Yunfan’s level was not someone they could fathom.","Chu Yunfan, who had caused such a great shock, didn’t feel much about it. Killing Divine Hell Protege and Li Jianlian was a piece of cake for him. Not only was their combat strength inferior to his but there was also a gap in their cultivation levels. They were not on the same level.","And when Chu Yunfan’s gaze fell on Wei Wugou, Wei Wugou instantly felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave. As if he had fallen into a land of death.","“Chu Yunfan, do you really want to make an enemy out of the entire Holy Land?!” Wei Wugou shouted in an attempt to stop Chu Yunfan. At the very least, he had to buy some time.","“The Holy Land’s enemy? Do you think you can represent the Holy Land? But so what if you do?” Chu Yunfan sneered. ” I won’t allow anyone to make trouble for what I want to do. Those who follow me will prosper, and those who resist me will die!”","When Chu Yunfan shouted this sentence, he immediately seized everyone’s hearts. Those who submit to him will prosper and those who resisted will die. How domineering were these words?","However, the strange thing was that if it was an ordinary person, others would only think that they were being arrogant. But when Chu Yunfan said this, everyone felt that it was the correct thing to say. No one felt that there was anything to be curious about.","“You won’t have a good end if you go against the entire Holy Land!” Wei Wugou shouted.","His voice was so loud that the entire Holy Mountain could hear it. He was fighting for time and also alerting the experts of his clan on the mountain peak.","He thought that today would be his chance to make a name for himself. He did not want to lose his life.","Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a smile because he had already seen through Wei Wugou’s plan. It was very obvious that Wei Wugou was trying to stall for time.","“Who dares to be so impudent!”","At that moment, many powerful Divines flew down from the peak.","Wei Wugou heaved a sigh of relief. His purpose of stalling had been achieved. The leaders of the major forces on the peak had noticed the situation at the foot of the mountain.","All of this seemed to have happened over a long period of time, but it felt like a century to him.","However, before he could stop smiling, he discovered that Chu Yunfan had already appeared in front of him. Chu Yunfan spread out his large hand and then suddenly slapped it toward Wei Wugou.","Wei Wugou immediately turned pale with fright. He didn’t even know when Chu Yunfan had appeared. At this time, he could only go all out. Since things had already come to this, he could only fight to the death.","Once Wei Wugou’s full strength was revealed, he was clearly stronger than Divine Hell Protege and Li Jianlian. He had stepped into tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage.","At his age, he was considered a peerless talent, and it was expected that he would step into the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage in the future.","But now, he had met his nemesis. Chu Yunfan was much younger than him, but Chu Yunfan’s strength was above his.","Wei Wugou brandished a long saber in his hand and his entire body emitted a faint golden light. Countless divine power condensed and then turned into an astonishing saber light. The saber light swept out and instantly blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","But Chu Yunfan barely glanced at it. His face was expressionless as he slapped his hand down.","Boom!","The saber light was shattered on the spot as if it had touched the toughest existence in the world. It cracked inch by inch and turned into a light that scattered in all directions with a deafening bang.","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly and said, “My turn next!”","He clenched his five fingers into a fist and his fist force condensed. He then threw it out at lightning speed and a huge golden asura appeared behind him.","Boom!","As soon as this punch was thrown, the color of nature changed as if all the colors in the world had been sucked into this punch.","Everyone felt as if their horizons had been broadened. It was as if their breathing had stopped. This was the first time they were discovering that when the power of a punch technique was raised to the extreme, it could hold such terrifying power.","With this punch, the entire Holy Mountain could see the sky and earth change color. Everyone could feel the stagnation of spirit energy and the shattering of the air.","This punch seemed slow, but it was actually fast. In the blink of an eye, it had already hit Wei Wugou. Although he had entered the fifth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, compared to Chu Yunfan, he was still too far away and had no ability to block it.","With a scream, he was hit.","Boom!","Wei Wugou exploded in mid-air, turning into a cloud of blood mist.","All of this happened in an instant. At the same time, the figures who had just spoken rushed down from the top of the mountain with angry faces and surrounded Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1043,"title":"Chapter 1043 Distinguishing Friend and Foe, and a Great War Breaks Out","paragraphs":["1043 Distinguishing Friend and Foe, and a Great War Breaks Out","The figures surrounded Chu Yunfan, each with a powerful aura.","He looked over and saw hundreds of Divines in the sky, their auras merging and covering it. The six leaders were superior to the rest.","Their auras even caused the world to change color. They were like dominators surrounding Chu Yunfan.","He did not need to ask to know which of these people were the masters of the Holy Land, the leader of the six superpowers. Still, his expression remained unchanged as hundreds of Divines surrounded him.","At this moment, he no longer hid anything, and the leaders of the significant forces recognized him immediately. It was Chu Yunfan, who they had previously said would not appear.","Not only did Chu Yunfan appear, but he had started a massacre. Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, and Green Loti’s sect leader’s expressions were incredibly unsightly and ashen.","The most promising junior of their sect or family, considered their successor, had died. Chu Yunfan had destroyed decades of hard work in one day. It was challenging to find a genius with such aptitude.","The six superpowers dominated the Holy Land, so they did not lack resources. However, geniuses with that kind of aptitude were extremely rare.","Especially when the three clan leaders had previously vowed that Chu Yunfan would not dare to return and even declared they would organize an army to attack. No one expected him to appear without warning.","“Chu Yunfan, you dare show your face?!” Clan Leader Wei was so angry that he felt his whole being ache. The Wei clan suffered tremendous losses when Chu Yunfan appeared.","However, all his previous losses added up were not as great as these two times. One was the current top combat power, and the other was the Wei clan’s future. These two losses were enough to make him feel heartbroken.","“Why wouldn’t I dare to?” Chu Yunfan said, “Didn’t you want to organize an army to attack me? Now that I’m here, I’ll save you all the trouble, won’t I?”","“It’s good that you’re courageous. I shall fulfill your wish!” the Green Loti sect leader jeered as his expression remained grim.","Everyone surrounded Chu Yunfan while he looked at the remaining people from the six superpowers and said, “Other than the three of them, are you planning to make a move as well?”","His expression remained unchanged, but his heart was full of killing intent. He saw ninety percent of the Holy Land experts had gathered on the Holy Mountain. Hundreds of Divines were simply a crushing force to the current Federation.","The Federation could not compare to the Holy Land regarding martial arts experts. If the Federation could not use such a vast force, Chu Yunfan would not allow them to stand against the Federation.","They would not hesitate, even if they had to go on a killing spree. At this time, Chu Yunfan was extremely cold. Even if he captured all the Holy Land’s higher-ups, he would not allow this force to stand against the Federation.","“We are not of the same opinion as them!” the sect leaders of Infinity Camp, Longevity Faith, and Moonfall sputtered as they stepped back.","They had considered invading the Federation but were not in a hurry. At the very least, they were terrified of Chu Yunfan and were unwilling to oppose him, not to mention the Federation behind Chu Yunfan was a behemoth.","If it were so easy to deal with, the Federation would have been destroyed long ago.","The three leaders had stated they would not participate in the battle against Chu Yunfan, so they immediately split into different camps. The three superpowers and the experts under them retreated to the side, unwilling to participate.","Meanwhile, Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei, and Green Loti’s sect leader showed dissatisfaction on their faces. However, they could do nothing to these three superpowers and could only give up.","It would be more difficult than expected without the participation of the other three. However, it was only a little more complicated. After the other three superpowers withdrew, Hellfire, the Wei clan, Green Loti, and their affiliated forces surrounded Chu Yunfan.","More than two hundred Divines formed a line, and the divine power on their bodies instantly connected into a line. There were talismans behind them, linking their powers together.","The earth-shattering power multiplied several times.","Clan Leader Wei looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. This was the method they had prepared to deal with Chu Yunfan.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had easily killed the Wei clan’s first elder, which terrified him, so he had prepared this formation.","Everyone’s mana connected into a line and transformed into strength, flowing toward Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, and Green Loti leader. The trio’s strength exploded to a terrifying extent.","The trio completely unleashed their powers. Any one of them had already entered the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, but now, their powers rose continuously, making them highly terrifying.","They connected every one of their actions to the strength of many experts. To use them to surround Chu Yunfan was a terrifying method.","“Chu Yunfan, you will die today!” Clan Leader Wei shouted.","Suddenly, a colossal Qi-condensed hand appeared in the sky. This hand appeared out of thin air and suddenly slammed toward Chu Yunfan.","The entire sky collapsed when the colossal hand made of Qi slammed down. It was a horrifying scene.","At this moment, everyone’s expression changed, even the three sect leaders of Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp. Clan Leader Wei’s and the other two’s auras were genuinely astonishing.","It was far more potent than they had imagined. Although it combined everyone’s strengths, this method was amazing.","Below them, Nie Simin, Lin Chenxi, and everyone else were running as far away as they could in a frenzy. The shockwaves from a battle between normal Divines could kill them, let alone a battle between peak Divines.","If they got hit by even one of the shockwaves, they would not escape death.","“Master!”","At that moment, even Lin Chenxi felt a sense of despair. She could not hope to catch up to any experts flying in the sky.","Chu Yunfan roared, clenched his fist, and threw out an asura fist.","Boom!","The Qi-condensed hand shattered in mid-air, but more hands came at Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1044,"title":"Chapter 1044 Peak of Tier Six of the Divine Abilities Stage, Peak Combat Power","paragraphs":["1044 Peak of Tier Six of the Divine Abilities Stage, Peak Combat Power","Increasing numbers of huge hands came crashing down, not even giving Chu Yunfan a chance to breathe. However, it was evident that he was extraordinary, so he naturally would not die so quickly.","Chu Yunfan had already entered the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage regarding strength. Otherwise, he could not have easily killed the Wei clan’s first elder, who had already entered tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Still, Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, and Green Loti’s sect leader had reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. With the addition of this formation, they could obtain the power of more than two hundred Divines for their use to a certain extent.","They had improved based on their original strength. Even Chu Yunfan began to struggle when facing such an attack. Various attacks completely enveloped him, almost drowning him.","!!","However, Chu Yunfan did not move an inch under such circumstances and simply bombarded many more attacks back at the three leaders.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Many explosions echoed through the air, and the aftershocks engulfed Chu Yunfan. The crowd could not even see him, only the occasional golden figure and the scene of Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, and Green Loti’s sect leader attacking violently.","The entire Holy Mountain shook violently. Sand and stones flew around, looking like the end of the world. Such an attack was even more powerful than the explosion of various large intercontinental missiles.","Even though they were far away, the terrifying shockwaves made everyone feel highly uneasy, almost unable to breathe.","“Chu Yunfan is dead for sure!”","At this time, the only people who still had the strength to speak were the sect leaders of Moonfall, Infinity Camp, and Longevity Faith. It was also their first time seeing the formation go all out.","The fact that Chu Yunfan could persist until now was already beyond their expectations. If it were them, it would be impossible for them to persist to this extent.","Infinity Camp’s sect leader said, “That’s right. It’s already impressive that Chu Yunfan can hold out until now. Still, the problem is that he can’t compete with more than two hundred Divines regarding mana. They’ll defeat him sooner or later.”","Longevity Faith’s sect leader echoed with emotion, “We thought too highly of him before. Although he’s powerful and can be called an unprecedented genius, he’s still too young. Being young is his weakness.”","The three masters did not think highly of Chu Yunfan, thinking his defeat was only a matter of time. Soon, the news spread to many the many masters on the Holy Mountain. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan could only hold out for a little while.","However, as time passed, they gradually discovered that something was amiss. They thought Chu Yunfan should not have been able to hold on for much longer, but he somehow managed.","Although he did not stop for a moment amid various terrifying explosions and attacks, he did not show any signs of defeat.","Even Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei, and the sect leader of Green Loti’s attacks could not compete with him. Although he was at a disadvantage, the attacks of the three experts could not hurt him.","“What an insane physique technique!” Longevity Faith’s sect leader suddenly said. His eyes glowed faintly as he watched how many attacks Chu Yunfan had suffered in the explosion.","It was not just the three great experts attacking, but the two hundred other Divines were actively participating. But no matter what attacks there were, they hurt Chu Yunfan even though the attacks landed directly on his body.","It felt like Chu Yunfan was like a massive vortex, absorbing these attacks.","“How can that be?! How could his body be so strong?!” Moonfall’s sect leader could not hide the shock on her exquisite face.","If they were to take Chu Yunfan’s place, they would have died long ago under such intense attacks. That was also why they were so afraid of Chu Yunfan.","Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei, and Green Loti’s sect leader could use such a method to deal with Chu Yunfan, which meant they could also use the same method to deal with the other leaders.","If that happened, they wouldn’t have the power to fight back.","Chu Yunfan was far stronger than they had expected.","Infinity Camp’s sect leader said, “No, he’s not just blocking the attacks. He’s also becoming increasingly stronger!”","Everyone then discovered that Chu Yunfan’s aura did not weaken amid the bombardment. On the contrary, it gradually became stronger, like a Phoenix rising from the ashes or a butterfly emerging from a cocoon.","Even Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei, and Green Loti’s sect leader realized something was amiss.","“H-How is this possible?! He’s using our attacks to strengthen and polish himself!” Green Loti’s sect leader said in surprise. He had already figured out that Chu Yunfan was not getting beaten to the point of no return. Instead, he used the opportunity to strengthen himself.","Clan Leader Wei took a closer look. Indeed, Chu Yunfan was getting stronger every second. His body seemed to have formed a vast black hole, constantly devouring their attacks.","One should know that although their attacks were energy, they were no spirit energy in them. They wondered if Chu Yunfan was courting death if he absorbed it. Still, he did it.","“No matter what he’s doing, we can’t wait any longer. Go all out and kill him!” Hellfire King shouted, and the divine power in his entire body began to boil. Then countless hellfires spurted from his body, turning into a long Hell Fire Dragon, pouncing toward Chu Yunfan.","Clan Leader Wei grabbed his saber and raised his strength to the extreme. He slashed down. The sky collapsed, and the earth cracked.","A ray of sword light shot out from behind Green Loti’s sect leader. It expanded and headed straight for Chu Yunfan. At this point, the leaders of the three superpowers had already decided to kill Chu Yunfan, no longer holding back.","The trio’s strength had already reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. With the support of the formation, they had surpassed the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, reaching an incredible level. They were just one step away from advancing.","Lin Chenxi could not help exclaiming, “Master, be careful!”","At this critical moment, Chu Yunfan’s aura finally reached its peak and broke through the restraints. Like a sharp sword, it broke through the aftermath of the explosions.","He finally broke the limit and entered the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage. His combat strength had surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage’s ordinary peak."]},{"number":1045,"title":"Chapter 1045 Nuclear Bomb Leveling the Ground","paragraphs":["1045 Nuclear Bomb Leveling the Ground","Chu Yunfan used the three masters’ powers and the entire formation to refine his power. Simultaneously, he used the Celestial Devouring Art to absorb the violent energy, constantly trying to break through to the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Everyone thought the trio would force him to face them head-on. No one expected him to absorb their power and turn it into his own.","He had even reached the peak of tier six. His combat power was already comparable to an ordinary peak Divine when he was in tier six. Now. he was even more invincible.","Chu Yunfan could feel that the divine power in his body had at least doubled just by taking this step. His strength had increased astonishingly and it was terrifying. The trio could have easily defeated him if he had not achieved a breakthrough. They were on entirely different levels.","!!","At this moment, the trio’s attacks landed simultaneously. The terrifying attacks were even more potent than before.","Boom, boom, boom!","Various terrifying attacks landed on Chu Yunfan, but he did not move an inch as he took all the damage.","“He’s finally going to die!” A hint of joy appeared on Clan Leader Wei’s face. In his heart, Chu Yunfan was terrifying. After all, he constantly erupted with terrifying combat strength and exceeded Clan Leader Wei’s expectations.","However, his smile froze because he found that Chu Yunfan was unscathed after tanking all the attacks.","After breaking through to the peak tier six, Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique had improved even further. A battle armor formed by thunder energy appeared around his body, and these attacks could not break through it.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan’s aura was still rising, reaching a shocking level.","“How is this possible?! How can his aura be so powerful?!” At this moment, even the sect leaders of Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp had drastic expression changes.","If Chu Yunfan’s previous strength was still within their understanding, then this sudden surge was now entirely above ordinary peak Divines like themselves. Chu Yunfan was not inferior, even when facing Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, and Green Loti’s sect leader that had the formation’s support.","Chu Yunfan had achieved this feat on his own, while the trio had relied on the formation and the support of hundreds of Divines. The two sides were not on the same level.","Longevity Faith’s sect leader was shocked and said in disbelief, “Could he have a way to turn the tables?”","“That’s impossible!” Even Infinity Camp’s sect leader found it unbelievable.","Still, Chu Yunfan’s aura had indeed reached an extreme level. He could even confront the hundreds of Divines in the formation and avoid falling into a disadvantageous position.","“Let’s fight it out with him! No matter how powerful he is, he can’t compare to our formation!”","“Do you think that this formation can affect me?” Chu Yunfan laughed. “Do you know what era it is, you old farts? You still can’t see reality, can you? Don’t you all look down on the Federation? Did you think you could take over the Federation?”","Clan Leader Wei gritted his teeth and roared, “That’s right! I don’t believe I can’t exhaust you to death!”","Suddenly, seven swords flew out from around Green Loti’s sect leader. They spun around him continuously, forming a sword Qi that grew stronger and more terrifying.","Chu Yunfan laughed again. “I’ll show you the power of the Federation!”","His words made Clan Leader Wei and the other two shudder. They even felt a strong sense of uneasiness. It was their sixth sense, and they usually trusted it.","Chu Yunfan’s performance wasn’t that dangerous, even if he could compete with them without being disadvantaged.","But suddenly, Chu Yunfan pulled out a portable nuclear bomb launcher.","Inside was, without a doubt, the nuclear bomb he had prepared to use to start a massacre. Initially, it was just a trump card he had prepared, but now, he had use of it.","“A nuclear bomb! He’s carrying a nuclear bomb!” Clan Leader Wei immediately reacted to what he saw. He planned to take over the Federation, so how could he not understand the Federation’s greatest weapon?","Although many of the Federation’s missiles were becoming increasingly powerful and may even be no less potent than early-era nuclear bombs, the Federation’s actual killing weapon was still nuclear bombs.","Everyone’s expression changed. These were all Divines, so they naturally understood the situation in the Federation. These were inevitable, whether it was invading or integrating into the Federation.","They naturally understood what a nuclear bomb was. Divines were people who could create miracles and transcend the mortal world. However, it was useless. They would still die after getting hit by a nuclear bomb.","If it were a nuclear bomb fired from a distance, they could react quickly and have enough time to escape. At most, the aftershock would sweep them away. The possibility of getting hit head-on was tiny.","However, if it were close, they could instantly react and kill the person who fired the shot. Still, Chu Yunfan’s strength was evident to all, and it was not something that the trio could deal with in a short time.","“He’s crazy!” Clan Leader Wei roared. He did not understand why Chu Yunfan would do this. At such a close distance, Chu Yunfan could not escape death either. The nuclear bomb would hit him.","There was no time for him to think about it. The other experts watching the battle from a distance fled at breakneck speed. They knew the power of the nuclear bomb, while those who had not realized what was happening followed suit.","“Hahaha!” Chu Yunfan laughed and launched the bomb. This time, he did not choose a small-scale tactical nuclear bomb but the kind that could attack a city with a much more extensive range.","Boom!","A mushroom cloud rose like a miniature sun. The heat wave devoured everything completely. The entire Holy Mountain trembled violently as the violent tide set off by the explosion instantly swallowed it whole."]},{"number":1046,"title":"Chapter 1046 The Power of the Nuclear Bomb, a Team Wipeout in One Strike","paragraphs":["1046 The Power of the Nuclear Bomb, a Team Wipeout in One Strike","Boom, boom, boom!","The Holy Mountain trembled violently, and the terrifying power caused by the nuclear explosion finally revealed itself.","These higher-ups had heard of nuclear bombs that were enough to destroy Divines. However, this was the first time they had encountered one.","In the distance, the sect leaders of Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp, who had finally retreated to a safe area, were shocked.","!!","The heat waves swept over them, scraping and hurting their skin, but not enough to kill them. They would not immediately die if they did not get hit directly. They would be severely injured and even die if the explosion hit them head-on.","“Is this the tactical nuclear bomb the Federation promotes?” The sect leader of Moonfall could not hide the shock on her delicate face.","The sect leader of Longevity Faith gulped and said, “It seems I’m right. I heard the Federation’s nuclear weapons have different levels of power and ranges. This one should be the tactical nuclear bomb used on battlefields. As expected, even a Divine can’t escape death in such an explosion.","The leaders of the six superpowers naturally knew more than the average person. They knew about different nuclear bombs. After all, ordinary nuclear bombs and tactical nuclear bombs were different.","The Federation was constantly increasing the power of nuclear bombs while also making continuous efforts to miniaturize them. Not only did they reduce the nuclear bombs’ sizes, but they also controlled the range to tactically use them on the battlefield.","Evidently, the one Chu Yunfan launched was a medium-sized tactical nuclear bomb. Even they felt a chill when they saw its terrifying power. It would have affected them if they had not retreated far enough.","Even if a nuclear bomb’s explosion only swept them, it would be enough to choke them.","The leaders of the three superpowers and the Divines behind them were utterly dumbfounded because they knew they could not escape death if the explosion hit them head-on.","“H-How terrifying. Was that a nuclear bomb?”","At this time, the nuclear bomb had left an indelible impression in everyone’s hearts. If it were them, they might have died. However, under normal circumstances, they would have felt a strong sensation before a nuclear bomb landed unless it was one with a large coverage area.","However, it was undeniable that the Federation, which had such power, did indeed have the terrifying power to destroy them.","“He’s a madman. Isn’t this a lose-lose situation for both sides?”","Everyone was dumbfounded. They thought Chu Yunfan was dead for sure. Even he could not escape death if he detonated the nuclear bomb at such a close distance to himself.","“Master!” Lin Chenxi bit her lower lip, and tears flowed out of her eyes as she watched Chu Yunfan’s figure get swallowed up.","The explosion finally subsided. At this time, the explosion almost completely eradicated more than two hundred Divines. Only the Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei, and the sect leader of Green Loti remained.","After the explosion, the trio was in a sorry state.","“Huff, puff, gasp, huff!”","The trio panted heavily, their clothes in tatters, looking miserable. Each of them had treasure armor, but it was completely broken at this time. As the leaders of the six superpowers, their foundations were naturally not something ordinary Divines could compare to.","They had treasure armor that their ancestors had refined for many years. These armors were high-quality magical artifacts, and this armor had saved their lives at a critical moment.","Of course, in that short period, the trio had fled more than ten thousand meters away and were not in the center of the explosion. Otherwise, it would have killed them even with their armor.","After all, this nuclear bomb was only a medium-sized one, not one for annihilating cities. Chu Yunfan could not possibly bring out a city-destroying missile alone and launch it himself, not to mention that one nuclear bomb would also destroy the remaining half of the Divines.","The nuclear bomb had completely flattened the area around the Holy Mountain. Although it was only a medium-sized tactical nuclear bomb, it was still shocking to the people from the Holy Land, who had never seen the power of a nuclear bomb in person.","Its horrifying power was like the end of the world. How could the Federation, which had such a weapon, be as weak as they thought? Perhaps if the Divines were careful, these nuclear bombs would not easily lock on to them.","However, if their subordinates dared to attack the Federation, they would be courting death. The Holy Land, which still used the ancient way of war, was no match for the Federation.","Only then did they realize that they had taken it for granted. They had only noticed that there were few Divines in the Federation. Nonetheless, they did not expect the Federation to possess such a powerful weapon.","That was not the only trump card the Federation had. Compared to the Federation, the six superpowers of the Holy Land had an uneven distribution of spoils.","“It’s a pity. Chu Yunfan might be the most talented person I’ve ever seen, but he went crazy and chose death,” Moonfall’s sect leader said in shock.","However, she felt even more regretful that the explosion had not killed the three leaders. At this point, it was better just to kill them. Then, they would naturally swallow up the remaining forces of the three superpowers, and their strength would increase considerably.","Clan Leader Wei roared again and again. Although he did not die, he was severely injured. Not to mention, Chu Yunfan had destroyed the foundation they had built for countless years in the blink of an eye.","The Divines of the Wei clan were annihilated, and so were the experts who were attached to the Weis. Clan Leader Wei shuddered at the thought of the Wei clan’s fate without Divines.","It was not just him. Hellfire King and Green Loti’s sect leader also had ashen faces. They wondered what had happened as the situation completely differed from what they had expected. They thought Chu Yunfan would not be able to escape death.","They did not expect Chu Yunfan to suddenly use such a suicidal method as if he had gone crazy. Now that Chu Yunfan was dead, they could not find anyone to vent their anger on, even if they were outraged.","“You three are still alive?” A figure in a black robe appeared in the air, accompanied by a leisurely yet surprised voice."]},{"number":1047,"title":"Chapter 1047 If One Comes, I’ll Kill One. If Two Comes, I’ll Kill Two","paragraphs":["1047 If One Comes, I’ll Kill One. If Two Comes, I’ll Kill Two","This voice made the entire Holy Mountain fall silent.","Everyone’s eyes widened, and they thought that they were hallucinating.","What had they seen?","They saw Chu Yunfan.","!!","Not only did he survive the nuclear explosion, but more importantly, he didn’t look as pathetic as Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, or Green Loti’s sect leader. He looked completely clean and untouched.","What he looked like before the nuclear explosion was what he was like now.","“How is this possible?!” Clan Leader Wei’s eyes widened and his expression froze, or rather, he was dumbfounded. He thought that Chu Yunfan was dead. Although he had paid such a big price, at least he had some gains.","But who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was still alive?","Not only did he not die, but he also seemed to be unscathed, not at all affected by the explosion.","Even the sect leaders of Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp were dumbfounded, let alone Clan Leader Wei.","They could feel the terrifying temperature and destructive power of the explosion from the outside. No one should have been able to survive it. Because of that, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would die.","“Master! Thank goodness!”","Lin Chenxi was so happy that she jumped up and down. She thought that Chu Yunfan was dead. Tears flowed down her cheeks as many thoughts ran through her mind, all of them about Chu Yunfan.","And now, Chu Yunfan, who they thought was dead for sure, had reappeared. Even they had only thought this for a short moment, it felt like a century.","Chu Yunfan reappeared out of thin air. The temperature was still very high as if the air was burning. The aftermath of the explosion was still wreaking havoc, but for someone with his cultivation level, he was no longer affected.","He looked at Clan Leader Wei, Hellfire King, and Green Loti’s sect leader, who had escaped tens of thousands of meters away in the blink of an eye, with some surprise. The three of them were the closest and the fastest to the blast area, but they were not dead.","However, he immediately spotted the broken armor on the three of them and immediately understood that they must have used the armor to block the fatal explosion.","In addition, this was not the kind of nuclear bomb used to massacre a city, which in turn had allowed them to escape from the center of the explosion and survive.","It was also because they were much stronger than the others. Anyone with a lower cultivation level, even if they were given treasure armor, would still not be able to escape from the center of the explosion and would die.","Chu Yunfan saw everyone’s shocked expressions and a satisfied smile appeared on his face. This was the fundamental reason he had used the nuclear bomb.","His cultivation had improved a step further and entered the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage. This, he could have contended with the formation with his own strength.","However, he still launched that nuclear bomb without hesitation. He wanted to warn Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp who had yet to interfere. The Federation not only had him as a top master but also had technological means that could take their lives.","If the Federation had the intention of perishing together with them, they could use city-wide nuclear bombs to carry out a large-scale massacre. No matter how fast they were, it was impossible for them to escape the baptism of such a terrifying weapon that could cover an entire battlefield.","Only by letting them understand the gap between themselves and the Federation would they be convinced.","And the effect was indeed outstanding. Everyone was scared silly. The nuclear bomb that had only been data on paper suddenly exploded in front of them, making them understand how close they were to death.","All the little tricks they had been up to instantly disappeared.","Through this nuclear explosion, Chu Yunfan achieved such an effect. It made the Holy Land understand that their previous thoughts of conquering the Federation were simply a joke.","And it was clearly impossible to control the Federation through the upper echelons because Chu Yunfan was in charge of the Federation. It would be impossible for them to succeed.","‘How did he dodge the explosion?!’ everyone thought.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s appearance, he definitely had not taken the explosion head-on. It was impossible for a Divine to take an explosion of this level head-on.","Then, he must have dodged it. But how?","“I understand! It was spatial equipment!” Infinity Camp’s sect leader shouted.","Everyone finally understood that Chu Yunfan must have some invisible spatial equipment that could hide him from people. Even the Holy Lands with their deep heritage didn’t have such a method.","There was a lot of spatial equipment throughout the Holy Land, but they could only inanimate objects inside them. Living things couldn’t be put in, let alone the user themselves.","This could only mean that the level of Chu Yunfan’s spatial equipment was at an unbelievable level.","Many people’s eyes flashed with a hint of greed, but they quickly regained their clarity. If Chu Yunfan was only in the Innate Stage and they had discovered this, they would definitely rob him blind.","But now, Chu Yunfan was a terrifying expert who could easily kill them. How could they dare to have such thoughts?","After thinking this through, many people finally understood why Chu Yunfan dared to launch a nuclear bomb without any hesitation. It was because he was one hundred percent sure that he could dodge it.","“The three of you are really lucky. Are you guys cockroaches?” Chu Yunfan said to the three of them with a sneer.","“Chu Yunfan, aren’t you afraid of incurring the wrath of the Holy Land by massacring so many people?!” Green Loti’s sect leader roared, and the entire Holy Mountain heard him. He hoped that the other Divines would be willing to help them.","However, everyone kept their heads down and pretended to be stupid. They were not willing to step forward before, let alone now that Chu Yunfan had shown such a terrifying killing method.","Asking them to risk their lives for a dying man—wasn’t that a joke?","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “If one person dares to jump out, I’ll kill them. If two jump out, I’ll kill them both!”","Chu Yunfan’s words made the remaining Divines slightly angry, but no one dared to step forward.","In the blink of an eye, he arrived in front of Green Loti’s sect leader. He casually grabbed at the air, and then, with a “swish” sound, the air transformed into a sword light.","The sword light was piercingly cold, and the terrifying sword intent was only above that of Green Loti’s sect leader.","Slash!","Green Loti’s sect leader tried to fight back, but he was already seriously injured. He didn’t have the ability to fight back and Chu Yunfan easily killed him."]},{"number":1048,"title":"Chapter 1048 Killing Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei’s Identity Exposed","paragraphs":["1048 Killing Hellfire King, Clan Leader Wei’s Identity Exposed","The head of Green Loti’s sect leader was cut off by the sword light. His head was separated from his body, and he fell to the ground.","It was just a simple strike, but the sword intent it contained seemed to contain all the sword intent in the world.","Just the magnificence of that one strike made everyone feel terrifying pressure.","That sword attack completely displayed Chu Yunfan’s strength. In terms of power, he was above the leaders of the six superpowers. This had already been confirmed before, so it was nothing.","!!","However, what shocked everyone was that the sword intent contained in Chu Yunfan’s casual slash was even purer than that of Green Loti’s sect leader.","They realized that they knew too little about him, or rather, they had never been able to push him to the extreme.","Even so, the sect leaders of Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp still felt a sense of sympathy when they saw Green Loti’s sect leader, who was originally on the same level as them, being killed by Chu Yunfan so easily.","“I didn’t expect you to have such a trick up your sleeve. I was too careless!”","Hellfire King spat out a mouthful of blood as he stared at Chu Yunfan, who was walking toward him.","Chu Yunfan covered a distance of more than ten thousand meters in a few leaps.","If he knew that Chu Yunfan had such a powerful weapon, he would have attacked him even if he was beaten to death. Not to mention that the strength Chu Yunfan just displayed made him feel despair.","Even if he was at his peak, he was probably not a match for Chu Yunfan. Not to mention now that he was unprecedentedly weak.","“You’ve been blinded by your own interests. I’ve said that I want to negotiate with you, but you’re the one who’s unwilling to do so. Did you really think you’d succeed?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Hahahahaha, that’s right! I was delusional. I, the great Hellfire King, actually ended up like this. But Chu Yunfan, don’t be too arrogant. Even if I die, I’ll drag you down with me!”","Hellfire King suddenly roared. He was chanting an ancient incantation in a low voice, and a huge man made of fire suddenly appeared behind him.","The man of fire grew bigger and bigger, more and more terrifying as if it was a terrifying creature from an alternate dimension.","In order to summon this fire human, Hellfire King had used up all of his power, and more than half of his lifespan had been used up. The middle-aged Hellfire King instantly entered his old age.","With the long lifespans of Divines, that one hit had taken away at least a hundred years of their lifespan.","To sacrifice a hundred years of his life just to deal with Chu Yunfan, one could only imagine how much Hellfire King hated Chu Yunfan.","“Is this Hellfire’s lineage? It’s said that it’s a fire summoned from hell, and that’s how it got its name!” Moonfall’s sect leader said in shock. She could sense how astonishing this hellfire was. Even she had only read it in ancient records and had never seen it with her own eyes.","There were very few people in the world who could force Hellfire King to this extent.","“That’s right, it’s hellfire. Unfortunately, Hellfire King isn’t at his peak, so the hellfire he summoned isn’t at its peak either.” Infinity Camp’s sect leader sighed.","“That’s right. This is probably his last attack. To summon hellfire, he has to pay the price with his life,” Longevity Faith’s sect leader said with pity.","“I see!”","In Chu Yunfan’s mind, the godhead suddenly emitted countless rays of light, which gathered in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, allowing him to see clearly. There seemed to be a will that was projected down from a distant alternate dimension. With this will as the center, it formed hellfire.","He wasn’t unfamiliar with this kind of summoning method. There were many such methods in the Alchemy Emperor’s memory, but most of these summoning methods often required a painful price to be paid in order to obtain enough power from the creatures in the alternate dimensions.","The giant flaming man charged at Chu Yunfan with lightning speed, and the power it released instantly shook the world. It had recovered to its peak level, or even further.","Boom!","In an instant, the giant flaming man arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. The terrifying temperature seemed to be able to turn him into ashes.","“Petty tricks!”","Chu Yunfan sneered and tore the air with his hands. In an instant, the whole world seemed to be torn apart.","The flaming man was instantly torn in half. Hellfire King behind the figure was also torn apart, turning into a rain of blood.","Hellfire King still had a look of disbelief on his face. The ultimate trump card he had summoned with all his effort was so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan, and he was easily torn in half.","“That was nothing.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","The whole place was dead silent. Chu Yunfan’s combat power was too terrifying. Ordinary peak Divines couldn’t even withstand a single blow from him.","He was like a heaven-killing demonic god, completely undefeatable.","In the end, Chu Yunfan turned his eyes to Clan Leader Wei.","Clan Leader Wei didn’t run away, or rather, he didn’t have the time. Hellfire King couldn’t even withstand a single blow and failed to buy him any time.","“There’s only one left.”","Lightning appeared under Chu Yunfan’s feet, his figure flickered a few times, and he arrived before Clan Leader Wei.","Chu Yunfan had fought the Wei clan since a long time ago—from the younger generation to now. Even Clan Leader Wei was about to die at his hands.","If Clan Leader Wei didn’t make a move, the number one family of the Holy Land wouldn’t be able to escape the fate of destruction.","At this moment, Clan Leader Wei revealed a ferocious expression and shouted, “Chu Yunfan, I won’t let you off today! My lord will not let you off!”","Chu Yunfan’s face suddenly flashed with a puzzled look, but Clan Leader Wei did not intend to continue explaining. The divine power in his body began to burn wildly, and countless sigils flew out of his body, turning into an illusory figure. The figure wrapped him in it like armor.","His aura had returned to its peak, and it was even more terrifying than the peak.","“This feeling... Which Divine Servant are you?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes suddenly flashed with a hint of shock, because he finally recognized this familiar and clearly inherited cultivation method.","It was just like the Seventh and Sixth Divine Servants he had killed previously.","“I’m the Third Divine Servant!” Clan Leader Wei burst into laughter. The huge figure turned into a shocking finger and pointed at Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1049,"title":"Chapter 1049 Oppressing the Holy Land and Making It His Own","paragraphs":["1049 Oppressing the Holy Land and Making It His Own","Clan Leader Wei did not deny his identity, which shocked Chu Yunfan.","From when he killed the Sixth and Seventh Divine Servants, Clan Leader Wei, one of the leaders of the six superpowers in the Holy Land, was the Third Divine Servant.","This so-called God-like strength was unexpected and powerful, far beyond Chu Yunfan’s expectations.","Clan Leader Wei was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. He was among the top existences in the Holy Land and the Federation.","Such a person was willing to become someone else’s subordinate. If one considered it carefully, one would know the “lord” they were talking about was an extraordinary existence.","The other Divine sect leaders had also heard the conversation. They were highly talented and intelligent people.","After thinking for a while, they understood the key to this matter. There was such an organization, and Clan Leader Wei, who was on the same level as them, was only the Third Divine Servant in this organization.","It was utterly conceivable how big the conspiracy of this organization was, which meant there were at least two Divine Servants who could be on equal footing with Clan Leader Wei or even more powerful.","At the thought of this, their expressions turned ugly. Such a terrifying organization could not be just a tiny community of cats and dogs. There must be a significant conspiracy brewing behind it.","Clan Leader Wei’s terrifying finger strike tore open half of the sky. The finger was displaying its full might—the terrifying power borrowed from the talismans in the sky.","“Wishful thinking!” Chu Yunfan shouted. He clenched his five fingers into a fist, which turned into a terrifying force that swept in all directions. He punched at the finger that was almost the size of a small mountain.","Boom!","The punch hit the finger, and the finger exploded in mid-air, turning into a rain of light that scattered in all directions. The earth-shattering finger strike failed to hurt Chu Yunfan.","After entering the Divine Abilities Stage’s sixth tier, Chu Yunfan’s skills had reached an unfathomable level. Even a desperate attack from Clan Leader Wei could not cause him any harm.","Spurt!","Clan Leader Wei spat a mouthful of blood and suffered a violent backlash.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan appeared before Clan Leader Wei. Chu Yunfan looked at him coldly and said, “Tell me, what kind of organization is this? Who is your lord? I’ll leave your corpse intact if you tell me the truth.”","He did not lie to Clan Leader Wei because he could not let such an expert live, as that would significantly threaten him.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think killing me today will prove useful? My Lord will not let you off the hook!” Clan Leader Wei said with a bitter smile.","Suddenly, a terrifying energy fluctuation came out from Clan Leader Wei. Every cell in his body boiled with terrifying power.","“Sh*t! He’s going to self-destruct!”","At that moment, the three sect leader’s expressions changed. Although the self-destruction of a ninth-tier Divine was not comparable to a nuclear explosion, the power was horrifying enough.","Everyone’s expression changed, and they set up a barrier, ready to defend themselves.","Simultaneously, Chu Yunfan projected a large hand and grabbed Clan Leader Wei.","The word “seal” appeared in his hand out of thin air. The divine power in Clan Leader Wei’s body, which was about to explode, suddenly cooled down as if someone with great force had pressed it back in.","Chu Yunfan’s palm caught Clan Leader Wei’s throat. Clan Leader Wei struggled but could not break free. The self-explosion had destroyed many meridians in his body. At this moment, he could not mobilize any of his internal energy.","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “You do not die until I allow you to.”","While Moonfall’s sect leader and the others heaved a sigh of relief, they were secretly shocked. Everyone wondered what kind of sealing technique that was. Clan Leader Wei was about to self-destruct, but Chu Yunfan could seal him.","One could only imagine how potent Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had become.","He sealed all of Clan Leader Wei’s acupuncture points and his whole body’s internal energy with an ancient sealing technique from the Alchemy Emperor’s memory. Chu Yunfan threw Clan Leader Wei into the Mountain River Diagram.","Since it was related to the Divine Servant organization, Chu Yunfan had to be careful. After dealing with everything, he appeared before the sect leader and the others who had fled in a few flashes.","Before he could say anything, Lin Chenxi had flown toward Chu Yunfan’s arms and pounced into his arms. “Master, thank goodness you’re okay!”","After witnessing Chu Yunfan’s multiple life-and-death situations, Lin Chenxi finally had enough and cried.","“Why are you crying?” He did not know how to react but felt a warm current flowing through his heart. Lin Chenxi finally felt appeased after Chu Yunfan consoled her for a while.","He glanced at the crowd and said, “Hello, everyone. This is our first meeting, so let me introduce myself. My name is Chu Yunfan, the current chief of the Federation’s Special Operations Department.”","Everyone noticed Chu Yunfan’s calmness. No one would have thought he had just experienced a massacre if they had not seen it with their eyes. He had killed hundreds of Divines, including big shots who could shake the entire Holy Land with a stomp of their feet.","“Hello, I’m Moonfall’s sect leader!”","“I’m Longevity Faith’s sect leader! It’s nice to meet you!”","“Infinity Camp’s sect leader, at your service!”","The trio realized that Chu Yunfan did not plan to capture them. They were overjoyed and quickly introduced themselves. They no longer dared to even think of infiltrating the Federation. It would be good enough if Chu Yunfan did not kill them.","“Since everyone’s here today, I’ll represent the Federation to discuss matters regarding the Holy Land moving into the Federation. What do you think?” Chu Yunfan said.","“Sure!” the sect leaders looked at each other and nodded vigorously.","Chu Yunfan had annihilated the upper echelons of Green Loti, the Wei clan, and Hellfire one after the other. When the three forces were about to be annihilated, Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp joined forces and agreed on the Holy Land’s behalf.","“Perfect!” Chu Yunfan looked at the crowd with a satisfied smile. His trip to the Holy Land had finally come to a successful end."]},{"number":1050,"title":"Chapter 1050 Reaching an Agreement, Full Integration","paragraphs":["1050 Reaching an Agreement, Full Integration","Chu Yunfan wanted to prioritize finalizing the attitude of the current three out of the original six superpowers.","Now that these three superpowers were willing to join the Federation, it was enough to finalize the general framework.","Fortunately, although the nuclear explosion had happened, the venue on the peak of the Holy Mountain was still there. Everyone could use this venue. The others had previously used it to discuss invading the Federation.","After everyone took their seats, Chu Yunfan said, “Let’s use this place to discuss integrating the Holy Land into the Federation. You three shall represent the Holy Land, while I will serve as the Federation’s representative. There should be no objections, correct?”","Many people nodded. With his current power and influence, they would not doubt his identity as the Federation’s number one expert, let alone as the head of Special Ops. After all, he was among the most senior officials in the Federation.","With Chu Yunfan’s current power and influence, there was a high chance he would be elected as the Federation’s president in the future. His words were naturally worth nine previous cauldrons, and his promises were worth a thousand golds.","“Mr. Chu, how does the Federation plan to help us settle down?” one of the Divines asked.","“The Federation is divided into many satellite cities built around base cities. According to my initial plan, we will arrange for ordinary people of the Holy Land to live in these base cities or satellite cities. That way, they won’t have to worry about food or clothing,” Chu Yunfan said, “We will assign then these base cities or satellite cities to you, your sects, and your families.”","Everyone agreed after some thought. Above all else, these people knew that the Kunlun Realm was the Federation’s territory. The Federation would not allow them to unite and rebel against them.","In such a way, they had to divide and split themselves into the Federation’s vast territory. In a place unfamiliar with people and land, it was naturally impossible for them to unite and go against the government.","Fortunately, they were allowed to move their entire sect, not wholly split up. Otherwise, they would be isolated.","However, according to what they knew, Divines were considered top elites in the Federation. They dominated a region, and no one dared to provoke them. Even if they split into various places, they would not get kicked when they were down.","This was the best choice for them. After all, the Federation had far more resources and development prospects than the Holy Land.","Infinity Camp’s sect leader said, “I wonder if we could perhaps join the Federation Government?”","“Of course, you can. The Federation Government welcomes all heroes willing to serve it, especially Divines like yourself,” Chu Yunfan nodded and continued, “Experts like yourselves can choose to join the Federation Government or the Federation Army.","“However, I must say some things that you may be uncomfortable with. The Federation is not a place to play house. Whether you join the Federation Government or Army is up to you.","“But since you’ve chosen to join us and enjoy our protection and many development benefits, you must go to the battlefield whenever the Federation Government summons you.”","Chu Yunfan continued, “Unlike your Holy Land, the Federation pays attention to the equality of power and obligation. Even Divines are no exception. Although Divines are typically above the rest, you’d be wrong if you think you’re above the Federation. I’ve personally captured Divines and put them on trial before.”","His words quickly made the Divines’ hearts tremble. They were above the rest in the Holy Land, and none could restrain them. However, they would soon have to follow the Federation’s laws like ordinary people.","It was a tremendous challenge for them since they had grown accustomed to being arrogant and overbearing. Still, they knew Chu Yunfan meant what he had said. After all, he had the strength to carry out his plans.","The Divines had already prepared themselves for the Federation Government’s recruitment. Ultimately, they could not completely break away from the Federation’s system when they were in its territory.","“As for whether you want to join our government or army, I can guarantee that the Federation will treat you fairly whichever you may choose. You will be promoted as long as you contribute to the Federation,” Chu Yunfan said.","That was natural because these experts directly supplemented the high-end combat power the Federation lacked most. Chu Yunfan could not suppress them. Instead, he had to put them in important positions.","However, the influx of these experts would take much authority from the local tyrants within the Federation. The Federation only had a few experts in the past. Introducing more experts and hundreds of Divines now would make Divines more accessible than before, which was unsuitable for these people.","One could even imagine it would cause the Federation’s citizens to reject them.","Still, this was fine for Chu Yunfan as it was related to the Federation’s future development. Whoever dared to oppose him would be suppressed.","With the addition of hundreds of Divines, the importance of these people to the Federation rapidly decreased. Naturally, they had no capital to jump around.","Longevity Faith’s leader said, “We also hope for that guarantee. After all, the Holy Land needs it to integrate into the Federation.”","“My words are my guarantee,” Chu Yunfan said simply, “Of course, some might not believe it, but I believe benefits are the best guarantee. You need the Federation to provide a place to live, and the Federation needs you to provide high-end combat power.","“So, I believe that you can integrate with us successfully. It’s not just a verbal promise since we need each other, right?”","His words were unpleasant to hear, but they were still somewhat comforting. They were no longer children and understood Chu Yunfan was speaking the truth instead of giving pleasant-sounding guarantees.","Divines were of great value to the Federation. It was much more helpful than any verbal or contractual guarantee.","With this foundation, the negotiation ended successfully. Furthermore, everyone present was a big shot. As for the details, they would have to wait until Chu Yunfan returned to the Kunlun Realm and allow the Federation time to organize a delegation and discuss things.","Meanwhile, everyone had forgotten about Hellfire, the Wei Clan, Green Loti, and the other small sects. That was how cruel the world was."]},{"number":1051,"title":"Chapter 1051 Half of the Holy Land Was Swept Clean in a Month","paragraphs":["1051 Half of the Holy Land Was Swept Clean in a Month","“I have one more request,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Mr. Chu, please speak your mind,” Longevity Faith’s sect master said.","“I would like to borrow ancient books from various sects,” Chu Yunfan replied.","Everyone looked at each other before asking again, “What kind of ancient books?”","!!","“I want to borrow each sect’s history books. The longer the book is, the better,” Chu Yunfan said.","That was his primary focus of coming to the Holy Land. According to the scattered information he had obtained, the Holy Land should consist of survivors of the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","When the Ancient Zenith Civilization got destroyed, its citizens hid in the Holy Land and slowly evolved into a civilization different from the Federation. He wanted to know why such an illustrious civilization had disappeared as if it had been destroyed overnight.","The Federation had many speculations as to what has happened, including the invasion of foreign enemies, significant environmental change in the Kunlun Realm, and the fact that it was unsuitable for survival.","However, there was no accurate, suitable conclusion. From the many excavated ruins, it seemed the people of the Ancient Zenith Civilization left in a hurry and did not encounter a disaster.","The Divines heaved a sigh of relief when Chu Yunfan said he only wanted to borrow historical books. They would not have known how to answer if he had asked to borrow their cultivation books.","After all, each family’s ancient books and records were secrets they could not pass down to others. Moreover, they passed down most of their secrets by word of mouth.","Still, they had witnessed Chu Yunfan’s power and influence and would not dare to refuse his request. It would be challenging for them if he asked for their cultivation books.","Fortunately, he had no intentions of making things difficult for them. Hence they sighed in relief.","Chu Yunfan shook his head at them. Ultimately, this method of sect inheritance was still too narrow-minded and far from the Federation Government’s approach.","This was how the Federation could go through the processes of the Ancient Zenith Civilization that spanned tens of thousands of years in just a few hundred.","However, many were suspicious, not knowing what Chu Yunfan wanted to learn. Generally speaking, people rarely touched these historical books.","“No problem, we’ll have someone send over the books immediately!” the sect leaders quickly promised.","“Also, some sects have been destroyed. Their inheritances will not be able to be preserved. I only have one request regarding that,” Chu Yunfan said, “Make a copy of all the ancient books and records you’ve obtained from these sects and send them to me. In addition, I want half of the treasures, gold, silver, spirit stones, and any other wealth they may possess.”","Everyone nodded after hearing his requests. None felt there was anything wrong with them. They would have nothing to say, even if he asked for everything. After all, Chu Yunfan had killed many Divines. They would not have had the chance to break into those sects without him.","These superpowers had rooted themselves in the Holy Land for countless years, especially the Wei Clan, Hellfire, and Green Loti. None could break into the other base without Chu Yunfan killing their Divines.","Of course, the most important thing was that Chu Yunfan’s incredible strength made them not dare to resist. Otherwise, he would destroy them like he destroyed those people.","“Also, find and send to me all kinds of historical books as soon as possible. I will be in Tianhe for the next month. Prepare a representative to go with me to the Federation. It is to discuss the detailed integration plan with the Federation,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Understood!” Everyone nodded. Then they quickly went to make arrangements.","Chu Yunfan had annihilated the higher-ups of Hellfire, the Wei Clan, Green Loti, and other forces. The other forces had to go back as soon as possible to organize an army so that they could catch the fallen sects off guard. It was a most nominal price to obtain tremendous benefits.","Soon, everyone left one after another while Moonfall’s sect master took away the bodies of the high-level experts that Chu Yunfan had killed.","Chu Yunfan brought Lin Chenxi back to Tianhe.","News of everything that had transpired and the Divines’ departure spread quickly throughout the Holy Land, immediately causing a huge uproar. After all, Chu Yunfan obliterated the Wei clan, Hellfire, Green Loti, and their many subordinate forces. None had managed to escape.","They were initially discussing how to take over the Federation, but no one expected Chu Yunfan to kill them before they could do much.","In particular, the Wei clan, Hellfire, and Green Loti had dominated the entire Holy Land for a long time. Their claws were deep in the Holy Land, and the forces involved occupied half of its forces.","Nonetheless, Chu Yunfan annihilated their entire army. He had taken the Holy Land by storm, leaving a profound impression in these people’s hearts.","No one had ever done what he did throughout the Holy Land’s history. The Holy Land’s people and history books were destined to remember Chu Yunfan’s name.","Before the fallen sects could react, the forces led by Moonfall, the Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp launched a counterattack almost immediately.","While the Holy Land was in turmoil, the alliance of powerful sects and families led by these three forces launched a sweep of the remaining forces led by the Wei clan, Hellfire, and Green Loti.","Without a leader, the Divines were annihilated. Even the strongest was only at the peak of the Innate Stage. None of the remaining forces could withstand it. Almost every sect collapsed and surrendered before the allied army arrived.","This storm swept through the entire Holy Land like a sudden thunderclap, causing the entire place to fall into turmoil. However, the leadership of Moonfall, Longevity Faith, and Infinity Camp quickly pacified the turmoil.","Chu Yunfan, who was in Tianhe, began receiving various books and records. There were many texts regarding the Holy Land’s history that the various families had promised to send over.","There were also many cultivation technique manuals from the various forces that had gotten wiped out.","In addition, the Divines also sent large numbers of treasures to the city lord’s mansion in vast queues every day. It had become a sight to behold for all of Tianhe. They had never seen so many treasures and might never have another chance to witness such a thing again.","Moreover, the significant forces dared not play any tricks on this issue. They sent the things they had promised to Chu Yunfan, who was in the city lord’s mansion of Tianhe.","In just a blink of an eye, a month passed."]},{"number":1052,"title":"Chapter 1052 Getting Rich Overnight, the Wealth of a Country","paragraphs":["1052 Getting Rich Overnight, the Wealth of a Country","In the past month or so, Chu Yunfan occasionally guided Lin Chenxi in her training while constantly looking through the historical books the major forces had sent.","Chu Yunfan was able to read almost all the sects’ historical records with the major forces’ cooperation.","The historical books were piled into almost the size of a mountain. It would take decades for an ordinary person to finish reading them, but Chu Yunfan was different. He had a photographic memory and could read ten lines at a glance.","Furthermore, his improved cultivation level further improved his reading ability. With just a glance, he could memorize an entire page. He was even faster than a computer scanning and recording history books.","Still, he had to read through every book and record day and night to finish them. However, after reading the many ancient history books he had received over the past month, they still did not quell his doubts. Instead, his doubts became more profound.","He felt a little depressed after reading these texts. Unlike the Federation’s way of recording history, each sect and force had almost no complete historical records. Most were secrets or records of historical events after they had happened. Moreover, most of these records were from each respective sect and force.","Through these books, he discovered that the sects and forces that had initially entered the Holy Land were wiped out long ago. The current six superpowers only rose to power later.","Although Divines were around, and the chances of a change in power were minuscule, the Holy Land, which had survived since the Ancient Zenith Civilization’s destruction, had been around for too long.","There was no such thing as an eternal foundation in the world. The forces that had dominated the Holy Land in the early years had been destroyed. The ancient books and records they left behind had slowly disappeared in the long river of history, leaving only a few scattered records.","Chu Yunfan learned much about the Holy Land’s secrets through these books but did not find out much about the Ancient Zenith Civilization as he had wanted. Although the Holy Land’s historical heritage was much more extensive than the Federation’s, the matter concerning the Ancient Zenith Civilization had become a legend.","According to the records, the experts of ancient surpassed the Divine Abilities stage. The existence of these experts stabilized the Holy Land, allowing them to obtain a place to rebuild.","However, those experts and the sects they had founded had long disappeared through time.","Even so, Chu Yunfan did not come up empty-handed after constantly looking through these historical records. He discovered that all the records left behind about the Ancient Zenith Civilization seemed to record the words “ascend to the world.”","Those words puzzled him. The strength of the Ancient Zenith Civilization had made it the base camp of all the worlds. With the Kunlun Realm as the core, the Ancient Zenith Civilization conquered the world.","Still, many ancient historical books he had just read mentioned ascension. He wondered if the entire Ancient Zenith Civilization had ascended together, but after some thought, he felt it was impossible.","The Ancient Zenith Civilization was mighty back then, and the number of living beings was in the trillions. The Federation and the Holy land were far inferior to the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","But it was almost impossible to achieve the ascension of an entire civilization. One could also discover this from the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","Furthermore, ascension was a civilization undergoing a dimensional ascension and entering a higher dimension according to the current scientific point of view. However, civilization would benefit if the entire world were to ascend.","Why did the founders of the Holy Land escape into the Holy Land? Not to mention, the entire world had ascended, and the Ancient Zenith Civilization had disappeared completely. It was as if it had never existed.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan did not understand what had happened back then, even after reading these books. Instead, he became even more confused. Still, he was sure the Ancient Zenith Civilization’s decline was unnatural.","‘Something must’ve caused the entire civilization to suddenly disappear.’","Even the Holy Land’s higher-ups did not know what had happened. However, without a more reasonable explanation, Chu Yunfan could only temporarily assume that the Ancient Zenith Civilization had ascended.","According to the Alchemy Emperor’s memories Chu Yunfan had obtained, even though the Ancient Zenith Civilization was strong then, they likely did not have the proper conditions to ascend.","The emperors resembled countless blazing suns in the sky. but simultaneously almost dispersed the Ancient Zenith Civilization’s power. Each family had a different development direction, and each emperor was mighty, so there was no possibility of anyone being able to unify the world.","It was only possible that it had happened at the end of the Alchemy Emperor’s memory or after the godhead fell from the sky.","According to the Alchemy Emperor’s last memory, that battle had been tragic. The various emperors fought until the sky collapsed and the earth cracked. It was a pity that the Alchemy Emperor died early, and there was not much in his memory that referred to this event.","Since Chu Yunfan could not discover the reason for the Ancient Zenith Civilization’s disappearance, he could only give up and start to take stock of his gains from this trip to the Holy Land.","He took half the treasures and gave the other half to the Holy Land’s various forces. The wealth inside was so much that one could imagine how amazing it was.","In the beginning, Lin Hongfeng was worried that the treasury of his mansion would be unable to contain so much wealth. After all, Tianhe had never received so many treasures before.","No one expected Chu Yunfan to accept everything. After all, he had developed his Mountain River Diagram several times, so its space grew exponentially. He even sorted all the treasures he had sent there.","Among these treasures were more than twenty million low-grade spirit stones. Their value was immeasurable, and Chu Yunfan’s wealth alone could rival a country’s. Indeed, he was now super rich and undoubtedly the wealthiest person in the Federation.","In addition, there were also countless natural treasures, rare precious medicine, and magical weapons, all of which filled Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram. He estimated there to be more than ten million low-grade spiritual stones.","There were also cultivation manuals from various sects. Although Chu Yunfan did not care much for them, they were still invaluable to the Federation. After all, they contained numerous cultivation methods, from breaking through to the Divine Abilities Stage to cultivating to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","The Federation could produce many Divines over the next few decades with these ancient records. According to the current number of experts, it was only a matter of time before thousands of Divines emerged.","Chu Yunfan could use this wealth to build a considerable force."]},{"number":1053,"title":"Chapter 1053 Everyone Surrenders and Returns to the Kunlun Realm","paragraphs":["1053 Everyone Surrenders and Returns to the Kunlun Realm","This was the largest amount of wealth Chu Yunfan had ever obtained in his life. Just the wealth alone was worth more than tens of millions of spirit stones, and if the various historical books were counted, the value would at least double.","It was not hard to imagine that these forces had accumulated a lot of treasures over the years.","When Chu Yunfan uprooted the Jiang and Huang clans, the wealth he had obtained was only in the hundreds of billions of federal coins. Now, the wealth he had obtained was in the trillions.","Such a huge amount of wealth made Chu Yunfan the richest man in the Federation.","Although the value of those books and records was immeasurable, Chu Yunfan still had to hand them over to the Federation in the end. Of course, he would not give be giving them away for free.","The Federation had never encouraged its citizens to sacrifice themselves for the Federation for nothing. That was not in line with the path of long-term development. Only when there were sufficient benefits would people step forward to do things for the Federation and would the Federation become stronger.","Those who set the rules were very smart, and now that Chu Yunfan had the right to set the rules, he naturally wouldn’t rashly break them.","Besides, he had risked his life to enter the Holy Land to obtain so much wealth. Naturally, he would not hand it over to the government for no reason. No matter how selfless he was, he did not have the final say in the Federation.","To the Federation, these historical books were like rain that had fallen from the sky, solving their urgent needs. The Federation occupied a vast area and had tens of billions of people. Every year, countless pioneer teams, mercenary groups, and monster hunters would venture into various places in the Kunlun Realm, bringing back with them an uncountable amount of wealth.","Compared to material wealth, the essence of the martial arts civilization was what the Federation needed the most at the moment. With the Federation’s foundation, as long as there were enough books and records, it was almost certain that a wave of martial arts experts would surge up.","Divines would no longer be scarce, and the Federation could even cope with the pressure from Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks at the same time so that it would not collapse. There was even a chance for a powerful counterattack.","This was beneficial to the Federation and Chu Yunfan.","After a month, the representatives sent by the superpowers gathered in Tianhe. They sent their successors to the city at the same time.","All of these people had been appointed as the next sect leader of their respective sects.","The future leaders were Moonfall Protege of the Moonfall, Longevity Protege of Longevity Faith, and Zhang Kuang of Infinity Camp. They represented the goodwill of the three superpowers.","In addition to the elders from other sects, there were hundreds of people in the delegation that would follow Chu Yunfan to the Kunlun Realm.","No one wanted to be left behind in the process of the detailed discussion with the Federation.","At this time, outside the Tianhe City Lord’s mansion, hundreds of people were waiting quietly. Although they were silent, there was a kind of silent power radiating off of these people.","The weakest among them were seventh or eighth-level Innates. There were even great elders of the three superpowers, who were so strong that they were almost in tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Usually, wherever these people went, they would shake the world with a stomp of their feet. However, at this time, they were all standing quietly outside the city lord’s mansion. No one dared to make a sound or ask for special treatment.","Lin Hongfeng and Lin Haoren stood before these people and gazed at the scene. They could not help but click their tongues in wonder. These people were those they could only dream of but could not reach in the past. It was an amazing thing to be able to invite even one of them.","And now, they were all quietly waiting in front of the city lord’s mansion. This was something that they had never dreamed of.","The father and son had not followed Chu Yunfan to the Holy Mountain, so they had not witnessed Chu Yunfan’s might as Lin Chenxi did.","But now, they finally saw it.","To be able to make these unruly people wait quietly, Chu Yunfan’s power was clear for everyone to see.","“Dear all, would you like to enter the residence to rest?” Lin Hongfeng asked tentatively.","Chu Yunfan could simply ignore them, but he could not be so blind.","“There’s no need. We’ll just wait here for Senior Chu,” Longevity Protege, the successor of the Longevity Faith, said quickly.","What a joke. He remembered how Chu Yunfan had displayed his godly might a month ago and took care of those big shots that even he had to temporarily look up to.","There had been no hard battle, and they were completely crushed.","Today, they were all waiting quietly because they were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s battle record from a month ago.","The others nodded in agreement with Longevity Protege.","Lin Hongfeng finally confirmed that these people were indeed frightened of Chu Yunfan. He didn’t know what kind of power Chu Yunfan had to make these unruly people so obedient.","The news that had spread throughout the Holy Land felt surreal.","But then he smiled bitterly. Not only them but even he himself was also intimidated by Chu Yunfan’s power.","But luckily, Chu Yunfan had no intention of making them wait for long. After a while, two figures walked out of the city lord’s mansion.","It was Chu Yunfan and Lin Chenxi. They walked out one after another.","“Greetings, Senior Chu!”","Everyone began to bow and salute at the same time. Although he was younger than all of them, on the path of cultivation, those who had reached the top and had strength were respected.","This was the common standard in the Holy Land. Although Chu Yunfan’s age was only a fraction of the three superpower’s sect leaders, because he was strong enough, he could sit side by side with them, discuss Dao with them, and call each other fellow comrades.","“Greetings.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at the representatives sent by the various forces. The young ones were full of vigor and were the hope of their respective forces, while the older ones had divine power as deep as the ocean, and their strength was incredible.","It was considered extremely high for the delegation to have such standards.","The sect leaders of the various forces did not head to the gathering at this time. Other than saying on the surface that they had to guard various parts of the Holy Land to prevent the remnants of the fallen forces from causing trouble, they probably still holding on to a trump card.","They were not completely at ease with the Federation yet.","It was normal to have reservations when cooperation was newly formed between two sides. Chu Yunfan did not mind. He had left the Kunlun Realm for so long and could not wait to return home.","“Let’s go!” Chu Yunfan waved and a layer of light appeared under everyone’s feet. They then flew out of the city.","Chu Yunfan took the lead, and behind him was Lin Chenxi. The rest of the people followed behind the duo.","Everyone was secretly shocked. To be able to lead so many people in one go, Chu Yunfan’s skill was far beyond their imagination.","A huge teleportation array had been set up outside Tianhe. All the forces had sent array masters here. After a month and a lot of time and resources, they had finally built such a teleportation array.","Everyone waited outside the city for a while before the array was activated. They then dove into the array.","The array was activated and the light engulfed everyone.","..."]},{"number":1054,"title":"Chapter 1054 The Powerful Federation and the Shocked Delegation","paragraphs":["1054 The Powerful Federation and the Shocked Delegation","The space around them twisted violently. Everyone’s eyes lit up, and they found themselves in a forest.","In the distant mountains, towering trees could be seen everywhere. They grew from the ground up and the roars of monsters could be heard.","This time, it was not a directional teleportation, so no one would be waiting for them on the other side of the teleportation array.","However, after Chu Yunfan used his terminal to determine their location, he quickly determined the direction.","!!","Most of them had never been to the Kunlun Realm before. After all, the Holy Land’s infiltration of the Federation had been on a small scale.","Everyone looked solemn because they could feel that the environment of the Kunlun Realm was many times worse than that of the Holy Land. The number and strength of the monsters here were even higher than that of the Holy Land.","The monsters in the Holy Land had been exterminated for many years. Though there were a few monsters left, it was difficult for them to pose any fundamental threat to the humans in the Holy Land.","However, it was a completely different story in the Kunlun Realm. The monsters here were much fiercer, and their numbers might be in the hundreds or thousands of times more than that of the Holy Land. It could be said to be endless.","In such a harsh environment, if the Holy Land moved into the Kunlun Realm rashly, the final result might be that it would be swallowed up by endless monsters. At the very least, it would be constantly harassed by countless monsters. The Holy Land was not like the Federation that could protect its people well.","Even though the Federation had many powerful weapons, satellite cities, and even base cities, it would still be attacked from time to time.","In the beginning, the Holy Land had thought of moving into the Kunlun Realm, but they didn’t want to rely on the Federation. However, they soon realized that it wouldn’t have worked.","The Kunlun Realm was full of dangers. Without the help of the Federation, they would have lost more than half of their people from the time they moved into the Kunlun Realm to gaining a foothold.","This result made everyone give up the idea of setting up their own base in the Kunlun Realm.","The Federation too had paid a huge price to gain a foothold in the Kunlun Realm. Many base cities had been lost, attacked, and fought over again and again. The number of casualties was probably more than the entire Holy Land’s citizens.","And such losses were constantly suffered in the fight with Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","This was the reason why the Holy Land quickly changed their target and set their sights on the Federation, a force that was also established by humans.","Most of them had only heard about it from others. When they entered, they found that the environment of the Kunlun Realm was worse than they had imagined. It was not bad for them, but it was a fatal threat to ordinary people.","Although there were more experts in the Holy Land than in the Federation, the system was not like that of the Federation where everyone cultivated. Therefore, most ordinary people were just slightly stronger in body, but they did not have any cultivation.","This was a problem with the Holy Land’s social system. Over there, the survival of ordinary people was a huge problem, let alone cultivation. However, in the Federation, as long as one was not lazy or stupid, it was easy to obtain a stable and comfortable life.","“Let’s go,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan led the way. Everyone followed him and flew toward the Federation’s territory.","It was only when they entered the Federation’s territory that they felt an extreme shock. It was a highly industrialized society that was completely different from the ancient society of the Holy Land.","There were also huge cities in the Holy Land, but they paled in comparison to the cities in the Federation.","Among them, the Divines could also sense the aura of countless cultivators lurking in the city. There were powerful ones and weak ones. Hundreds of millions or even billions of people in the entire base city were all cultivators. It was an amazing scene.","They were all dumbfounded because they knew that cultivation required a large number of resources. In the Holy Land, most of the ordinary people supported the cultivation of a small number of warriors.","However, in the Federation, this was completely subverted. Everyone in society was a cultivator, regardless of their cultivation level. This was shocking.","The resources required for a day’s training in a base city were astronomical. At the same time, the strength of the Federation was beyond imagination.","Previously, they had thought that the Federation’s strength was average and did not amount to much. That was because the Federation had fewer high-level experts.","However, now that they had arrived in the Federation, they realized that they had made a huge mistake. The Federation was in a period of preparation. All they needed was an opportunity. Once the terrifying foundation that had been accumulated for hundreds of years was unleashed, even ten Holy Lands would not be able to catch up.","Their first thought was to have the Holy Land follow this model, but they immediately rejected it. Compared to the Kunlun Realm, the Holy Land was too small. Everyone was like a dragon, and the great era of everyone’s cultivation relied on a massive amount of resources.","The Federation was like a giant beast that had devoured countless resources. The Holy Land could not afford to support such growth.","At this rate, it wouldn’t be long before the Holy Land was completely surpassed by the Federation. When that time came, it would be very difficult for them to integrate into the Federation, because the Federation wouldn’t need them anymore.","Thinking of this, they all felt lucky that they were able to keep up with Chu Yunfan’s pace. When they looked at him, they were originally very surprised. How could he have such a shocking cultivation level at such a young age?","But now, they understood. Compared to the environment of the Kunlun Realm, the Holy Land was just a small pond while the Kunlun Realm was the ocean. Shallow water couldn’t raise true dragons, but the ocean would eventually give birth to true dragons.","People like Chu Yunfan would definitely not be an exception. On the contrary, there would probably be more and more of them in the future.","They had been a little proud at first, but now they felt a sense of heaviness. The more they felt this way, the more the Holy Land wanted to reach a deal with the Federation. Otherwise, the Holy Land would lose its only chance to integrate into the Federation.","Soon, Chu Yunfan brought this group of people to the base camp of Special Ops in Kunlun City.","However, just as Chu Yunfan entered the city, Special Ops immediately informed him of a piece of earth-shattering bad news."]},{"number":1055,"title":"Chapter 1055 The Great Purge of Special Ops, Critical Situation","paragraphs":["1055 The Great Purge of Special Ops, Critical Situation","Most Federation experts were trapped in a secret realm out on the Infinite Sea and the Federation was in turmoil.","At this time, Special Ops felt reinvigorated. Their chief’s return would play a crucial role in stabilizing the situation.","The other newly promoted deputy chief of Special Ops, Bai Wen, looked at Chu Yunfan nervously.","Everyone had heard the news of Chu Yunfan’s death in the teleportation array’s spatial turbulence. The news had spread and caused a huge uproar throughout the Federation.","!!","The former number one expert of the Federation, the president, had disappeared and they had just produced another great expert. No one expected the great expert to fall before holding on to his position for a few years.","It was initially just a rumor and not many believed it, but soon, the video recording showed what had happened. Chu Yunfan had been ambushed in the teleportation array. The array was a trap set by a traitor in Special Ops.","After that, Special Ops experienced a sizeable purge.","Chu Yunfan, who was the Federation’s current totem, a pillar of strength, and a high-ranking Federation official, had met with a mishap because there was a traitor in Special Ops.","The Federation Government was furious, and even its higher-ups believed these were not just some low-ranking spies. It was likely that even the higher-ups of Special Ops had been deeply infiltrated.","Chu Yunfan’s fate was unknown, and it was highly likely he was already dead. The Federation higher-ups did not trust the current Special Ops, primarily because it used Special Ops to carry out missions. It was a sharp, swift sword in the Federation Government’s hands.","Now that its sword had rusted, one could imagine how furious the Federation Government was.","Special Ops would typically be the ones to investigate if there was a mole among them, but now, the Federation Government suspected that Special Ops had been infiltrated. Hence, the Federation Government transferred elite personnel from various departments to Special Ops.","They took everyone involved in this matter for investigation, including the deputy chief. It was an unprecedented event for Special Ops.","What made the Special Ops members even more anxious was that a nested case had been found. The group of people the deputy chief led been infiltrated.","This time, it was highly suspected that Chu Yunfan’s death was related to the deputy chief. It further aggravated the Federation Government’s upper echelons and they expanded the scope of the investigation.","In just a few months, the Federation Government had investigated and taken away tens of thousands of people. There was no other outcome than being shot for such a quasi-military unit if they found a spy.","Special Ops’ reputation, which Chu Yunfan had brought up, plummeted after such an incident. Simultaneously, Special Ops was in a state of panic.","Afterward, the Federation Government no longer trusted Special Ops. It would be difficult for Special Ops to regain its trust before the dust settled.","The death of the legendary Chief Chu Yunfan also caused Special Ops’ morale to plummet.","Now their chief had reappeared, it boosted Special Ops’ morale significantly. As long as he was around, Special Ops would be held in high regard.","“Chief Chu, you’re okay! That’s great!” Bai Wen was delighted and relieved.","Chu Yunfan’s resurrection was the great news for him. The pressure on him during this period had been too great.","He possessed the ambition to improve himself and had thought about what it would be like to take charge of Special Ops one day. However, he had already felt overwhelming pressure after being in charge of Special Ops for a short time.","The survival of countless people in such a large department sat on his shoulders. It made him understand how ridiculous his previous ambitions were. Now that Chu Yunfan had returned, he could finally sigh in relief.","“What’s going on? Where’s Huo Ruonan?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Chief Huo got lost in the ruins,” Bai Wen said worriedly.","Chu Yunfan’s brows furrowed slightly. Then he learned from Bai Wen what had happened in the few months he had been away.","Over the past few months, a traitor in Special Ops had betrayed Chu Yunfan. No one knew whether or not Chu Yunfan had survived. Meanwhile, the Federation Government investigated Special Ops.","However, it was different for the Federation. Instead, many Divines had gotten lost in the deep sea ruins out at the Infinite Sea.","A Divine of the Federation initially discovered the ruins, but one party could not monopolize it because it was expansive. Therefore, the Federation organized more than half of its Divines to go there together.","The momentum of this operation had been huge. However, no one expected it to be a trap set by the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain. The two forces had sealed off the ruin’s entrance, chasing and killing the Divines who entered.","Nearly ten Divines had fallen within just a few days. As for Huo Ruonan, she became the acting chief when Chu Yunfan’s fate remained unknown. She had also entered the Divine Abilities Stage because of the Divinity Nourishment Pill.","As such, she had also participated in the search of the ruins. Now, she was also trapped and her fate was uncertain.","“How bold!” Chu Yunfan clenched his fists tightly. He knew Huo Ruonan, Tang Siyu, Chu Haoyue, the Chu Great Ancestor, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, and his grandfather, Yang Feiyang, had gotten involved.","They had gotten trapped with uncertain fates.","Although the relationship between the marine folks and humans was shaky, they had maintained a degree of restraint between them. They did not know there was a big fight between the Federation and Infinite Demon Mountain.","Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks had joined forces to deal with the Federation’s Divines. He had a terrible feeling about the two sides joining forces against the Federation."]},{"number":1056,"title":"Chapter 1056 A Tragic Battle, a Great Battle Is About to Start","paragraphs":["1056 A Tragic Battle, a Great Battle Is About to Start","Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks were mortal enemies of the Federation.","Infinite Demon Mountain had fought against the Federation for many years and the two forces had been mortal enemies since the Federation marched into the Kunlun Realm for the first time.","The Federation was almost exterminated and had no choice but to retreat back to Earth. They relied on their last base city, Kunlun City, to resist the terrifying situation of countless monsters.","Many humans died tragically and became food for the monsters. It was like the end of the world.","Even now, though the Federation had achieved a power balance, the monsters would still managed to breach its base cities. Even Chu Yunfan had personally encountered it once. The terrifying scene of the monsters attacking the city was like purgatory on earth.","The marine folks’ strength was more formidable than the Infinite Demon Mountain. The number and density of the marine monsters far exceeded those on land. The fights between the marine folks and the land monsters were never-ending.","Under such circumstances, the marine folks were outstanding. If it were not for the fact that the various tribes could not work together, their strength would probably be above that of the human race and Infinite Demon Mountain.","“According to the information we obtained, these tribes hadn’t acted spontaneously. It feels like someone is manipulating things from behind the scenes.” Bai Wen looked at Chu Yunfan worriedly.","“The thing I feared most has happened,” Chu Yunfan said.","The Federation had always been worried that if an unparalleled figure emerged among the marine folks, he would unify them. Even if he could only unify a part of it, it would still threaten the Federation.","Now, it seemed his worry was not without reason. On the contrary, it had become a reality.","“Do you know what’s happening in there?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Take a look, Chief.” Bai Wen handed him a tablet. The photos on it almost made Chu Yunfan’s eyes pop out of their sockets.","The first picture was of a vast black-scaly wing, which Chu Yunfan was all too familiar with.","Before he left, he had instructed Ebony Dragon King to protect Tang Siyu. When Tang Siyu entered the ruins, it was likely that Ebony Dragon King had followed suit.","However, Ebony Dragon King’s entire wing had been torn off and thrown to the ground. One could only imagine how tragic the battle had been.","Sure enough, the second photo was of Ebony Dragon King fleeing into the distance. Still, it looked like the scales covering his body had shattered, and a significant wound had almost split his body in two.","The third photo was of a corpse. An older man had been beheaded and his blood had dried up. He died a horrifying death. Chu Yunfan did not know who the older man was.","The man was the Huangfu clan’s great ancestor. The Huangfus were part of the Eigth Greats.","Chu Yunfan had never crossed paths with the older man but knew that the Huangfu Great Ancestor had made impressive military achievements for the Federation. The Huangfu Great Ancestor was a legendary figure in the Federation but had died tragically in the ruins.","The following picture was of another corpse. This time, it was of a well-built older gentleman. He had gotten cut in half and fell to the ground with his eyes wide open. No matter how powerful he was before, he would be no different from an ordinary person after death.","The older gentleman was the Liu clan’s great ancestor. His family was one of the Eight Greats as well.","Other than the Jiang and Huang clans that Chu Yunfan had uprooted, the Huangfu and Liu clans would probably be eliminated from the list of once-famous aristocratic families in the Federation.","Without a Divine to back them up, the two families could not protect themselves. Besides the Chus and Tangs, only the Wang and Li clans remained. The losses were unimaginable.","However, that was only the beginning. There were still many more pictures, all of which consisted of well-known Federation experts. Everyone was in a sorry state and severely injured.","In addition to the Huangfu and Liu clans’ great ancestors who had fallen, there was also an old marshal on the same level as Zhu Buping in the Federation Army. He had gotten shot in the head. Only his body remained, and a monster had dismembered his corpse.","Chu Yunfan also saw Chu Haoyue among these pictures. He escaped after getting one of his arms cut off, while Yang Feiyang, Zhu Buping, the Chu Great Ancestor, Heavenly Dragon Elder, and others had gotten captured after being severely injured.","“Where did you get these?” Chu Yunfan’s heart sank as he looked at the pictures. Even with his wealth of experience, he could feel how brutal the killing must have been.","“These are on a public account on the Internet. It must be the work of the marine race experts. Every battle result had been posted on the internet,” Bai Wen explained.","Chu Yunfan’s heart grew heavy. If the pictures were real, it was easy to imagine that even if the remaining experts were not dead, they would be in a hazardous situation.","However, the marine folks did this even if they had to shed all pretenses of cordiality with the Federation. It also meant that they had already planned to fight the Federation.","The worst-case scenario they anticipated had finally happened—the marine folks were planning to come ashore. Once they did, they would have to face two behemoths, Infinite Demon Mountain and the Federation.","The marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain were monsters compared to humans, so they were closer to each other by nature. As expected, they had finally joined forces.","The current power structure had undergone a drastic change. Chu Yunfan believed that luring these Federation experts and killing them was only the beginning.","As the saying went, “To capture the bandits, one must first capture the king.” These Divines were not just the benchmark of martial arts in the Federation, they were also high-ranking officials of the Federation. Many, like Chu Yunfan, controlled key departments of the Federation Government or the Federation Army.","If all of these people were to die, the Federation would be like a fish out of water. Even if the Federation could elect a new chief, they could not convince the public in this era without power. Then, chaos would ensue.","Such a scenario would be enough for one to destroy the Federation many times over.","‘There’s an expert behind the marine folks’ and Infinite Demon Mountain!’ Chu Yunfan knew the situation was worsening.","They chose to publish these pictures and videos on the Internet to break the fighting spirit of the ordinary Federation citizens. These experts were the spiritual pillars of the Federation’s martial Dao.","The impact on the Federation’s morale would be unimaginable if its entire army got annihilated.","This served as another killing move."]},{"number":1057,"title":"Chapter 1057 The Federation’s Trump Card, Super Mechas","paragraphs":["1057 The Federation’s Trump Card, Super Mechas","Watching their spiritual pillars getting killed one after another severely impacted the Federation’s morale.","Most began to think it was the end for the Federation. Even if a portion of the Federation survived, it would still be a severe blow.","Unlike the Holy Land, which was determined to take over the Federation, it would still consider the consequences and not provoke resistance among the people.","However, it differed for the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain. They wanted to destroy the Federation and wipe humankind from the Kunlun Realm. They even wanted to counterattack and infiltrate Earth.","!!","That was the fiercest enemy. They would not consider many things because they could not rule the Federation. Moreover, it was pointless for them to rule over the Federation. The only feasible path was to destroy it.","“What a vicious plan,” Chu Yunfan said with a frown.","“Have you seen any news concerning Clan Leader Tang?” He finally asked the question that had been on his mind.","“No, we’ve only seen Ebony Dragon King but not Clan Leader Tang. Still, rumors are saying she’s severely injured, so there’s no good news for now. They will surely post it on the Internet once there is,” Bai Wen explained.","Chu Yunfan agreed after some thought. He could not help but heave a sigh of relief. Although the situation was terrible, it was not irredeemable. He said, “Something vital has happened, and it’s been a few days. Is the Federation Government still undecided on what to do?”","“The Federation is still considering whether or not to start a war with the marine folks. After all, the Federation is already dealing with the behemoth Infinite Demon Mountain. I’m afraid the odds of winning are low with the addition of the marine folks,” Bai Wen said worriedly.","Chu Yunfan discovered that the Federation Government had split into two factions. One faction wanted war, while the other wanted a peace treaty with the marine folks.","The marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain had joined forces to bully the Federation, and a war was about to break out. It was impossible to avoid it even if they wanted to. Now, the only way was to fight.","As for the peace-seeking side, the current quasi-Federation could not afford to fight against the two major forces simultaneously, especially now that so many Divines had fallen. They could not act rashly.","“At a time like this, those people still think peace talks will be helpful?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Maybe he did not understand what those people were thinking. Maybe the marine folks would not stand on the Infinite Demon Mountain’s side as long as the Federation met their needs.","However, these people had never thought about the benefits the Federation could offer to bribe the marine folks compared to the great benefits of them destroying the Federation.","The marine folks knew doing so would cause a complete falling out with the Federation. Still, they had done it. There was only one possibility—they already planned for there to be a fallout.","However, this was also because the Federation needed a leader or influential figure to hold the fort. They could not agree with each others’ opinions and were pushing each other around.","That was the disadvantage of democracy.","“Has the rescue operation started yet?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“We’ve already mobilized all the troops we can to rescue them. However, Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks have prepared long ago. They have intercepted our people at the ruin’s periphery, so our people can’t break in,” Bai Wen said worriedly.","Then he quickly showed Chu Yunfan a video. The footage started above the Infinite Sea where the Federation’s army had been dispatched. Various warships, underwater space carriers, and mechas covered the sky and blotted out the sun.","However, this was the Infinite Sea region. The marine folks were even more endless. There were also countless low-intelligence sea beasts that continuously filled the sea surface, blocking the Federation Army’s advancement. It was simply impossible to kill them all.","The fleet of Infinite Demon Mountain had also appeared in the sky, trying their best to stop the Federation’s fleet from entering the ruin. Countless aerial monsters rushed in from all directions. They filled the sky and fought numerous mechas.","The battlefield looked tragic. Countless monsters died at every moment, while numerous mechas got blown up. The human experts inside them ended up in the beasts’ stomachs.","Countless monsters were constantly attacking the motherships in the water and the warships in the sky.","One side went all out in order to save their experts, while the other side risked their lives to block them.","“There are Divine monsters?” Chu Yunfan squinted his eyes.","He spotted many Divine monsters and marine folks on the battlefield fighting with all their might to stop the Federation Army. Otherwise, those monsters and sea beasts alone would not be able to stop the advance of the Federation Army.","Those Divine monsters were simply too terrifying. Even if a warship fired hundreds of cannons of various calibers at the same time, it would still be difficult to catch their shadows.","As for the ordinary mechas, they were even more vulnerable. The mechas that were comparable to Innates were too fragile in front of these Divine monsters. They could not even withstand a single blow.","In just a few days of battle, the losses had already exceeded the strength of an entire army. Divines were too important that the Federation had to save them at all costs. Otherwise, they would have given up on such a huge loss. After all, it was not worth it for the remains.","Of course, Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks had also suffered great losses, but they were still sending countless monsters and sea beasts to the battlefield. They didn’t want to give up.","“That’s right. These Divine monsters are too troublesome.” Bai Wen shook his head. “We don’t have the combat power to fight against them.”","“Didn’t the Academy of Science successfully develop super mechas?” Chu Yunfan asked.","At his level, he naturally knew many secrets that others didn’t know. One of them was the super mechas that the Federation had been researching and developing, which was comparable to the combat power of Divines.","In fact, it was not difficult to develop this kind of mech. With the accumulation of various high-end technology, a few could be produced. However, the problem was mass production.","Compared to the Holy Land, Infinite Demon Mountain, and the marine folks, the Federation’s biggest advantage was that it could mass-produce all kinds of high-tech weapons. It was known as the amazing ability of a violent army.","If it could not be mass-produced, it would not make much of a difference whether there was one or not. In a real large-scale battle, a few of these mechas would not be able to play a decisive role and would be used up very quickly.","However, in general, this was the top combat power that humans could currently bring out."]},{"number":1058,"title":"Chapter 1058 Launch the Nuclear Bombs, I Want Them All Dead","paragraphs":["1058 Launch the Nuclear Bombs, I Want Them All Dead","Under such circumstances, it was better to have a few super mechas in the battle than none. It was just that most people did not know that the Federation had such a trump card.","Now that the Federation’s power was on the rise, if given enough time to achieve mass production of super mechas, it would only be a matter of time before it flattened Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","However, it was clear that Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks had also noticed something. They didn’t intend to continue to waste time with the Federation.","Compared to the strange leap-like development of the Federation’s national power, the progress of Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks was much smaller.","“We’ve sent five super mechas to the front line and three of them have been destroyed,” Bai Wen said with a wry smile.","“There are too many of them. Each super mecha has to face several Divine monsters. Three of them were destroyed in just a few days. The remaining two can only help in defending the battleships and motherships. They can’t attack.","“As for the other super mechas, they have to guard different locations. The armies of Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks are not just making their move here, but also on the coastline of the Infinite Sea and on the human-monster battlefield. We are unable to mobilize more troops.”","Chu Yunfan could understand that with the Divines lost in the ruins out on the Infinite Sea, the various top forces of the Federation were stretched thin.","“So many elites went together and they were all lost to the ruins. There must be a spy among us. Who spread the news? Have you found out?” Chu Yunfan asked.","For so many experts to go together, they must have obtained some accurate information. To be able to make these Divines believe it, this person must not be an ordinary person.","“We’ve found out that the person who passed the message to the Divines was none other than the Liu clan’s great ancestor, one of the Eight Greats...” Bai Wen said with some difficulty.","Chu Yunfan was speechless. Half of the Eight Greats had already been killed, and now the Liu Great Ancestor was under suspicion. He was probably doomed.","“The investigation hasn’t started yet?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Bai Wen glanced carefully at Chu Yunfan and said, “The Liu clan has a huge influence on the Federation. I’m afraid that such an inexplicable investigation would shock both the inside and outside of the Federation.”","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","How could he not understand? It must be the Liu clan’s influence inside and outside the Federation that was blocking the Federation Government’s investigation.","“The Federation is about to collapse. What are you afraid of? ” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Pass down my orders. Every department is to select their best men and carry out a full investigation on the Liu clan. If any problems are found, take them all down!”","“Yes, Chief!” Bai Wen said quickly.","In the current situation where all the Divines had been lost in the ruins, Chu Yunfan’s words were the final decision.","“In addition, pass down my order to use the nuclear bombs,” Chu Yunfan said viciously, “Can you find out which Divine monsters and marine folks’ sea beasts participated in the siege?","“I recall that the Federation had put together a power distribution map of the various marine tribes. According to the positions marked on the power distribution map, use nuclear bombs to cleanse them. I want to wipe out all of their tribes!”","When Bai Wen heard this, the air in his lungs froze. Chu Yunfan intended to use nuclear bombs to destroy the Divine monsters who had participated in the siege.","This was basically a complete fallout.","Unless they were blocked, Divines usually had an extremely amazing sixth sense. The moment a nuclear bomb was launched, Divines would catch on. It was almost impossible to use a nuclear bomb to do anything to them unless they used one at a very close distance like Chu Yunfan had done. It would then be impossible for them to escape. Otherwise, it would be extremely difficult to kill them.","However, the marine folks and demons were different. They didn’t have the ability to avoid nuclear bombs. Chu Yunfan was going to exterminate them and kill all the races that had dared to participate.","One could only imagine how crazy these Divine monsters would be once they knew that their race had been annihilated.","They would probably attack the Federation’s cities at all costs, which would cause great damage to the Federation.","Therefore, unless it was an extreme situation, the Federation would rarely use such a method. Once it was used, it would mean falling out with them and they would fight to the death.","“But if we do that, the consequences will be hard to predict,” Bai Wen said.","“It has already come to this, so what’s there to be uncertain about? Don’t tell me you’re holding onto any hope of luck?” Chu Yunfan said, “I want everyone to know the consequences of going against the Federation.","“There’s no end to backing down. This isn’t a treat. It doesn’t matter if we back down or go all out. This is a species war. If we lose, humanity will be wiped out of the Kunlun Realm,” Chu Yunfan said seriously, “Although the Kunlun Realm is huge, we have no room to retreat.","“Also, they can’t do anything about it. If I go, they won’t be able to escape.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm, but his fists were clenched tightly. He could not calm down. Now that Tang Siyu’s whereabouts were unknown, and it was uncertain if she was dead or alive, he was extremely worried.","However, he knew that it was useless to worry right now.","“Oh, about the mole in our department, sort out all the files and information and give them to me. I’ll read them when I come back,” Chu Yunfan instructed.","“Yes, Chief.” Bai Wen quickly nodded.","Then, Chu Yunfan found the representatives of the Holy Land and said, “Everyone, your first test is about to arrive.”","Then, he told them the whole story, which immediately caused an uproar among the delegation. After all, even they had not expected to encounter such a major event the moment they left the Holy Land and came to the Kunlun Realm.","They understood that this was a test for them. If they chose to retreat, they would never have the chance to integrate into the Federation.","Not to mention that Chu Yunfan was right here. If they backed out, he might not let them go. They had a deep understanding of his ruthlessness.","“We’re willing to listen to your orders, Chief Chu,” Longevity Protege stepped forward and spoke on behalf of the delegation.","“Excellent.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “The Federation is the mother of all human civilization. If you want to integrate into the Federation, you won’t benefit if its severely damaged.”","“If you want to integrate into the Federation, show the whole Federation your sincerity,” Chu Yunfan continued, “Everyone, listen up. Those below the Divine Abilities Stage, stay behind and discuss the matter of the merging and relocation of the Holy Land. Those above the Divine Abilities Stage, follow me to the battlefield!","“Let go kill the enemy!”"]},{"number":1059,"title":"Chapter 1059 The True Species War, the Shocked People From the Holy Land","paragraphs":["1059 The True Species War, the Shocked People From the Holy Land","Following Chu Yunfan’s orders, the twenty or so Divines who had come with the Holy Land delegation flew into the sky with him.","Everyone’s aura was fully released.","More than twenty Divines shocked all of Special Ops, especially since everyone in Special Ops knew that almost all the Divines of the Federation had been lost in the deep sea ruins.","Now that there were more than twenty Divines, they were both surprised and overjoyed. After all, at this critical juncture. The addition of more than twenty Divines was undoubtedly a powerful force.","Although this event had come suddenly, after a few days, many people understood that the marine folks and the Infinite Demon Mountain planned to break the backbone of the Federation.","The Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks made no effort to hide their intentions. In fact, they were happy to do it. This was the only way to scare the Federation.","While everyone was in a state of panic, Chu Yunfan’s return undoubtedly calmed the Federation.","Divines were extremely fast when they flew at full speed, especially Chu Yunfan, who was so anxious that he even released the power of thunder that he had cultivated to speed up the group’s flight.","It was even faster than a high-speed fighter jet.","Soon, they arrived at the edge of the Infinite Sea. Although the edge of the Infinite Sea was not the main battlefield, they could see the aftermath of the battle from there. All over the place, countless marine monsters seemingly driven by some invisible force were constantly rushing toward the battlefield.","Just like the monsters at Infinite Demon Mountain, most of the marine monsters didn’t have higher intelligence. Only a few of them did, and they either had a strong cultivation base or had a fortuitous encounter.","Most of the marine monsters didn’t possess higher intelligence. They were just cannon fodder for the marine folks who did.","But though they were just cannon fodder, these monsters were extremely powerful. Especially for ordinary people, these monsters were simply terrifying killing machines.","This was especially true regarding Infinite marine monsters. Many of them had the ability to survive on land, but they could not live as freely as they did in the water.","Once these marine monsters came ashore, they would cause terrible disasters.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even need the navigation system to find the battlefield. He simply followed the monsters.","Everyone was flying extremely fast. Although the battlefield was deep in the sea region, they arrived at the battlefield in less than half an hour.","The scene from the distance shocked the Divines of the Holy Land. Hundreds of battleships—like hundreds of mountain-like beasts—were divided into two camps and bombarded each other wildly. All kinds of terrible attacks swept across the sky.","The power of the main cannons was so strong that even they could feel the threat.","Around these hundreds of battleships were countless mechas and all kinds of ferocious beasts flying through the sky and swimming in the sea. They were fighting and killing each other in a frenzy and did not stop for even a moment.","The entire battlefield was ablaze.","The Federation’s Army had to pay the price of blood for every step they took. On the other hand, the marine folks and the Infinite Demon Mountain had to pay the same price.","At every moment, countless figures were being blasted apart.","Although those from the Holy Land were powerful and were be considered the top few in the Kunlun Realm, the situation had been fixed for many years due to the limitation of the Holy Land. The various forces maintained relative peace. Although all kinds of fights were not rare, it was the first time they had seen a racial war.","Only now did they truly understand the difference between the Holy Land and the Federation. The Holy Land would not be able to support such a level of consumption. A few more battles of this level would cripple the entire Holy Land.","The Holy Land’s model was the path of the elite. Countless ordinary people were used to support a small portion of these elites. However, this model was vulnerable in the face of such a large-scale species war. It was just like the super mecha developed by the Federation. Without the ability to be mass-produced, it was completely useless.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were like a torch as he swept his gaze across the densely packed battlefield. He could see that there were many Divine monsters rampaging on the battlefield. It was very difficult for the battleships of the Federation to block their movements, and the monsters in turn had delayed a considerable amount of the Federation’s military forces.","To deal with these Divine monsters, it was best for human Divines to take the charge.","And behind those countless monstrous beasts, a huge entrance to the ruins was faintly visible. That was what these countless monstrous beasts were guarding.","At this moment, a group of hundreds of aerial monsters discovered Chu Yunfan’s group flying through the sky. They suddenly let out a sharp screech and rushed toward the group.","“You’re looking for death!”","Chu Yunfan casually flicked his finger. A sword ray that was over a thousand feet long swept out and instantly annihilated the hundreds of aerial monsters.","He paused for a moment, then opened his terminal. After a while, an old man in a marshal’s uniform was projected on the terminal.","“Chu Yunfan here reporting in.”","“Chief Chu, thank goodness you’re okay!” the old man said with an excited expression. He couldn’t help but be excited. At this critical moment, Chu Yunfan’s appearance was undoubtedly like a stabilizing force.","“Special Ops should have already contacted you. I’ve asked some Divines to come and help. Set up the friend-or-foe identification signal,” Chu Yunfan pointed at the Divines from the Holy Land behind him.","“No problem. This is great. The Divine monsters on the battlefield are troublesome. It’s been hard to protect ourselves even with a few super mechas,” The old man immediately burst into laughter.","With more than twenty Divines, their situation on the battlefield was about to be greatly improved. They would not have to use a considerable part of their military power to restrain the Divine monsters.","“All right, enough talk. Killing the enemy is more important.”","Chu Yunfan turned off his terminal, then turned to the people from the Holy Land and said, “I’ve already spoken to them. When the time comes, you’ll be recognized as allies. As long as you’re careful, there won’t be any problems.”","After saying that, Chu Yunfan took the lead and charged straight into the battlefield.","The people from the Holy Land looked at each other, gritted their teeth, and immediately followed Chu Yunfan into the fight."]},{"number":1060,"title":"Chapter 1060 A Divine Marine Monster? It’s Nothing!","paragraphs":["1060 A Divine Marine Monster? It’s Nothing!","Chu Yunfan took the lead and rushed into the battlefield. The moment he entered the battle, countless monsters pounced on him.","“You’re courting death!”","Chu Yunfan looked coldly at the thousands of aerial monsters in the sky.","A bronze longbow had appeared in his hand at some point. It was a strange bow that was covered in cracks and even stained with dried blood but had no bowstring.","!!","Chu Yunfan poured all of his divine power into the Sun Shooter and it immediately turned into a terrifying energy fluctuation. Chu Yunfan’s strength was completely different from when he had first obtained the Sun Shooter.","Under the urging of his divine power, a huge arrow of light appeared in his hand.","Boom!","The arrow shot out like a heavy cannon. The huge light arrow instantly expanded and turned into a terrifying arrow that was more than ten meters wide. The light arrow swept out.","Boom!","The arrow was like a heavy cannon, setting off a terrifying tide. Wherever the long arrow passed, a terrifying vacuum zone that was hundreds of meters wide and thousands of meters long was formed.","The monsters that were hit head-on were instantly vaporized by the terrifying attack, while the monsters that were swept by the astral wind brought about by the light arrow were all ground into minced meat.","With just one strike, Chu Yunfan had killed at least ten thousand monsters. This terrifying power stunned everyone.","Although this had something to do with the monsters pouncing over, the power of an arrow that annihilated tens of thousands of monsters still made both sides dumbfounded.","In an instant, the entire battlefield fell silent. It was a deathly silence.","At this time, the Federation soldiers on the battlefield finally saw clearly who that person was. He was the number one expert of the Federation, Chu Yunfan, whom many had pronounced dead.","In the past few months, the Federation knew that had been a traitor in Special Ops, and the head of the Special Ops—the number one expert of the Federation, Chu Yunfan—had met a mishap.","But now, they realized that those rumors were all bullsh*t. Didn’t they see that Chu Yunfan was still there?","And Chu Yunfan’s existence naturally boosted the morale of the Federation Army, and they suddenly had the possibility of winning.","After Chu Yunfan joined the battle, more than twenty Holy Land Divines joined the battle as well. In an instant, the tables on the battlefield were turned around.","The Divine monsters, which had been a headache for everyone, were no longer a problem under the control of these Divines.","This was especially so for Longevity Faith, Moonfall, and Infinity Camp. They had sent their great elders as part of the Holy Land delegation, and all of their cultivations had already entered tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Although they were not at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, it was no different from the explosion of a nuclear bomb for the entire battlefield.","Soon, news from the higher-ups came down. Chu Yunfan, who was thought to have met with a mishap, not only returned safe and sound, but he had also brought back more than twenty Divines, which was enough to turn the situation around.","In an instant, the Federation soldiers in the hundreds of warships and countless mechas cheered.","Sure enough, with the addition of more than twenty Divines, the entire battle was reversed. The Divine monsters, which had been the biggest headache for everyone, could no longer interfere with them.","“I’ll leave the rest to you guys!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","Although he also wanted to stay, he knew that the most important thing was those who were lost in the deep sea ruins. Every minute and second was extremely important.","Then, his figure flickered and flew in the direction of the deep sea ruins.","“Use all your power to open up a path for Chief Chu!”","Under the command of the marshal in the leading warship, hundreds of other warships fired their main cannons at the same time. The extended fire landed in Chu Yunfan’s path, trying to clear a path for him to reach the deep sea ruins.","However, the marine race and the Infinite Demon Mountain clearly understood Chu Yunfan’s plan. Immediately, more and more monsters pounced toward him.","The aerial monsters in the sky seemed to have received some kind of order. They advanced wave after wave, forming groups and pouncing over.","It wasn’t just the aerial monsters in the sky, even the marine monsters seemed to have gone crazy. They all flew out of the water and opened their bloody jaws, trying to bite Chu Yunfan.","Although Chu Yunfan was high in the sky, these marine monsters had amazing jumping power. They could jump thousands of feet high in a single leap. Many mechas were bitten into pieces by them if they were not careful.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","Thunder power suddenly surged out from under his feet. It instantly turned his surroundings into a thunder domain, and countless thunder dragons surged within it.","The marine monsters that had pounced at Chu Yunfan were unable to touch him. They were charred black by the thunder dragons and fell heavily back into the sea.","Chu Yunfan was fast. While stepping on the thunder, he grabbed at the air and grabbed a handful of thunder energy. It turned into a long sword and threw out a sword light that filled the sky.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The aerial monsters that had caused so much trouble for the countless mechas were unable to get close to him. When they touched the sword light, they were directly cut into pieces.","Chu Yunfan’s attack was like a one-sided sweep. The difference in strength was too great, and nothing could stop him. Whether it was an Acquired or Innate aerial monster, the result was the same.","A single sword strike had swept away hundreds of them. It was simply terrifying.","In just a few moments, the line of defense formed by countless aerial and marine monsters, which originally prevented the Federation Army from advancing even an inch, had been penetrated by Chu Yunfan. They were unable to stop his advance even in the slightest.","At that moment, a huge creature emerged from the sea. It was a ferocious sea beast as large as a small mountain—an extremely powerful sea beast in the Divine Abilities Stage.","The beast opened its bloody jaws and a terrifying energy shot out from it, turning into a terrifying energy bomb that shot toward Chu Yunfan.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan coldly snorted and stomped his foot.","Suddenly, before the energy shot could touch him, it disappeared without a trace as if it had touched an invisible shield.","Chu Yunfan didn’t hold back either. He swung the thunderbolt sword in his hand, and wherever the sword light passed, the Divine beast was split into two.","Even Divine sea beasts were unable to withstand a single blow from him."]},{"number":1061,"title":"Chapter 1061 A Heaven-Shaking Sword Strike at the Critical Moment","paragraphs":["1061 A Heaven-Shaking Sword Strike at the Critical Moment","Chu Yunfan’s figure flickered a few times, and he entered the ruins.","The entire ruins seemed to have opened a bloody mouth. Upon entering the place, Chu Yunfan felt as if he had entered another world.","It wasn’t like he had entered the deep sea where he couldn’t see his fingers. Instead, it was filled with the chirping of birds and the fragrance of flowers. It was like a paradise on earth. He instantly understood that this was probably a sacred cave left behind by a powerful person.","The scale of this cave was truly shocking.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t in the mood to appreciate the scenery. His heart was filled with anxiety, and he rushed like the wind.","Not far from the entrance of the ruins, a man and a woman both covered in scales were guarding this area that everyone had to pass through to get deeper into the cave.","They possessed terrifying auras that no one dared to ignore. They were not only Divines but peerless Divines.","The two of them were well-known on the Internet because they were the ones who posted the photos and videos of Divine humans running away or dying.","Over the past few days, the two of them had gained a lot of fame in the Federation. Of course, this fame was of the notorious-kind, but they clearly did not care about that.","Suddenly, a figure flew out from the ruins in the distance and appeared before them.","When the figure saw them, they froze.","“D*mn it! How could this be? Rainbow Spirit Snake King! Tiger Shark King!” He immediately recognized the two.","The man with the majestic demeanor was none other than Tiger Shark King and the woman was Rainbow Spirit Snake King of the Rainbow Spirit Snake tribe.","In the past, the Federation didn’t know much about the marine tribe experts. However, after this period, they came to learn more.","Much of the information were released by the marine folks themselves and the humans suddenly realized that the marine folks had a terrifying number of experts. In terms of numbers and strength, they were far above the Federation.","The Federation had only been developing martial arts for the past few hundred years. On the other hand, the marine folks had existed for tens of thousands of years. Naturally, they could not be mentioned in the same breath.","“There’s actually a fish that escaped the net. Tsk, tsk!” Tiger Shark King sneered, stood up, and looked at the figure in front of him. “I’ve read about you. You’re the great ancestor of the Li clan, one of the so-called eight great families of the Federation.","“Tsk, tsk, you’re considered a hero in the Federation but here are plenty like you in the endless deep sea.”","Great Ancestor Li looked to be in a miserable state. He had just managed to escape after a bloody battle and had not expected to encounter these two super killer gods at the entrance.","Boom!","Tiger Shark King released a terrifying aura and said, “Leave this to me. I’ve been quite bored. The so-called number one expert that the Federation bragged about for half a day ended up with the so-called president disappearing. Even Chu Yunfan had died a long time ago. It’s so boring.","“Such a pity. If Chu Yunfan was here, I would wring his head off in front of those people. What bullsh*t number one expert of the Federation? It’s only when there are no tigers in the mountains that the monkeys become kings.”","Tiger Shark King was clearly let down. He felt it a pity that he couldn’t fight the two so-called top experts of the Federation.","‘Tier seven Divine!’","Great Ancestor Li eyebrows crept up. He felt as if he was facing a mountain. To the current Federation, a tier seven Divine was almost impossible to deal with.","As a Divine of the older generation, his cultivation had only barely crossed the fourth tier. As far as he knew, the great ancestors of the other Eight Greats were all in this rank.","To the Federation, this level was already considered extremely high. The reason why the Eigth Greats had not fallen was because they were strong enough.","However, against the entire Kunlun Realm, this power was not worth mentioning, especially in comparison to the marine folks which had many masters.","On the other side, the aura of Rainbow Spirit Snake King who had yet to make a move was no less than that of Tiger Shark King. She was definitely a ruthless character and could not be underestimated.","“I wanted to do it but since you said it first, I’ll leave it to you.” Rainbow Spirit Snake King sneered.","To kill all the humans, the marine folks had put in a lot of effort. Two tier seven Divine was were unknown figures among the marine folks, but they were arranged to guard the ruin entrance.","On the one hand, it was to prevent any fish from escaping. On the other hand, it was to prevent the human Federation Army from breaking in from the outside.","“But you’ll have to act quickly. Don’t waste too much time!” Rainbow Spirit Snake King laughed sinisterly. Her face which was covered in scales looked extremely ferocious.","“It won’t take long.”","Tiger Shark King was not the least bit worried about Great Ancestor Li. The man was no match for him at his peak, let alone now that he had been crippled.","Boom!","Great Ancestor Li made the first move. He didn’t have much of a choice in the face of two existences whose strength was far above his. He could only strike first.","He sent out a shocking sword rainbow. The sword light tore through the sky so dazzling that people couldn’t even look at it directly. It was simply too brilliant and terrifying.","The sword light swept toward Tiger Shark King but simply sneered and slapped his palm toward it.","Bam!","Tiger King Shark shattered the sky-splitting sword. It was unable to pose any threat to him.","“Useless. Human martial arts are so weak. How can a race that is not naturally suitable for cultivation occupy such a vast space?” Tiger Shark King grinned hideously, and his palm, which was covered in scales, suddenly slapped down.","Boom!","His palm expanded and in the blink of an eye, it grew to the size of a small mountain and slammed into Great Ancestor Li.","Great Ancestor Li, unable to keep up with Tiger Shark King’s speed, didn’t have time to defend himself. The gap between their cultivation levels was too big.","Great Ancester Li was sent flying with a single blow, and he spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body seemed to be falling apart. A large piece of flesh had been torn out of his chest.","He had been pierced through.","“This is so boring. The next move will take your life.” Tiger Shark King pouted and slapped down again.","Suddenly, just as Tiger Shark King was about to hit Great Ancestor Li, a shocking sword rainbow descended from the sky, turning into a terrifying light that chopped off Tiger Shark King’s hand."]},{"number":1062,"title":"Chapter 1062 Killing Tiger Shark King With One Punch","paragraphs":["1062 Killing Tiger Shark King With One Punch","This strike was shocking. Along with this shocking sword light, a huge scaled hand fell from the sky.","Boom!","The big hand ruthlessly smashed into the ground, setting off a wave of dust that was several feet high. Blood spurted out from the wound, quickly dyeing the entire ground red.","“Who’s there?!” Tiger Shark King clutched the spot where his hand had been cut off, his face full of shock.","!!","He saw a figure coming from afar on a flying light.","“How is this possible?” Tiger Shark King couldn’t see who it was but it should be impossible for anyone to come from that direction.","Although he didn’t step outside, he knew that there was a line of defense formed by the endless marine folks and demons of Infinite Demon Mountain at the ruins’ entrance, blocking the Federation’s reinforcements outside and not allowing them to enter.","It was impossible for even a Divine to break through the dense defense line.","At least, he wouldn’t have been able to do it. Not to mention that there were more than twenty Divine monsters outside. Breaking in was almost as difficult as ascending to the sky.","On top of that, almost all the Federation experts were already inside the ruins. There was no one else outside.","However, when he saw the identity of the person who came, he suddenly felt his hair stand on end. He couldn’t be mistaken. It was the number one expert of the Federation, Chu Yunfan, who he had just said was a pity that he had met with a mishap.","“Chu Yunfan!”","Great Ancestor Li, who came had already given up hope and thought he would surely die, also recognized the person. He didn’t expect to actually meet Chu Yunfan here.","He now had a chance of survival.","Chu Yunfan landed next to Great Ancestor Li and took out a healing pill from his pocket, handing it to Great Ancestor Li.","Great Ancestor Li quickly swallowed it and immediately felt the injuries in his body recover at a rapid speed.","He was shocked. At his level, the strength of his physical body was terrifying. It was difficult for ordinary missiles to hurt them. But it was also because of this that once they were seriously injured, ordinary means would not be able to do anything.","There were very few pills that could heal a Divine. The few pills he himself had prepared were accumulated over the years, and he had used them up in this battle. If not for that, he would not have been able to escape.","Upon swallowing the pill Chu Yunfan had given him, he realized that the effects of the pill were at least several times better than the ones he had collected. It was really a case of comparing goods to goods.","He vowed to forever remember this favor. If he did not favor Chu Yunfan before, his opinion had completely changed now.","Great Ancestor Li barely managed to get to his feet. He wanted to fight alongside Chu Yunfan. He knew all too well how terrifying Tiger Shark King and Rainbow Spirit Snake King were. Even with his strength, he couldn’t last more than a few moves against Tiger Shark King. It was easy to imagine how amazing they were.","However, Chu Yunfan clearly was not of the same opinion and said, “Since you’re injured, you should recuperate first. There’s no need for you to deal with these little rascals, my comrade.”","Great Ancestor Li was shocked when he heard this. However, thinking about that shocking sword light from before, he didn’t reject Chu Yunfan.","“Be careful.” was all Great Ancestor Li said.","Opposite him, Tiger Shark King was extremely angry after hearing Chu Yunfan’s words. Chu Yunfan had not even an inch of regard for them.","“This is good. Chu Yunfan, I was very regretful before that I couldn’t twist your head off myself, but now I have the chance.” Tiger Shark King formed a hand seal and activated all the divine power in his body.","A new hand quickly grew out of the part where his arm had been severed. It was exactly the same as the previous one.","This race’s self-regeneration ability was truly powerful and terrifying. This was no longer within the scope of divine abilities because even Chu Yunfan couldn’t regrow a severed hand so easily. This was the innate ability of their species.","“Were you two the ones who posted those videos and photos?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s right, we did it. Tsk, tsk, I think humans are about to be completely annihilated. Just in time. I’ll kill you and round up the numbers!” Tiger Shark King said with a sinister smile.","“The marine folks have suddenly united. There must be someone behind this. Who is that person?” Chu Yunfan asked indifferently.","“Hahahaha! Chu Yunfan, do you think I’d tell you?” Tiger Shark King said with a cold smile. “You humans have occupied such a large area of the Kunlun Realm. It’s time to spit it out. There’s only one end for you, and that’s death.”","“Since you’re not going to tell me, then there’s no use in keeping you alive,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, Tiger Shark King made the first move and launched an attack. With a long roar like a fierce tiger roaring toward the sky, he slammed his palm down. The terrifying strike intent turned into an incomparably terrifying tiger shark. It was hundreds of feet in size, and almost instantly drowned Chu Yunfan.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t even try to dodge as if he didn’t even have the time to react.","“Oh no!”","Great Ancestor Li instantly knew that this was bad. Chu Yunfan was simply too arrogant.","Just as he was about to go to the rescue, he suddenly discovered that the tiger shark that was about to swallow Chu Yunfan whole was beginning to crack inch by inch as if it had hit an iron plate. When it touched the three-inch strong wind around Chu Yunfan’s body, it began to shatter, unable to get close to Chu Yunfan’s body.","Boom!","Immediately after, the tiger shark formed by the strike intent crumbled.","It couldn’t cause even the slightest damage to Chu Yunfan!","“My turn!” Chu Yunfan shouted. His entire body emitted a terrifying light, and the light tore the sky apart. Then, he clenched his five fingers into a fist, and suddenly, countless fist forces spewed out from the gaps between his fingers as he punched out.","Boom!","The terrifying power burst out and cut across the sky.","“Sh*t!”","Tiger Shark King instantly realized that something was wrong. His cultivation had already entered tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage, which was considered very powerful in the current world.","However, it was still useless. In front of Chu Yunfan’s fist force, it seemed to be nothing.","Tiger Shark King crossed his arms across his chest. His arms glowed with boundless light and the endless divine power within him began to boil.","He immediately formed a barrier to protect himself.","Boom!","A loud muffled groan was accompanied by the sound of metal clashing. Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through the barrier and pierced through Tiger Shark King’s chest.","Spurt!","Blood poured out, and Tiger Shark King was sent flying.","He was dead, and it was only one punch.","..."]},{"number":1063,"title":"Chapter 1063 Slaying Rainbow Spirit Snake King, Invincible!","paragraphs":["1063 Slaying Rainbow Spirit Snake King, Invincible!","Great Ancestor Li was dumbfounded.","The fact that Chu Yunfan had killed Tiger Shark King with a single punch had completely overturned his world views.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was naturally above his. This was something Great Ancestor Li had known a long time ago. Back then, Great Ancestor Jiang had been on the same level as him, but Great Ancestor Jiang had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Therefore, it was normal for Chu Yunfan to be stronger than him.","But in his impression, Chu Yunfan was at most at tier five or six of the Divine Abilities Stage. Even so, it was very impressive.","Not that much time had passed since Chu Yunfan had killed Great Ancestor Jiang, so it was a miracle that he had cultivated to tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan’s current performance told him that all of his previous assumptions were wrong. Chu Yunfan’s strength was clearly far beyond their expectations.","Even a tier seven Divine was no match for Chu Yunfan and got blown away. It was hard to imagine how powerful he had become.","What kind of fortuitous encounter had he obtained in the time he had disappeared?","Great Ancestor Li didn’t dare to imagine it. However, he wasn’t surprised. He too also had fortuitous encounters and his cultivation had advanced by leaps and bounds because of them.","On the other side, Rainbow Spirit Snake King’s expression suddenly became solemn. Previously, she had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously. The so-called number one expert of the Federation was just a monkey on a mountain without tigers. It was because the Federation did not have many experts.","This was something that was publicly acknowledged.","Who would have thought that the Fderation’s number one expert was not only worthy of his name, but even more terrifying than the rumors.","“It’s your turn next.” Chu Yunfan looked at Rainbow Spirit Snake King, and his aura burst out. It was as terrifying as a tsunami.","Great Ancestor Li felt his blood boil and his heart surge with emotions. At the critical moment, Chu Yunfan had saved his life. Now, it seemed that there was hope for him to save the others and the Federation.","Great Ancestor Li wasn’t a fool. He knew that after this incident, the marine folks would launch a large-scale attack on the Federation. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have taken the risk of completely falling out with the Federation and scheme against them.","Rainbow Spirit Snake King made her move. She was extremely fast, and in just a moment, she was already in front of Chu Yunfan. She was like a black bolt of lightning.","A huge explosion was heard. All kinds of terrifying thunderbolts interweaved and boiled. A sword had appeared in her hand and it carried an unimaginable sword light. The sword slashed down.","Bam!","The sword light landed on Chu Yunfan’s body.","Suddenly, the sound of metal clashing rang out, and the sword light created a burst of sparks on his body as if it had hit a piece of gold.","There was a dense black aura on the sword light. It was a deadly poison that was refined from Rainbow Spirit Snake King’s body and integrated into her sword. Even a Divine would die if they were touched by it. It was extremely terrifying.","It was because of this that she had the confidence to fight against Chu Yunfan and did not choose to run away. However, she never expected that she would not be able to hurt Chu Yunfan even in the slightest.","It couldn’t even break Chu Yunfan’s protective energy barrier. When it hit his body, it was as if the sword light had hit gold and iron.","This was absolutely terrifying.","“What is this physique?!” Rainbow Spirit Snake King was shocked. Even the marine folks’s Divine monsters would not be able to take on her sword without any scruples.","But Chu Yunfan had somehow done it.","Chu Yunfan stared at her, and she felt as if she was being stared at by an ancient fierce beast. She could feel the hair on her back stand on end.","“D*mn it!”","Rainbow Spirit Snake King immediately decided to take action. The long sword in her hand was no longer as strange as before. Instead, it filled the sky with countless sword lights. Each of them contained extremely terrifying power, tearing apart the sky and turning into sword shadows that covered the sky, enveloping Chu Yunfan within.","However, the moment these sword lights touched Chu Yunfan, they were all killed by a terrifying force and instantly turned into nothingness, unable to cause any damage to him.","Rainbow Spirit Snake King began to retreat. Her speed of retreat was extremely fast, like a bolt of lightning.","However, even though she was fast, Chu Yunfan was even faster. In the blink of an eye, he had already caught up with her.","Then, Chu Yunfan raised his arm up high and countless thunderbolts condensed together, turning into a terrifying thunderbolt spear. The spear flew through the air as it was thrown out.","Whoosh!”","The spear struck down like a bolt of lightning. Rainbow Spirit Snake King wanted to dodge, but at that moment, she felt as if a terrifying intent had locked onto her. There was no way for her to escape and she could only choose to meet this terrifying attack head-on.","Boom!","The terrifying thunder spear struck Rainbow Spirit Snake King’s body.","The barrier around her body was instantly obliterated, unable to withstand the attack.","Stab!","The spear nailed her to the ground without any resistance.","Everything happened so quickly that even Great Ancestor Li, using his spiritual eyes, couldn’t keep up with the speed of their battle. He only saw the result when the spear nailed Rainbow Spirit Snake King to the ground.","He couldn’t help but take a deep breath. He had clearly seen the spear penetrate Rainbow Spirit Snake King’s heart. Even a Divine was a mortal at the end of the day. If their heart was pierced, they would die.","As expected, Rainbow Spirit Snake King inhaled and exhaled a few deep breaths before dying.","Everything had come to an end and Great Ancestor Li had a look of disbelief on his face as if he had never imagined everything to happen like a beautiful dream.","When he was on the brink of death, he thought he was a dead man. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would appear out of nowhere and save him?","And Chu Yunfan had killed Tiger Shark King and Rainbow Spirit Snake King with lightning speed. The entire process was extremely fast. It took mere moments for the two of them to be completely annihilated.","Either one of these two could sweep through and stir up chaos in the Federation, but they had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands without a sound.","They were like two unimportant minions.","At that moment, in the eyes of Great Ancestor Li, Chu Yunfan was like a god.","He was invincible."]},{"number":1064,"title":"Chapter 1064 Creating a Stir on the Internet","paragraphs":["1064 Creating a Stir on the Internet","After easily killing the two Divine marine folks experts, Chu Yunfan took a photo of their bodies and uploaded it to the Internet.","And there was only one caption, “I’m back, you b*stards. Are you ready?”","After posting these photos, Chu Yunfan turned to look at Great Ancestor Li.","“Thank you for saving my life, Chief Chu,” Great Ancestor Li said as he bowed deeply. He was still in shock and felt like he had just escaped death.","!!","Whether it was Tiger Shark King or Rainbow Spirit Snake King, any one of them could have easily taken his life.","“No need to thank me. It was a small matter,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan’s answer made Great Ancestor Li purse his lips, not knowing what to say. To him, those two indeed had been mortal enemies that almost cost him his life, but to Chu Yunfan, it was as easy as lifting a finger. He had casually killed two masters.","Great Ancestor Li didn’t know what to say.","“No matter what, thank you for saving my life, Chief Chu. In the future, if you need m help, I’ll go through hell and high water, even if it costs me ten thousand lives,” Great Ancestor Li solemnly promised, “Have the Federation Army reinforcements arrived?”","With his intelligence, it was not difficult for him to guess that the Federation would not sit idly by and would send a large army to rescue the many experts trapped here.","This was the most likely possibility. The Federation couldn’t be compared to Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks in terms of top experts. However, in terms of the military power, it was above Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","“That’s right. The Federation Army are outside but Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks are desperately trying to stop them. The Federation Army is unable to break through the defense line, so I’m the only one here to provide support,” Chu Yunfan said.","Great Ancestor Li nodded. He could imagine that Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks would definitely do their best to kill those within the ruins. It was impossible for them to give up halfway so easily.","“It’s enough. You alone is worth thousands of troops, Chief Chu,” Great Ancestor Li said.","“Let’s not talk about that for now. Do you know what’s the situation of the others?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I don’t as we didn’t come in together. Later on, we were quickly separated and were forced to run for our lives, so we didn’t keep in contact,” Great Ancestor Li said with a bitter smile. At that time, they had to flee for their own lives, so how could they have the time to care about others?","It wasn’t that they hadn’t tried to gather together, but it was useless. The experts of Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks were much higher in both quantity and quality than them, and they were ultimately scattered.","It was clear that the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain didn’t want them to gather together. They wanted to separate and kill them one by one.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was grave. It was clear that the situation was worse than he had imagined.","“But I crossed paths with Chu Haoyue and the others. They fled in that direction. If you follow it, there should be hope,” Great Ancestor Li said as he pointed.","“What I want to know now is that was it the Great Ancestor Liu who brought you in here?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s right. That d*mned traitor!” Great Ancestor Li gritted his teeth. When he thought about how he had been betrayed, he wanted to tear Great Ancestor Liu into pieces.","“We came here because we received information from him. Who knew that this would be a trap? He betrayed the Federation and colluded with the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain.”","Then, Great Ancestor Li told Chu Yunfan about what had happened.","On that day, Great Ancestor Liu discovered these ruins and invited many experts from inside and outside the Federation to come together.","Who knew that it would turn out to be a trap? Or rather, no one ever imagined that Great Ancestor Li would lie to them. After all, he was well-known throughout the Federation and had made countless outstanding contributions.","No one would have thought that such a person would choose to betray the Federation.","‘It seems that I’m right,’ Chu Yunfan thought. Fortunately, he had already ordered a full investigation of the Liu clan before he came here. He would soon find out how many problems there were.","“In that case, I won’t say anything more. You can get out of first, but there are fierce beasts of the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain everywhere outside. Be very careful,” Chu Yunfan said.","Great Ancestor Li nodded and didn’t say anything more. He knew his current situation all too well. Although he had recovered a little, he wasn’t at his peak. If he continued fighting, it would be too much of a stretch.","However, if it was just ordinary beasts, he was not afraid. The difference between Divine, Innate, and Acquired monsters was huge. As long as he was careful, he would be fine even if he was in a chaotic battlefield.","After bidding farewell to Great Ancestor Li, Chu Yunfan immediately flew in the direction that Great Ancestor Li had pointed out.","At this time, the entire Internet was in an uproar. The two photos that Chu Yunfan had posted were undoubtedly the photos of the two unparalleled experts of the marine folks.","One had been killed in an attack, while the other was nailed to the ground by a thunder spear.","As soon as these two photos were released, it immediately caused a sensation. These two experts had been constantly releasing photos and videos of the various tragic situations of humans for the past few days. They had long become a household name. Countless people hated them, but they had no choice.","To the current Federation, a tier-seven Divine was a mythical level expert that they could not deal with. One of such experts was enough to turn the Federation upside down, let alone two.","But now, these two had died one after another When the photos were posted, it immediately caused a huge uproar.","Humanity’s morale soared. Countless people watched with great satisfaction and felt extremely happy. They’ve long had enough of these two arrogant and despotic faces.","However, there were still many people who expressed their doubts and felt that this was simply impossible.","After all, in the current Federation, there shouldn’t be anyone who could contend with the existence of these two experts, let alone kill them both.","The marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain who had accounts on the Internet were jumping up and down, laughing at the Federation for being at their wits end and photoshoping photos to comfort themselves. It could be said that they were extremely arrogant for a while.","However, a technical expert quickly pointed out that these were not photoshopped photos because there was no trace of such tampering.","However, the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain were still unyielding. Even if the photos weren’t photoshopped, it was possible that the content was fake. Maybe the humans had made fake models of the two experts.","It was not until someone noticed that the account that had posted these two photos was actually the account of the Federation’s number one expert, Chu Yunfan, that there was a sudden silence."]},{"number":1065,"title":"Chapter 1065 Face-Smacking Infinite Demon Mountain","paragraphs":["1065 Face-Smacking Infinite Demon Mountain","In the beginning, everyone’s attention was on the authenticity of these two photos. After a while, someone noticed that the person who posted the photos was none other than Chu Yunfan.","In the past few months, the Federation had only just accepted the fact that Chu Yunfan had met with an accident. But suddenly, he made a new post.","Everyone’s first reaction was that it was unbelievable, but they soon realized that something was wrong, because in this era of the Internet, there was no such thing as hacking accounts.","The reason was simple. The Internet was connected to the human brain and only the account holder could log into the account.","Once the person died, it would be impossible to log into their account. Therefore, if the account was being used, there was only one possibility—Chu Yunfan himself was posting the photos.","As soon as the news came out, there was an uproar. Some people didn’t want to believe that he was still alive, but soon, Special Ops came forward to refute the rumors. The person who used Chu Yunfan’s account was indeed Chief Chu himself.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t dead!","This news spread through Federation like a tsunami. Especially in the past few days where everyone was paying attention to the battle situation in the ruins. Everyone understood what kind of disaster it would be for the Federation if all the human experts were annihilated.","Although the Federation didn’t rely on many Divines and relied on various high-tech weapons to sweep through the battlefield, without a Divine to hold the fort, they would be at a complete disadvantage in the confrontation with Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","And at this critical moment, Chu Yunfan returned. And the moment he returned, he instantly exterminated two experts who made the Federation gnash their teeth in hatred.","Soon, after confirming Chu Yunfan’s return, Special Ops announced another piece of news.","Previously, Chu Yunfan’s so-called mishap was not really a mishap, but he had gone to the Holy Land. He had successfully convinced the Holy Land to join hands with the Federation and brought back more than twenty Divines who had now joined the battlefield.","It was only a matter of time before they broke through Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks’s blockade.","As soon as this announcement was made, the Federation was in an uproar. Everyone knew that the Federation was in a passive position on the battlefield of the ruins.","Because there were no Divines to oversee the battlefield, the Federation was forced to take a passive position.","Now that Chu Yunfan had brought more than twenty experts from the Holy Lands with him, it was enough to turn the situation around.","Besides, the Holy Land was not new news. Everyone knew that the Holy Land was very powerful and had many experts. Their participation would certainly make the Federation stronger.","The establishment of such a huge alliance greatly increased Chu Yunfan’s reputation, and the hope of the Federation was saved from being extinguished.","In the face of such a situation, the Infinite Demon Mountain and marine folk experts who had been clamoring earlier seemed to have been beaten senseless.","No one had expected Chu Yunfan to reappear when everyone thought that he had already died, and that he would immediately take away two of the marine folks’s Divines.","It was like a heavy hammer had fell on their heads.","However, after a short silence, the marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain began to jump up and down.","“The so-called Federation number one is nothing more than this!”","“He’s just a monkey pretending to be a king where there are not tigers. If he dares to appear in front of the marine folks’s top experts, he’ll die!”","“Now that he has entered the ruins, he’s dead for sure! He won’t escape!”","This arrogant behavior naturally caused countless people to criticize them, but because they were separated by the Internet, they could not really do anything to these people.","Although the Internet was developed by humans, there were many marine folks and demons who had intelligence no less than that of humans. Naturally, they could find a way to access the Internet.","At this time, Chu Yunfan didn’t know that the Internet had been turned upside down, To him, the most important thing was to save Chu Haoyue and the others.","His divine will was completely released, and the vast surrounding land was under his control. However, the ruins were too large. So large that it was like a small continent.","But it was also because of this that the Federation experts had room to escape. Otherwise, they would have died in the hands of these people.","While he was searching, two aerial monsters flew over from a distance. These two monsters had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage. Their bodies were as huge as small mountains.","Soon, they spotted Chu Yunfan and their eyes lit up. They regarded Chu Yunfan as their prey and immediately pounced on him like two bolts of lightning.","Although they were extremely huge, they were extremely fast.","“I’ll kill you!”","Facing these two flying beasts, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He took a step forward and simply stepped on them.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s foot landed on the body of one of the monsters. It felt as if it had been struck by lightning and let out a blood-curdling screech as its entire body was instantly torn apart.","A Divine monster’s body was extremely strong, but against Chu Yunfan, it had no power to fight back. With just one step, it was stomped into two.","The other one saw this and was instantly scared out of its wits. It frantically flapped its wings, trying to escape from Chu Yunfan’s grasp.","However, how could Chu Yunfan give it the chance to do so? He grabbed at the air and a mass of thunder energy appeared in his hand. It suddenly turned into a thunder spear, and then, he threw it out.","Stab!","The monster screamed as it was nailed to the ground. It struggled for a while before it stopped breathing and died.","Chu Yunfan didn’t forget to take photos and post them on the Internet. The caption was also only two words—Four Heads!","His words caused a huge uproar on the Internet. Just a moment ago, Infinite Demon Mountain had posted a picture of a human expert that had been nailed to death on a mountain peak.","It was an old man in his sixties wearing a Daoist robe. Some people identified him as the abbot of the White Dragon Abbey in the Outskirt Territories.","Although White Dragon Temple wasn’t a force within the Federation, they had great influence in the Outskirt Territories and was usually on good terms with the Federation. But now, he had been killed and nailed to a mountain peak.","While Infinite Demon Mountain was jumping up and down to provoke the humans again, Chu Yunfan’s two photos were like two tight slaps to their faces."]},{"number":1066,"title":"Chapter 1066 Chu Haoyue’s Desperate Situation","paragraphs":["1066 Chu Haoyue’s Desperate Situation","Although Chu Yunfan’s original intention of posting these two photos was not to slap Infinite Demon Mountain in the face, it had the effect.","Infinite Demon Mountain had just released a photo of the dead abbot of White Dragon Abbey who was well-known throughout the Federation.","As soon as this photo was released, White Dragon Abbey in the Outskirt Territories was in tears. They couldn’t imagine that their abbot had died in the ruins, and it was such a meaningless and tragic death.","The Federation was completely speechless. This was not the first time in the past few days that Chu Yunfan had appeared when they were unable to retaliate.","!!","The two photos and the death of two powerful aerial monsters from Infinite Demon Mountain were a slap to Infinite Demon Mountain.","In particular, the demons’ actions were clearly to damage the morale of the Federation, and now Chu Yunfan’s photos had boosted the morale of the Federation. It was true that some of the Federation’s experts had died in their hands, but so what? The Federation would soon return the favor.","The demons had killed one Fderation expert but had lost two of their own. No matter how one looked at it, it could not be considered a successful deal.","After the demons were speechless for a moment, they grew even more furious. Ever since Chu Yunfan returned, they found that everything was slipping out of their control. Their previous plan to suppress the Federation’ morale seemed to have failed.","Chu Yunfan had also become a must-kill target for Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks, not only because of his identity as the Federation’s number one expert, but also because he had killed four Divines without any restraint.","At this time, in the depths of the ruins, three figures flew across the sky at a rapid speed. Their bodies were stained with blood, but it was not their own. It was three tall members of the marine folks.","All three of them were equally famous among the marine folks.","At this time, they formed a triangle and began to search as if they were searching for someone.","In the middle of a mountain range, two figures were fleeing at full speed. They did not dare to fly across the sky.","One of them was an old man in ragged clothes while the other was a young man in his twenties.","There was a large hole in the old man’s chest and blood would flow out from it from time to time.","The young man’s condition was only slightly better but his left arm had disappeared. It had been cut off.","These two people were none other than Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue.","“You’re in a much better situation than I am. The three of them are getting closer and closer. It’s impossible for us to escape. I’ll cover your escape.” Great Ancestor Chu stopped in his tracks and looked at Chu Haoyue seriously.","“Great Ancestor, what are you saying? This isn’t the time to joke around. Even if one of us has to stay behind to cover the escape, I should be the one to do it. Our clan and the Federation can do without me, but we can’t do without you, Great Ancestor!” Chu Haoyue instantly dismissed this idea.","“What nonsense are you saying?” Great Ancestor Chu said, “You’ve seen my injuries. If I don’t find a place to recuperate, I’ll be dead. But in the ruins, where can we do that? Those three vicious dogs are chasing us, where can we escape to?","“There’s no hope for me, but you’re different. You’re young and talented. You’re our clan’s and the Federation’s future hope.”","Great Ancestor Chu looked at Chu Haoyue. Although Chu Haoyue had lost an arm, it was not a life-threatening injury. For Divines like them, this sort of injury was the least of their concerns.","“Even if I survive, how many more years will I be able to live? The future of the clan is still dependant on you.”","Great Ancestor Chu had already thought it through. If the two of them continued to run, the only result would be that neither of them could escape. The three behind them were getting closer and closer, and someone had to stay behind to slow them down.","Otherwise, neither of them would be able to escape.","In that case, he was the most suitable candidate. Since he wouldn’t live for many more years, he might as well fight for Chu Haoyue’s life.","Of the two most talented people in the Chu clan, Chu Yunfan had already met with a mishap a few months ago after being plotted against. Now, there was only Chu Haoyue left. If he was buried here, then the entire Chu clan would be finished.","He had to protect the Chu clan’s and the Federation’s last hope.","“Great Ancestor, no. How far would I be able to run? Although the ruins is large, there’s nowhere for us to escape,” Chu Haoyue said in disagreement.","“There’s no other way. I have a secret technique that can temporarily activate all the qi and blood in my body to recover to the peak. I believe I can hold the three of them back and find a way to seriously injure them., Maybe even take one of them away to relieve the pressure on you,” Great Ancestor Chu said with a solemn expression.","However, before Chu Haoyue could argue, his and Great Ancestor Chu’s faces fell. They didn’t know when, but three figures had appeared beside them.","“I didn’t expect you to be here. Tsk, tsk. Still arguing about who will stay behind to cover the retreat? I don’t think any of you will be able to leave, hahaha!” one of the three figures spoke, and the three of them surrounded Chu Haoyue and Great Ancestor Chu.","Although the three figures were humanoid in shape, they didn’t have human heads. Instead, they had the heads of dogs.","They had the heads of dogs and the bodies of humans. The three of them had strong bodies and were more than two meters tall. Each of them was famous for their ferocity in the deep sea.","It was obvious that Chu Haoyue and Great Ancestor Chu had noticed these three strong creatures with dog heads and human bodies.","“The Hell Seal Brothers!” Great Ancestor Chu called out their identity.","During this period, the two of them had fought against the Hell Seal Brothers a few times. Of course, they were the ones who were beaten up and forced to run away.","However, during this process, he also found out the identity of these three people. They came from a marine tribe called the Hell Seal tribe. In that tribe, these three brothers were regarded as high and mighty gods.","The three brothers had an extremely sharp sense of smell. No matter how they tried to escape, it was useless. They would be caught by the three of them in the end. This feeling almost made them despair.","“It seems like we have no other choice. We can only fight!” Great Ancestor Chu said. He had already understood that he had no choice but to fight with his back to the water.","“Yes. But even if I die, I’ll let them be buried with me!” Chu Haoyue’s eyes flickered with a sharp light as he shouted."]},{"number":1067,"title":"Chapter 1067 Welcome, Mighty Chu! All Power to Mighty Chu!","paragraphs":["1067 Welcome, Mighty Chu! All Power to Mighty Chu!","“Hahaha, just you guys?” the leader of the Hell Seal Brothers laughed out loud.","As if they had heard the funniest joke in the world, the Hell Seal Brothers burst out laughing.","In their eyes, Chu Haoyue wanted them to die with Great Ancestor Chu. Wasn’t that funny?","He simply didn’t know his place.","At this moment, a spherical camera appeared around the Hell Seal Brothers and began to film the entire scene.","“I heard that live streaming is very popular among you humans. Now, I’ll do a live broadcast and let the humans see how you two die!”","The second Hell Seal Brother said.","“Detestable!”","Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue naturally understood the Hell Seal Brothers’ purpose. The brothers intended to broadcast their deaths to the whole world. At that time, it would be a blow to the Federation’s morale.","“It’s a pity that your Chu Yunfan isn’t here and I can’t kill him with my own hands. What a pity,” the third brother said regretfully.","“If he’s here, you’d all be dead!” Chu Haoyue said.","“Hahahaha, your so-called number one human expert is just a joke!” The eldest brother laughed maliciously, clearly not taking Chu Haoyue’s words to heart.","The Federation’s weakness in martial arts made the brothers look down on the so-called number-one expert of the Federation.","At this time, a live stream was started. Not long after, millions of people poured in. All of them saw the tragic state Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue were in through the camera and were shocked.","These two people were highly respected in the Federation, but now they were being hunted down.","Seeing that enough people had entered, the eldest brother said, “In front of us are the two leaders of the Chu clan, one of the eight great families of the human race. Haha, they’re going to die here!”","The entire screen was filled with countless comments pouring in at an astonishing speed. Countless people were in a frenzy, but they couldn’t help. They could only watch as the two great experts were killed.","“Hell Seal Brothers, do you dare to announce your coordinates?”","Unknown when it started, but the entire public chat was filled with this one sentence. It was as if all the other voices had disappeared.","“What’s there to be afraid of?”","The eldest brother sneered and reported their coordinates.","“What? Can your guided missiles reach this place? What a joke.”","The marine folks and the demons’ allied army had the ruins heavily surrounded. It would be a joke for the Federation to manage to attack this place.","Even if they did, it would be a long time from now and the two people here would have died long ago.","After the eldest brother reported his coordinates, the comments on the public screen changed completely.","“Chu Yunfan will reach the battlefield in three seconds!”","“High energy alert!”","“I’m waiting for these three brothers to be beaten to death!”","“You guys are dead!”","The Hell Seal Brothers didn’t understand why the viewers were suddenly so positive. Shouldn’t they be crying and shouting or cursing?","Why did it feel like something was wrong?","As for that Chu Yunfan, wasn’t he already dead?","The Hell Seal Brothers didn’t quite understand what was going on. Why was the whole thing so different from what they had expected? The entire chat seemed to be in a jubilant mood.","The Hell Seal Brothers were dumbfounded. They couldn’t understand what was going on.","Suddenly, the second brother took out an arm from the void, and Chu Haoyue’s eyes flashed with killing intent. The arm was his, which had been cut off by the Hell Seal Brothers earlier.","“Tsk, tsk. Don’t you want your arm back?” The second brother coldly looked at Chu Haoyue.","“If you want it, you can have it!” Chu Haoyue said through gritted teeth.","“Hahaha, since you don’t want it, I’ll eat it then!” The second brother laughed maliciously.","After saying that, he opened his mouth and was about to swallow the arm.","At that moment, a terrifying aura flew over and seized the arm.","“Who’s there?!” The second brother immediately felt a sense of danger and looked ahead.","It was a young man in his twenties. He wore a black robe and looked extraordinary.","Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","At this time, the entire chat of the live stream was boiling.","“Hahaha, as expected. He reached the battlefield in three seconds!”","“It’s over. The Hell Seal Brothers are going to be beaten to sh*t!”","“You brought this upon yourself!”","“Welcome, Mighty Chu! All power to Mighty Chu!”","“Welcome, Mighty Chu! All power to Mighty Chu!”","“Welcome, Mighty Chu! All power to Mighty Chu!”","The entire chat was flooded with that one sentence. Everyone was extremely excited. After these few days of depression and despair, there was finally a ray of light.","Chu Yunfan held the arm. The arm was still alive. Although it had been cut off a few days ago, the physical vitality of a Divine was naturally not comparable to that of ordinary living beings.","Chu Yunfan threw the arm to Chu Haoyue, who was in a state of complete shock. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to appear.","In his impression, shouldn’t Chu Yunfan be dead?","...","Back then, the matter was so big that even he and Great Ancestor Chu had to personally go to Special Ops to question them. He had seen the evidence presented by Special Ops. Chu Yunfan had indeed been plotted against and met with a mishap.","However, just when everyone was in despair, Chu Yunfan suddenly appeared.","On the other hand, Great Ancestor Chu was overjoyed. He had lamented the loss of the most promising genius of the family the most, but the genius had reappeared.","“Thank God you’re alive. Thank God!”","Suddenly, Great Ancestor Chu seemed to have thought of something and quickly said, “Yunfan, be careful! Those three brothers have a joint attack.”","He recalled the terrifying attack from the Hell Seal Brothers. He and Chu Haoyue couldn’t stop it even when they joined forces. After that, they could only flee. A big hole had been blasted through his chest and Chu Haoyue’s arm had been cut off.","“It’s fine, they’re just clowns. We’ll talk once I’ve killed them,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly. He didn’t take the Hell Seal Brothers to heart.","“Such great courage!”","The Hell Seal Brothers also recognized Chu Yunfan, and their eyes shone with a terrifying light.","The three of them made their move. Their auras merged into one and they pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","..."]},{"number":1068,"title":"Chapter 1068 Instantly Killing the Hell Seal Brothers","paragraphs":["1068 Instantly Killing the Hell Seal Brothers","The three of them had been working together for a long time, and it was clear that this was not their first time.","Any one of the three brothers had strength that exceeded tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage, and the eldest of the Hell Seal Brothers had even entered tier five.","The energy exuded by the three of them together exceeded that of a tier-seven Divine. It was an extremely brilliant joint attack technique, and only the three brothers, who were connected by blood, could use it through their mental connection.","Boom!","!!","The atmosphere boiled, forming an overwhelming pressure that swept in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Boom!","The joint attack landed on Chu Yunfan, but it instantly crumbled, unable to cause any damage to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan then made his move. With just one step forward, all these attacks were completely nullified.","“Again!”","The Hell Seal Brothers looked at each other and immediately launched another attack. The three of them joined forces and turned into a huge sea beast. It opened its bloody maw and pounced in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","“You’re courting death.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly, clenched his fist, and threw a punch.","Boom!","The Hell Seal Brothers’ second attack was also instantly scattered, unable to withstand Chu Yunfan’s fist force.","The Hell Seal Brothers were shocked. Their attacks couldn’t even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","With the three of them working together, they could even fight against a tier-seven Divine and not be at a disadvantage.","Only now did they realize that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above tier seven, which was even more terrifying.","“How is he so strong?!”","Only now did they realize that their previous speculations about Chu Yunfan’s strength were completely off the mark.","In their previous deduction, Chu Yunfan entering tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage would already be considered extremely impressive. However, they now realized that they were completely wrong.","The brothers were shocked and angry, and they immediately pounced toward Chu Yunfan again.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, didn’t move an inch. He simply retracted his fist to his abdomen and threw another punch. At that moment, the shadow of a golden asura appeared behind him, and this golden asura also threw a punch.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The brothers let out a blood-curdling screech as they were sent flying. They were like kites with their strings cut, each of them coughing up blood.","The viewers in the live stream were completely shocked. Even though they were very confident in Chu Yunfan, they were still dumbfounded by the scene in front of them.","Chu Yunfan had easily injured the notorious Hell Seal Brothers.","“He... He’s way too strong!”","“Mighty Chu is mighty. He’s so powerful!”","“Mighty Chu is the idol of my generation. When will I be able to reach a tenth of his power?”","“With Mighty Chu here, it’s impossible for those marine folks and demons to be so arrogant!”","Soon, the chat was filled with one sentence.","“Mighty Chu is mighty and domineering!”","On the battlefield, everything happened in the time it took for a spark to fly off a piece of flint. It had already happened before anyone could expect it.","An indescribable expression flashed across Chu Haoyue’s face. He realized that Chu Yunfan was stronger than before, and it wasn’t just by a little bit. Chu Yunfan was so strong that he himself was no longer a match for Chu Yunfan.","Great Ancestor Chu, on the other hand, had a relieved expression on his face. He immediately sat down cross-legged and began to recuperate. He believed that with Chu Yunfan around, the Hell Seal Brothers would not be able to turn the tables.","Previously, he was afraid that Chu Yunfan would not be a match for the brothers. Only now did he realize that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","He couldn’t delay his recuperation any longer. Otherwise, he would surely die.","The Hell Seal Brothers were sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s punch. They felt their internal organs tremble and an unprecedented fear rose in their hearts. They seemed to come to a tacit understanding as they fled in all directions.","“Trying to escape now?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He grabbed at the air, and a mass of thunder energy flooded into his hand, which then turned into a long sword.","Swoosh!","He leaped out using thunder energy and instantly appeared in front of the eldest of the Hell Seal Brothers.","“Sh*t!”","The eldest brother instantly knew that something was wrong, but it was already too late. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to catch up to him so quickly. It was as if a sword light had torn the sky apart and swept across him.","Slash!","The eldest brother was split in half and his body fell to the ground like a stone.","After killing the eldest brother, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He stomped his feet and instantly caught up with the third brother who was running away.","The third brother immediately sensed that Chu Yunfan was chasing after him and was instantly scared out of his wits. He had not expected his eldest brother to be so useless. The eldest couldn’t even withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan and had been killed.","The third brother turned around and transformed into his true form. He looked like a seal from hell, and he pounced at Chu Yunfan.","Slash!","However, his ending was no different from the eldest brother’s. He too was instantly torn apart by the sword light.","His huge body, which was like a small mountain, fell to the ground. The ground shook violently, and a huge pit was formed.","At this time, the second brother had already run far away and could no longer sense Chu Yunfan’s aura. However, he didn’t even have the time to let out a sigh of relief before he suddenly felt a terrifying aura rushing toward him.","Chu Yunfan had revealed a pair of thunder wings on his back, and in an instant, had caught up with the second brother.","...","“How are you so fast?!” The second brother was instantly horrified as if he had seen a devil from hell.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan took a step forward, and the second brother felt as if a divine elephant was trampling on him.","Chu Yunfan kicked the second brother toward the ground.","Bam!","The second brother crashed into the ground, creating a huge crater. All the bones in his body had shattered. Before he could react, a thunder spear fell from the sky and nailed him to the ground. He died a tragic death."]},{"number":1069,"title":"Chapter 1069 Another Face-Smacking","paragraphs":["1069 Another Face-Smacking","All of this took a long time to describe, but it happened in the blink of an eye.","The Hell Seal Brothers, who were extremely arrogant and even wanted to broadcast the killing of Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue, died tragically at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","They had only gone through one round, but they had already completely lost their confidence. It could be imagined how much pressure Chu Yunfan had put on them.","The entire stream was in an uproar. Everyone was excited because Chu Yunfan had killed the Hell Seal Brothers.","!!","Previously, when the brothers were so arrogant that they wanted to start a live stream when they were about to kill Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue, it made countless people gnash their teeth in hatred.","They understood that the brothers’ purpose was to strike a blow to the Federation’s morale. However, there was nothing they could do.","But now that Chu Yunfan had returned, he didn’t let them down. In a matter of minutes, he had already killed the three aggressive brothers.","“Mighty Chu is powerful. The marine folks and the demons are no match for him!”","“I remember that the marine folks and the demons were previously jumping up and down, saying that Mighty Chu is only so-so. Now, if you have the ability, come out and say it!”","Many people even tagged the accounts of the demons and the marine folks, which made the demons and marine folks so angry but couldn’t do anything about it.","Chu Yunfan’s instant kill of the Hell Seal Brothers had left them dumbfounded. It was like a huge slap on their faces.","They could quibble about the deaths of Tiger Shark King and Rainbow Spirit Snake King. But then, the Hell Seal Brothers were killed by Chu Yunfan on a live broadcast. They had no way to deny it.","Even if many people were unwilling, they couldn’t say that Chu Yunfan was only so-so, especially those who were Divines. They understood, even more, how difficult it was to achieve what Chu Yunfan had done.","However, one thing was for sure—Chu Yunfan’s combat power was definitely above tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","After collecting the corpses of the Hell Seal Brothers, Chu Yunfan said to the camera, “Seven!”","Everyone understood what Chu Yunfan meant. Looking at him, it was obvious that he wouldn’t give up so easily. Killing these seven powerful Divine beasts was just the beginning.","This definitely wasn’t the end.","“Wash your necks and wait for your deaths!” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","He then turned off the camera used for the live broadcast and landed beside Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue.","“Are you guys okay? How are you doing, Great Ancestor?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I’m fine. I’m old, but I’m still useful,” Great Ancestor Chu said as he got to his feet. He had forcefully suppressed his injuries. Although they were not fully recovered, as long as he used a large amount of his inner energy, there would be no problem.","On the other side, Chu Haoyue’s arm had finally been reattached. The abilities of the Divine Abilities Stage were indeed amazing. Although his arm had been cut off for a few days, it could still be reattached, but it was stiff.","“Yunfan, didn’t you encounter a mishap?” Great Ancestor Chu asked.","“That’s right, I was ambushed by someone.”","Chu Yunfan briefly told Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue about what he had done in the Holy Land.","“What? You’ve subdued the Holy Land? That’s great!” Great Ancestor Chu said in surprise. How could he not understand what it meant for the Federation that Chu Yunfan had conquered the Holy Land?","This could make up for the lack of high-end combat power within the Federation. Compared to the demons and the marine folks, the Federation’s biggest disadvantage was this. After making up for it, there was basically no disadvantage.","Chu Haoyue was shocked that Chu Yunfan was able to conquer the Holy Land, especially after Chu Yunfan briefly mentioned the battle where he was besieged by hundreds of Divines.","However, he was also a Divine. How could he not understand how dangerous it was? It was simply terrifying.","If it were him, there was no possibility of him coming back alive. No, to be precise, if it were him, it would be impossible to attract such a lineup to encircle and annihilate him because he did not have the qualifications.","Great Ancestor Chu also knew this, but he didn’t say much. Since Chu Yunfan didn’t say much, it meant that he didn’t want them to worry so they naturally didn’t ask.","“Great Ancestor, Haoyue, follow me for now,” Chu Yunfan said. He naturally had his reasons for making such arrangements. This place was not like the entrance of the ruins. If they were close to the exit, there would not be any danger if they wanted to leave.","But here, in the depths of the ruins, if they left on their own, it was very likely that they would encounter the marine folks and the demons again. If that happened, Chu Yunfan would have saved them for nothing.","“By the way, do you know where the others are, Great Ancestor?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I don’t. However, although this ruin seems large, it’s not that big. If we continue to search, there will be results,” Great Ancestor Chu said.","“Yes, I think so too,” Chu Yunfan said, “Before that, I want to know one thing. What reason did Great Ancestor Liu use to trick everyone into coming here? He couldn’t have tricked everyone into coming in without saying anything, right?”","He had found it strange. These Divines were all smart people so how could they be so easily tricked into coming here?","If there weren’t enough benefits, it would be impossible.","“It’s because of the Brahma Tree,” Great Ancestor Chu explained.","“The Brahma Tree?” Chu Yunfan immediately sucked in a breath of cold air. He instantly recalled what the Brahma fruit tree was.","Even Great Ancestor Chu and the others might not have a deeper understanding than him.","It was a divine tree that was extremely rare even back during the era of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. There had been records of the Brahma Tree for generations.","The records related to the Brahma Tree were usually related to ascension. It was a tree that bore something known as the Brahma Fruit that could greatly enhance a cultivator’s cultivation. There were even records of cultivators ascending in broad daylight after consuming many of the Brahma Fruits.","In fact, there had even been a Brahma sect in the Ancient Zenith Civilization that had relied on the Brahma Fruits from Brahma Trees to develop into a massive entity.","He immediately understood why all these people had been attracted to this place. Most people who knew about the existence of the Brahma Tree would not be able to remain calm."]},{"number":1070,"title":"Chapter 1070 Infinite Demon Mountain With the Inescapable Net","paragraphs":["1070 Infinite Demon Mountain With the Inescapable Net","Unlike Chu Yunfan, most of the Divines in the Federation were facing the same problem. The road ahead had been cut off, and every breakthrough required constant exploration and a lot of effort.","They were not like the Divines of the Holy Land, who had the way paved for them and only needed to cultivate step by step.","Speaking of which, any one of the Federation experts who could enter the Divine Abilities Stage was actually a genius. In a situation where the road ahead was cut off, they had managed to carve out a path. They were not inferior to the Holy Land, the marine folks, or the demons, but they lacked heritage.","This was the fundamental reason why Chu Yunfan brought back a large number of ancient books and records from the Holy Land. It was to make up for the shortcomings of the Federation’s foundation.","!!","The Brahma Fruit that grew from the Brahma Tree could help experts in the Divine Abilities Stage or even higher to improve their cultivation.","This would depend on whether the Brahma Tree had fully matured. The effects of the Brahma Fruits that could be produced at each stage would be different.","In any case, even if it bore fruit for the first time, it was enough to make a Divine’s cultivation progress greatly.","It was because of this that Great Ancestor Liu managed to trick these people into coming here. Thinking about it this way, Chu Yunfan understood everything.","If it were him, he would probably not let go of this opportunity either. Cultivation itself was going against the will of the Heavens. Every second counted, and one’s life was snatched from the Heavens. If one did not seek these opportunities and cultivated step by step instead, one might not even have a chance to ascend until their death.","“I understand now. So it’s the Brahma Tree. No wonder everyone rushed in here. That’s a neat trick!” Chu Yunfan said, “However, do you know whether the Brahma Tree is real or fake?”","Great Ancestor Chu thought for a while and said, “It’s very likely to be true. We are all in the Divine Abilities Stage, and our vision is naturally not the same as ordinary people. Just photos and videos are not enough to convince us. Although I’m not good at science, I know that there are many technological methods that can make videos look fake.","“Great Ancestor Liu obtained our trust by presenting a branch of the Brahma Tree. It was sent to the National Academy of Sciences for research. The conclusion they drew was that this was most likely the real Brahma Tree.”","As Great Ancestor Chu spoke, he revealed a cold smile. “The demons and the marine folks spent so much money to trick us into coming here.”","“If that’s the case, there must really be a Brahma Tree in the ruins,” Chu Yunfan said.","Great Ancestor Chu nodded. “That’s right, this trap is real, and the Brahma Tree should also be real.”","“The marine folks and the demons are really generous. In that case, how could we disappoint them?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I’m going to make them lose both money and numbers!”","“That’s right. The Brahma Tree must not fall into the hands of the marine folks or the demons. The Federation is already no match for them in terms of high-end military force. If the tree falls into their hands, we will be even less of a match for them,” Great Ancestor Chu said.","“Don’t worry, they won’t be able to get it. I’ll render their plans naught.”","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. He was determined to get the Brahma Tree. It just so happened that he could plant the Brahma Tree in the Mountain River Diagram.","The Brahma Tree grew in very harsh environments. It could not be planted in an ordinary environment. Since ancient times, there had been cases of Brahma Trees being discovered and dying quickly after being replanted.","The herb mountain happened to fulfill this condition. No matter what kind of heavenly treasure it was, it could survive well on this mountain.","“Yunfan, look at the Internet!” Chu Haoyue suddenly said.","An image was projected on his terminal. It was the front of a huge valley. Everyone could see that there were about six or seven people trapped in the valley. All of them were injured, and some of them were even seriously injured. If it were not for their high cultivation, they would have died a long time ago.","These people joined hands to set up a formation, covering up the valley and hiding inside, barely surviving.","In front of the image, there was a figure flying above the valley. It was a man who looked about thirty years old. He was wearing a flamboyant silver robe and looked extravagant.","He strode forward and kicked the valley hard. It started to shake violently.","Boom!","This barrier was barely able to support itself, and in just a moment, a huge crack appeared.","At this moment, the man turned to the camera and said, “Chu Yunfan, didn’t you arrogantly kill demon experts earlier? You want to save humankind? I’ll give you a chance now. If you can get there in fifteen minutes, you’ll have a chance to save these people. Otherwise, these humans will become my food!”","In the video, Chu Yunfan saw that among the people trapped in the valley, there was his grandfather, Yang Feiyang, Marshal Zhu Buping, and a few others.","These people were well-known existences throughout the Federation, but they were all trapped in a rather sorry state.","At this point, Chu Haoyue turned off the video.","“Yunfan, this is clearly a trap,” Great Ancestor Chu said after taking a deep breath.","Chu Haoyue also nodded. “They’re trying to lure you to your death. They must have set up an inescapable net there.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm. How could he not know the other party’s plan? They must be using those people as bait to lure him over. Once he went there, he would inevitably face thunderous attacks.","On the other hand, if Chu Yunfan didn’t go, the other party would take advantage of the situation to kill those few Federation experts and damage Chu Yunfan’s reputation at the same time.","He would be at a disadvantage either way.","“What a good plan!”","Chu Yunfan could only say that the other party was really good at scheming, but then he added, “Although I know it’s a trap, I still have to go.”","“Don’t be a fool,” Great Ancestor Chu quickly said, “Do you know who that person was? That’s the current general of the Silver Moon Kingdom, Silver Frost. His cultivation base is unfathomable. Ever since he took over the position of the general twenty years ago, he has caused extremely heavy losses to the Federation!”","The Silver Moon Kingdom was one of the three big kingdoms that ruled Infinite Demon Mountain. There were many experts in that kingdom. To be able to stand out in there and become the general who led countless demon beasts, Silver Frost’s cultivation must be extremely high.","“It doesn’t matter. He’s just courting death.” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1071,"title":"Chapter 1071 They Don’t Know What True Power Is","paragraphs":["1071 They Don’t Know What True Power Is","Chu Yunfan just kept sneering.","Silver Frost thought that he had Chu Yunfan in the palm of his hand and had prepared an inescapable net to make it impossible for Chu Yunfan to escape.","But unfortunately, they didn’t know Chu Yunfan’s current strength. No matter what kind of schemes they had, they were not capable of bringing him down.","If it was Chu Yunfan, he wouldn’t even need to set up an inescapable net. He could kill Silver Frost all by himself.","!!","“Yunfan, think it over carefully. Silver Frost definitely isn’t alone. There must be many experts lying in wait to ambush you,” Great Ancestor Chu said worriedly.","“No matter what methods they have, no matter what inescapable net they have, they still don’t know what true power is.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","With his current strength, even if he rushed directly into Infinite Demon Mountain, he was confident that he could infiltrate it.","“I have no choice but to go. My grandfather is there, and so is Marshal Zhu. I have no choice,” Chu Yunfan said.","“In that case, then I will accompany you,” Great Ancestor Chu said firmly.","He had already made his decision. If things went south, he would stay behind to guard the retreat. Whether it was Chu Yunfan or Chu Haoyue, they were the hope of the Chu clan and the Federation. They could not die here.","“I’ll go with you.”","Without waiting for Chu Yunfan to look over, Chu Haoyue said.","Although he cherished his life, he was not afraid of a battle. Those who could enter the Divine Abilities Stage were not timid people. Those people would not have the courage to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","“All right, in that case, let’s work together,” Chu Yunfan said with relief.","Although he was confident that he could face Silver Frost alone, it was naturally great that Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue were willing to go with him.","After the three of them made up their minds, they immediately flew toward the valley.","Meanwhile, on the Internet, the situation was already boiling. Silver Frost’s insolent words made countless people gnash their teeth in hatred.","However, what really made countless people anxious was that Silver Frost clearly had a conspiracy waiting for Chu Yunfan.","This wasn’t a secret conspiracy. It should be said that this was an open conspiracy. They were using Federation experts who were trapped inside the valley to force Chu Yunfan to show himself.","Then, Silver Frost would kill Chu Yunfan. This was what countless people were worried about.","Chu Yunfan was the hope of the Federation and the stabilizing force of the people’s hearts. If he were to fall, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Countless people were cursing Silver Frost for forcing Chu Yunfan into such a corner, but they had no way to interfere.","After fifteen minutes, Chu Yunfan arrived at the valley.","At this moment, Silver Frost was floating above the valley. Seeing Chu Yunfan arrive, he turned around and looked at the three of them.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re really brave. You clearly knew that this is a trap, but you still dared to come. Just for this, I respect you as a hero and will leave your corpse intact.”","Silver Frost looked at Chu Yunfan with a sinister smile, as if he could already see the distant future and Chu Yunfan’s death.","“Leave my corpse intact?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer. “You used these people to threaten me to appear, but you don’t know that you’re just seeking your own death.”","“Hahahaha, I think you’ve been arrogant for too long. The title of number one of the Federation has made you lose your mind!” Silver Frost laughed as if he was looking at someone who did not know what was good for them.","“Not only will you die today, but all the martial experts of the Federation will also die!”","“It’s Yunfan!” Yang Feiyang, who was in the valley, recognized Chu Yunfan.","Compared to a few months ago, Chu Yunfan’s strength was much stronger. With the help of the Divinity Nourishment Pill Chu Yunfan had given him, he had also entered the Divine Abilities Stage two months ago.","He had joined this operation after becoming a Divine, but who knew that he would encounter such a mishap so soon?","They were hiding in this valley, and before they could even catch their breath, they were boxed in by Silver Frost of the Silver Moon Kingdom, unable to advance or retreat.","When he thought he was going to die here, Chu Yunfan suddenly appeared.","Not only Yang Feiyang but also Zhu Buping and the others had hope in their eyes. This was a huge blow to them.","“There’s hope!”","“But this is obviously a trap. Chu Yunfan has been tricked!”","“Sigh, we can’t help him.”","Chu Yunfan looked around and said, “Are there only so few of you? I’m afraid that you alone won’t be enough for me to kill.”","“Hahahaha, you’re really arrogant. But that’s good. I’ll make you submit!” Silver Frost laughed.","Suddenly, a dozen figures appeared from the surroundings and encircled Chu Yunfan, Great Ancestor Chu, and Chu Haoyue.","And among them, there was a human figure that was particularly conspicuous.","“You b^stard! How dare you show up in front of us!” Great Ancestor Chu stared coldly at the old man, who was the great ancestor of the Liu clan.","The human powerhouses who were trapped in the valley gritted their teeth in hatred. If not for Great Ancestor Liu, they would not have been lured here and ambushed.","“Hmph, why wouldn’t I dare to appear here? All of you will die here and I will be the final victor,” Great Ancestor Liu proclaimed with a cold smile.","Apart from Great Ancestor Liu, the dozen or so Divines surrounding them were all experts from the marine folks and the demons.","These experts were not ordinary Divines. They were at least experts in tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage, and there were even a few experts even higher than that.","With such a lineup, it was no wonder that the Federation experts had been defeated.","After all, most of the Federation experts were in tiers one to three of the Divine Abilities Stage. Not many had entered tier four. In comparison, the marine folks and the demons were generally in tier four or above.","It was not just the quantity. Even the quality was superior. They were not on the same level.","“Which Divine Servant are you?” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at Great Ancestor Liu.","Everyone was a little confused as they looked at Great Ancestor Liu. They didn’t know why Chu Yunfan had said that.","“You can see it?” Great Ancestor Liu said in shock. “That’s right. I’m the Fifth Divine Servant of my lord.”","As soon as Great Ancestor Liu finished speaking, Chu Yunfan immediately understood why Great Ancestor Liu, who was a famous general of the Federation, would suddenly betray the Federation.","...","Great Ancestor Liu had seemed loyal from the very beginning. It was just that no one had known about it before."]},{"number":1072,"title":"Chapter 1072 One Slap to Death, One Move to Wipe Out the Team","paragraphs":["1072 One Slap to Death, One Move to Wipe Out the Team","This situation was similar to that of Clan Leader Wei. No one knew that he was someone else’s subordinate.","This kind of thing gave people a creepy feeling.","Clan Leader Wei and Great Ancestor Liu had established their own foundations but were pawns in someone else’s hands. This was an astonishing fact.","One could imagine how powerful this “lord” was, and no one knew how many forces were hidden behind it.","What Chu Yunfan was concerned about was that Great Ancestor Liu had been hiding so well before that no one had discovered him, but now he dared to stand out so openly.","This meant that this “lord” would soon surface. No matter what his purpose was, he had clearly lost his patience.","“Hmph, you’re just a pawn abandoned by your so-called lord. You betrayed the Federation, so what good does your Liu clan do for the Federation? They will be uprooted,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“What do you know? My lord’s greatness is not something you can understand. If the Federation dares to hurt the Liu clan, I will take revenge a hundred times over!” Great Ancestor Liu said coldly, “When the Federation is destroyed, the Liu clan will become the king of mankind. The Federation will then be under the leadership of my lord.”","“You don’t know what you’re talking about. You’re a pathetic, brainwashed man,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Divines are powerful figures, and it was normal for their strength to vary. However, these Divines had been brainwashed to become someone else’s pawn. It was simply ridiculous.","“What did you just say?!” Great Ancestor Liu was instantly infuriated as if Chu Yunfan had touched his bottom line.","Boom!","Great Ancestor Liu was immediately enraged and pounced toward Chu Yunfan. The marine folks and the demons standing behind Great Ancestor Liu also pounced on Chu Yunfan.","A dozen Divines pounced at him at the same time.","Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue immediately tensed up, and the divine power in their bodies condensed together, ready to follow Chu Yunfan’s lead.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan said, “There’s no need for you to attack. Just help me hold the line and watch my back!”","Chu Yunfan sneered as a series of terrifying attacks were launched in his direction. Each of them carried a terrifying aura of Heaven and Earth, and the whole valley shook violently. Sand and stones flew and black clouds pressed down as if it was the end of the world.","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. The aura in his body boiled, and his qi and blood soared up to the sky. He confronted the dozens of Divines and was not at a disadvantage in the slightest.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and released all the divine power in his body. His fist intent was released, forming a golden asura behind him.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fist shot out again and again, and wherever the fist force passed, it illuminated the world. Wherever the fist force from the asura passed, the attacks of the dozen or so Divines were all shattered.","The attacks launched by the Divines were all scattered. The advance of the experts was halted, and they felt a wave of backlash sweep across them.","It hit their chests, making them cough up mouthfuls of blood.","Great Ancestor Liu was stunned for a moment and a look of disbelief flashed across his eyes. It was as if he had never thought that Chu Yunfan’s one punch would be able to fight against more than a dozen of them without falling into a disadvantage.","“I’ll kill you first!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","No one knew when he had arrived in front of Great Ancestor Liu.","Great Ancestor Liu roared and clenched his fist.","Bam!","This punch landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but Chu Yunfan didn’t even glance at it. The fist force scattered when it hit his body, unable to affect him in the slightest.","“Aaaaargh!”","Great Ancestor Liu let out a blood-curdling screech as he continuously retreated. When his fist landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, he was hit by an even more terrifying force. His entire arm was instantly crippled and his muscles were completely blown apart, causing blood to instantly flow out.","He realized that he was no match for Chu Yunfan so he immediately retreated.","But how could Chu Yunfan let him go? He chased after Great Ancestor Liu and sent a slap across his face.","Smack!","Great Ancestor Liu was hit by Chu Yunfan’s qi-condensed hand. His whole body trembled violently and a terrible force was sent coursing through him.","After a blood-curdling scream, Great Ancestor Liu’s body instantly shattered into pieces, turning into blood clots that filled the sky. He died a tragic death.","Everything had happened too quickly—from Great Ancestor Liu’s counterattack to Chu Yunfan killing him with a single slap. It was so fast that no one present could react in time.","The entire scene fell into a dead silence.","Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue were still completely dumbfounded. Although they had seen it before, seeing Chu Yunfan kill Great Ancestor Liu with a single slap still shocked them.","Yang Feiyang, Zhu Buping, and the others remembered that when Chu Yunfan killed Great Ancestor Jiang. It had taken him a lot of effort. It was not like now, where he could kill Great Ancestor Liu with a casual slap as if it was as easy as killing a fly.","Chu Yunfan’s current performance was much fiercer than before, and his transformation seem to have happened quite recently.","“How dare you!”","Silver Mist finally realized that Chu Yunfan had killed Great Ancestor Liu in front of him. Although he didn’t really care about this human, Chu Yunfan’s actions were clearly a provocation to him.","“Your turn will come. Even if you want to die, you don’t have to be in such a hurry,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer. He raised his arm high, and in an instant, countless thunderbolts condensed behind him. In an instant, they turned into eighteen weapons, including knives, spears, swords, halberds.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","After a series of violent thunderous sounds, these weapons were all released, sweeping toward the dozens Divine demons and marine folks like a storm.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The demons and the marine folks were all locked on and killed in an instant."]},{"number":1073,"title":"Chapter 1073 A Trap? What a Joke. Kill Silver Frost!","paragraphs":["1073 A Trap? What a Joke. Kill Silver Frost!","In just one move, the Divines demons and marine folks were all killed.","It was no different from what happened to Great Ancestor Liu.","Divines were like cabbages in the market. No matter what level they were at, they were all the same. In front of Chu Yunfan’s current attack, they couldn’t even withstand a single blow.","For a moment, there was a deathly silence. Everyone was completely dumbfounded, especially Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue. They finally understood what Chu Yunfan had said before.","“They don’t understand true power.”","Now, it seemed that not only the demons and the marine folks didn’t understand, but even they didn’t know what true power was.","Originally, they were Divines, and logically speaking, they should be the ones who understood the power of Divines best. However, they now realized that their level was too low, and they had no idea to what extent Divines could achieve.","A true top expert could single-handedly turn the entire world upside down. At the same time, they could also stabilize all the disturbances on their own. They were just like the president of the Federation, who could stabilize all the disturbances within and outside the Federation.","And now, Chu Yunfan was exactly the same as the president.","At this moment, Silver Frost was no longer making a fuss. He could feel the terrifying pressure Chu Yunfan was giving him.","With a simple wave, Chu Yunfan had killed more than a dozen Divines, including those in tier seven and eight.","These demons and marine folks were by no means ordinary figures. Ordinary Divines were not even qualified to join this operation.","Silver Frost looked at Chu Yunfan with a solemn expression. All the divine power in his body lingered around him and turned into a terrifying tide. The qi and blood in his body were surging.","He grabbed at the air and immediately produced a heavenly halberd. This halberd was a magic weapon. It was snow-white and made of bones. To be more precise, it was made from the bones of a demonic beast he had killed.","Although they were bones, they were much stronger than any metal.","Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue could instantly tell that Silver Frost was completely different from the others as if he had entered a different realm.","Although they were confident in Chu Yunfan, they still couldn’t help but worry.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes and ascertained Silver Frost.","Silver Frost was indeed different from the others. He was stronger and had already entered tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage. He was probably only a hair’s breadth away from the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","To the current Federation, almost no one could fight against him. It was difficult to find anyone who could compete with him. But unfortunately, he had met Chu Yunfan.","Silver Frost didn’t dare to be careless. His halberd instantly boiled with power. He swung it down, letting out a burst of metal clangs. In an instant, the silver wolf engraved on it leapt out and pounced at Chu Yunfan.","Silver Frost didn’t hold back because he knew that if he did, what awaited him would be death.","It was a deadly attack as soon as it came. The terrifying attack crushed the air. One could see from a distance that the air in the entire valley was collapsing, forming a terrifying cyclone.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan took a step forward and miraculously stabilized the air that was about to collapse.","Then, he clenched his five fingers into a fist, and his entire body flickered with golden light. His fist force condensed and burst forth in an instant, turning into a golden asura.","Boom!","The silver wolf and the golden asura collided in the sky. In an instant, the violent shockwave that was set off almost collapsed the valley.","Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue retreated, not daring to get any closer. Although they were also Divines, the aftermath of the battle proved to be a huge pressure on them.","Since they were already heavily injured, they couldn’t bear the pressure of the terrifying shockwaves.","The silver wolf in the sky opened its jaws, trying to swallow the golden asura. However, the golden asura’s fist slammed into it mouth and pierced through the silver wolf.","“How are you so strong?!”","Silver Frost couldn’t believe it. Chu Yunfan had shattered his martial arts intent with just one punch. He couldn’t pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","However, he didn’t have much time to think about it. The force of Chu Yunfan’s punch didn’t slow down. After it pierced through the silver wolf, the golden asura continued to come crashing down in his direction.","“Roar!”","“Go to hell!” Silver Frost roared. All the mana in his body surged and turned into a silver wolf that surrounded him. He charged at the golden asura.","Boom!","In the instant of contact, the silver wolf was shattered into pieces. It could not resist at all.","Boom!","At this moment, it was too late for Silver Frost to retreat. He could only take the punch head-on. Suddenly, the terrifying attack was like Mars hitting Earth. Silver Frost hastily retreated and a shower of blood burst out of his chest.","He continued to stagger as he suffered a heavy blow. Blood seeped out from the corners of his mouth, which was extremely terrifying.","“Why are you so strong?!” Silver Frost kept roaring. He felt his blood and qi shaking, and so were his organs.","In just one exchange, Chu Yunfan had crushed him.","“You want to set up an inescapable trap to ambush me? What a joke. You know nothing about true power!” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Silver Frost’s all-encompassing net was just a joke in his eyes.","In the Holy Land, Chu Yunfan had encountered the siege of hundreds of Divines. That kind of scene was a terrifying power that could destroy the world.","This siege formation was simply child’s play.","And Silver Frost’s strength was a bit weaker than the leaders of the three Holy Land superpowers.","Silver Frost was furious. He was injured by Chu Yunfan with just one punch. He had no choice but to mobilize all the divine power in his body. With a loud roar, the halberd in his hand slashed out again.","In that instant, Chu Yunfan felt as if all the spirit energy in the world was rejecting him, and he was trapped by the Silver Frost.","However, with just one step forward, the blockade completely collapsed.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan transformed into a golden roc, crossed the void, and bombarded the halberd.","Bam!","The halberd flew out of SIlver Frost’s hand and shattered in mid-air.","...","Silver Frost wasn’t any better off. He too was hit by the roc and his body exploded.","He died instantly."]},{"number":1074,"title":"Chapter 1074 Their Faces Were Slapped Swollen","paragraphs":["1074 Their Faces Were Slapped Swollen","“Couldn’t even withstand a single blow.”","To Chu Yunfan, killing Silver Frost wasn’t something to be proud of. If it was before, it might have taken a lot of effort, but now, he could kill Silver Frost in just a few seconds.","After absorbing the dragon spirit in the spirit stone mine, Chu Yunfan’s strength greatly increased. Compared to before, he had undergone a heaven-shaking transformation.","“He did it...”","!!","Yang Feiyang, Zhu Buping, and the others in the valley seemed to be in complete disbelief. Even Yang Feiyang, who had the most confidence in Chu Yunfan, never expected Chu Yunfan to kill Silver Frost so easily.","“That’s amazing. Feiyang, your grandson has become a dragon!” Zhu Buping said as he looked at Yang Feiyang. He felt a little envious. Compared to Chu Yunfan, his juniors were nothing. One could even say that they were trash.","At their age, there was nothing more gratifying than having a promising junior.","Yang Feiyang just nodded and smiled.","After a while, Chu Yunfan landed in the valley.","“Chu Yunfan, if it wasn’t for you, I’m afraid we wouldn’t have been able to escape this calamity,” Zhu Buping said gratefully.","“It’s fine, I only did what I should have done,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yunfan, you don’t have to worry about us old folks. Since you’ve already killed Silver Frost, we won’t be in any danger. You should hurry and go save that girl, Siyu,” Yang Feiyang said.","“Grandpa, you know where Siyu is?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Yes, we were originally working together, but we got separated. However, I know where she is. She’s in the deepest part of this secret land and is heading in the direction of the Brahman Tree,” Yang Feiyang said.","“That’s right, we shouldn’t be in any danger. Although the marine folks and demons have many experts, most of them should be concentrated in the direction of the Brahman Tree,” Zhu Buping said.","“That’s right. Since you now know where Siyu is, you should go to her. We’ll be fine as a group,” Great Ancestor Chu added.","“That’s a good plan. Hurry up and leave. Don’t stay here,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Okay.”","Everyone quickly nodded. It was indeed unsuitable for them to stay here.","Everyone pointed out the way for Chu Yunfan. After leaving behind some healing pills, he flew toward the deepest part of the ruins.","At the same time, on the Internet, the discussions about Chu Yunfan became more and more intense. Many people were worried that something had happened to him.","After all, the incident at the valley was clearly a trap. If Chu Yunfan were to fall into it, he would be seeking his own death.","“If Chu Yunfan goes, I’m afraid he won’t be able to escape death.”","“Sigh, I want him to go, but I also don’t want him to go. It’s so contradictory!”","“Although Mighty Chu is powerful, this is clearly a trap. Even he would have a hard time dealing with this.”","At the same time, the marine folks and the demons were stirring up trouble on the Internet.","“Chu Yunfan is dead for sure. Hehe, Silver Frost is the general of Silvermoon Kingdom. How could he possibly escape?”","“That isn’t for certain. Maybe he won’t even dare to go? Hahahaha!”","“I think so too. He probably won’t dare to go!”","Just as these people were jumping up and down, Chu Yunfan’s account was updated again, and there were only a few words.","“Here’s your general!”","Then, a series of photos were posted. The ground was covered with marine folk and demon corpses.","After a short period of silence, the entire Internet was in an uproar again. The humans were cheering for the photos.","Previously, they were worried that if Chu Yunfan went, he would fall into the trap. But now, not only did he go, but he also broke through the encirclement.","Seeing the corpses all over the ground, the outcome of the battle was clear. It was obvious who had won and who had lost.","Chu Yunfan won again, and the marine folks and demons who had set up the trap were killed and their blood flowed like a river.","“Hahaha! As expected of Mighty Chu. Our previous worries were completely unnecessary. In his eyes, these marine folks and demons are nothing but clay statues.”","“That’s right. We’ve overestimated them.”","“Weren’t the marine folks and demons being arrogant earlier? How about now? They were all killed by Mighty Chu!”","The entire Internet was in a jubilant state. The accounts of the marine folks and demons, which were originally very arrogant, suddenly became silent. They no longer had the arrogance and domineering attitude that they had when they were jumping up and down. Some of them were even dumbfounded.","They didn’t understand how Chu Yunfan was so powerful. This was completely different from what they had known before. Chu Yunfan was much stronger than they had imagined.","Chu Yunfan had thrown their arrogance back in their faces time and time again, and they didn’t know what to do anymore.","Their arrogance was built on the fact that the experts of the Federation were about to be exterminated. But now, the situation had been completely reversed. The marine folk and demon experts they had placed their hopes on had been killed by Chu Yunfan.","Previously, everyone in the Federation was in a state of panic. Now, it was the marine folks and demons turn to be in a panic.","In particular, the time between these incidents was very short. It had not even been half a day, and Chu Yunfan had already killed so many experts. In total, there were already more than twenty Divines who had fallen.","The marine folks and demons, which had many experts, had lost so many experts in one breath. Especially the outstanding ones who were above the tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage. They were all elites Divines, which was extraordinary.","This loss was even greater than losing forty or fifty ordinary Divines, because the birth of each expert of this level was accompanied by a large number of killings, just like raising venomous insects. Only the king of venomous insects raised would become a Divine.","For a moment, the demons and the marine folks were speechless. Originally, they had planned to kill the Federation experts and destroy all the Federation’s hope.","But now, Chu Yunfan had killed so many marine folks and demons in a row. Everyone felt that their faces were burning, not to mention that those Divines were the pillars of support for their respective tribes and kingdoms.","After being killed by Chu Yunfan, the various tribes and kingdoms of the marine folks and demons felt as if the sky and earth had collapsed. For a moment, they were suppressed to the point of speechlessness.","The entire Internet became a world of ice and fire. However, the situation was completely different from before."]},{"number":1075,"title":"Chapter 1075 I’m Not Dead, Which Means You’ll All Die Here","paragraphs":["1075 I’m Not Dead, Which Means You’ll All Die Here","Previously, it was the humans of the Federation who were in an abyss of suffering.","Now, it was the marine folks and the demons who were in an abyss of suffering. The experts who had been killed made them feel deep pain in their hearts.","So many of their experts had died in the valley without any warning.","While the Internet was bustling with noise and excitement, Chu Yunfan had already arrived at the deepest part of the ruins.","!!","And in the deepest part of the ruin, there was a huge fiery-red tree. It was more than a hundred feet tall and looked extremely huge, with many branches and leaves.","This divine tree exuded a holy aura.","Around the tree was a barrier that completely enveloped it. It was a barrier that the divine tree had formed of its own accord.","On the outside of the barrier, there was a group of about thirty Divines. They were divided into two camps that surrounded the Brahma Tree.","These two camps were the demons and the marine folks.","The two camps surrounded the divine tree and were in a stalemate as if neither of them was willing to let the other take control of it.","And in this divine tree, Chu Yunfan saw two familiar figures.","One of them was Ebony Dragon King. One of his wings had been torn off, and had now barely grown back. It was clearly different from the other wing, and there were still other wounds on his body, which made him look quite ferocious.","Behind Ebony Dragon King was Tang Siyu, whom Chu Yunfan had not seen for a long time.","Tang Siyu was dressed in a white robe. Her figure was slender, and she was floating in the air. Her entire body was emitting a faint light, looking extremely holy and elegant.","She looked an immortal that had descended from the Heavens.","Seeing that Tang Siyu was fine, Chu Yunfan was slightly relieved, but he could also see that Tang Siyu’s body was exuding powerful energy, and it was getting stronger and stronger with each passing moment.","It was as if a powerful force was spreading through her body, promoting it to transform.","Chu Yunfan came to the conclusion that Tang Siyu had most likely consumed the Brahma Fruit that grew on the Brahma Tree.","If that was not the case, there was no way to explain why she would choose to break through in such a place.","Although Chu Yunfan had no idea how Tang Siyu did it, he still heaved a sigh of relief. Judging from the aura that she was exuding, she was almost at tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage. It would probably not take long for her to enter tier nine.","Of course, the premise was that the demons and marine folks could sit by and watch her completely absorb the medicinal effects of the Brahma Fruit.","Chu Yunfan turned his eyes to the demons and the marine folks, who had surrounded the Brahma Tree from both sides.","Among them, the leader of the demons was a middle-aged man in his forties. He was dressed in battle armor and looked extremely mighty, just like a general.","On the other side, the leader of the marine folks was a man who looked to be in his thirties. He was wearing a moon-white robe that seemed to belong to some religion, and he gave of a dignified aura.","The marine folks all respected this man.","However, Chu Yunfan was sensitive enough to sense that this leader of the marine folks was the same level as Great Ancestor Liu. He too had the aura of a Divine Servant.","Although the marine folk leader and Great Ancestor Liu had different origins and were not even the same species, they both secretly cultivated the cultivation technique of the Divine Servants, so they had the same aura.","And Chu Yunfan, who had dealt with the Divine Servant Organization many times, was able to determine it in just a glance.","He thought back to what Bai Wen had told him earlier. The marine folks had been unified by someone. From the original chaotic situation, they had been forcibly unified.","Chu Yunfan instantly came to a conclusion. It was highly likely that the person who united the marine folks was the lord of the Divine Servants.","Judging from the strength displayed by the Divine Servant Organization, it was not impossible.","“Hmph, White Dragon, if you hadn’t stopped me, how could this woman have beaten me to it? ” the leader of the marine folks asked.","The armor-clad White Dragon sneered and said, “King Ren, if I hadn’t stopped you, wouldn’t I have been letting you get here first? So what if she consumed the Brahma Fruit? I know how to make medicine out of humans,” White Dragon said with a cold smile.","He knew King Ren all too well. If he hadn’t stopped him, King Ren would have taken the Brahma Fruit for himself. As for the human woman, he was not the slightest bit concerned about her.","So what if she had consumed the Brahma Fruit? He could refine her into a medicine using a secret technique. This was treating a human as a great medicine and refining them into human medicine.","Dragon King was a member of the demon race of Infinite Demon Mountain, so he naturally didn’t think there was anything wrong with this. It was just like how humans hunted monsters and seized their inner cores without any scruples.","“If you let her continue absorbing the energy from the Brahma Fruit, I’m afraid you won’t be able to make this human medicine. She might even run away,” King Ren said.","“If this goes on, she’ll break through to tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage sooner or later. When that happens, it won’t be so easy to capture her. How about we make a deal? Let’s first break the barrier and capture her then decide how to split the loot. How about it?”","“Deal.”","White Dragon had already decided that if this continued, the human woman might really take advantage of the situation. That would be a joke.","“The two of you are so carefree!”","Suddenly, a leisurely voice was heard.","“I suggest you listen to my advice and give me some face. Why don’t you stop attacking for now?”","Everyone’s hearts clenched tightly. Even with their cultivation, they hadn’t noticed anyone approaching. It could be imagined that the person approaching was no ordinary person.","When they saw who it was, their hearts tightened and they instantly recognised who this person was.","Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan, the so-called number-one expert of the Federation?","“Chu Yunfan, you’re not dead?!”","White Dragon immediately recognized Chu Yunfan and his eyes lit up with a terrifying light.","When he saw Chu Yunfan, he was reminded of his clansman who had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. For the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, which didn’t have many pure-blooded demons, it was a heart-wrenching pain.","“Yeah, I’m not dead. Are you disappointed?” Chu Yunfan grinned and said. “But I’m not dead, which means you’ll all die here. You can forget about leaving this place alive.”"]},{"number":1076,"title":"Chapter 1076 If I Want to Kill You, No One Will Be Able to Save You","paragraphs":["1076 If I Want to Kill You, No One Will Be Able to Save You","“Hahaha! Chu Yunfan, you’ve really gone crazy!” White Dragon laughed as if he was looking at a crazy guy.","Chu Yunfan was on his must-kill list, but that was mainly because Chu Yunfan had killed the demons of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. In addition, he was the Federation’s number one expert.","If White Dragon wanted to destroy the Federation’s momentum, he had to kill Chu Yunfan.","He didn’t think that Chu Yunfan was anything special. In the end, the development of martial arts within the Federation had only flourished in the last few years. Even when he was young, he had experienced the near-destruction of the Federation.","At that time, the demons had attacked the border of the two worlds and almost destroyed the Federation. If the Federation had not made a prompt decision to stop the demons’ advancement with a large number of nuclear bombs, the Federation would have been destroyed.","The lifespan of demons from Infinite Demon Mountain was far above that of humans, and their kind was even above that of ordinary demons. In White Dragon’s eyes, all human experts were simply ants.","Among the marine folks, one of them looked at Chu Yunfan with eyes full of disbelief.","“Impossible! How did you survive?!” The man’s face revealed a look of disbelief. Because the person who had plotted against Chu Yunfan back then was none other than him.","He was certain that he had managed to trick Chu Yunfan. The teleportation array had been tampered with and there was no way Chu Yunfan could have survived.","However, not only did Chu Yunfan not die, but his strength increased greatly. This was truly strange.","Chu Yunfan turned to look at this person. He was a marine folk who was also wearing a moon-white robe. Although Chu Yunfan had only caught a glimpse of him back then, he still remembered.","“I haven’t settled the matter of you plotting against me. You actually dare to appear in front of me now?”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flickered with a sharp light. He had come a hair’s breathe away from death at that time. If he hadn’t cultivated the Imperial Physique, which made his physical strength much stronger than ordinary people, he would have died long ago.","Even so, he had been crippled for a long time.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan took a step forward, and lightning burst out from under his feet. He flew toward the person at an astonishing speed.","“Stop him!” King Ren shouted.","Under his command, all the marine folks pounced on Chu Yunfan. They were not afraid of him. When he appeared, they were in a neutral state. But now, they were all roaring and pouncing on him.","A dozen Divines pounced at the same time. What kind of scene was that? It was as if the sky was falling and the earth was splitting apart. In an instant, the sky changed color and a terrifying force swept down.","“Stop me? Do you really think you can?”","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, this earth-shattering scene was nothing more than child’s play. He had killed far more people in the Holy Land.","He clenched his fist and fist energy seeped out from the gaps between his fingers, turning into a golden asura.","Boom!","The punch instantly shattered the world. The dozen Divines who had pounced on him vomited blood and retreated. To be precise, they were sent flying.","A dozen Divines were nothing more than trash against Chu Yunfan’s fist.","“Impossible!” King Ren’s eyes were wide open in shock.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He spread out his five fingers and flicked them. Suddenly, five sword lights shot out from his fingertips. These five sword lights exploded in mid-air and turned into a rain of swords that shot out.","In an instant, the countless sword rain swept over like heavy rain and filled the space. Everyone on the scene raised their defensive means one after another, trying to block the sword rain.","The Divine marine folks who had been blown away by Chu Yunfan earlier weren’t so lucky. They were already seriously injured, and this wave of sword rain overwhelmed them. Their bodies were instantly shattered by the sword rain and they died unceremoniously.","After doing all this, Chu Yunfan took a big step forward and rushed toward the marine folk who was wearing the moon-white priest robe. “If I want to kill you, no one will be able to save you!”","Meanwhile, the others were still busy dealing with the sword rain that Chu Yunfan had shot out, so they didn’t have time to save their kinsman.","The priest marine folk was dumbfounded. All of this seemed to have happened over a long time, but in fact, it happened in an instant.","Chu Yunfan had shattered the joint attack of so many marine folk experts with a single punch, severely injuring them. Then, he aimed to kill the priest with his next strike.","His movements were clean and crisp, and there were no overly fancy moves. However, this simple move had great power in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The priest quickly reacted. With a long roar, he suddenly turned into an incomparably huge sea beast. He was the size of a small mountain and his eyes were red like a pair of lanterns.","Its huge body was like a landslide as it charged toward Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had forced the priest to the extreme, forcing him to reveal his true form.","After the priest took on his original form, his strength increased tremendously. His massive body pounced over with the might of a thousand pounds.","Boom!","However, after a series of terrifying collisions, Chu Yunfan stopped his momentum, reached out with one hand, and blocked the incoming attack.","A look of complete disbelief appeared on the priest’s huge, ferocious-looking face. He was shocked. Chu Yunfan was powerful, and his strength was much greater than his.","With a loud shout, his primordial spirit materialized in the air. He gripped the spear in his hand and thrusted it at Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan casually slapped down and shattered the spear in mid-air. He then grabbed the priest’s primordial spirit and it struggled with all its might.","On the other side, King Ren and the others had finally broken free from Chu Yunfan’s harassment of sword rain and were pouncing over.","Just as they were about to save the priest, Chu Yunfan crushed the priest’s primordial spirit without even looking at him.","Without the support of his primordial spirit, the priest’s original form collapsed and smashed a huge hole in the ground. He died instantly.","A deathly silence fell over the place."]},{"number":1077,"title":"Chapter 1077 Ebony Dragon King’s Shock","paragraphs":["1077 Ebony Dragon King’s Shock","“I’ve said it before. If I want to kill you, no one can save you,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","The marine folk priest was strong. He had already entered tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage. With such strength, he would definitely be considered a great expert in the present world. However, he was no match for Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan! You’re dead meat!” King Ren glared at Chu Yunfan.","“Your organization is really ambitious. I’d like to see if your lord will stick his neck out when I kill his Divine Servants one by one,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Originally, he wanted to find out who this lord was and what kind of existence they were. But now, he no longer cared because he knew that this lord would jump out sooner or later.","These Divine Servants had been completely brainwashed and were tough nuts to crack. It would be impossible to get anything out of them.","After all, after having crossing paths with a few Divine Servants, Chu Yunfan already knew this.","King Ren suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan was not killing without a target. If he counted carefully, he would find out that Chu Yunfan had killed the Fourth, Fifth, Sixth, and Seventh Divine Servants.","Since the establishment of their organization, they had never suffered such a great loss. However, King Ren didn’t know that even the Third Divine Servant at the Holy Land had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Such a loss could be said to be heart-wrenching.","Chu Yunfan was the nemesis of their organization. At first, the organization had wanted to recruit Chu Yunfan. After seeing Chu Yunfan’s talent and threat, they made up their mind that if he couldn’t be recruited into their organization, he would be killed.","That was why the Seventh Divine Servant had went after Chu Yunfan. Who knew that it was like poking a hornet’s nest?","After that, the Divine Servants were killed one after another. After discovering the existence of this organization and their killing intent toward him, Chu Yunfan didn’t show any mercy and killed them without hesitation.","This organization’s vitality was greatly damaged.","“You’re next. I’ve already killed the Third Divine Servant. What’s your rank?” Chu Yunfan grinned as he looked at King Ren.","King Ren’s pupils contracted slightly. He knew about the Third Divine Servant.","Unlike the others, the Third Divine Servant had already entered the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, but Chu Yunfan had still managed to kill him. King Ren had to admit that all his previous estimations of Chu Yunfan had fallen short, and could even be said to be completely wrong.","Chu Yunfan’s scariness was far beyond imagination.","“You’re a great threat to my lord. I’ll do my best to kill you here.”","King Ren had no intention of underestimating Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, his eyes were filled with terrifying killing intent.","On the other side, when White Dragon saw King Ren’s attitude, he naturally understood that Chu Yunfan was no ordinary person. From the moment this mysterious King Ren appeared, he had established and directed the cooperation between the marine folks and the demons.","He thought that King Ren was the mastermind behind the scenes, but it was now revealed that this was not the case. There was someone else behind King Ren.","White Dragon had no choice but to be vigilant. Although the amrine folks and the demons were allies in destroying the Federation, they were still competitors in essence.","According to the plan, after the Federation was destroyed, the demons and the marine folks would fight for the leadership of the Kunlun Realm.","But at this time, White Dragon could see that Chu Yunfan’s strength was not to be underestimated. Even King Ren treated him seriously.","Of course, Chu Yunfan’s lightning-fast massacre of the Divine marine folks had also sent shivers down his spine.","If it were the demons, they would probably have suffered the same fate. Chu Yunfan’s strength clearly exceeded that of ordinary Divines. In front of him, the number of ordinary Divines was meaningless.","White Dragon secretly sent a message to the demon experts, telling them to be on guard against Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack.","There was no need to.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying combat power had already scared them half to death.","When did such a terrifying and fierce guy appear among the human race?","They probably would not fare any better in the situation that the marine folks had just faced. They instinctively raised the power to the limit, ready to attack at any time.","Inside the barrier around the tree, Ebony Dragon King who was laying beside Tang Siyu, who was transforming and improving, was finally awakened by the commotion outside. He thought that something had happened. Who would have thought that he would witness Chu Yunfan killed all the marine folks who had once defeated him in seconds?","It was like chopping vegetables!","Ebony Dragon King could feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength had become even more terrifying after these few months. Compared to when Chu Yunfan had first subdued him, the difference was like Heaven and Earth.","At that time, although he was not Chu Yunfan’s opponent, they were still on the same level. But now, Chu Yunfan gave him the feeling that he could crush him with one finger.","Ebony Dragon King was much stronger than he was a few months ago. With the cultivation method that Chu Yunfan had given him, he had already entered peak tier-six of the Divine Abilities Stage and was only one step away from the seventh.","However, he knew that if he were to face Chu Yunfan, he wouldn’t have the power to fight back.","Compared to the others who didn’t know the truth, Ebony Dragon King naturally knew more. From the moment the Federation began to spread the rumor that Chu Yunfan had met with an accident, he knew that it was all fake.","He had been subdued by Chu Yunfan and his mind and spirit had become one with Chu Yunfan’s. Whether Chu Yunfan was fine or not, other people might not know, but how could he not know?","If something happened to Chu Yunfan, he would probably be the first one to die. Although it was cruel, it was the truth. If he was fine, it meant that Chu Yunfan was fine too.","However, when Chu Yunfan returned, Ebony Dragon King realized that Chu Yunfan had undergone a tremendous change. Compared to back then, he was now more than twice as strong.","If Ebony Dragon King thought about trying to escape before, he no longer had any now. Not only because his life was in Chu Yunfan’s hands, but also because Chu Yunfan’s strength had completely surpassed his.","Chu Yunfan’s strength had skyrocketed. Following such a master, his future could be said to be limitless.","He might even have the chance to step into the legendary peak of the Divine Abilities Stage and reach the top of the world."]},{"number":1078,"title":"Chapter 1078 Chu Yunfan Goes on a Massacre!","paragraphs":["1078 Chu Yunfan Goes on a Massacre!","“Kill me? Hahahaha! You’re talking as if you can do it!” Chu Yunfan burst out laughing.","“Your organization has caused trouble for me time and time again. You have put my life in danger several times. If I don’t destroy all of you, how can I vent the hatred in my heart?”","This Divine Servant organization had repeatedly tried to cause trouble for Chu Yunfan. From the first time the Seventh Divine Servant appeared, Chu Yunfan’s life had been fraught with dangers.","If the Jiang clan hadn’t used a nuclear bomb to scare away the Seventh Divine Servant, Chu Yunfan would have been embroiled in a fierce battle. Although he was confident that he could have escaped, his cultivation at that time was much weaker than that of the Seventh Divine Servant’s.","“You will die here today!” King Ren shouted loudly as all the mana in his body began to boil.","“Before that, let’s clear the area.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan’s voice fell, he suddenly disappeared from where he was standing and vanished from everyone’s sight.","The demons, who were already fully focused and on guard, suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan had suddenly appeared in front of them.","Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations—one step to heaven!","Behind Chu Yunfan’s back, a pair of thunder wings spread out, making him look like a god.","He wielded a thunder sword in his hand.","Swish!","The sword flashed, and a terrifying sword light instantly slashed out.","One of the demon experts didn’t even have time to react. The layers of barriers he had arranged in front of him were like a stack of paper that were instantly sliced apart.","Slash!","This Divine demon didn’t even have time to react before Chu Yunfan’s sword cut him in half. He couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s sword light.","“D*mn it!” White Dragon roared in anger. He didn’t think that Chu Yunfan, who was about to fight King Ren, would suddenly turn around and attack the demons.","Chu Yunfan changed his attitude faster than flipping a book!","White Dragon and King Ren chased after Chu Yunfan in a flustered and exasperated manner, trying to stop him.","“Just you? You want to stop me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Chu Yunfan’s body flickered slightly and nine silhouettes of him appeared.","Every single one of them pounced toward one of demon.","Nine Cyclone Phantoms!","Chu Yunfan had cultivated this movement technique to a godlike level. It had broken away from being just a martial arts technique and risen to the level of divine ability.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was simply too fast. Chu Yunfan’s nine silhouettes launched their attacks at the same time.","The sword light instantly tore through the demons’ defensive barriers. In the face of Chu Yunfan’s sword light, their defensive barriers couldn’t even withstand a single blow.","In an instant, more than half of the demons had been killed or injured.","“D*mn it!” White Dragon roared in anger.","These demons were not just experts of the demons, but also top experts from the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. Losing more than half in one go was a huge blow to their kingdom.","But it was no use. They were far too slow compared to Chu Yunfan. Even if they were at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage and used all their power, they still couldn’t keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed.","They could only watch as Chu Yunfan went on a killing spree.","The nine silhouettes returned to being one.","The remaining demons began to retreat to the side, trying to avoid Chu Yunfan’s attacks. They had seen how the fallen demons had been unable to withstand a single blow. How could they not be on guard now?","However, they had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","Although they had fled in all directions, how could they escape from Chu Yunfan’s hands?","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand and countless thunderbolts flew out of his body. Behind him, they turned into blades, spears, swords, halberds, and many other weapons.","The weapons were densely packed, forming a wall of weapons behind him.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","The weapons swept out, turning into a terrifying hail of weapons. The demons who were fleeing in all directions were shocked and turned around to launch their attacks at the hail of weapons.","However, they discovered that they were unable to stop the incoming hail even if they tried their best.","Every time a weapon exploded, it would release an endless amount of thunder energy.","The constant thunder explosions instantly turned them into ashes. Their Divine bodies were completely useless in the face of this terrifying thunder energy.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","A terrifying thunderous explosion sounded, and the entire world trembled. Endless waves of dust were set off and sand and stones were sent flying. It was as if the world was about to collapse.","White Dragon suddenly felt a heart-wrenching pain. When he had ordered the massacre of the Federation’s experts, he had never thought that he would have to face the same situation.","White Dragon pounced at Chu Yunfan with the black spear in his hand as he released all of his energy.","He was one of the top figures of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. In terms of cultivation, he was even stronger than the leaders of the three superpowers of the Holy Land that Chu Yunfan had killed.","...","Although he was only stronger by a sliver, and everyone had already reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, just a sliver stronger was still extremely impressive.","King Ren’s power wasn’t any weaker than White Dragon’s. He followed closely behind and pounced over as well. His eyes flickered with a light of hatred.","“Great!” Chu Yunfan laughed. He was not afraid at all.","He released all his inner energy, and it was extremely violent. His battle strength rose to the extreme.","He clenched his fist and punched out. A terrifying light burst out from his fist and hit the black spear.","Clang!","A deafening explosion, like the sound of metal clashing, shook the entire world.","Ack!","White Dragon coughed up a mouthful of blood. Both his arms were shaking, and the web between his thumb and forefinger was split open, causing blood to splatter.","He hastily retreated and roared. He thought that he was powerful and invincible. He was one of the top experts in the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, but he was now being forced into such a state by Chu Yunfan.","It was simply tragic.","...","White Dragon spat out a mouthful of blood as he retreated, but Chu Yunfan wasn’t going to let him go.","Chu Yunfan’s fist intent soared out and turned into a terrifying asura that came crashing down. White Dragon had no other choice but to take it head-on.","Bam!","White Dragon was sent flying like a cannonball, coughing up large mouthfuls of blood."]},{"number":1079,"title":"Chapter 1079 Internal Strife? Behead King Ren!","paragraphs":["1079 Internal Strife? Behead King Ren!","Chu Yunfan’s fist force was too fierce. Even the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom’s royals, which were famous for their strong physical bodies, could not compare to him.","White Dragon was sent flying a few hundred meters away. With a boom, he crashed into a small mountain like a comet, blasting it into pieces.","The scene was extremely terrifying. The battle between the two was powerful and terrifying. It was a battle where their fists hit each other. It was extremely terrifying.","It was even more powerful than when so many Divines attacked at the same time. It could be said that the earth was shaking.","“Chu Yunfan!”","White Dragon let out a series of roars like an injured wild beast that had suddenly exploded.","He struggled to get up and tried to escape from the battlefield. Although he wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, he now understood the gap between them from the clash earlier. He didn’t want to die in vain here.","Chu Yunfan was too terrifying. It should be said that humans were too terrifying. He was only in his twenties. For the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom’s royals, this age might not even be enough to lay an egg, but Chu Yunfan had already grown to an incredible level.","Although humans were not as good as them, once they stepped onto the path of cultivation, they could often achieve amazing achievements in a short time. Their speed was far faster than the long-lived demons.","On the other side, King Ren had also rushed toward Chu Yunfan and shouted, “White Dragon, are you really going to run now? Will he let you go? Only by working together can we kill him!”","Compared to White Dragon, King Ren understood Chu Yunfan’s ruthlessness. Several Divine Servants had died by Chu Yunfan’s hands,and he killed them without hesitation. From this, it could be seen that Chu Yunfan was not a soft-hearted person.","That was why King Ren didn’t think about running away. What a joke. Judging from the speed Chu Yunfan displayed, Chu Yunfan was clearly much faster than the two of them. It was almost impossible for them to escape from his grasp.","Unless Chu Yunfan was severely injured or killed, none of them could leave today.","King Ren made a hand sign, which instantly turned into a huge mountain that smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","“Mount Tai Seal!”","With King Ren in front of him, Chu Yunfan had no choice but to temporarily let go of pursuing White Dragon. He shouted, “You want to stop me with this?! Can it really stop me?!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and jumped up from the ground. His whole body burst out and he punched the huge mountain that was falling.","Boom!","The huge mountain exploded in mid-air, turning into light spots that filled the sky. After all, it was only a divine power and not the real Mount Tai.","King Ren suddenly felt a suffocation in his chest as his divine power was reflected back at him. Since he had cultivated the Mount Tai Seal, he had basically swept through everyone. Very few people dared to go head to head with his seal, let alone someone like Chu Yunfan, who had exploded it with a single punch.","At this moment, he finally understood why White Dragon, who even he was afraid of, was sent flying by a single punch. Chu Yunfan’s physique cultivation was simply terrifying and he didn’t seem like a human.","After destroying the Mount Tai Seal, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. Like a bolt of lightning, he pounced at King Ren.","“Since you want to die first, I’ll oblige!”","Chu Yunfan flew high up into the sky. His leg instantly tore out like lightning and martial intent materialized in the air, turning into an incomparably huge mantis. The leg seemed to be able to cut the world apart. The terrifying energy that seeped out was terrifying, and even the sun, moon, mountains, and rivers lost their color.","At this time, the Mantis Divine Kick that Chu Yunfan used was completely different from those of Innates. For a true master, even if it was a very ordinary move, it would have the power to turn something rotten into something magical, and the current Chu Yunfan was just like that.","King Ren felt the hair on his back stand on end. If he didn’t dodge this attack, he would have been cut in half.","“Chain Mount Tai seal!”","Sensing the danger, King Ren frantically urged the divine power in his body. His moon-white robe was full of energy, and his hand signing was as fast as lightning—so fast that the afterimages of his hands could was imperceptible.","One after another, huge mountains appeared out of thin air and started to fall in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar and threw out a punch. The fist energy shook the sky and the earth. The terrifying fist energy scattered in all directions and shattered everything. Those huge mountains were penetrated by his fist.","Boom!","The force of the punch did not slow down and arrived in front of King Ren.","A powerful light burst out from King Ren’s body and formed a barrier in front of him, protecting him. However, this barrier was of no use. With just a single punch, Chu Yunfan penetrated the barrier and hsis fist landed on King Ren’s body.","Ack!","King Ren immediately coughed up a mouthful of blood. He felt as if all the bones in his body had been shattered one by one. A terrifying fist force was raging through his body.","Boom!","King Ren fell heavily to the ground, creating a huge pit.","He was thrown to the ground, but when he saw White Dragon from the corner of his eye, he felt like he was about to explode. He had said so much, and even stopped Chu Yunfan to buy time for White Dragon to recover.","Who would’ve thought that White Dragon was determined to escape? White Dragon didn’t even care that he had been knocked to the ground and immediately turned to escape. White Dragon had used him as a shield.","On the other hand, White Dragon’s thinking was much simpler. Looking at Chu Yunfan, did it look like he could be dealt with by two people working together? It was obvious that Chu Yunfan had reached an existence of another level.","Therefore, he wasted no time. He immediately dragged his broken body and fled the ruins.","Chu Yunfan saw that the two of them were not united and sneered. However, it was not strange. King Ren and White Dragon were originally hostile to each other, but under the pressure, they reluctantly joined forces.","As soon as one had the chance, one would sell the other party out immediately without any hesitation.","Chu Yunfan didn’t hold back. He raised his arm high, and a thunder spear appeared in his hand. Then, he threw it out.","Stab!","The thunder spear swept toward King Ren at lightning speed.","King Ren didn’t have time to dodge and was locked on by Chu Yunfan’s divine will. The spear nailed King Ren to the ground and he struggled to get up."]},{"number":1080,"title":"Chapter 1080 Slaying White Dragon and Obtaining the Brahma Tree","paragraphs":["1080 Slaying White Dragon and Obtaining the Brahma Tree","Chu Yunfan’s casual strike instantly nailed King Ren to the ground, and then Chu Yunfan chased after White Dragon.","The thunder wings behind Chu Yunfan’s back unfurled, and he was as fast as lightning. He caught up with White Dragon in the blink of an eye.","White Dragon was shocked. He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to catch up to him within seconds.","He had given up the opportunity to join forces with King Ren, hoping that King Ren would buy him some time so that he could run far enough so that Chu Yunfan couldn’t catch up.","!!","Who would have thought that everything would be for naught. It was something that was simply impossible to achieve.","“Rrrraaagh!”","White Dragon let out a roar and his entire body began to glow. He threw a punch at Chu Yunfan, and the terrifying light of the fist energy was emitted. All the qi and blood in his body were mobilized, and he turned it into divine power as he attacked Chu Yunfan.","Such a terrifying punch, even an ordinary peak Divine would not dare to take it head on, for fear of being killed.","But Chu Yunfan did not care.","Clang!","This punch landed on Chu Yunfan’s body and a sound like the clanging of metal erupted. However, it failed to stop Chu Yunfan. Instead, the energy that was reflected back made his entire body tremble.","It was extremely terrifying.","White Dragon’s face showed a hint of fear. He no longer had the invincible aura he had before, let alone the feeling of contempt he had for Chu Yunfan.","In just a few moves, he could feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above his. That terrifying strength was enough to crush him.","He no longer had that feeling of being high and mighty.","By the time White Dragon came back to his senses, Chu Yunfan was already right in front of him.","Chu Yunfan didn’t make any extra movements. He just threw a simple punch at White Dragon.","White Dragon let out a blood-curdling screech as he was sent flying, crashing into a mountain wall.","But Chu Yunfan did not let him go. He threw a few more punches at him.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Every time Chu Yunfan’s fist landed on White Dragon’s body, it was like a comet hitting the earth, causing a series of terrifying explosions.","Finally, White Dragon couldn’t hold on any longer. He couldn’t even maintain his human form and transformed into a white flood dragon that was over three hundred meters long.","At this moment, the scales on the flood dragon’s body were broken into pieces, and blood was flowing out from the cracks. It was all caused by Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Fortunately, demons’ physical bodies were naturally strong. If it were an ordinary person, they would have long been blown to pieces.","“Rrrraaaggh!”","White Dragon, who had turned into a flood dragon, roared and opened his bloody jaws. A terrifying energy surged out from within and turned into a huge dragon pearl, smashing toward Chu Yunfan.","“You managed to cultivate a dragon pearl?” Chu Yunfan looked at White Dragon in surprise.","Only real dragons could cultivate the dragon pearl. It was the true natal magic weapon of the dragon race, and also the source of its origin, which had endless power.","However, only a true dragon could cultivate such a thing. If the bloodline of an ordinary dragon wasn’t pure enough, it couldn’t be cultivated.","White Dragon must have had some fortuitous encounter. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to cultivate the legendary dragon pearl.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up when he saw this and immediately spread out his arms. When this dragon pearl landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. Usually, even a huge mountain would be smashed into pieces. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan’s physique was strong enough. Otherwise, he would not have been able to withstand it.","Chu Yunfan opened his palms and caught the dragon pearl in his hand. He felt a huge force pulling at the dragon pearl, trying to pull it back.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and slapped down with his palm, directly hitting White Dragon’s huge body.","“Rrrraaagh!”","White Dragon let out a blood-curdling scream as he crashed into the mountain peak. He struggled to get up, but Chu Yunfan wouldn’t give him the chance to do so. He immediately used the Mantis Divine Kick to sweep out, and White Dragon’s huge body was cut in half by a terrifying blade light.","Then, Chu Yunfan raised his arm high and condensed a ball of thunder energy in his hand. He then turned it into a thunder spear and threw it out.","Boom!","The upper half of White Dragon’s body was nailed to the mountain peak, and his heart was pierced through. Even though his life force was as strong as that of dragons, he couldn’t stop it and died instantly.","After White Dragon’s death, the dragon pearl lost its owner. Chu Yunfan easily erased the spiritual imprint on it and took it for his own use.","Dragon pearls were extremely rare treasures, even back during the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Although it was only the dragon pearl of a flood dragon, it was still very precious to the current Chu Yunfan. It was enough to be refined into an extremely powerful magic weapon.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t have the time to refine it right now. After collecting White Dragon’s corpse, he returned to where the Brahma Tree was.","At this moment, the Brahma Tree barrier was weakening. Ebony Dragon King flew out from within and greeted, “Greetings, Master!”","“Ebony Dragon King,” Chu Yunfan said with a nod, “You’ve done well. When the time comes, I will pass on a remarkable secret art to you as a reward.”","Hearing this, Ebony Dragon King was overjoyed. He had already figured out that Chu Yunfan must have obtained some kind of incredible inheritance. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be in such a state. And if he could have Chu Yunfan’s guidance, he would be able to save himself a lot of time on the path of cultivation.","It was worth it for him to betray the demons and join the Federation.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked at the Brahma Tree. In front of this towering tree, Tang Siyu’s aura was gradually rising, just an immortal deity.","At this rate, it would be easy for Tang Siyu, who had consumed the Brahma Fruit, to break through to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan could not help but laugh. Everyone had come for the Brahma Tree, but no one had expected that Tang Siyu be the one to gain its fruits in the end.","However, Chu Yunfan’s harvest was even greater, because this Brahma Tree was a once-in-a-thousand-years miracle.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand and placed Tang Siyu into the Mountain River Diagram, letting her continue to cultivate there and slowly digest the energy of the Brahma Fruit.","After that, he conjured two giant hands using qi and pulled the Brahma Tree out of the ground, then transplanted it onto the herb mountain in the Mountain River Diagram.","Sure enough, just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, there was no rejection.","...","Chu Yunfan then looked at Ebony Dragon King and said, “Let’s get out of here.”"]},{"number":1081,"title":"Chapter 1081 This Is What You Call a Massacre","paragraphs":["1081 This Is What You Call a Massacre","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged on Ebony Dragon King’s back.","Ebony Dragon King let out a long roar and quickly flew out of the ruins.","As soon as they were out, Chu Yunfan found the entrance of the ruins in chaos.","Great Ancestor Chu, Chu Haoyue, Yang Feiyang, and Zhu Buping, who had come out earlier, were all here.","!!","At the exit of the ruins, the demons and the marine folks had clearly discovered the situation inside. Countless marine folks and aerial monsters flew over.","They were so densely packed that almost the whole sky was blocked out. Even if everyone was a Divine, they would not be able to break out.","Although Divines were powerful, they were not gods. They could be killed and would encounter difficulties. It was just a matter of whether they were willing to pay the price.","Among the marine folks and the demons, there were also many monsters at the Divine Abilities Stage. It was these powerful monsters that made Great Ancestor Chu and the others unable to advance or retreat.","The whole battlefield was even more tragic than when Chu Yunfan had entered the ruins because more demons and marine folks had come to support the attack.","The experts from the Holy Lands brought by Chu Yunfan had urged the demons and marine folks to send more experts, blocking Great Ancestor Chu and the others inside.","They didn’t know that in the ruins, the demons and marine folks had already been completely annihilated by Chu Yunfan.","They were still continuously charging over, trying to surround and kill Great Ancestor Chu and the others.","Seeing this, Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate. He put his index and middle fingers together and pointed. A terrifying sword light instantly burst out from his fingertip.","Wherever the sword light passed, all the monsters, regardless of whether they were marine folk monsters or aerial monsters, all exploded and turned into clouds of blood mist.","It was only one strike, but this sword light was over a thousand meters long. Wherever the sword light swept, hundreds of monsters were turned into blood mist.","Such a huge commotion naturally alerted Great Ancestor Chu and the others.","“Yunfan!” Great Ancestor Chu said in surprise.","Everyone’s attention turned to Chu Yunfan, and their faces revealed a hint of surprise. After all, at this point, everyone was trapped. Now that Chu Yunfan had appeared, they had a new force.","Sure enough, Chu Yunfan was different from them. Those monsters were tall and many of them were even like small mountains. They could kill a few humans with a casual attack, and even a dozen of them. But compared to Chu Yunfan, they simply paled in comparison.","Chu Yunfan’s casual attack had blown up thousands of monsters. The commotion was much bigger than their own. At first, they were wondering how Chu Yunfan managed to break through the encirclement of so many monsters.","Now, they finally understood that Chu Yunfan had killed his way in. Whoever got in his way would die. He had killed his way in.","Chu Yunfan took a step and flew up from Ebony Dragon King’s back, killing his way through the endless horde of monsters.","Countless monsters pounced at him, and Chu Yunfan began to operate the Emperor Method. All the divine power in his body began to boil, turning into thunder that filled the sky. After merging with the Thunderclap Physique, Chu Yunfan’s control over thunder had reached a peak.","Boom!","A hundred meters around Chu Yunfan’s body turned into a sea of thunder, and Chu Yunfan was like the god of thunder in this sea of thunder.","This was a divine power that Chu Yunfan had developed based on his Thunderclap Physique, the Thunder Domain. Any monster that entered this domain would be electrocuted to death by the power of thunder.","Those monsters couldn’t get close to Chu Yunfan. They were all electrocuted and fell into the sea like stones, but more monsters rushed over without fear of death.","These monsters were clearly being controlled by stronger experts. Although they would die if they rushed up, the marine folks and demons had a higher life level than these monsters after they transformed. They could control these monsters, and these monsters couldn’t resist. This was the suppression in the depths of their bloodlines.","Chu Yunfan didn’t hold back either. The sword light from his fingertips kept sweeping out, and in the instant the sword light swept out, thousands of monsters died at his hands.","‘This won’t do. If this continues, there will be no end to it.’ Chu Yunfan frowned slightly.","There was no end to these monsters. Even with his killing speed, it would be difficult to kill them all. After all, they were not on land, but out on the Infinite Sea.","There were countless powerful marine monsters in the Infinite Sea, and they could not all be killed. It was simply impossible to expect to kill all of them. Even if the Federation were to launch all of their nuclear bombs, it would still be impossible.","Chu Yunfan didn’t mind. He could fight for another three days and three nights. However, Great Ancestor Chu and the others were seriously injured. If they continued to fight, they would probably run out of energy.","‘The only thing we can do now is kill those Divine monsters first. After killing them, these ordinary monsters will collapse without a fight.’","Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. Even if these monsters were not afraid of death, they wouldn’t attack endlessly without anyone controlling them.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. He took a few steps forward, and already rushed toward a Divine monster.","The monster didn’t seem to have expected Chu Yunfan to suddenly appear in front of it. It let out a roar and opened its bloody maw, trying to swallow Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan slashed out a shocking sword light, splitting the marine monster in half.","Slice!","The monster let out a blood-curdling screech as its body was cut in half. Its huge body fell and its blood dyed the entire sea red.","Countless sea creatures rushed over and began to devour the flesh of the Divine monster. It was not an ordinary monster. It was a Divine. Even if it was dead, its flesh and blood contained powerful energy, and it immediately attracted the marine monsters to feed on it.","There were even many aerial monsters that swooped down, fighting for the flesh and blood. They stopped listening to commands.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop either. He immediately pounced on the next Divine monster.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","In mere seconds, Chu Yunfan had killed more than twenty Divine monsters. Suddenly, the attacks of those fearless monsters slowed down."]},{"number":1082,"title":"Chapter 1082 A God-Like Man, Forcing Back the Allied Forces","paragraphs":["1082 A God-Like Man, Forcing Back the Allied Forces","Even if those monsters weren’t afraid of death, they weren’t really reckless. They were just driven by the powerful marine folks and demons which were more terrifying than their instincts.","But now, Chu Yunfan had slaughtered more than twenty of those Divine monsters in one breath, and even more monsters and marine beasts had escaped from his control and fled in all directions as if their lives were lost.","Immediately, the pressure on Great Ancestor Chu and the others was greatly reduced. It was not that they didn’t know about this method.","To shoot a man, one had to shoot the horse.","To capture a bandit, one had to capture the leader.","It was just that in their current state, it would be good enough if they could protect themselves. They simply didn’t have the ability to capture the leader before capturing the bandit.","However, Chu Yunfan’s massacre was not over yet. He was like a killing machine that doesn’t know fatigue. He killed in all directions—from top to bottom and from left to right. Wherever he passed, countless monsters were killed.","The entire sea had been dyed red with blood. The remains of countless monsters and marine beasts had attracted even more marine beasts.","However, even though these marine beasts did not have any self-control, they didn’t dare to rashly attack Chu Yunfan and the others. Although they weren’t very intelligent, they could instinctively understand how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Chu Yunfan’s unscrupulous slaughter of these monsters finally attracted the attention of the main battlefield. He had killed these densely-packed monsters and no more monsters or marine beasts dared to come forward.","Finally, the Federation’s fleet saw Chu Yunfan and the others. When they saw that Chu Yunfan had rescued those inside, the morale of the fleet soared.","“He did it!”","After Moonfall Protege of Moonfall killed a few marine beasts that pounced at her feet, she stared in shock as she watched Chu Yunfan’s massacre in the distance.","For her, today was a good lesson. For the first time, she understood what a species war was. In the Holy Land, the largest battle she had experienced was the battle between sects.","The scale of those battles was huge, but it was nothing compared to a species war.","It was a model that she had never seen before—fighting for the survival of a species.","In the Holy Land, when the sects fought, the defeated party could still surrender and have a chance to start over again. There was no such opportunity in a species war. Whether it was the marine folks, the demons, or the humans, they were all fearless and would not retreat.","The Federation had suffered heavy losses over the past few days. A large fleet had been crippled, but they continued to push forward and fight to the death.","The losses of the demons and the marine folks were even greater, but no one retreated, because it was impossible to surrender on this battlefield.","If the monsters surrendered, they would only be killed by the humans, and their inner cores would be used to make medicinal pills. The other parts of their bodies would also be used for various purposes.","There was only one outcome for humans if they surrendered, and that was to become food for the monsters.","This was the first time Moonfall Protege had come into contact with such a mode of battle.","The other shock came from Chu Yunfan. He had gone into the ruins alone and killed his way into the demons and the marine folks’s encirclement.","However, he had been successful and rescued the people trapped inside.","Chu Yunfan’s unstoppable massacre left a deep impression in her heart. He was like a demonic god.","Not only Moonfall Protege, but the other Holy Land experts were also the same. A seed of awe had been planted in their hearts, and they were no longer as high and mighty as before.","What shocked these experts even more was that Chu Yunfan could kill Divines like they were grass. With just a casual strike, a Divine marine beast or monster would die at his hands.","Only then did they realize that the pride of Divines was nothing in front of him. Most of them recalled how he used a nuclear bomb to kill hundreds of Divines in one go.","That day, Chu Yunfan had used a nuclear bomb, so it didn’t count as his own power. But now, it was all his own.","Now, they realized that if Chu Yunfan hadn’t used the nuclear bomb that day, he probably would still have had the power to wipe out the more than two hundred Divines in one go.","It was just that he chose the most intimidating method to make them fear the Federation.","Chu Yunfan’s reappearance gave the Federation’s fleet hope of victory.","In the past, the Federation’s fleet had been extremely troubled by these endless monsters and marine beasts. Although they knew that they were driven by Divine monsters and marine beasts, it was difficult for them to do anything to these Divine monsters.","Therefore, the Federation had no other choice but to fight a war of attrition with them and use the mechas produced by industrial assembly lines to fight against the endless monsters.","That was the last resort. A human family might only have two or three children in their lifetime and maybe a few more. However, monsters could give birth to more than a dozen in one go. This fertility rate was not something that humans could compare to.","Even though the Federation had a large population, they still felt a headache from such a head-on fight.","But Chu Yunfan had changed the Federation’s thinking.","While he was killing the ordinary monsters that were pouncing at him, he spread out his divine will to search for those Divine monsters. Once he found them, he would point them out one by one.","The Divine monsters that were called out were, without exception, unable to escape.","Although there were many Divine monsters on the battlefield, their numbers were too few when compared to the endless number of ordinary monsters.","In just a short time, Chu Yunfan had singlehandedly killed more than half of the Divine monsters on the battlefield. Even with so many Divine human experts working together, they wouldn’t be able to kill as many as Chu Yunfan had.","This showed the soldiers of the Federation why a top master was so important. He was indeed as powerful as a nuclear weapon.","After Chu Yunfan went on a killing spree, the remaining Divine monsters didn’t dare to stay. Their intelligence was much higher than that of ordinary monsters, so they naturally understood that they were no match for Chu Yunfan.","Almost immediately, they started to flee in all directions.","Without the control of the Divines, the remaining monsters were finally scared of being killed. They quickly scampered away in an unorganized fashion.","They were chased by the Federation Army for thousands of miles before they finally successfully got away.","On the Internet, news that Chu Yunfan had rescued the Federation’s experts who were trapped in the deep sea ruins and then defeated the allied forces of the marine folks and the demons spread like wildfire, causing an uproar."]},{"number":1083,"title":"Chapter 1083 Chu Yunfan the Human-Shaped, Walking Nuclear Bomb","paragraphs":["1083 Chu Yunfan the Human-Shaped, Walking Nuclear Bomb","The Internet was in an uproar.","“As expected of Mighty Chu. He’s mighty and domineering!”","“That’s right, the marine folks and the demons are nothing but clay statues!”","“Hahaha, let’s see what those guys have to say now. They’re nothing in front of Mighty Chu!”","On the Internet, Chu Yunfan had become known as the guardian deity. It was as if as long as he existed, the Federation had nothing to be afraid of.","After all, Chu Yunfan had even turned this near-death situation around.","Once a video of him killing the marine folk and demon allied-army out on the Infinite Sea was released, it shocked countless people on the Internet.","Although they all knew that Chu Yunfan had saved people and that his strength was not to be underestimated, they did not know how he had done it.","After watching this video, they finally understood and were shocked. When they saw his sword strike, which destroyed hundreds and thousands of monsters that were as big as small mountains in one breath, they were dumbfounded.","“This is equivalent to the power of a small tactical nuclear bomb on a battlefield.”","“That’s right. Mighty Chu is like a walking nuclear bomb!”","“The Federation is impregnable from now on!”","Many were shocked that humans could become so powerful with their own cultivation—even comparable to a nuclear bomb.","In the past, their understanding of a Divine’s strength was derived from various legends. Compared to ordinary people, Divines were undoubtedly much stronger. However, they did not know how strong the experts in the Divine Abilities Stage were.","And Chu Yunfan’s existence had undoubtedly provided them with a realistic template.","Of course, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan’s strength was at the top of the Divine Abilities Stage. However, this didn’t prevent them from being inspired by him and setting off a crazy wave of cultivation in the Federation.","In modern society, although it was said that everyone cultivated martial arts and everyone was like a dragon, most still did not regard cultivation as the main theme of their life. They went to work and went to school.","But the amazing strength that Chu Yunfan displayed made them feel a throbbing in their hearts.","This video was, of course, released by the higher-ups of the Federation to boost the recently low morale of the Federation. At this moment of panic, especially when the trend of the demon and the marine folk alliance was becoming more and more obvious, the Federation’s morale had dropped.","The Federation was in desperate need of such a hero.","At first, there were many forces inside and outside the Federation who were quite dissatisfied with Chu Yunfan, but when they saw the video of the battle, they were completely dumbfounded. They all passed down orders that no one was to go against Chu Yunfan.","Those who were originally targeting the Chu clan, Chu Yunfan, and all the forces related to him completely ceased their activities. What a joke, if he was angered, he could single-handedly annihilate a super-large force. It was no problem to say that he was a walking nuclear bomb.","Although the battle had ended, the aftermath had only just begun to ferment. Great Ancestor Liu was confirmed to have betrayed the country. One could imagine the situation that this once prominent family was facing.","Because Great Ancestor Liu had schemed against all the human experts inside and outside the Federation, and now that most of these experts had been saved by Chu Yunfan, their revenge naturally followed shortly after.","The Liu clan’s various forces were uprooted, their properties were divided up by various forces, and the remaining vacancies were filled by other forces.","Although many of the Liu clan’s descendants were not aware of their great ancestor’s actions, no one would complain on their behalf.","More people suddenly realized that out of the original eight great families, only the Chu clan, the Tang clan, and the Li clan were left. Out of the Eight Greats that had stood tall in the Federation for at least a hundred years, five of them had been destroyed in a few short years.","This was a slap in the face for many who had thought that the Eight Greats would continue to exist forever.","Within the Federation, the reshuffling of the major forces had just begun. Too many things had been exposed this time around. It was not just the Liu clan. Many other forces that had close ties to them, even the small forces that had developed from the Liu clan, were wiped out.","However, for the Federation, although these things were in full swing, they were only settled after autumn. The distribution of interests finally came to an end.","Of course, Chu Yunfan got the biggest share. Now, no one dared to ignore his existence. Even though he failed to save all the Federation experts, with his strength, it was only natural that he would get the biggest share.","He had saved so many people this time and almost everyone wanted to express their gratitude to him. Among them, the biggest benefits naturally fell into his hands.","Just Chu Yunfan’s various assets alone had exceeded 200 billion. The Chu clan and Special Ops, who had been following Chu Yunfan, had also benefited greatly.","His wealth had been comparable to that of a country’s, and now it had increased even more.","The major event that the Federation was facing was how the Holy Land would integrate into the Federation. With such a large force and countless experts, the integration of the Holy Land would naturally involve countless matters. It was not something that could be explained clearly in a few words.","There was the matter of which force would be assigned to which base city, who could enter the Federation and become a senior official, and so on. There were many trivial matters, but they had to be faced.","Fortunately, the higher-ups of the Holy Land and the Federation reached an agreement. As for the specific details, both sides would organize a large negotiation to finalize them one by one.","All of these things had nothing to do with Chu Yunfan. He couldn’t wait to go home. It had been a long time since he last saw his family.","At this time, Mr. And Mrs. Chu were living in the core area of the Chu ancestral land. Because of Chu Yunfan, this branch had long become the core of the Chu clan.","Compared to when Chu Yunfan first came to the Chu clan a few years ago, the scale of the Chu clan’s ancestral land had more than doubled. Because of him, the Chu clan’s strength had at least doubled compared to a few years ago. With their size, it was easy to imagine how many benefits they had gained.","However, as he walked through the core area, Chu Yunfan was surprised to see a familiar figure."]},{"number":1084,"title":"Chapter 1084 When Do You Plan to Get Married?","paragraphs":["1084 When Do You Plan to Get Married?","That person’s features were somewhat similar to Chu Yunfan’s, and who else could it be other than his cousin, Chu Yuntian?","Beside Chu Yuntian stood a tall and beautiful woman who looked to be in her twenties.","Upon spotting Chu Yunfan, Chu Yuntian’s expression became a little awkward. After all, the relationship between the two cousins was not very good, but of course, it was not bad either.","In the past, Chu Yunfan had always aimed to surpass Chu Yuntian. At least in his memory, most of the time. But, Chu Yuntaian didn’t know when it started, but Chu Yunfan had become the person he had to look up to.","He wasn’t even a target to catch up to!","The Divine Abilities Stage was a supreme stage within the Federation. Those who could enter it were all top figures of the Federation.","Chu Yuntian was also known as a genius and later received the full support of the Chu clan. He was now only in his twenties and his cultivation had already entered the fourth Innate stage. Within the Chu clan, he was a famous genius. Even within the Federation, he had made quite a name for himself.","But in front of Chu Yunfan, all of this was like a light the size of a grain of rice against the bright moon.","Their reputations were like Heaven and Earth. Just stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage was something Chu Yuntian might never have the hope of achieving in this life.","Although he was conceited, he knew what the Divine Abilities Stage was. There were many geniuses in the Chu clan whose talents were no less than his, but they were also stuck in the Innate Stage, unable to advance.","He and Chu Yunfan had not seen each other for a long time.","“Yuntian, who’s this?” Chu Yunfan was the first to speak.","The tiny bit of ill-feelings he had in the past had already disappeared, so he didn’t feel that there was anything to be embarrassed about.","“This is Xiao Yu, my girlfriend. When did you get back?” Chu Yuntian asked.","Chu Yuntian had also seen the chaos at occurred at the deep sea ruins. However, with his cultivation, he did not have the qualifications to join. He could only read the news on the Internet.","“I just got back. We’ll catch up later. I’m going to visit my parents. I’ll come to find you when I’m free,” Chu Yunfan said.","He could also see that Chu Yuntian was a little awkward, so he didn’t say anything more. At this time, he was missing his family, so he immediately said goodbye to his cousin.","“Alright.” Chu Yuntian nodded. He did not know why, but he felt relieved.","Seeing Chu Yunfan walk away, Xiao Yu finally asked, “Was that your cousin? Why does he look so familiar?”","Because the gap between him and Chu Yunfan was getting wider and wider, he was not willing to mention that he had such a cousin. His pride did not allow him to be seen as Chu Yunfan’s older cousin in the eyes of others.","That was why he had never mentioned it to his girlfriend.","“Of course. He’s my cousin.”","Chu Yuntian didn’t want to talk about it anymore, so he left with his girlfriend.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan returned to his family villa. Although the Chu clan wanted to move his parents to a bigger house, they rejected the offer. There were only two of them, so why did they need such a big house?","However, compared to ordinary people, this villa which was over 800 square meters, was super luxurious.","As soon as Chu Yunfan stepped into the villa, a huge figure flew over and pounced on him, affectionately rubbing his face.","“Silly thing!”","Chu Yunfan patted the head of this huge figure. Who else could it be but the Thunder Winged Beast?","The Thunder Winged Beast hadn’t seen Chu Yunfan for a long time, so it immediately pounced at him the moment he appeared.","Now that the Thunder Winged Beast’s strength had improved greatly and entered tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage, it had returned to the appearance it had when it first met Chu Yunfan—only about two meters tall. But compared to the past, it was currently much more powerful.","Not far away from the Thunder Winged Beast, there was a fox about the size of an ordinary kitten curled up and lying on its side. This fox had six tails and flames would burst out of its body from time to time.","It was the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox that Chu Yunfan had subdued before.","Although Chu Yunfan had tamed both these monsters, the Nether Fox was different from the Thunder Winged Beast.","The Thunder Winged Beast had been tamed by Chu Yunfan since young, so they were very close to each other. The Nether Fox was respectful to Chu Yunfan but they were not close.","However, Chu Yunfan did not care too much about this. His eyes lit up because he recalled his previous arrangements. Ebony Dragon King was assigned to protect Tang Siyu, while the Thunder Winged Beast stayed at home to protect his parents, and the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox was to follow his sister.","This was the bodyguard that Chu Yunfan had secretly arranged for his sister, Chu Qingxuan. After all, she had been cultivating with her instructor all over the Kunlun Realm and it was inevitable that she would encounter all kinds of dangers, so Chu Yunfan had been worried about her.","However, what Chu Qingxuan did not know was that the six-tailed little fox that she thought looked cute was actually a shadow assassin, an existence that had long entered the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan had never told her about it and just instructed her to bring the fox with her. Chu Qingxuan and her instructor’s cultivation level were not high enough to ascertain the hidden cultivation level of the Nether Fox.","After all, the Nether Fox was famous for its assassination and was best at hiding its aura.","However, if the Nether Fox was here, did that mean that Chu Qingxuan was home?","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan strode across the lawn and pushed open the door. As expected, he immediately heard Chu Qingxuan’s clear and melodious laughter.","Chu Wencheng and Yang Yayun were also there, chatting and laughing with Chu Qingxuan.","“Mom, Dad, I’m home!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","Yang Yayun simply glanced at Chu Yunfan, then nodded and said, “Oh.”","Chu Yunfan suddenly felt a little awkward.","“Since you’re back, sit down,” Chu Wencheng said.","He was already used to his son leaving for prolonged periods. Before this, everyone assumed that Chu Yunfan had met with an accident, but he knew that his son was fine.","After all, whether Chu Yunfan was fine or not, Ebony Dragon King knew it best.","A day ago, he had received news from Special Ops that Chu Yunfan had reappeared. The couple had already rejoiced yesterday.","Chu Qingxuan, on the other hand, said excitedly, “Big Brother, I saw the video! You were so powerful! Those demons and marine folks were no match for you!”","Chu Yunfan saw his parents staring at him and smiled awkwardly. Of course, he understood that his parents were deliberately giving him the cold shoulder. Who asked him to disappear for such a long time and make them hear about his death over and over again?","“It’s nothing. They’re not as powerful as they claim on the Internet,” Chu Yunfan said.","Suddenly, Yang Yayun blurted out, “When do you plan to get married?”","..."]},{"number":1085,"title":"Chapter 1085 Time to Get Engaged","paragraphs":["1085 Time to Get Engaged","“Huh?” Chu Yunfan didn’t expect that the first question his mother would ask him was when he would get married.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s confused look, Yang Yayun struck while the iron was hot and said, “Look at the other boys who are the same age as you. They have all brought girlfriends home. You’re the only one who’s still single. Don’t you think that your dad and I don’t worry?”","“Mom, I’m still young!” Chu Yunfan said.","He didn’t feel that he was that old. He had just graduated a few years ago. In addition, nowadays, humans had very long lifespans. Generally, people could live up to the theoretical limit of 120 years old. Therefore, a man in his 20s was only equivalent to a teenager in the past. Many people got married in their 30s or 40s. Some even married in their 50s.","Not to mention that after stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage, one’s lifespan would more than double that of the average person.","It was because of this that Chu Yunfan didn’t consider the issue of marriage. He always felt that he was still very far away from this.","“You’re not young. You’re already in your twenties. If you don’t get married soon, you won’t ever bring a girl home!” Yang Yayun said.","“Look, your dad and I have met a lot of good girls recently. They’re all daughters from rich families and I heard that they are all from prestigious families.”","Chu Yunfan furrowed his brows. “Since they’re from famous families, how did you get to know them, Mom?”","“It’s because of you. You’re so famous now that many people are trying to curry favor with me. Do you think I don’t know?” Yang Yayun said lightly.","Chu Yunfan had made a name for himself in the outside world and there were many people who wanted to curry favor with him but had no way to do so. He was in secluded cultivation all year round and no one could find him, so they naturally thought of ways to curry favor with his relatives.","Among them, Chu Qingxuan was training out in the wilderness all year round, following her instructor on expeditions to various places. Since they couldn’t find her, there was naturally no other way. Thus, Chu Wencheng and Yang Yayun became highly sought after in the eyes of these people.","As long as one wasn’t blind, they would be able to see that with Chu Yunfan’s age and power, the Chu clan would be the most powerful family in the Federation for the next few hundred years.","If they didn’t curry favor now, when would they start?","Moreover, Chu Yunfan was still unmarried, so he had become a hot commodity in the eyes of many people. They thought of many ways to recommend outstanding juniors to Yang Yayun.","In the past few years, Yang Yayun was dazzled by the number of outstanding girls she had been introduced to, and the level of these girls was getting higher and higher.","Even Yang Yayun was very satisfied with them. In addition, Chu Yunfan was slowly getting older. She couldn’t hold it in any longer and had to settle this matter.","“That’s right. And it’s not just your mother. Many people have even come to me with proposals!” Chu Wencheng said, “I know that you’re focused on cultivation, but your mother and I think it is time for you to think about your life. You disappeared for a few months to a year every time. Do you want to continue delaying this?”","“I think that girl from the Tang clan is a good choice,” Chu Wencheng said.","Chu Yunfan was startled by his parents’ words. He thought that it was indeed the case, so he could only say, “Dad, Mom, you’re right. I also think it’s time. But Siyu is currently in seclusion. Once she comes out, I’ll propose to her.”","His parents made Chu Yunfan realize that it was about time for him and Tang Siyu to come to a conclusion.","Although he felt that it was still too early to get married as he and Tang Siyu were both busy with cultivation, if it was just an engagement, they could start preparing.","“Great, I’ve been waiting for you to say that!” Yang Yayun quickly said.","Because of Chu Yunfan, the two of them no longer had any pressure to survive. They looked young, but in fact, they were only in their fifties. They were in the prime of their lives and had nothing to do, so naturally, they had their eyes on Chu Yunfan.","“How about this? We’ll start preparing for these things. After all, Siyu is now the head of the Tang clan and you’re now the number one of the Federation. Your engagement can’t be rushed,” Chu Wencheng said.","“Okay.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","He could let them handle these things and that would give them something to do.","Of course, the most important thing was to block out many people’s thoughts. After all, in the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan was still single, which was an opportunity and a hot cake.","In many people’s eyes, this was an extremely good opportunity. If Chu Yunfan were to marry one of their descendants, they would also be able to share some of the benefits of his strength.","During this period, everyone knew that the Chu clan had gained a lot of benefits because of Chu Yunfan. Even the Tang clan had gained a lot because of him.","Regarding this, all the forces were drooling. Furthermore, there were rumors that Chu Yunfan had a method that could help peak Innates enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","Divines were highly regarded throughout the Federation. As long as one of them appeared within a family, that family would immediately soar.","In this situation, everyone was trying to find ways to put their own people around Chu Yunfan. Forget being his wife, even becoming his concubine would be good.","Although it was modern society now, concubines were still popular, and Tang Siyu was the child of a maidservant, whose status was lower than that of a consort.","Among the various forces, it was very normal for powerful men to have many concubines.","Fortunately, his parents knew what they were doing. No matter how others tried to promote themselves, they would not relent.","However, Chu Yunfan also felt that it was indeed time to solve this problem. After he got engaged to Tang Siyu, he would be able to make many people give up on this idea. Otherwise, all kinds of harassment would annoy him.","“Why not just get married? Get married sooner so that your dad and I can have grandchildren...” Yang Yayun muttered in dissatisfaction.","She wanted to get things done in one go and make Chu Yunfan marry Tang Siyu.","Beads of sweat popped up on Chu Yunfan’s forehead. He had never sweated when he fought against countless strong enemies, but he was already sweating profusely after talking to his mother for a few minutes.","While Chu Yunfan’s parents were forcing him to get married, the Federation was discussing the deep sea ruins.","After all, this incident involved all the Divines of the Federation and many experts died tragically. The Liu clan, one of the Eight Greats, had betrayed the Federation and was uprooted by the Federation.","The aftermath of this incident had not yet subsided, and it was just the beginning, especially since Chu Yunfan had ordered the use of nuclear bombs to bombard the demons and the marine folks who had participated in the siege of the Federation’s Divines.","For a time, there was a huge uproar."]},{"number":1086,"title":"Chapter 1086 Shocking the Federation","paragraphs":["1086 Shocking the Federation","Other than using nuclear bombs on the battlefield, the Federation rarely annihilated the monster tribes.","This was a tradition that had been passed down a long time ago in order to not push the monsters over the edge.","At that time, humans were still weak. If they angered the monsters, they would probably be constantly attacked.","To the Federation, which had just experienced a great catastrophe, it was undoubtedly a heavy blow. This tradition had been passed down since the beginning. After all, the current Federation didn’t have any advantage over the demons and the marine folks.","The humans were still accumulating advantages and cultivating their inner energy.","If they didn’t use nuclear bombs on a large scale, the demons and the marine folks wouldn’t send Divines to invade on a large scale. It had become a tacit understanding between the two sides.","However, Chu Yunfan’s order broke the long-standing tradition. With the guidance of the Federation’s military satellites, nuclear bombs were launched from the silo one after another. These were not tactical nuclear bombs used on the battlefield, but all strategic nuclear bombs.","The Federation did not use these kinds of nuclear bombs lightly. Once they were launched, it would be a major event. Of course, for the situation at that time, it was not wrong to describe it as a major event.","At that time, everyone’s attention was attracted by the fact that Chu Yunfan had rescued the experts of the Federation. By the time everyone realized what had happened, the matter of the Federation’s large-scale bombardment of the marine folks and the demons’ territory came to light.","For a time, it caused a great uproar. Everyone knew that the fragile balance between the Federation, the demons, and the marine folks was about to be broken.","An even bigger conflict and war were inevitable. For a time, many people on the Internet began to criticize Chu Yunfan’s order as being too rash. He had sent humanity into danger.","“This is going to break the years of relative peace the Federation has had.”","“Is Chu Yunfan trying to put the Federation in danger?”","“That’s right. Is it possible for the Federation to deal with the marine folks and the demons at the same time?”","“Doesn’t he know that the Federation will be plunged into misery and suffering after such an order is issued?”","However, these claims were immediately refuted by more people.","“Are we going to wait for the demons and the marine folks to attack us before we launch a counterattack?”","“That’s right. They were planning to bury all the Divines of the Federation. Isn’t that enough to start a war?”","“They sent the Federation experts to their deaths and then launched a full-scale invasion. It has been so many years. Are you still not used to the methods and habits of the monsters?”","“The all-out war has already begun, and you’re still holding on to that kind of hope at this point?”","For a time, the Federation was in a frenzy of discussion. This matter concerned the life and death of the Federation and was closely related to everyone. Many people were afraid of the upcoming war, but most of them were fearless.","At this time, the accounts of the demons and the marine folks that had disappeared suddenly resurfaced. They were all clamoring to take revenge on Chu Yunfan and the Federation.","Unless the Federation handed over Chu Yunfan, it would definitely lead to the crazy revenge of the two species.","The two species had suffered too many losses this time, losing their rare and powerful Divines.","This time, Chu Yunfan ordered the nuclear bombs to hit their homes one by one. Although not every tribe was hit, the vast majority were. One nuclear bomb would destroy all the settlements of these species all at once.","Without Divines, these races had no way of defending themselves against such attacks. They evaporated from the Kunlun Realm.","There were even a few nuclear bombs that went directly toward Infinite Demon Mountain. Although they didn’t really hurt the demons in the end and were blocked by a barrier, they still scared the entire Infinite Demon Mountain.","If it wasn’t for the barrier, even if only one nuclear bomb fell into their home, the consequences would be unimaginable.","In the face of these demons and marine folks who clamored for revenge, the Federation was united like never before, especially those Divines who had been tricked. Almost all of them let out their angry roars.","They had been schemed against and almost died. Before their anger had subsided, the demons and the marine folks dared to declare that they would take revenge? Were they the only ones allowed to scheme against the Federation and not allow the Federation to retaliate?","All of the Divines had eyes. They were so miserably schemed against that they were unwilling to let it go.","They only replied with one sentence, “Come out if you want to fight.”","In addition, the matter between the Federation and the Holy Land had attracted the attention of many people. The Holy Land, which had once clamored to take over the Federation, had finally chosen to integrate into the Federation.","Many people were bewildered. After all, they did not know if the Holy Land was harboring any ill intentions. The Federation had too many opponents and could not afford to be tormented.","However, specific news soon came out. It turned out that Chu Yunfan had taught them a harsh lesson, and the major factions of the Holy Land had been completely annihilated. In the end, the smaller factions had no choice but to integrate into the Federation instead of trying to take over.","Many people suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan had done so many things that they didn’t know about.","Especially as more and more things about the Holy Land were revealed, they finally knew how dangerous the situation Chu Yunfan faced had been.","The entire Holy Land had wanted to kill him, but he had killed his way out. He forced the Holy Land to lower its head with his might, which was how the Holy Land had integrated into the Federation.","After all this was exposed, Chu Yunfan’s popularity in the Federation rose to another level. Those who originally criticized him also disappeared without a trace.","After all, he had already done so much, and they couldn’t ask him to do any better.","While there were all sorts of discussions going on the Internet, there was a piece of news that caught the attention of the Federation’s higher-ups.","The Chu clan had announced to the public that Chu Yunfan was getting engaged to the current head of the Tang clan, Tang Siyu, next month. Everyone was welcome to attend the engagement banquet.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength, status, and the level of attention he was receiving now, this news shocked the upper echelons of the Federation almost as soon as it came out."]},{"number":1087,"title":"Chapter 1087 The Incoming Storm","paragraphs":["1087 The Incoming Storm","Although it was just an engagement, with Chu Yunfan’s current status, his every move would attract the attention of countless people.","Not to mention, with this engagement, many people who had thoughts about Chu Yunfan could only give up now.","For most people, when they found out that he was getting engaged to Tang Siyu, they were relieved. Indeed, in this generation, only she was worthy of him.","Just like Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu was also a famous young genius. Even though she could not be compared to him, she was already in the Divine Abilities Stage at her age.","!!","After stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage, one’s status was completely different. Tang Siyu was now on equal footing with the big shots who had founded their own sects. She was also in charge of the Tang clan, one of the Eight Greats of the Federation.","This was especially so now that all the aristocratic families were in trouble, leaving only the Chu clan, the Tang clan, and the Li clan. As the only female head of a family, and at such a young age, it was easy to imagine how much Tang Siyu had to suffer as a clan leader.","However, no one had the courage to pursue Tang Siyu. Everyone knew about the relationship between her and Chu Yunfan. After Chu Yunfan entered the Divine Abilities Stage, many people knew that they could no longer afford to provoke him.","In the eyes of many, they were a destined couple.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t really announce it to the Federation, news of such a big event still spread very quickly. It immediately caused a sensation within the Federation. This was destined to be an engagement ceremony that would shake the Federation.","And with Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu’s current status, it was impossible for them to do things casually.","After the engagement was announced, countless media outlets squatted outside the Chu clan’s ancestral residence, hoping to obtain some news from the Chu clan.","However, Great Ancestor Chu had ordered everyone to keep things a secret. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t want to do it casually, he also didn’t want everyone to know about it.","Naturally, no one in the Chu clan dared to disobey the great ancestor’s orders.","It was the same for the Tang clan. No one in the Tang clan dared to disclose the news of their clan leader.","However, this engagement still shook the Federation. All the forces were in an uproar. Of course, no matter how grand the Chu clan was, there was a limit to the number of people who could attend the wedding in person. Only a small number of people could attend the wedding in person.","However, many people sent all kinds of gifts one after another.","Outside, while everyone was discussing Chu Yunfan’s engagement, the person in question was in the Mountain River Diagram.","In front of him, Tang Siyu slowly opened her eyes. She released circles of divine power from her body, forming a violent tide. After a moment, it that was released was immediately absorbed back into her.","Tang Siyu exhaled slowly, but it turned into a sword light that rose and fell. It was very shocking.","“Your abilities should have reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. The effects of the Brahma Fruit are indeed amazing!” Chu Yunfan said, “It’s a pity that it’s only a young Brahma Tree. Otherwise, the medicinal effects of its fruit would be even more astonishing.”","“In terms of power, I’ve already reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage,” Tang Siyu said slowly.","“Not just that. I’m afraid that even ordinary peak Divines can’t compare to the divine power in your body now,” Chu Yunfan said, shaking his head.","He could feel the powerful divine power in Tang Siyu’s body. Fortunately, she had changed her physique from an ordinary one to the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique.","This constitution was extremely powerful, and her body had undergone earth-shattering changes. This was why she was able to continuously absorb and digest the Brahma Fruit’s energy without exploding.","“But I still can’t fully control this divine power,” Tang Siyu said with a slight frown.","It was naturally very satisfying to have one’s cultivation base soar to the heavens in a single step. However, her corresponding cultivation level had not caught up and her control of mana was not as smooth as it had been before.","In fact, she could only mobilize a small portion of her divine power. Of course, this small portion was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","“Yes, I’ve already thought of that,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ve written down the cultivation method and insights of each tier in the Divine Abilities Stage. If you cultivate and gain insights according to this method, you should be able to control this power very quickly.”","In this regard, Chu Yunfan naturally had the right to speak. In fact, in his memory, the Alchemy Emperor often had this kind of distress because the medicinal pills swallowed by the Alchemy Emperor would often make his cultivation progress rapidly, and he had also come up with many solutions for this.","Compared to the instant success of an alchemy emperor’s cultivation, Tang Siyu’s problem was just a small one.","Of course, it would still take some time, but Chu Yunfan had already foiled the demons and marine folks’ plans, so he had won enough time.","“Okay.” Tang Siyu nodded.","Chu Yunfan gently pulled Tang Siyu into his arms and said, “I’ve already sent someone to the Tang clan to propose the marriage on my behalf. You and I are both at the golden age of cultivation, so we must seize this time to cultivate. However, there should be a conclusion to our matter. Let’s get engaged first.”","“All right,” Tang Siyu said as she blushed.","During this period, the outside world had been spreading rumors that Chu Yunfan had met with a mishap. If it wasn’t for the fact that she had learned from Ebony Dragon King that Chu Yunfan was still alive, she wouldn’t have been able to continue cultivating so calmly.","If she had to marry Chu Yunfan and have children now, she would not be willing either. Just as Chu Yunfan said, both of them were at the golden age of cultivation, and it could be said that it was unprecedented for them to cultivate to this level at their age.","The joy of cultivation was not something ordinary people could imagine.","“Since there’s still some time left, I’ll make the best use of it to cultivate. I feel like a storm is brewing,” Chu Yunfan said.","He told Tang Siyu about the grudge between him and the Divine Servant organization. Tang Siyu also remembered the Seventh Divine Servant she had met at the foot of Mount Tai.","However, she didn’t know that there were so many experts in the organization. From what Chu Yunfan said, it was probably planning something big, and the scheme against the Divines of the Federation was probably just the beginning.","After hiding and developing for so many years, it was probably more to it than just this little scheme.","“In that case, I’m afraid a fierce battle is coming,” Tang Siyu said."]},{"number":1088,"title":"Chapter 1088 The Engagement Party, Everyone’s Lamentations","paragraphs":["1088 The Engagement Party, Everyone’s Lamentations","“Well, according to what I know now, the person behind the unification of the marine folks is none other than the lord that the Divine Servants spoke of,” Chu Yunfan said with a worried expression. “At that time, I’m afraid we won’t be facing just one or two masters from the marine folks or the demons. This person has a big plan, and I’m afraid the marine folks and the demons will take action.”","Tang Siyu knew that Chu Yunfan’s worries were not unfounded. It was clear that the demons and the marine folks were joining forces.","It was not like what many people had previously guessed, that there would be a fight between the two sides. It was clear that both sides had already made plans to destroy the Federation first before dealing with other matters.","For the current Federation, it was undoubtedly an eventful period.","Tang Siyu understood how serious this matter was. Just the marine folks and demons alone were opponents that the Federation could not underestimate. If the two sides joined forces, it was impossible for the current Federation not to be prepared for heavy losses.","“You have to make good use of your time. It’s best if you can gain complete control of your divine power before our engagement,” he said.","It was impossible for Tang Siyu’s cultivation level to improve by leaps and bounds in a short period of time, but there was still hope for her to control her divine power.","To his surprise, Tang Siyu’s cultivation level was actually not low. In fact, she had already entered tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage, only a little bit weaker than him.","She had previously made great progress by relying on the inheritance pearl. However, she had been forced to consume the Brahma Fruit, and her cultivation base had skyrocketed to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","“Okay,” Tang Siyu said.","“You can cultivate in peace now. Leave the rest to me,” Chu Yunfan said.","A month quickly passed. On this day, several famous and influential figures from all over the Federation arrived.","All kinds of luxurious flying devices filled up the tarmac of Chu Yunfan’s home. Although he had not invited many people, they all came at the same time.","After the high-level officials of the Federation arrived, the important guests that Chu Yunfan had invited arrived one after another.","“Marshal Zhu Buping has arrived!”","“Heavenly Dragon Elder has arrived!”","“Clan Leader Li has arrived!”","***","One by one, the big shots arrived. This afforded Chu Yunfan great prestige.","Usually, the appearance of any one of these people would cause a stir in the Federation, let alone so many people coming together.","Such a lineup was unprecedented. Many Divines had come to congratulate the couple in person.","This was something that had never happened before. In the past, it was already an honor to receive a congratulatory gift from a Divine. And now that all of them had come personally, even the craziest people would not have dared to think about it.","However, no one found it strange. Everyone knew that it was Chu Yunfan who had rescued these high and mighty figures from the deep sea ruins. Without him, they would have probably died there.","“What a great turnout!” Among the Chu clan’s guests, Chu Yunfan’s high school teacher, Qin Wu, was also invited.","Another teacher of the focus class, Jin Feng, was also in attendance.","“That’s right. Back then, none of us would have thought that these two little fellows would have their current status.” Jin Feng sighed.","Qin Wu nodded. He had never expected this. At that time, Chu Yunfan had indeed shown extraordinary talent, but in his heart, if Chu Yunfan could enter the Innate Stage, it would already be extremely amazing.","With his knowledge, Qin Wu could only see the Innate Stage. As for the Divine Abilities Stage, it was a legend. He had even talked about the power of the Divine Abilities Stage as a strange story in class.","Who would have thought that he would actually be able to raise a student who would reach the Divine Abilities Stage and become the number one of the Federation?","And it was not just Chu Yunfan. Even Tang Siyu had become a Divine and was in charge of the Tang clan.","The two of them became the golden couple of the Federation.","“Everyone has their own fate,” Qin Wu said, “But we’ve also benefited a lot from it. Because we taught Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu, our school has now become a focus middle school in the district.”","Qin Wu thought about it and felt that it was a miracle. A few years ago, who would have thought that their low-ranking school would become a focus middle school?","There were even countless geniuses who wanted to join their school by name, just to see Chu Yunfan’s footsteps. The government also provided large amounts of funds, and the strength of the entire school continued to improve in just a few years, and they even had plans to apply for a key city spot.","This was the effect brought about by Chu Yunfan. This was why so many schools put in all their resources to invest in elite students as there would always be this kind of return.","On the other side of the crowd, Gao Hongzhi was busy eating. His girlfriend looked at him helplessly and said, “Why aren’t you going to congratulate your good brother on his engagement? This is a relationship that many people can’t wait to have!”","“What do you know? With my relationship with Yunfan, I don’t need to put on such a front,” Gao Hongzhi said, waving his hand.","He and Chu Yunfan had a life-and-death relationship. Long before Chu Yunfan rose to power, their relationship was already very good, so there was no need for all these empty words.","Gao Hongzhi knew that his talent was limited and that it was impossible for him to be as powerful as Chu Yunfan. Everyone’s talent was different, and he had already reached the limit of the Innate Stage.","Therefore, after he graduated, he quickly went home to take over his family’s business. With Chu Yunfan’s support and the care that Chu Yunfan gave him, both openly and secretly, his family’s business had grown to a scale of several billion in just a few years and was approaching the ten billion mark.","Even though there were many big shots among the guests present, Gao Hongzhi was still satisfied.","“Besides, he’s so busy now. Wouldn’t it be better to ask him out for a drink later than to go over now?” Gao Hongzhi continued to eat, not caring about the gazes of the people around him.","In another corner, there was a tall, adorable woman in her twenties. She was looking in the direction of the engagement party with a hint of sadness in her eyes.","She had once been very close to Chu Yunfan, but at that time, she didn’t know what it meant to like someone. But now, she seemed to understand a little."]},{"number":1089,"title":"Chapter 1089 The Arrival of a Nuclear Bomb and the Power of the Electromagnetic Cannon","paragraphs":["1089 The Arrival of a Nuclear Bomb and the Power of the Electromagnetic Cannon","At that time, Bai Ling’er was too young to understand what love was. Now, she seemed to understand a little.","But it was too late.","She felt a little uncomfortable in her heart. Gazing up at the blue sky, she could not help but feel a little dazed.","At this time, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were dressed in formal clothes and were surrounded by a crowd in the center of the wedding venue. In the eyes of the crowd, they looked like a golden couple.","!!","Tang Siyu snuggled up to Chu Yunfan’s side, feeling extremely lovey-dovey.","“Congratulations!”","“You guys make such a great couple!”","“That’s right, you guys are heaven-sent talents—unprecedented and unparalleled!”","In the midst of all the congratulations, Chu Yunfan’s expression suddenly changed and he looked directly up at the sky. Then, Tang Siyu, who was snuggling on his shoulder, also suddenly looked up at the sky.","Immediately after, Great Ancestor Chu, Chu Haoyue, Yang Feiyang, and the other Divines present all reacted and looked up at the sky.","“Watch out! It’s a nuclear bomb!”","Heavenly Dragon Elder’s shout jolted everyone out of the festive atmosphere.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze went beyond what he could see. A missile flew across the sky, heading straight for the Chu clan’s ancestral home. Although he couldn’t see it, his divine will spread out and he could sense the bomb.","“Where’s the barrier?!” Great Ancestor Chu shouted, “What about the defense system?!”","There should be a perfect defense system in Maple Leaf City. Located outside the city was the first layer of defense, the barrier inside the city was the second layer, and the third layer was at the Chu clan’s ancestral home.","But now, the first two defenses had failed collectively, allowing the nuclear bomb to fly in.","Humans had been using nuclear bombs against their enemies all year round, so how could they not be on guard against this? After all, the manufacturing technology of nuclear bombs was not particularly difficult. Even if the demons were not good at scientific development, they still managed to master some nuclear bombs by kidnapping human scientists.","But now, someone had invaded this place.","Maple Leaf City’s terrain was that of a large valley. If a nuclear bomb exploded here, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“It’s too late!”","Within seconds, the nuclear bomb had already arrived above the Chu ancestral home. Everyone’s expression turned serious. The Chu clan’s defense system detected the missile, and the counter system started automatically.","A Divine’s first reaction was to escape.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan took a step forward. On his entire right arm, there was terrifying thunder energy running through it as if circles of electricity were formed on his hand.","He took out a coin from his pocket with his other hand and threw it high into the air.","Boom!","A bolt of thunder energy shot out and struck the coin. It then turned into a terrifying lightning tide that swept through the sky.","Boom!","A huge explosion was heard as the wave of lightning hit the nuclear bomb. Then, it turned into a huge mushroom cloud that slowly rose up. It transformed into a terrifying energy tide that swept across the sky.","At the same time, the barrier of the Chu clan’s ancestral home was activated, protecting the place.","In an instant, a strong wind blew, and a terrifying light bloomed in the sky above the Chu clan like a small sun.","The barrier was like the surface of water that was being blown by the wind, and it began to shake violently. Fortunately, the nuclear bomb did not directly explode in the Chu clan’s ancestral home. If it was only the aftermath, it would not be able to blow up the solid defense system.","However, this sudden change still left most people dumbfounded. There were very few people who could sense the nuclear attack. Only a few Divines had been able to do so.","Most of the people were still in the midst of celebrating. Before they could feel anything, the nuclear bomb suddenly exploded, and most of them were scared silly. They knew how terrifying the power of a nuclear bomb was.","At this moment, everyone felt as if they had just escaped from death. Even those who were further away had yet to react to what had happened.","“This nuclear bomb doesn’t have any safety measures.”","The detonation of a nuclear bomb was not that simple. Generally speaking, even if it was intercepted, it should not explode directly. At most, it would cause an ordinary explosion.","However, the safety measures of this nuclear bomb had probably been removed and would thus explode if it was touched.","It could also be seen how vicious the person who launched the nuclear bomb was.","How could everyone not understand at this time that a nuclear bomb would be enough to kill more than half of the upper echelons of the Federation, especially the celebrities and upper echelons of the Chu clan who were gathered at this time?","The person who launched the bomb must have been waiting for such an opportunity.","After all, the higher-ups of the Federation and the celebrities from all walks of life were usually scattered all over the place, not to mention the Divines, who lived in seclusion and could not be tracked.","It was only at this time that it was possible to capture everyone in one fell swoop.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t blown it up, the defensive barrier of the Chu clan’s ancestral home wouldn’t have been able to withstand the impact of the nuclear explosion and would have exploded on the spot. At that time, even if the barrier absorbed most of the explosion, the remaining power would be enough to send most of the people here to heaven.","The Divines looked at Chu Yunfan as if they had seen a ghost.","This was especially true for the Divines from the Holy Land. They had never encountered a nuclear bomb before. To them, the most they could do was to sense the arrival of the nuclear bomb in advance, but it had been too fast for them.","They couldn’t catch the specific flight path, let alone the way Chu Yunfan blew it up in mid-flight.","It was like a miracle. It was impossible!","Moreover, the power of Chu Yunfan’s electromagnetic cannon shocked everyone. If it were them, they probably wouldn’t have been able to stop the bomb.","“Is that an electromagnetic cannon?”","Over the past month, Moonfall Protege had learned about many of the high-end weapons of the Federation, including the electromagnetic cannon. However, she never thought that humans could produce an electromagnetic cannon without any equipment.","The power of an electromagnetic cannon was terrifying.","Even if it was just a power that was casually released, if it was an ordinary Divine like her, it would probably be enough to kill her in one blow.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had already reached an unbelievable level. It was extraordinary and far beyond ordinary.","Suddenly, everyone felt a strong warning in their hearts. There was another nuclear bomb.","..."]},{"number":1090,"title":"Chapter 1090 The Mastermind Appears, the Monster Cult’s Leader","paragraphs":["1090 The Mastermind Appears, the Monster Cult’s Leader","“Another nuclear bomb!”","Everyone’s heart skipped a beat as their gazes turned to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan laughed and said, “Someone wants to send a big firework to my engagement party. I should thank them!”","He sneered and flew up into the sky.","!!","In the sky, another three nuclear bombs fell from outer space. They were almost at the edge of the Kunlun Realm’s atmosphere.","The defense of the Federation was not limited to a single base city. A huge defense network had been formed between all the base cities. These nuclear bombs were going all out to avoid this defense network.","The three nuclear bombs split into dozens of warheads in mid-air and shot toward the entire Maple Leaf City.","Most of them landed in the direction of the Chu clan’s ancestral home, but if any of the other nuclear warheads landed in the city, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“Chu Yunfan, let’s see which one you will save!”","An arrogant voice filled with pride came from the periphery of Maple Leaf City.","This voice was familiar. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t have time to search for it. He took out a handful of coins from his pocket and threw them into the sky.","His arm was already wrapped in circles of thunder energy.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","A series of terrifying electromagnetic cannons were fired from the void.","Chu Yunfan’s hands left behind afterimages. His entire body radiated with the power of thunder and the beams of lightning shot out like terrifying electromagnetic cannons across the sky.","“Boom, boom, boom!”","In an instant, dozens of terrifying small suns rose up, covering the entire sky. These nuclear bombs were intercepted by Chu Yunfan at a high altitude. Although they formed a gust of wind, it was not enough to pose a threat to Maple Leaf City below.","Chu Yunfan finally heaved a sigh of relief. Then, he was drowned by a terrifying gust of wind and all kinds of terrifying explosions.","But he divine power around Chu Yunfan’s body quickly began to surge, creating a space for him. With his current cultivation base, unless he was directly hit by a nuclear bomb, the aftershock and even nuclear radiation would not be able to do anything to him.","Chu Yunfan made his move and stopped the nuclear bombs again, saving the citizens of Maple Leaf City. Everyone’s hearts felt relieved.","On the ground, Great Ancestor Chu was furious. Such a big mess had happened in their city. Normally, every base city of this level was equipped with a comprehensive defense mechanism. But now, these defense mechanisms had been completely disabled.","If any one of these nuclear bombs landed in Maple Leaf City, even if it wasn’t in the Chu clan’s ancestral home, it would be an unacceptable and painful loss for the Chu clan.","After all, Maple Leaf City was the Chu clan’s base, and their influence extended to all the surrounding areas.","“Investigate this! Find out what happened right now!”","Following Great Ancestor Chu’s words, a series of urgent orders were immediately passed down.","Chu Yunfan was flying in the sky above the city. He released all his divine will, and suddenly, a figure appeared in his perception.","“Since you’re here, why don’t you come out?”","Chu Yunfan’s finger suddenly shot out a huge sword light that was over a thousand meters long, slashing into the void.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, an invisible mecha was cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s sword and a figure fell out of it.","This person’s face was filled with complete disbelief. His mecha was made using the latest invisible mecha technology. Not only could it not be detected by radar, but it was also invisible to the naked eye.","What he didn’t know was that under Chu Yunfan’s divine will, invisibility of any sort was useless because this was not a means of technology and it couldn’t be explained by the principles of technology.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw that this person looked extremely strange. Half of them was human, but the other half was a monster. It was covered in scales, had thick hands and feet, and had a green face and fangs.","“Hahahaha! Chu Yunfan, since you’ve discovered me, I won’t hide anymore!” The figure laughed.","“Leader of the Monster Cult? I didn’t expect you to still be alive and to have turned into this ghastly thing.” Chu Yunfan immediately recognized this person.","It was none other than the Monster Cult’s leader, who had once posed a huge threat to Chu Yunfan.","But that day, Chu Yunfan shot him with the Sun Shooter, and the cult leader escaped after sustaining serious injuries.","Chu Yunfan hadn’t seen him for a long time, so he thought the cult leader was dead. He didn’t expect the cult leader to still be alive.","It was just that he looked neither like a human nor a ghost and was extremely terrifying.","However, after seeing the cult leader, Chu Yunfan finally understood why the defense system of Maple Leaf City had suddenly failed.","It was probably the work of the sect master.","If it was someone else, it would be impossible. Maple Leaf City was the Chu clan’s headquarters, and the Chu clan had been based here for hundreds of years. Even the Federation Government had no authority here.","However, the Monster Cult was different. Over the years, countless people from the cult had infiltrated the Federation. With the help of these moles, many cities of the Federation suddenly fell. It was clear that the cult had done the same in Maple Leaf City.","The mole must have infiltrated the city first, then paralyzed the defense system, and finally led up to the situation with the nuclear bombs.","This series of actions could not be said to be unsuccessful. If Chu Yunfan had not been here, they would have succeeded in their plan.","It had been a month since Chu Yunfan had announced his engagement. If someone wanted to deal with him, they could have done a lot of things in such a long time.","After understanding this, Chu Yunfan was no longer surprised.","Compared to other opponents, the cult leader was indeed more difficult to deal with, because no one knew where he would appear or even how many of the people were under his command.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flickered with a sharp light. Previously, he had been searching for the cult leader but to no avail. Now that the cult leader had appeared, it was a good opportunity to exterminate him.","He would completely eradicate this nightmare that had plagued the Federation for countless years and return the human race to a peaceful world.","“This is all thanks to you!” The Monster Cult’s leader grinned. “It was my biggest mistake not to kill you as soon as possible. If it weren’t for you, my great cause wouldn’t have failed!”","..."]},{"number":1091,"title":"Chapter 1091 The Cult Leader at the Peak of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1091 The Cult Leader at the Peak of the Divine Abilities Stage","Thinking about how the cult’s undertakings had been ruined by Chu Yunfan one after another, the cult leader gnashed his teeth in hatred.","At that time, he hadn’t taken Chu Yunfan seriously. At that time, Chu Yunfan was just a small fry to him.","However, it was this insignificant person that had dealt a great blow to the great cause of his cult. No one had ever been able to make them suffer such heavy losses. Not even the president of the Federation.","By the time the cult leader started to pay attention to Chu Yunfan, the latter had already become powerful enough to injure him severely with a single arrow from the Sun Shooter.","Half of his body had been blown to pieces. If it wasn’t for his profound cultivation base, he wouldn’t have been able to hang on and would have surely died.","Thinking back to the pain he had suffered back then, he felt his body twitch. It was not as simple as his body being shot.","The Sun Shooter had contained the true fire of the sun. Although it was only a trace, it was enough to make one feel as if their soul was burning. If it wasn’t for a chance encounter, the cult leader would have died long ago.","Although he survived, half of his body had become like this. However, he did not see this as a bad thing. The cult’s philosophy itself did not place emphasis on form.","“Unfortunately, there’s no medicine for regret.”","Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at the cult leader. How could he not see that the cult leader’s body was different? Before, he had a demonic aura. Now, it was a ghostly one.","The cult leader had probably survived due to a treasure that could suppress the true fire of the Sun Shooter. It was some kind of treasure that was used to cultivate the ghost Dao.","Everything in the world had a mutual promotion and restraint. Even the domineering and extreme yang, like the true fire of the sun, was not impossible to suppress. There was a way to suppress the extreme tin and evil things.","The cult leader must have had a fortuitous encounter in this area to have gained this ghostly and ghastly appearance.","The cult leader didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had already guessed all this in just a split second. Otherwise, he would have been shocked. He had never told anyone about this, so he thought no one knew.","Chu Yunfan could guess it with just a glance. It was definitely enough to send a chill down his spine. He, who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, had a wide range of knowledge, which was not something the cult leader could imagine.","“Now, I’m going to make up for my mistake,” the cult leader said coldly. His eyes were filled with ghostly qi and killing intent. “If nuclear bombs can’t kill you, I’ll kill you myself!”","The cult leader regarded Chu Yunfan as his nemesis. Ever since he met Chu Yunfan, just like today, his plans kept failing. He had worked so hard to enact such a big scheme, but in the end, it didn’t hurt Maple Leaf City in the slightest.","The most unbelievable thing was that Chu Yunfan managed to block it with his astonishing means.","Therefore, the cult leader decided to personally deal with this trouble.","Boom!","The cult leader’s divine power burst out, rushing to the seventh, eighth, ninth, and finally, the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","The terrifying ghostly Qi spread in all directions, and the entire city seemed to be able to hear ghostly wails and wolf howls. The sinister energy was so dense that it was as if the entire world was going to turn into a ghostly domain.","The surroundings seemed to have turned into hell, and the cult leader was the legendary lord of hell, which was extremely terrifying.","Countless people in Maple Leaf City saw this scene. Suddenly, the entire Internet was in an uproar. After all, many people had heard about the Monster Cult, but this was the first time they had seen the legendary figure—the cult leader.","Many people felt a sense of fear.","Chu Yunfan looked at the cult leader and said, “To be able to turn into such a ghostly appearance and increase your strength so much, could it be that you’ve eaten Specter Ghost Grass?”","The cult leader’s originally cold and murderous face finally showed a hint of a surprise because he had never mentioned it to anyone. Even if ordinary people had guessed, it was impossible that they would guess the Specter Ghost Grass.","This herb was extremely rare and only grew in extremely cold places. Moreover, the place it grew had to be where countless people were buried, either in a battlefield or a mass grave. Only when these two conditions were met at the same time would there be a certain chance of it growing.","Because the cult leader hadn’t been able to withstand the torture of the true fire, he had sought out such a place. He just wanted to make himself feel better. He hadn’t expected to come across the Specter Ghost Grass. After swallowing the herb, the true fire in his body was suppressed and his body was transformed into this neither human nor ghost appearance.","Most importantly, after that, he transformed from a demonic cultivator to a ghost cultivator. His strength did not decline, but instead advanced all the way to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","“As expected. It’s that d*mn thing.” Chu Yunfan saw the cult leader’s shocked expression and nodded in satisfaction.","From the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, he knew what this Specter Ghost Grass was. It was a natural treasure for cultivating the ghost Dao. After consuming it, no matter what Dao one had cultivated, it would completely transform into the ghost Dao and one’s strength would increase greatly.","However, after that, their strength would be sealed and they would not be able to make any progress. They would be stuck at this cultivation level for the rest of their lives.","However, with the current strength of the Kunlun Realm, the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage was the highest level. Even if they couldn’t make any more progress, it was still a rare opportunity for many people.","“Hahaha, that’s right, Chu Yunfan. Although I don’t know how you know, your guess is right. I did consume this herb. You didn’t expect that your arrow wouldn’t kill me but help me achieve my goal instead, did you?!” The cult’s cult leader burst into laughter. “I feel unprecedented power now. Even if the president was in front of me, I could kill him!”","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You’ve already become something that’s neither a human nor a ghost. How can you be compared to the president?”","“Let’s see if you’ll still be stubborn after I kill you!” The cult’s cult leader was furious upon hearing this and glared at Chu Yunfan.","At that moment, the barrier over Maple Leaf City reappeared below them, protecting the entire city.","The cult leader immediately understood.”You were stalling!”","He immediately understood that Chu Yunfan was trying to buy time so that Great Ancestor Chu could regain control of the defense system in Maple Leaf City."]},{"number":1092,"title":"Chapter 1092 I’ll Let You Live if You Don’t Die in Three Moves","paragraphs":["1092 I’ll Let You Live if You Don’t Die in Three Moves","Maple Leaf City was the Chu clan’s territory, and the cult had only taken advantage of the Chu clan’s lack of vigilance.","After all, one could be a thief for a thousand days, but there was no reason to be on guard for a thousand days.","As long as the Chu clan worked hard, they would soon regain control of the defense system. The members of the cult who had infiltrated the defense system would be immediately found and eliminated.","Now that the city’s defenses were back up, even if the cult attacked again with a nuclear bomb, it would not be so easy to break through it.","Boom!","About a hundred miles away, a huge mushroom cloud slowly rose into the air. The huge mushroom cloud’s boiling light could even be felt from the city.","The cult leader didn’t even need to look to know that it was the Chu clan’s counterattack. From the trajectory of the nuclear bomb in the sky, it was easy to trace back to the location of the cult’s base outside the city.","If they were to launch a precise attack, the base would have been completely destroyed.","The Chu clan’s quick counterattack was truly shocking.","And what Chu Yunfan was doing was stalling.","No one would have thought that his actions were just a feint, and the cult leader had actually fallen for such an evil trick.","This feeling was like giving the cult leader a tight slap in the face when he was feeling smug, and he simply couldn’t accept it.","In his eyes, Chu Yunfan’s faint smile seemed to be mocking his stupidity.","“Rrraaagggh!”","The cult leader roared toward the sky and countless ghostly Qi gushed out of his body, dyeing the entire world in a ghostly haze. His eyes were bloodshot as he glared at Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan, I will make sure you die without a burial place today!”","“Hahahaha, go ahead and do it if you can!”","Chu Yunfan’s qi and blood also began to boil, and like a sharp sword, he cut open a crack in the ghostly haze.","He took a step forward and stepped into the void. His black hair fluttered in the wind, and his body emitted a jade light as if he was a god who had descended into the world of men.","Their auras collided in the void, creating an earth-shattering scene.","“The two of them are so strong, especially the cult leader. How is he so strong?” the sect leader of Moonfall said.","As the leader of Moonfall House, who was the only one among the three superpowers of the Holy Land to come in person and also represented the Holy Land, she could feel the terror of the two people in the sky.","She had reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage and was second only to Tang Siyu among the experts present. However, she could still feel how terrifying the cult leader was. He was stronger than her by a level.","In addition, Tang Siyu, who was secretly circulating her power, ready to attack at any time, realized that the advantage she had thought the Holy Land had in terms of high-end Divines now seemed to be nothing.","It could be said that the Federation was full of crouching tigers and hidden dragons, and there were indeed many experts.","If even she had such a feeling, the other Divines were even more crestfallen. Many of the people present had dealt with the cult leader before, but they did not expect him to become so terrifying.","After having a fortuitous encounter, their strength would advance by leaps and bounds. This kind of thing was not uncommon, but it was extremely rare to see someone advance by leaps and bounds as the cult leader had.","Below them, Tang Siyu flew up into the air. She had mobilized all the divine power in her body. If Chu Yunfan made any wrong moves, she would immediately attack.","In the past, she didn’t have the strength to intervene, but now it was different. She had the ability to intervene in this battle. The cult leader had many fortuitous encounters, but she too had become stronger.","In the sky, Chu Yunfan let the strong wind ruffle his robe as he said indifferently, “Cult leader, you and I have been entangled in this enmity for so many years. It’s time to end this. If you can withstand three of my moves, I’ll let you live.”","Chu Yunfan thought back to when he first started going against the cult. It was because a branch of the cult had captured his sister. That was the first time he had learned of the existence of the cult, and also the first time he learned that such an organization shrouded the Federation like a nightmare.","At that time, he had sworn to uproot the cult, and now it was finally time to fulfill the oath he had made when he was younger.","The cult leader hadn’t expected that what made Chu Yunfan so determined to destroy the cult was just a small matter that he didn’t care about at all. After all, the cult kidnapped countless people from the Federation every day.","And it was this seemingly insignificant matter that had created a terrible enemy and started the fuse of the cult’s destruction.","The cult leader sneered and said, “You? Three moves. What a big proclamation. Forget three moves. Even three hundred moves can’t do anything to me!”","Green wisps surged out of the cult leader and a powerful force swept through his body, which also raised his confidence to the extreme. He was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage—the strongest person in this world.","Chu Yunfan wanted to kill him in three moves? What a joke.","Boom!","The Qi of both parties rose rapidly. With them as the center, it was like a tsunami that was thousands of meters tall, tearing the sea of clouds in the sky into pieces. The collision of Qi was everywhere. It looked like a scene from the end of the world.","The killing intent in their hearts surged wildly as the people on the ground felt their hearts palpitate.","The aura of the two swept down, making Mr. And Mrs. Chu worry. The two of them could feel the terrifying aura of these two forces.","Lin Chenxi, who was standing beside them, quickly said, “Uncle, Auntie, don’t worry. That cult leader is no match for Master.”","Lin Chenxi had become Chu Yunfan’s fangirl ever since she saw him slaughter more than two hundred Divines. Compared to the situation he was in back then, the current situation was nothing.","Hearing this, Yang Yayun nodded. She liked this disciple of her son’s very much. The little girl was young but she was very clever and cute.","Although they had only been together for a month, Yang Yayun felt as if she had gained another daughter. After all, Chu Qingxuan was busy cultivating outside every day and they did not often see her nowadays.","While they were talking, the momentum of the battle in the sky had reached its limit. The cult leader roared and took the lead to launch an attack.","In an instant, the sea of clouds changed."]},{"number":1093,"title":"Chapter 1093 Abusing the Monster Cult Leader","paragraphs":["1093 Abusing the Monster Cult Leader","The cult’s cult leader made the first move. A long saber appeared in his hand and it boiled with endless ghost energy.","This ghost energy turned into a terrifying saber light that was hundreds of feet long. The cult leader, who was holding the saber, was like a ghost king suppressing the world.","“Cult leader, you were injured by the Sun Shooter that day. Today, I will send you all the way to hell using the same weapon!”","Facing the cult leader who had attacked first, Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm.","!!","In the blink of an eye, a bow had appeared in his hand.","It was a bronze longbow. The cracks on the bow told of the terrible battles it had encountered, what enemies it had defeated, and what heavy injuries it had suffered.","Chu Yunfan poured his divine power into the bow and the place where there was no bowstring was strung up by a string of light. On this string of light, a golden crow flew out. He quickly pulled back the string of light and the crow grew bigger and bigger. It flapped its wings and was about to fly away and the terrifying flames that it turned into burned the sky.","“What kind of magic weapon is that?”","The Divines below were all frightened by this scene. They could feel an unprecedented sense of horror from the golden crow.","Especially the cult leader of the Moonfall. She felt her heart beating wildly. If it were her, she would probably be killed in one strike.","Only now did she realize that Chu Yunfan had held back and not used his full strength during the previous battle. He probably hadn’t needed to use the nuclear bomb to destroy those hundreds of Divines.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan released the string of light and the crow let out a cry and rushed out. It grew in the wind, and in an instant, grew to the size of a small mountain.","The power of the Sun Shooter would naturally be different according to the user. Compared to before, Chu Yunfan’s strength was more than ten times stronger. It was simply a world-shaking change.","Another large crack appeared on the bow. This was the price for releasing this attack.","The crow charged at the cult leader. He was unable to dodge and was hit head-on.","Boom!","A terrifying scene happened all of a sudden. A terrifying mushroom cloud slowly rose up as if the cult leader had been struck by a nuclear bomb.","All the Divines could not help but gasp when they saw this. If they were the ones facing such an attack, they would be wiped out in one blow. This was the most terrifying thing. To them, the threat of martial arts was far greater than the threat of technology.","They could sense the launch of a nuclear bomb in advance, but this method was clearly beyond the scope of their perception.","“Is the cult leader dead?” Moonfall Protege said. Even she couldn’t believe that the mighty cult leader had died just like that.","If it was her, she probably wouldn’t even be able to withstand one move.","However, before everyone could breathe a sigh of relief, an unforeseen event suddenly occurred. Just when everyone thought that the cult leader was dead after being hit by such a terrible blow, a figure suddenly rushed out from the mushroom cloud.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think that I would be completely unprepared after suffering a loss at your hands previously? I want you dead!”","The cult leader arrived before Chu Yunfan in the blink of an eye. He wasn’t dead. In fact, he wasn’t even seriously injured as everyone had expected.","He was fine, but there was broken armor on his body. There was a big hole in the middle of the armor.","It was this armor that had blocked the attack from Chu Yunfan’s bow and saved the cult leader.","What kind of person was the cult leader? The first time he had ever suffered such a big loss was from Chu Yunfan. Since he had seen Chu Yunfan’s trump card, he was naturally prepared this time around.","The cult leader’s face was extremely arrogant, but he was a little shocked in his heart. To deal with Chu Yunfan’s bow, he searched all over the Kunlun Realm for this armor. He thought it could resist all of Chu Yunfan’s attacks. This was the fundamental reason why he was confident to come and cause trouble even though he knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","Who knew that one shot from Chu Yunfan’s bow would blast his armor into pieces, making his plan fall through? Although he wasn’t injured, his previous plan had already vanished.","The cult leader swept out with his ghostly blade. The terrifying saber light split the sea of clouds in half, then directly hit Chu Yunfan’s body.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was not flustered in the slightest. He stretched out one of his hands and the saber cut his hand.","Boom!","The terrifying strike landed, but unlike what many people had expected, Chu Yunfan’s hand was not cut off. On the contrary, his hand caught the saber.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan grabbed at the saber and the ghostly weapon was shattered into pieces.","At this time, the cult leader’s expression finally changed. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to do this.","He could feel that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level had yet to reach the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage and was far inferior to his. However, Chu Yunfan’s divine power was extremely dense.","He had never expected Chu Yunfan to be able to block and easily crush this attack.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the fragments of the saber light in his hand and then suddenly threw them at the cult leader.","Boom!","The entire sky suddenly exploded and the fragments swept out with a terrible momentum, hitting the cult leader head-on.","The cult leader couldn’t dodge because he was too close and was directly hit by the attack.","Spurt!","After the cult’s cult leader let out a blood-curdling scream, he coughed up a mouthful of blood. He was instantly sent flying like a kite with a broken string. He flew out of Maple Leaf City and crashed into a huge mountain outside the city.","Boom!","The entire mountain trembled violently and the cult leader’s body was covered with the saber light fragments.","Chu Yunfan turned into a beam of light and flew out. The Divines looked at each other and chased after him.","He saw the cult leader struggling to climb out of the giant mountain. He laughed and said, “Chu Yunfan, you can’t kill me! I’ve become immortal! You can’t kill me!”","Everyone saw that the huge wound on the cult leader’s body was healing at a speed that was visible to the naked eye."]},{"number":1094,"title":"Chapter 1094 Three Moves It Is, the Monster Cult’s Leader Dies!","paragraphs":["1094 Three Moves It Is, the Monster Cult’s Leader Dies!","The cult leader laughed out loud. Ever since he had swallowed the Specter Ghost Grass, his physique had changed, and it wasn’t just his strength that had increased.","It had also transformed his physique, turning him into a half-human half-ghost creature. If it were an ordinary person, even if they didn’t die, they would be seriously injured. It was impossible for them to recover as easily as the cult leader.","“Chu Yunfan, didn’t you say three moves? I don’t think so!”","The cult leader laughed out loud, extremely arrogant. He was trying to provoke Chu Yunfan. After two moves, even someone not very bright would be able to tell that he was no match for Chu Yunfan. Moreover, he wasn’t stupid, he was very smart.","Only by goading Chu Yunfan into admitting the three-move promise was silly could he escape unscathed.","Even he found this laughable. Previously, he had not taken the promise of three moves to heart, but now he had to rely on it to save his life.","He had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s strength. Next time, he definitely wouldn’t let Chu Yunfan off. He would definitely kill Chu Yunfan!","The cult leader’s eyes flashed with hatred and anger.","“I said three moves, so be it. I’ll take your life within three moves,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","In his eyes, the cult leader was indeed very difficult to deal with. Much more difficult than ordinary Divines. However, it was only difficult, not impossible.","“Asura Punch!”","All of Chu Yunfan’s divine power burst out and boiled. He clenched his five fingers into a fist, and the fist force ran through his whole body. The fist intent boiled and a golden asura appeared behind him.","This asura was different from the previous one. Its entire body was wrapped with the energy of thunder, like a golden thunder giant.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan threw out a punch. In the blink of an eye, the sky changed color. This punch pierced through the sky and earth, shattering the sea of clouds.","The cult leader’s first reaction was to escape. This kind of terrifying power was not something he could deal with. At this time, he understood how Chu Yunfan was so confident. The strength Chu Yunfan possessed was beyond his imagination.","But almost immediately, he felt that he had been locked on by Chu Yunfan’s powerful divine will. He knew that once he was locked on, it would be impossible for him to escape no matter where he tried to go.","He quickly erected a shield in front of himself to protect himself.","Bam!","This punch directly hit the Ghost Head Shield. This shield was a magic weapon. Although it was not as good as the armor the cult leader had worn before, it was still extremely powerful.","However, after being hit by Chu Yunfan’s Asura Punch, it instantly crumbled, unable to resist at all.","It was like paper, and in an instant, it crumbled away. Then, Chu Yunfan’s fist force tore everything apart and hit the cult leader.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion erupted. Chu Yunfan’s fist pierced through the cult leader’s chest. The terrifying power was still shaking, tearing apart the cult leader’s body.","The cult leader’s recovery ability, which he was so proud of, was completely useless in front of Chu Yunfan’s punch. This level of damage had far exceeded the limit of the cult leader’s recovery ability.","Boom!","The cult leader exploded in mid-air and turned into a cloud of blood mist. He died in an instant.","Only three moves!","The cult leader died a tragic death!","And Chu Yunfan didn’t go back on his promise. In just three moves, the cult leader was already unable to resist.","In fact, if it weren’t for that armor, the cult leader would have died from the Sun Shooter and it wouldn’t have been three moves.","Chu Yunfan understood that the cult leader wanted to use words to stop him, but it was obvious that the cult leader had underestimated his strength.","The cult leader’s sudden burst of strength seemed very strong. In reality, his foundation was not stable. Against ordinary Divines, his strange moves were a real headache. However, against Chu Yunfan, he would be at a loss.","It was because Chu Yunfan didn’t play tricks. He was able to defeat the cult leader with just his powerful strength.","Although the cult leader had switched to a ghostly technique, it was obvious that he had not mastered it. He was completely suppressed by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had cultivated the Imperial Physique, so he was not at all afraid of these monsters.","The Divines who rushed over only had time to see Chu Yunfan kill the cult leader with one punch. Their eyes widened in complete disbelief.","They had all witnessed the cult leader’s strength. He was indeed extremely powerful. But in front of Chu Yunfan, he couldn’t even withstand a single blow.","Whether it was by magic weapon or strength, Chu Yunfan was completely above the cult leader.","“With Chu Yunfan’s strength, he really is the number one Divine!”","“That’s right. It’s not wrong to say that he’s the number one Divine. At least, I’ve never seen anyone in the Divine Abilities Stage who’s stronger than him.”","“It’s a blessing for mankind to have such an expert.”","The crowd discussed animatedly, feeling that they were really lucky.","When the Holy Land experts saw this, they felt that their previous decision was right. The best choice was for the Holy Lands to integrate into the Federation.","If they provoked such a top expert, it was possible that the Holy Land would be completely annihilated.","“Let’s go,” Chu Yunfan said after putting the cult leader’s body into the Mountain River Diagram. “Now that the matter has been resolved, let’s go back and drink. Don’t let such a small matter spoil our mood!”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s nonchalant attitude, everyone was speechless. When the nuclear bombs fell earlier, it was like a moment of life and death for them, and many of them still felt a chill on their backs.","However, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was just a small matter.","Many people were speechless. They could only say that this was the reason why Chu Yunfan was so powerful. Just his attitude alone was way better than theirs.","Chu Yunfan had dealt with the cult leader, and the entire Internet exploded.","Originally, his engagement banquet had already attracted the attention of the entire Federation. Even if they couldn’t enter the main venue, there were still many reporters outside broadcasting it live.","This broadcast showed a series of dangerous situations from earlier. When those nuclear bombs fell, just when everyone thought that Maple Leaf City was going to be destroyed and the Chu clan was going to be finished, Chu Yunfan appeared and solved those nuclear bombs with dazzling means.","However, the person who appeared after that caused an explosion on the entire Internet. He was rumored to be a human nightmare that was elusive.","..."]},{"number":1095,"title":"Chapter 1095 Half a Year Passes, War Breaks Out","paragraphs":["1095 Half a Year Passes, War Breaks Out","There were too many legends about the leader of the Monster Cult floating within the Federation.","It was like a huge shadow shrouding the Federation’s sky. Everyone had heard of the cult’s various matters. It could be said that it was sinister, cunning, and vicious.","Many people’s family members had been captured and trained to be the cult’s men of sacrifice, which was hated by countless people.","However, it was obvious that just gritting their teeth in hatred was not enough to kill the cult leader.","And now, Chu Yunfan’s killing of the cult leader caused a great sensation. It could even be said that the Federation was in an uproar.","Many families who had suffered misfortunes couldn’t wait to offer Chu Yunfan a memorial tablet for longevity. The cult had been wreaking havoc in the world for many years. Although it wasn’t enough to pose a fatal threat because of the size of the Federation, there were definitely many who had been persecuted by the cult.","With the death of the cult leader, the Federation’s all-out counterattack against the cult began. Orders were passed down from various departments to the inside and outside of the Federation, uprooting the cult.","Previously, the Federation knew of many of the cult’s strongholds but they were afraid of the cult leader and did not wish to completely fall out with him.","If the entire cult were to be mobilized, it would be impossible for it to destroy the Federation. However, it would be enough to cause a lot of trouble, even to the extent of attacking their base cities.","Now that the cult leader had fallen, the Federation’s last fear was gone. They followed the clues and began to destroy the cult’s strongholds one by one. Within the government and the army, anyone who was related to the cult, even if it were just speculation, was arrested and interrogated.","Under such circumstances, the cult was completely finished. Even if there were still some people who were hiding very deeply, they could no longer cause any waves. Without the cult leader, the cult was no threat at all.","With the Federation’s strength, if there was no more fear of the cult leader, a mere cult could be destroyed with a flip of the hand.","Many people were shocked to find that with Chu Yunfan’s rise, the situation in the Federation had changed dramatically.","Many of the forces that they thought would last for a long time had all been defeated. Chu Yunfan was like the nemesis of these major forces. Anyone who provoked him didn’t have a happy ending.","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan had no taboo. He had done many things that no one had ever dared to do before, such as arresting Divines and dragging them down from their pedestals to be tried in court.","He also ordered a large-scale counterattack against the demons and the marine tribes with nuclear bombs. All of these things proved that he was definitely not a person who followed the rules.","Chu Yunfan was seen as an assassin of a big force.","However, in the eyes of many people, this was a good change for the Federation, especially since Chu Yunfan had made many great contributions to the Federation.","The news that Chu Yunfan had killed the leader of the cult had yet to spread, but in the Chu clan’s ancestral home, Chu Yunfan’s engagement banquet was still going on as usual.","Although they had just experienced such a shocking battle, with the death of the cult leader, the defense of Maple Leaf City had been taken over again. Even if a nuclear bomb attacked at this time, it would not be able to threaten their lives.","Everyone was naturally in the mood to continue attending the engagement banquet, and the scene that had just happened became the hottest topic among countless people.","In particular, Chu Yunfan’s killing of the cult leader was like a sudden clap of thunder that left no time for covering one’s ears. It was an eye-opening experience for everyone.","After a whole day of hard work, even with Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu’s cultivation, they were very tired. Not physically, but mentally.","However, neither of them complained, because they both understood that it was impossible for people to completely ignore the world and rules when living in this world.","That night, the two of them slept in each other’s arms, and it went without saying that they had sex.","After getting engaged to Tang Siyu, Chu Yunfan went into seclusion again to help Tang Siyu digest her current power so that she could control her peak Divine Abilities Stage strength.","He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so his judgment was much better than that of the people of this era. The problems that Tang Siyu encountered in her cultivation were fine in Chu Yunfan’s eyes. They could be easily solved.","However, in the outside world and the Federation, the entire atmosphere was slowly becoming more chaotic.","This was because the actions of the demons and the marine tribes were becoming more and more frequent. They did not restrain themselves even after the battle in the deep-sea ruins.","On the contrary, the trend of the two sides joining forces was becoming more and more obvious. Although ordinary people could not feel much, the higher-ups of the Federation could clearly sense the murderous aura.","The mobilization of the various army troops also gradually became more frequent.","The relocation of the various Holy Land sects and forces accelerated. Because they were in different worlds, they had to use the teleportation array to move. The consumption of the teleportation array was huge, so even if it was just to send people over, it was a huge project.","With the relocation of one sect after another, the strength of the Federation increased significantly. Although these sects had yet to fully integrate into the Federation, the addition of more than two hundred Divines would be of great benefit to the Federation’s current strength.","Everything was proceeding in an orderly manner.","The small movements between the demons and the marine tribes were becoming more and more frequent, and the war between the two sides was imminent.","Half a year passed in the blink of an eye. The Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu’s engagement banquet, which had caused a sensation six months ago, had long become an old story.","In the past six months, the biggest news was the purge. There were many traitors inside and outside the Federation, and they were even of a high level that could plot against Divines.","Many of the higher-ups of the Federation could be said to have learned a lesson from this painful experience. If this continued, the Federation would be in big trouble.","This was especially so on the eve of the great war. If these problems were not resolved, they would become the greatest internal threat to the Federation.","The higher-ups of the Federation decided to carry out a purge campaign and vigorously investigate the spies from the demons, the marine tribes, and many other forces from the Outskirt Territories.","It also included the thorough investigation and eradication of the Monster Cult.","It was truly impossible to not investigate. The moment they did, they were shocked. The Federation had been infiltrated by various forces like a sieve.","In this half a year, these thorns were gradually removed, which greatly deterred the evil people with ulterior motives.","However, the war broke out all of a sudden."]},{"number":1096,"title":"Chapter 1096 Purgatory on Earth, the Hope Within the Despair","paragraphs":["1096 Purgatory on Earth, the Hope Within the Despair","The war broke out without warning.","At a time when no one had expected it, a piece of news spread throughout the Federation.","The war had erupted!","Overnight, the defense lines of the three base cities—Binhai City, Kaiping City, and Anyuan City—and the subsidiary satellite cities at the border of the demons and the marine tribes were all broken into.","!!","This news came so suddenly that many people thought it was just a joke. After all, in one night, three base cities had fallen and hundreds of millions of people were involved.","However, countless photos and videos sent from the front lines confirmed it. The three base cities had been attacked all of a sudden. Many people were killed by the monsters in their sleep.","The monsters were like a tide. Hundreds of millions of monsters charged in from the breach in the defense line and began a bloody massacre.","The three base cities had turned from peaceful to hell on earth. Blood was everywhere and corpses piled up like mountains. Many people didn’t even leave behind bones as they were swallowed by the monsters.","The troops stationed in the three base cities were unable to defend their base cities. They were ambushed by the experts of Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine tribes.","The entire defense line collapsed.","In front of the top experts, these ordinary troops were completely useless. They were no match for them at all.","Although everyone in the Federation cultivated, not everyone was a soldier. The majority of people cultivated only to strengthen their bodies or to prolong their lives.","Facing these monsters that fought for a living, they were completely powerless. Or rather, they were powerless to resist.","Moreover, facing the surprise attack of thousands of monsters, ordinary people had no way to resist without the help of the army.","In one night, three base cities fell and countless people died. This shocked the entire Federation.","When the Federation Army was faced with hundreds of millions of monsters, they were completely defeated. Without the help of a complete defense line, it was simply impossible for the Federation to fight against hundreds of millions of monsters.","No matter how elite the Federation Army was, they would still be completely overwhelmed by numbers.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu received the news in the middle of the night. They hurriedly put on their clothes and went out.","In the villa, a high-speed transport plane was already prepared. On the high-speed transport plane, Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue had been waiting for a long time.","In addition to Ebony Dragon King and the Thunder Winged Beast that Chu Yunfan had brought along, there were a total of five Divines gathered.","The Thunder Winged Beast had managed to step into tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage in the last half a year, while Ebony Dragon King’s cultivation had leaped from tier six to tier seven. Such combat power could be considered a high level.","“What’s going on? How could the defensive line be completely broken?” Chu Yunfan asked in disbelief.","Even if nuclear bombs were used indiscriminately, it would still be very difficult to take down those base cities.","Losing one base city was already a big deal, not to mention losing three in one night.","This had to be a bad joke.","“I’m not sure about the current situation, but I’m afraid there will be a fierce battle,” Great Ancestor Chu sighed.","The high-speed transport plane only took two hours to send Chu Yunfan and the others from Maple Leaf City to the nearest city, Binhai City.","At this moment, the sky was already getting brighter. The roars of monsters could be heard everywhere. Hundreds of millions of monsters were wreaking havoc. How terrifying would those roars be?","Even the transport planes couldn’t get close, because, in the sky, thousands of aerial monsters were flying over the city.","Fortunately, none of the people present were ordinary people. They were all Divines. They opened the cabin door and flew out. Then, the transport plane sped off.","Boom, boom, boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fingertips casually swept out a sword light, and the sword light, which was thousands of feet long, directly cut the world in half. Wherever it passed, the monsters were all killed.","Great Ancestor Chu and the others also made their moves. The attacks of Divines were naturally very powerful.","Among them, apart from Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu’s cultivation was the highest. Her cultivation was comparable to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. She held a long sword in her hand, and with a casual sweep of her sword, hundreds of monsters were cut into pieces.","Although there were only four people and two beasts, the strength of this small team was beyond doubt. In the blink of an eye, they had killed all the aerial monsters nearby.","However, there were still more monsters pouncing over, not to mention the monsters on the ground. They all jumped up from the ground and opened their bloody jaws to bite the team. Not to mention the dense demonic energy bullets that swept over, almost enveloping the entire sky.","Even the powerful Great Ancestor Chu could feel his scalp go numb. There were too many monsters. Compared to the number of monsters here, the number of monsters that they had encountered in the deep-sea ruin was simply child’s play. They were simply not on the same level.","There were too many of them, and even with Chu Yunfan’s speed, it was impossible for him to clear them all.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan threw out a punch and cleared out a few hundred square meters of space. He looked down and saw that the nearby Federation Army had arrived and was doing its best to rescue the citizens.","Countless people were running out of Binhai City in their pajamas. They had to face the heavy attacks of countless monsters along the way. The road to escape was filled with difficulties.","It was a complete massacre.","On the road to escape, in the dark of the night, a woman with a panicked expression was running with a child in her arms. Many monsters gradually surrounded her.","The woman staggered and the child fell out of her arms. The monster, which had been waiting for a long time, pounced at the child.","“My child! My child!”","The woman let out a shrill scream, her eyes filled with despair.","Many people around her couldn’t bear it and turned their heads. They couldn’t help this woman. Who would help who on the way to escape?","Suddenly, countless swords rained down from the sky like torrential rain.","Each of the sword lights landed on a monster, killing them instantly.","In the blink of an eye, the hundreds of monsters that had surrounded them and made them feel despair, all died tragically, their heads exploding one after another.","“My child!”","The woman hurriedly crawled to the child’s side and held the child in her arms.","“Chu Yunfan!” someone suddenly shouted, “It’s Chu Yunfan!”","..."]},{"number":1097,"title":"Chapter 1097 All of You Will Die!","paragraphs":["1097 All of You Will Die!","Many people raised their heads and looked over.","It was indeed Chu Yunfan!","Many people felt extremely lucky to be able to meet the Federation’s war god at this moment of despair.","Ever since he had killed the cult master, Chu Yunfan’s nickname had changed from the Federation’s number-one expert to the Federation’s God of War.","!!","“Quick! The army is waiting for you outside! I’ll cover your retreat!” Chu Yunfan shouted as he casually waved his hand and released a rain of swords. These swords seemed to have grown eyes as they attacked the monsters head-on.","Although there were a lot of these monsters, they weren’t very strong. After being locked on by Chu Yunfan, he could easily kill them with a wave of his sword lights.","Chu Yunfan’s attack instantly killed all the monsters that surrounded him.","At this time, on the periphery, troops of the Federation Army descended from the sky, constantly gathering and advancing toward Binhai City.","However, there were just too many of these monsters. It was already very difficult for an ordinary army to eliminate the monsters that were blocking their way. It was impossible for them to break through like Chu Yunfan.","Only a few elite teams made up of Innates were able to break through, but they were also stuck. It was impossible for them to break through as easily as Chu Yunfan.","Fortunately, the Federation implemented a national cultivation policy in recent years. Everyone had extraordinary cultivation and was agile. Although Binhai City had fallen, countless people had escaped.","If this had happened in the Common Era, they would have been finished long ago.","These people quickly thanked Chu Yunfan profusely and ran away. However, he didn’t have the time to care about these people.","He headed deeper into the city. The closer he got to Binhai City’s center, the more monsters there were. There were even some huge monsters that were at the level of siege monsters. Chu Yunfan could even see behemoths that were hundreds of meters tall.","These war machines of Infinite Demon Mountain ran rampant in Binhai City. Some of them were even at the peak of the Innate Stage and destroyed the tall buildings without restraint.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. His eyes were extremely cold. He raised his arm high, and suddenly, countless balls of thunder turned into swords, spears, halberds, and many other weapons behind him.","A wall of weapons, hundreds of meters wide, formed behind him.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","These weapons flew out as if there was a rain of weapons. They were densely packed and swept over.","In an instant, countless monsters lost their lives as they were beheaded by these weapons that seemed to have eyes.","Every time Chu Yunfan used this move, a large number of beasts would die. At this moment, he was like a ruthless harvester, killing countless beasts every second.","However, Chu Yunfan’s strength alone was still not enough to kill all of these monsters.","If it was a real battlefield, it would be much easier to deal with. Countless nuclear bombs would be launched. Although hundreds of millions of monsters were a lot, the Federation had a lot of nuclear bombs stored in storage.","However, in such a large-scale chaotic battle, the Federation was cautious and did not dare to use weapons of mass destruction, including nuclear bombs.","In the distance, Tang Siyu was fighting alongside him. She could form glaciers that were thousands of meters long with just a wave of her sword. All the monsters they encountered along the way were frozen into ice blocks.","Great Ancestor Chu, Chu Haoyue, the Thunder Winged Beast, Ebony Dragon King, and the others were also frantically clearing out those monsters.","The Thunder Winged Beast, in particular, was like a god of thunder soaring through the sky. The power of countless thunderbolts had turned its entire body into a sea of lightning.","However, the others did not have the ability to rush in like Tang Siyu did. There were too many monsters, and they were so densely packed that they drowned everything. Therefore, they could only rescue the ordinary people who were running away from a distance, clear the surrounding monsters, and clear the way forward for them.","“Let’s kill those siege beasts first!” Chu Yunfan said to Tang Siyu through telepathy.","These ordinary monsters were just cannon fodder for the demons, and they could be summoned at any time. They were all raised in the wild.","However, the siege beasts were different. The demons had carefully cultivated them, and the loss of one was a huge loss.","Of course, to Chu Yunfan, the only difference was that the beasts were a little bigger.","He flew in without making a move. In an instant, his body turned into an ocean of thunder, and all the monsters that got close were electrocuted into charcoal, unable to get close.","It was the same for Tang Siyu. She was surrounded by a sea of ice. When the monsters approached her, they were all frozen into ice. She looked like an ice goddess.","“Roar!”","As soon as Chu Yunfan entered Binhai City, a huge beast’s head immediately bit at him.","It was an extremely huge beast. Its eyes alone were as big as two Chu Yunfans.","“You’re looking for death!”","Chu Yunfan summoned a lightning sword in his hand and swept out a thousand-meter-long sword light, cutting off the beast’s head.","Boom!","With a loud boom, the head of the beast fell to the ground.","After beheading the behemoth, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He immediately charged into the horde of behemoths that were attacking the city.","At the same time, countless aerial monsters pounced at him.","Of course, there would be no exception in the end. All of them were killed.","Chu Yunfan finally saw the tragic state of Binhai City. Countless corpses were lying in the streets, and countless monsters were eating the human corpses.","There were also many humans who rose up to resist in every corner of the streets. However, they were becoming more and more powerless in the face of countless monsters.","“Chu Yunfan! It’s Chu Yunfan!”","Someone saw Chu Yunfan flying in the sky and immediately screamed, as if Chu Yunfan’s existence could make them completely at ease.","“I’ll clean up the monsters in this area. You guys should leave quickly. The army is waiting for you outside!” Chu Yunfan said, and then began to frantically kill the monsters.","With just one attack, hundreds of beasts were killed. Chu Yunfan’s killing efficiency made these people dumbfounded.","Even those huge siege beasts were no match for him.","Soon, Chu Yunfan had already slaughtered over a hundred of the siege beasts.","...","But Chu Yunfan’s massacre quickly attracted the attention of the demon experts, and more than a dozen Divine demons surrounded him from all directions.","Chu Yunfan looked over. There were Divine demons and also Divine marine folks.","However, it made no difference to him.","Because all of them had to die!"]},{"number":1098,"title":"Chapter 1098 An Expert Above Divine Abilities Stage? Battle Over!","paragraphs":["1098 An Expert Above Divine Abilities Stage? Battle Over!","The dozen or so Divine monsters pounced over and surrounded Chu Yunfan.","These monsters had a crazed look in their eyes from all the killing. Many of them still had blood in the corner of their mouths. It was unknown how many people they had bitten to death, but they were currently feasting on their food.","As a result, Chu Yunfan’s presence immediately attracted the attention of these Divine monsters and marine beasts, and they all pounced over.","“You b*stards, you’re all going to die!” Chu Yunfan roared.","Around him, countless blood-red flames boiled and formed a huge blood-red skeleton. It was the Demon Descends Illustration that he had directly cast.","“Go to hell!”","The huge skeleton wrapped around Chu Yunfan and turned him into a hundred-meter-tall behemoth. It threw a palm at a Divine monster that was pouncing over.","Bam!","The Divine aerial monster that was the fastest was hit directly. Its huge body flew away and fell apart in mid-air. Its entire body turned into a rain of blood.","It was instantly killed by Chu Yunfan!","Seeing the tragedy in Binhai City, Chu Yunfan’s anger exploded and he didn’t hold back.","The remaining Divine monsters and marine beasts finally came to their senses. What kind of terrifying power did this human, who was so small compared to them, have?","But at this time, how could Chu Yunfan, who was completely enraged, give them the time to escape? The huge bloody skeleton launched an attack with lightning speed.","With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, the power of the Demon Descends Illustration in his hands had climbed to a level that no one had ever achieved before.","The huge blood-red skeleton began to perform martial arts techniques, chasing after the Divine monsters and marine beasts.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Following a series of loud explosions, one Divine monster or marine beast would be killed by Chu Yunfan with each explosion.","In the blink of an eye, more than half of these marine beasts and monsters had been killed by Chu Yunfan. The remaining ones finally overcame their fear and realized that he would not easily let them go. They immediately pounced on him with bloodshot eyes.","However, all of this was completely useless. The difference in strength was huge, and they became souls in Chu Yunfan’s hands one by one. They were simply no match for him.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan killed them all. To him, these Divine monsters and marine beasts were only slightly more difficult to deal with, but there was no difference in essence.","After killing these Divine monsters and marine beasts, Chu Yunfan charged into the downtown area of Binhai City. He could see countless monsters rushing in through the gap that had been blasted open.","However, before they could start a bloody massacre, they encountered a real fiend. Chu Yunfan was the one to start the crazy massacre.","These monsters gathered in groups and became Chu Yunfan’s best targets. He didn’t even need to make a move as the bloody skeleton easily stomped many monsters to death.","There were even some that were just as large but they were easily torn apart by the blood-red skeleton. They were completely useless.","Later on, Chu Yunfan simply left the Demon Descends Illustration and used the bloody skeleton formed by it to guard the gap, preventing these monsters from invading.","Meanwhile, he began to kill the monsters that were still slaughtering their way into the city. Tang Siyu also joined in. The two of them joined forces and formed a crazy massacre.","Hundreds of monsters were dying every second. Facing the slaughter of such high-level experts, these ordinary monsters had no way to resist. Chu Yunfan had killed all the Divine experts among them.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was grave as he slaughtered the monsters. He found that although there were countless monsters here, there were too few Divine existences. He had only killed a dozen of them, which was too few for the marine folks and the demons.","In fact, it was impossible to break through Binhai City’s defense line with this level of deployment. Even if they launched a surprise attack and the demons used a nuclear bomb, it would not be enough to completely conquer a base city like Binhai city.","Chu Yunfan observed the gap in the city wall. There was a terrifying energy residue on it. The gap was not made by a technological weapon, but by someone’s hand.","The hand mark was obvious and had a radius of at least a thousand meters. This became the gap that countless monsters had entered.","Chu Yunfan was in disbelief. This was not the first time that the Federation and the demons had fought against each other, so how could the Federation not be prepared?","The city wall outside the base city was at least tens of meters wide and was cast with the latest high-tech materials. It wasn’t that a Divine couldn’t destroy it, but it would be very difficult.","It was no problem to destroy it bit by bit. Even if it were him, it would take a lot of time to blast a hole through this wall. Such a long time was enough for the local garrison to react, and even the Federation Government would be alarmed.","At that time, all kinds of high-tech weapons would be launched all at once. When the future enemies were killed, they would at least be forced to retreat.","However, the situation this time was different. It was a huge hole created by one strike. Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t do this.","It should be said that for the time being, it was impossible.","In other words, whether it was among the marine folks or the demons, it was very likely that a peerless master had appeared. Maybe even a peerless master who had surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage.","After coming to this conclusion, Chu Yunfan took a deep breath. If this was really the case, then it would definitely make things worse for the Federation. He suddenly had an urgent desire to improve his strength.","A life-and-death battle was on the horizon.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t have time to think about it. The most important thing right now was to clean up all the monsters in Binhai City. With the blood-red skeleton blocking the gap, there were no more monsters coming in in large numbers.","Chu Yunfan was able to calmly clear out the monsters that had barged in and save the remaining citizens. Although the consumption of energy from fighting on both fronts was extremely great, it was not a big deal for him, whose divine power was as deep as the sea.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu worked together, and with the help of Great Ancestor Chu and the others who came in later, they began to clear up the monsters in different areas.","Later, various elite troops of the Federation also joined in. Even so, by the time countless monsters retreated and the monsters in the city were cleaned up, a full day and night had passed."]},{"number":1099,"title":"Chapter 1099 Killing 1000 Enemies, Losing 800 of Your Own, Federation in an Uproar","paragraphs":["1099 Killing 1000 Enemies, Losing 800 of Your Own, Federation in an Uproar","After an entire day and night, the crazy killing finally stopped.","Humans killed monsters and monsters killed humans. They killed each other.","After a day and night of killing, the number of casualties was simply uncountable. It could be said that corpses piled up like mountains, blocking every street that was originally prosperous.","Who knew how long it would take to clean up.","After a day and a night of fighting, even though Chu Yunfan’s divine power was still as vast as the ocean, he felt deeply exhausted.","This incident had happened too suddenly, so suddenly that they were not prepared at all.","The follow-up matters were handed over to the elite troops of the Federation who had come to take over the defense line. These elite troops were responsible for evacuating the people. Although the battle had ended, the scattered monsters hiding in the city were still being cleaned up.","Moreover, no one could guarantee that the demons and the marine folks wouldn’t make a comeback, especially since Binhai City was right by the sea, and countless marine beasts could come back at any time.","After the battle, Chu Yunfan and the others gathered on the roof of a tall building. Everyone looked a little tired. After a day and night of killing, everyone’s faces were full of fatigue.","The Thunder Winged Beast curled up in the shadow at the side. Although it looked powerful, it was not an adult and was still a baby.","“It’s finally over. If I continue killing like this, I’ll be crippled!”","Chu Haoyue felt that his whole body was about to fall apart.","“What’s the situation in the other two cities?” Chu Yunfan asked.","The Divines were assigned to different cities.","“The situation is bad.” Great Ancestor Chu looked at the situation on his terminal.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan and the others also checked the messages sent to them on their terminals.","Chu Yunfan’s face also turned ugly, because he had already seen the news from the other two cities. Unlike Binhai City, the other two cities were reduced to ruins because the Federation had used nuclear bombs.","The monsters in the two cities were completely annihilated by the nuclear bombs. But at the same time, those who had not managed to retreat in time were also buried in the indiscriminate coverage.","The other two cities weren’t like Binhai City, where Chu Yunfan was personally in charge and could easily defeat the masters of the monsters.","The other two cities weren’t so lucky. A large number of masters suddenly appeared. Not only were the troops stationed in the cities completely destroyed, but even the troops that rushed to support the counterattack were also destroyed.","Even the Divines who had rushed over to help were defeated.","In the video, Chu Yunfan saw that many Divines headed to the other two cities to provide support.","With the addition of experts from the Holy Lands, the number of Divines in the Federation had increased fundamentally.","Because Chu Yunfan was in Binhai City, most of the masters had gone to the other two cities. It should have been a foolproof situation, but the actual situation was not so.","Just when these experts arrived at the fallen city, they were defeated by a hand that fell from the sky.","The dozens of Divines could not withstand this terrifying hand. They were all defeated and retreated while spitting blood. As for the Federation’s Army, it was needless to say. They were not a match at all and were directly defeated.","Under such circumstances, the Federation had no other choice. In the end, the higher-ups of the Federation made the decision to use a large number of nuclear bombs and turn the entire fallen city into ashes. The densely packed nuclear bombs covered the sky, and only then did they finally escape the pursuit of the large hand. The army was able to retreat in a situation where they were on the verge of collapse.","The whole situation was extremely tragic. Countless elite soldiers of the Federation Army had died tragically, and countless experts had died without a burial place. Even the Divines were severely injured.","In another city, the situation was similar. Just as many experts were about to enter the city, the mysterious big hand appeared again. As soon as it appeared, it defeated many Divines. Even the Federation Army collapsed and several warships were destroyed.","With the experience of the previous city, the higher-ups of the Federation no longer hesitated and launched countless nuclear bombs. While destroying tens of millions of monsters, they blocked the pursuit of the mastermind behind the scenes.","This matter was so huge that it couldn’t be concealed. The entire Internet was in an uproar. Countless people were discussing this matter.","This was especially true for the large-scale use of nuclear bombs in the base cities where they were located. It had destroyed countless monsters and humans. This made countless people heartbroken, especially when many people had friends and relatives in these two cities.","Although it was possible that they were already been buried in the stomachs of the monsters, there was still a chance of survival. However, once the nuclear bombs were used to sweep away the monsters, even if there was a chance of survival, it would be all gone.","This battle, where they killed 1000 enemies and lost 800 of their own, had happened quite often in the early days of the Federation’s establishment. However, in the last few decades, or even a hundred years, the Federation had gained a firm foothold in the Kunlun Realm. Under normal circumstances, it was very rare for the Federation to use such a method.","The denouncement of the Federation Government on the Internet came wave after wave. Many people simply could not accept such a thing, especially the Federation Government which kept saying that humans were the foundation of their nation.","However, there were many who understood the Federation Government’s actions. After all, the situation at that time was extremely dangerous. If the nuclear bombs were not used, not only would the people inside not be saved but many Divines and elite troops who went to the rescue would also be killed.","Anyway, most of the people who were trapped in the two cities had escaped, and those who couldn’t escape basically couldn’t.","This was an acceptable situation.","However, what was even more unacceptable to countless people was that the three cities with such powerful defense systems had collapsed overnight. Many people began to panic, as this meant that an extremely terrifying mastermind had appeared behind the scenes.","Under such circumstances, Binhai City, where Chu Yunfan was in charge of the rescue, became the only hope in the hearts of countless people. At least the city was not destroyed by a nuclear bomb in the end.","More people were worried that if something happened to them, they would also be wiped out by nuclear bombs.","The Federation was in a state of panic!"]},{"number":1100,"title":"Chapter 1100 After Swallowing a Golden Pill, I Know That My Fate Is in My Hands and Not the Heavens!","paragraphs":["1100 After Swallowing a Golden Pill, I Know That My Fate Is in My Hands and Not the Heavens!","“As expected, a peerless expert has intervened.” Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely grave because the news from the other two cities was exactly the same as what he had guessed.","As expected, a supreme figure had emerged from among the demons and marine folks. For the current human Federation, it was needless to say that the pressure was immense.","It was just like the first time the Federation had faced a Divine monster. It had exhausted all means before finally killing it.","At that time, that was the first time that they knew that there was the Divine Abilities Stage above the Innate Stage. At that time, there were very few Innates, let alone Divines.","Furthermore, it was unheard of for a Divine to be so powerful.","The current situation was exactly the same as it had been in the past.","In terms of martial arts, the demons and the marine folks were one step ahead of the Federation.","Great Ancestor Chu and the others also looked solemn. Then, everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan knew what they were thinking and said, “If it were me, That person would be no match for me. However, it’s impossible to defeat them all with just a single strike.”","Great Ancestor Chu, Chu Haoyue, and the others all looked a little disappointed. Chu Yunfan was the number one expert of the human race. If even Chu Yunfan couldn’t do it, then that person’s power must have surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage.","“It’s not that we can’t deal with this kind of master. In fact, a nuclear bomb can still pose a threat to him. The best proof is that it can repel him. But it’s almost impossible to do anything to him. The best way to deal with a martial arts master is still with another martial arts master. High-tech weapons are not enough in this regard,” Chu Yunfan said, shaking his head.","The perception of a martial arts master was so sharp that a Divine could rely on his senses to avoid the attack of a nuclear bomb. As long as they were careful, a nuclear bomb would not be able to hurt them, let alone those beyond the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, the Federation was far behind in terms of high-end experts. In essence, only a quantitative change would lead to a qualitative change, and the number of Divines in the Federation was not enough for quantitative change.","This was a fundamental difference. In comparison, the heritage of the demons and the marine folks ranged from the initial Divine Abilities Stage to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. It was highly likely that an expert who had surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage would be the first to emerge among them.","After this incident, Chu Yunfan had to think of a way to increase the number of Divines in the Federation.","He had brought back many cultivation books from various Holy Land sects, even the specific cultivation methods and so on. Although they had begun to spread, it had caused crazy competition among the peak Innates.","Of course, the borrowing of these books was not free. They were all very expensive. These books brought Chu Yunfan a great amount of wealth.","However, this method was too slow. If it was during peaceful times, it was indeed possible to use this method to let those Innates improve themselves. But now that the marine folks and demons were about to attack him, Chu Yunfan had no choice but to use some more effective methods, such as the Divine Nourishment Pill.","He had a large number of monster inner cores in his possession, and he had slaughtered a lot of Divine monsters. If he could refine all of them into Divinity Nourishment Pills, it would be enough to produce a large number of Divines for the Federation.","This was an urgent matter.","In addition to the improvement of his overall strength, the most important thing was how to deal with the existence behind the big hand.","“Yunfan, do you know what realm is above the Divine Abilities Stage?” Great Ancestor Chu asked Chu Yunfan.","The Federation did not even know much about the Divine Abilities Stage. As for experts above that stage, they were even more confused.","Other people might not know, but Chu Yunfan knew it very well.","“The level above the Divine Abilities Stage is called the Core Stage,” Chu Yunfan said, “The cultivation of the Core Stage is best understood through ‘Enlightenment’ written by Zhang Boduan in the Northern Song Dynasty during the Common Era.","“In short, once you swallow a golden pill, you will know that your fate is in your hands.","“After swallowing the golden pill, will I know if my fate is in my own hands and not in the hands of Heaven?” Great Ancestor Chu was stunned after hearing this. How bold was this?","“I control my fate, not the heavens.” This was what many people said. However, no one knew how to do it. The so-called “going along” and “going against the flow” of most people were actually the will of heaven.","“Every step in the journey of cultivation was a process of self-transformation. From the Innate Stage, Innate true energy was born. And then to the Divine Abilities Stage, where true energy was transformed into divine power.","“And in essence, the Core Stage is when the divine power of the Divine Abilities Stage was cultivated to the extreme and condensed into a golden core,” Chu Yunfan continued, “In fact, the dantian that we often use as a cultivator is not actually used to store true energy, but rather, it is where the final golden core is. It’s just that many people don’t know about it.”","“From this point of view, humans do not possess suitable physiques for cultivation. If they don’t have a physique, they will be too weak, so they have to strengthen their bodies. If they don’t have a qi meridian, they have to open it. If they don’t have a golden core, they have to cultivate one. These are the innate conditions of the demon race. Could it be that the demons are truly born to be suitable for cultivation?” Tang Siyu said.","Hearing this, Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue felt that this was indeed the case. Demons were born with all the conditions needed for cultivation, but humans had nothing. They had to start by training their bodies and improving themselves step by step. It was a sad way to look at things.","Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “That’s not the case. Wisdom is the most powerful tool for human beings to explore the great Dao. It’s because there is nothing that humans can walk the strongest path. Monsters rely on their bloodline and their limitations to determine what stage they can reach. However, the potential of human beings is far more than that. However, it’s not like humans have nothing. In the distant past, the only thing for humans was the Acquired Stage, which was much more powerful than modern people.","“It’s also recorded in the ‘The Yellow Emperor’s Internal Canon’ that people in ancient times lived through spring and autumn to a hundred years old, but their movements never slowed down. It’s hard to find out if it’s true or not, but from this, we can see the abilities of the human race.”","“Is the Core Stage really that powerful?” Chu Haoyue looked at Chu Yunfan, full of hope.","“Very. The power of a Core expert has been condensed into a golden core. Their control over their power has long reached an incredible level. As for their strength, you saw it in the video,” Chu Yunfan said.","The crowd was disappointed. The Core Stage was far more powerful than they had thought.","However, it’s not impossible to deal with it. They just needed time."]}]);
